1657
01:17:34,737 --> 01:17:36,037
マル秘？
The secret one?

1658
01:17:36,037 --> 01:17:37,237
はい。かな？
Yes. Probably?

1659
01:17:37,237 --> 01:17:38,737
オッケー
Okay.

1660
