I wonder if mine has enough hit points...

1682
01:18:45,037 --> 01:18:49,237
最悪ダメだったら、もうあれ出すわ。あの、テリジノ
If worst comes to worst, I'll bring that out. You know, Therizino.

1683
01:18:49,237 --> 01:18:50,237
うん
Yeah.

1684
01:18:52,037 --> 01:18:56,737
