1695
01:19:26,737 --> 01:19:28,737
湧いた？湧いてる？
Did it spawn? Has it spawned?

1696
01:19:28,737 --> 01:19:31,237
わっかん...湧いてるかな？3分経った？
I don't kno... Did it spawn? Has it been 3 minutes?

1697
01:19:31,237 --> 01:19:33,237
経った、3分？
Has it been 3 minutes?

1698
01:19:35,237 --> 01:19:39,737
