え？やってるね今
Huh? They're fighting it right now.

1719
01:20:22,152 --> 01:20:23,152
待ちか
Gotta wait, huh?

1720
01:20:23,252 --> 01:20:25,352
まあ前の人がいたのかな？あ
Well, I guess someone was here before us? Ah,

1721
