Oh man...

1830
01:24:43,452 --> 01:24:46,752
どれくらいで湧くのか分かんないよね、3分って
We don't know how long it takes to spawn, right? "3 minutes"...

1831
01:24:46,752 --> 01:24:47,252
うん
Yeah.

1832
01:24:47,252 --> 01:24:48,052
ね
Yeah.

1833
01:24:50,952 --> 01:24:51,952
はーい
Okay.

1834
01:24:51,852 --> 01:24:53,252
ちょっ、でもこれが…
Wait, but this...

1835
01:24:54,052 --> 01:24:55,252
これが今…
this right now...

1836
01:24:55,052 --> 01:24:57,252
これが今開いてるってことは…
the fact that this is open right now means...

1837
01:24:56,852 --> 01:24:57,852
え？うん
Eh? Yeah.

1838
01:24:57,752 --> 01:24:59,852
行けるのかな？行っていいのかな？
Can we go? Are we allowed to go?

1839
01:24:59,952 --> 01:25:03,752
かなたちょっと、あ、アキロゼがボイチャにいねえんだよな
Kanata's a bit... Ah, Akirose isn't in voice chat, is she?

1840
01:25:04,307 --> 01:25:05,307
ははは
Hahaha.

1841
01:25:05,307 --> 01:25:07,507
アキロゼに行きたいんだけど、アキロゼあいつ...
I want to talk to Akirose, but that girl...

1842
01:25:07,507 --> 01:25:11,807
待機...ボイチャにいない、常駐にいないんだよな。
waiting... She's not in the voice chat or the main channel.

1843
01:25:13,107 --> 01:25:16,007
まあ、空いてるなら行ってみるか。
Well, if the spot's open, should we go take a look?

1844
01:25:16,007 --> 01:25:18,307
行こうか。トワ様行ける？
Let's go. Towa-sama, can you make it?

1845
01:25:18,307 --> 01:25:20,707
トワ乗れないよね？これ。
Towa can't ride this, right?

1846
01:25:20,707 --> 01:25:22,907
一回下行ってからだね、多分。
Probably once we get down below.

1847
01:25:23,107 --> 01:25:24,407
かな？
I guess?

1848
01:25:24,407 --> 01:25:26,107
え、どうやって行けばいい？これ。
How do I get down there?

1849
01:25:26,107 --> 01:25:28,007
これ、滝降りるんでしょ？
We drop down the waterfall, right?

1850
01:25:28,007 --> 01:25:29,007
うん。
Yeah.

1851
01:25:29,007 --> 01:25:30,007
じゃあ行こうか。
All right, let's go.

1852
01:25:30,007 --> 01:25:31,307
あ、いよ。
Sure thing.

1853
01:25:31,307 --> 01:25:32,807
お、牡丹さん先に行った？
Oh, Botan went ahead?

1854
01:25:32,807 --> 01:25:35,107
うぇーい！
Wheee!

1855
01:25:35,107 --> 01:25:36,707
え、牡丹さん死んだ？
Wait, did Botan die?

1856
01:25:36,707 --> 01:25:38,107
え、いる、生きてるよ。
No, she's alive.

1857
01:25:38,107 --> 01:25:40,807
下、下、下水だよ。
There's water down here.

1858
01:25:40,807 --> 01:25:41,707
うん。
Yeah.

1859
01:25:41,707 --> 01:25:43,307
オッケー、オッケー。うわあ！
Okay, okay. Whoaaa!

1860
01:25:43,307 --> 01:25:45,107
わわわわわ...
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

1861
01:25:45,107 --> 01:25:47,307
うわ！あ、なんか...
Whoa! Ah, something...

1862
01:25:47,307 --> 01:25:48,507
生きてる？
Are you alive?

1863
01:25:48,507 --> 01:25:50,107
これ、あれ...
This is, uh...

1864
01:25:50,107 --> 01:25:51,107
やば。
Uh oh.

1865
01:25:51,107 --> 01:25:52,307
え、なんで聞こえたんだ？
Wait, how did you hear that?

1866
01:25:52,307 --> 01:25:54,307
陸に上がれな...あれ？
Can't get onto land... Huh?

1867
01:25:54,307 --> 01:25:56,107
今やってる？
Are they fighting it right now?

1868
01:25:56,107 --> 01:25:57,707
上がれない。
Can't get up.

1869
01:25:57,707 --> 01:25:59,507
あれ？誰かいる。
Huh? Someone's here.

1870
01:25:59,507 --> 01:26:01,707
待ちタイムでこれからの...これから？
It's waiting time for... from now?

1871
01:26:01,707 --> 01:26:03,507
あ、じゃあ先どうぞ。
Ah, go ahead of us then.

1872
01:26:03,507 --> 01:26:05,307
あ、ららららら。
Oh, dear dear dear.

1873
01:26:05,307 --> 01:26:07,307
向こうに、え？
Over there, huh?

1874
01:26:09,307 --> 01:26:11,707
どうぞどうぞ、お先にどうぞー。
Go right ahead, after you!

1875
01:26:11,707 --> 01:26:14,307
え、ボイチャってこれ自分聞こえてんのかな？向こうに。
Can they hear me on voice chat right now?

1876
01:26:14,307 --> 01:26:16,607
や、どうだろう。フブちゃんの声聞こえてないわ。
Hmm, dunno. I can't hear you, Fubu-chan.

1877
01:26:16,607 --> 01:26:19,107
うわ、もう今ボイチャ壊れてんな自分。
Ugh, my voice chat is totally broken right now.

1878
01:26:19,807 --> 01:26:22,307
これ今、これ今、あれか...
Is this... right now...

1879
01:26:22,307 --> 01:26:25,307
アイスワームって... Dチームがやってるみたいな感じか。
The Ice Worm... is Team D fighting it?

1880
01:26:25,307 --> 01:26:27,507
あ、Dチームか。
Ah, it's Team D?

1881
01:26:27,507 --> 01:26:30,807
アイスワームってどういう状況？
What's the situation with the Ice Worm?

1882
01:26:31,307 --> 01:26:34,107
アイスワームって今どういう状況？
What's the current situation with the Ice Worm?

1883
01:26:34,107 --> 01:26:35,507
どういう状況？
What's going on?

1884
01:26:35,507 --> 01:26:42,107
今バグでまつり先輩が死んでしまって、生き返ってもらっててそれ待ちですね。
Matsuri-senpai died due to a bug, so we're waiting for her to be revived.

1885
01:26:42,307 --> 01:26:44,807
なるほど。
I see.

1886
01:26:44,807 --> 01:26:48,507
で、まつりちゃん来たらこれからアイスワーム。
And once Matsuri-chan gets here, we'll fight the Ice Worm.

1887
01:26:48,507 --> 01:26:51,607
はい、オッケー。うちらはじゃあそれを待ってたらいいのね？
Okay. So we should just wait for that, right?

1888
01:26:51,607 --> 01:26:53,307
だと思う。かな？
I think so. Probably?

1889
01:26:53,307 --> 01:26:55,807
Sorry! Sorry. / オッケー。
Sorry! Sorry. / Okay.

1890
01:26:55,807 --> 01:26:58,907
かがり火があったかいんじゃ。これパクリかがり火。
The bonfire is so warm. This is a stolen bonfire.

1891
01:26:58,907 --> 01:27:03,307
あ、あったかい！あったかい！
Ah, it's so warm! It's warm!

1892
01:27:03,307 --> 01:27:07,807
いや、全然聞こえねえや。さんでぃやボイチャ壊れてる。
Man, I can't hear at all. Voice chat is busted.

1893
01:27:08,307 --> 01:27:13,307
ボイチャ壊れてたら一回ね、あの、再起しないとあれ...
If voice chat is broken, you might need to restart...

1894
01:27:13,307 --> 01:27:16,807
それか、SteamでSteamがあれなのかも。
Or maybe something's up with Steam.

1895
01:27:16,807 --> 01:27:18,907
あー、なんか変わっちゃったのかな？
Ah, maybe the settings changed?

1896
01:27:18,907 --> 01:27:21,707
うん、変わっちゃったかもしれないから、一回Steam見てみたら？
Yeah, they might have. Why not check Steam once?

1897
01:27:21,707 --> 01:27:22,807
オッケー。
Okay.

1898
01:27:22,807 --> 01:27:24,807
Steamの設定...
Steam settings...

1899
01:27:24,807 --> 01:27:27,307
まつりのテリジノがいないかも？
Matsuri's Therizino might not be here?

1900
01:27:27,307 --> 01:27:29,807
えーっと...
Let's see...

1901
01:27:33,807 --> 01:27:37,107
あ、あ、あー。
Ah, ah, aah.

1902
01:27:37,107 --> 01:27:38,307
よーし。
All right.

1903
01:27:38,307 --> 01:27:41,507
オッケー。ちょっとこのプテラだけなんかスタックしちゃった。
Okay. Just this Ptera got stuck somehow.

1904
01:27:41,507 --> 01:27:43,307
反応してるよな...
It is reacting though...

1905
01:27:43,307 --> 01:27:44,507
まあいいや。
Whatever.

1906
01:27:44,507 --> 01:27:49,107
チームなんか変わってなかった？その、設定した前... / 変わってない。
Did the team settings not change? From before... / They haven't changed.

1907
01:27:49,507 --> 01:27:52,507
でもこれ、うちらも降りちゃってるけどいいのかな？
But is it okay that we dropped down too?

1908
01:27:52,507 --> 01:27:55,807
段差の上から降りたら... / もう一個下じゃない？もう一個下か。
If you drop from the ledge... / Isn't it one level down? One lower.

1909
01:27:55,807 --> 01:27:59,507
あー、なるほどなるほどね。
Ah, I see, I see.

1910
01:27:59,507 --> 01:28:02,807
でもここから出していいか、あれ。 / うん、大丈夫だと思う。
But can we just summon it from here? / Yeah, I think it's fine.

1911
01:28:07,807 --> 01:28:10,307
なら、お持ち...
In that case, we wait...

1912
01:28:10,807 --> 01:28:14,807
これボスが始まったら...表示されるのかな？
Once the boss starts, will it be announced on screen?

1913
01:28:14,807 --> 01:28:16,807
そうだね。
Yeah, probably.

1914
01:28:17,507 --> 01:28:21,507
これだと終わってるのかと思っちゃうよね。
Like this, you'd think it was already over.

1915
01:28:21,507 --> 01:28:23,307
ねー。
Right?

1916
01:28:26,307 --> 01:28:29,807
よいしょ。はぁ...。
Alrighty. *sigh*...

1917
01:28:29,807 --> 01:28:34,307
いや、他の恐竜意外とテイムいけたんじゃないかと思ってしまう。やばい、効率厨が...
Man, I can't help thinking we could've tamed other dinos. Oh no, my inner min-maxer...

1918
01:28:34,307 --> 01:28:37,307
あー、わかるぞ、凄くわかるぞ。
Ah, I get it, I totally get it.

1919
01:28:37,307 --> 01:28:39,307
「この時間もったいないよな」っていう。
Thinking "this time is such a waste."

1920
01:28:39,307 --> 01:28:43,307
めちゃめちゃもったいないよなー。
Such a total waste of time, right?

1921
01:28:44,107 --> 01:28:46,307
まあまあしょうがないんだ。
Well, it can't be helped.

1922
01:28:46,307 --> 01:28:50,307
バグっぽいからしょうがない。どうやらバグってたらしい。
It's due to a bug, so nothing we can do. Apparently it bugged out.

1923
01:28:50,307 --> 01:28:55,307
洞窟に入った瞬間に、「何々チーム洞窟入ってます」みたいな...
Like, the moment someone enters the cave, an announcement like "Team X is inside"...

1924
01:28:55,307 --> 01:28:58,307
アナウンスあったらよかったのにー。
It would've been great to have an announcement like that.

1925
01:28:59,307 --> 01:29:03,307
よいしょ。はぁ...。
Up we go. *sigh*...

1926
01:29:03,307 --> 01:29:06,307
あれ？もう出てるよ。 / うぇえええ！ / あれだ！
Huh? It's already out! / Eeeeeek! / There it is!

1927
01:29:06,307 --> 01:29:10,807
うー！おー！怖い！だけどそれ行けんの？
Whoa! Ahhh! Scary! But can they beat that?

1928
01:29:10,807 --> 01:29:12,807
頑張れー！
Good luck!

1929
01:29:13,807 --> 01:29:17,807
え、なんか誰か...誰かのプテラが！
Wait, someone's... someone's Ptera!

1930
01:29:17,807 --> 01:29:21,807
おーい、誰かのプテラ！プテラー！
Hey, someone's Ptera! Ptera!

1931
01:29:22,107 --> 01:29:24,307
誰のプテラ？
Whose Ptera is that?

1932
01:29:24,307 --> 01:29:26,807
多分向こうのチームじゃないか、これ。 / うん。
Isn't that the other team's? / Yeah.

1933
01:29:26,807 --> 01:29:29,807
ちょ、ちょ、ちょ、ちょ... / ちょっとどうしよう？
Wait, wait, wait, wait... / What do we do?

1934
01:29:29,807 --> 01:29:35,807
ちょ、ちょ、ちょ、ちょ...あのあのあの！
Wait, wait, wait, wait... Um, um, um, um!

1935
01:29:35,807 --> 01:29:38,807
おいさーん！
Oisaaan!

1936
01:29:39,107 --> 01:29:42,807
別チームのプテラ！
The other team's Ptera!

1937
01:29:42,807 --> 01:29:45,807
誰かのプテラがー！
Someone's Ptera is...!

1938
01:29:45,807 --> 01:29:49,307
戦っ...あ、自分とボイチャ聞こえないんだ。
Fighti... Ah, they can't hear my voice chat.

1939
01:29:49,307 --> 01:29:53,307
誰かのプテラが... / 終わったっぽい？でも終わったっぽい？終わった？
Someone's Ptera is... / Looks like it's over? Is it over? Over?

1940
01:29:53,307 --> 01:29:56,807
やばい、もうこれ上にも上がれないしね。
Oh man, and we can't even climb back up.

1941
01:29:56,807 --> 01:30:01,307
え、待って、置いてかない...置いてかないで！置いてかないでー！
Wait, don't leave... Don't leave me behind! Don't leave me!

1942
01:30:01,307 --> 01:30:04,307
プテラー！おーい、誰かのプテラー！
Ptera! Hey, someone's Ptera!

1943
01:30:04,328 --> 01:30:05,628
めっちゃ痛い！痛い！
That hurts so much! It hurts!

1944
01:30:05,128 --> 01:30:07,328
うわあ！助けて！
Whoa! Help me!

1945
01:30:08,128 --> 01:30:09,428
助けて！
Help me!

1946
01:30:09,328 --> 01:30:12,128
おーい！誰かのプテラ！
Hey! Someone's Ptera!

1947
01:30:12,128 --> 01:30:13,428
誰のだこれ？
Whose is this?

1948
01:30:13,328 --> 01:30:14,828
下がるか？
Should we back up?

1949
01:30:15,028 --> 01:30:17,528
おーい！誰かのプテラが！
Hey! Someone's Ptera is...!

1950
01:30:17,728 --> 01:30:22,328
すいません、アキロゼです。こちらちょっと対応してもらえるように今至急運営さんにお願いしております。少々お待ちください。
Excuse me, this is AkiRose. I'm asking the admins to handle this right away, so please wait a moment.

1951
01:30:22,328 --> 01:30:24,128
はーい！すいませーん！
Okay! Sorry about that!

1952
01:30:24,328 --> 01:30:26,828
だれかー！だれかー！
Somebody! Somebody!

1953
01:30:27,128 --> 01:30:29,828
死んじゃうよ！対応して！死んじゃう！
It's gonna die! Deal with it! It's gonna die!

1954
01:30:29,828 --> 01:30:32,328
死んじゃうよ～！
It's gonna dieee!

1955
01:30:33,328 --> 01:30:34,528
ふぅ。
Phew.

1956
01:30:34,328 --> 01:30:37,528
フブキー！攻撃受けてるー！
Fubuki! It's taking damage!

1957
01:30:37,528 --> 01:30:39,228
誰のよー！
Whose is it?!

1958
01:30:39,328 --> 01:30:41,628
ボコボコにされて…
It's getting beat up...

1959
01:30:41,328 --> 01:30:44,128
おーい！ダメージ負ってます！
Hey! It's taking damage!

1960
01:30:44,128 --> 01:30:46,428
もうでも、もうしゃあない、これは！
Well, there's nothing we can do about this!

1961
01:30:45,528 --> 01:30:47,428
しゃあないよ、これは！もう！
Nothing we can do! Seriously!

1962
01:30:47,728 --> 01:30:51,328
え、ちょっとこれ、もう俺が死ぬかお前が死ぬか…
Wait, at this rate, either I die or you die...

1963
01:30:51,128 --> 01:30:52,228
そうでしょう。
That's right.

1964
01:30:51,828 --> 01:30:54,328
俺が生きるかお前が生きるか…
Either I survive or you survive...

1965
01:30:54,828 --> 01:30:56,828
しかも居なくなっちゃったし。
And they disappeared, too.

1966
01:30:56,728 --> 01:30:58,228
本当だよ！置いてったんだ。
Seriously! They left it behind.

1967
01:30:58,228 --> 01:31:00,028
置いてかれたやつが可哀想やろ。
The one left behind is so pitiful.

1968
01:30:59,628 --> 01:31:01,628
可哀想〜。
Poor thing~

1969
01:31:01,828 --> 01:31:04,128
お前…285…
You... Level 285...

1970
01:31:04,128 --> 01:31:05,628
285…
285...

1971
01:31:05,628 --> 01:31:07,728
あ、でもなんか大人しくなった？
Ah, but did it calm down?

1972
01:31:07,628 --> 01:31:09,828
確かに。多分消えたから…
Indeed. Probably because they logged out...

1973
01:31:09,828 --> 01:31:10,828
消えたか？
Did they log out?

1974
01:31:10,828 --> 01:31:12,828
あ、置いてかれた…
Ah, left behind...

1975
01:31:12,728 --> 01:31:14,328
悲しい…
So sad...

1976
01:31:13,928 --> 01:31:16,728
あ、そうか。置いてかれたって…
Ah, I see. Left behind...

1977
01:31:16,628 --> 01:31:17,828
悲しい…
Sad...

1978
01:31:17,728 --> 01:31:19,328
捨てられたんだ。
It was abandoned.

1979
01:31:19,328 --> 01:31:21,128
フーちゃん、一人で大丈夫？
Fuu-chan, are you okay on your own?

1980
01:31:20,928 --> 01:31:22,128
ここで見ておきなよ。
Keep watch from here.

1981
01:31:21,828 --> 01:31:23,628
うん、とりあえず大丈夫。
Yeah, I'm okay for now.

1982
01:31:27,828 --> 01:31:29,828
デバフ…デバフ消そう。
Debuff... Let's clear the debuff.

1983
01:31:29,828 --> 01:31:33,828
プテラノドンお忘れですよ。
You forgot your Pteranodon.

1984
01:31:40,828 --> 01:31:46,128
どういう状況？に多分置いて繋がってると思われちゃってるわ。
They probably think they got disconnected while in that kind of situation.

1985
01:31:46,128 --> 01:31:47,328
うん、なるほど。
Yeah, I see.

1986
01:31:49,628 --> 01:31:53,128
スタックしてるからいらしいみたい。
Looks like it's because it's stuck.

1987
01:31:53,328 --> 01:31:55,128
え？してなかった？
Eh? Wasn't it?

1988
01:31:55,628 --> 01:31:58,328
攻撃されて…
Taking attacks...

1989
01:31:59,128 --> 01:32:00,328
え、なんか動く。
Eh, it's moving.

1990
01:32:01,328 --> 01:32:02,828
運営さん…
Admin...

1991
01:32:02,128 --> 01:32:05,128
お前、俺のチームに来るか？お前。
Hey you, wanna join my team?

1992
01:32:05,128 --> 01:32:09,528
俺のチームに来る…え、なんか、うわ！赤ちゃん生まれたと思ったらスタックさんだった。
Join my team... Eh? Whoa! I thought a baby was born, but it was just Mr. Stuck.

1993
01:32:09,528 --> 01:32:11,328
ああ、良かった良かった！
Ah, thank goodness!

1994
01:32:11,328 --> 01:32:12,828
早っ！
So fast!

1995
01:32:12,828 --> 01:32:15,828
どっか行った！どっか行った！一瞬見えた！
It went somewhere! It's gone! I saw it for a second!

1996
01:32:16,328 --> 01:32:18,528
帰った…
It went back...

1997
01:32:18,528 --> 01:32:20,328
あ、ポーチあった。
Ah, there's a bag.

1998
01:32:20,328 --> 01:32:21,828
あ、助かる。
Ah, that helps.

1999
01:32:21,828 --> 01:32:25,128
スタックしちゃってたんだ、あいつ。可哀想に。
That guy was stuck. Poor thing.

2000
01:32:27,828 --> 01:32:30,828
おいしょ。スタックしてたのか。可哀想に。
There we go. So it was stuck. Poor thing.

2001
01:32:31,128 --> 01:32:34,828
リスタートしたことによって自由の身になったんだ。
By restarting, it became a free body.

2002
01:32:34,828 --> 01:32:36,828
なるほど。そういうことね。
I see. That's what happened.

2003
01:32:36,828 --> 01:32:37,828
うん。
Yeah.

2004
01:32:37,828 --> 01:32:40,328
失礼します、アキロゼです。
Excuse me, this is AkiRose.

2005
01:32:40,128 --> 01:32:41,328
お、はい！
Oh, yes!

2006
01:32:41,128 --> 01:32:47,328
はい、えーといろ、色々ちょっとダメージを負ってしまったところもあるかもしれませんので、回復アイテムをちょっとお渡しします。
Yes, uh, since you might have taken some damage in various ways, I'll give you some recovery items.

2007
01:32:47,328 --> 01:32:48,528
あい、助かる〜！
Alright, that helps~!

2008
01:32:48,328 --> 01:32:50,828
はーい、少々お待ちくださーい。
Okay, please wait a moment.

2009
01:32:50,128 --> 01:32:51,828
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

2010
01:32:51,328 --> 01:32:56,328
あ、でもなんだかんだすぐ回復はできてるから大丈夫っちゃ大丈夫かも、HP。
Ah, but somehow we're healing quickly, so HP-wise we might be okay.

2011
01:32:56,328 --> 01:32:57,628
大丈夫ですか？
Are you alright?

2012
01:32:57,628 --> 01:32:59,628
うん、大丈夫、大丈夫。
Yeah, we're okay, we're okay.

2013
01:33:00,128 --> 01:33:06,328
了解しました。ではこのまま時間が来次第、チャレンジしていただくということで大丈夫でしょうか？
Understood. Then will it be okay for you to start the challenge once the time comes?

2014
01:33:06,328 --> 01:33:07,628
はーい！
Yes!

2015
01:33:07,628 --> 01:33:11,828
はい、分かりましたー。一応メディカルブリューお渡しできるんですが、どうします？
Alright, got it. I can provide Medical Brews just in case, would you like some?

2016
01:33:11,828 --> 01:33:13,328
あ、貰っとこうぜ！
Ah, let's take them!

2017
01:33:13,328 --> 01:33:15,328
お願いしやす！タダですよね？
Please! They're free, right?

2018
01:33:15,328 --> 01:33:18,828
タダです！タダなら貰います！タダなら貰います。
They're free! If it's free, we'll take it! If it's free, we'll take it.

2019
01:33:18,828 --> 01:33:22,328
貰い得か？行った？貰い得。一旦貰い得か。
Free gain? Did it work? Free gain. Totally a free gain.

2020
01:33:22,328 --> 01:33:23,328
はい。
Yes.

2021
01:33:23,328 --> 01:33:25,328
少々お待ちくださいね。
Please wait a moment.

2022
01:33:25,128 --> 01:33:27,328
あざーっす！あざーっす！
Thanks! Thanks!

2023
01:33:27,328 --> 01:33:30,328
おっ、おっ！笹の如くいただきやす！
Oh, oh! We'll gladly take it!

2024
01:33:30,128 --> 01:33:31,328
おいしょ。
There we go.

2025
01:33:31,328 --> 01:33:33,328
あ、すごい100個もあるよ！100個！
Ah, wow, there's 100 of them! 100!

2026
01:33:33,128 --> 01:33:34,828
渡りましたでしょうか、無事に？
Did you receive them safely?

2027
01:33:34,828 --> 01:33:36,128
はい、いけましたー！
Yes, we got them!

2028
01:33:36,128 --> 01:33:39,328
はい、そちらをご活用いただきまして、攻略頑張ってください。
Yes, please make use of them and do your best in the dungeon.

2029
01:33:37,628 --> 01:33:39,328
分け合おう、分け合おう。
Let's share, let's share.

2030
01:33:40,128 --> 01:33:43,328
それでは健闘を祈っております。頑張ってください！
Well then, I wish you good luck. Do your best!

2031
01:33:42,828 --> 01:33:45,328
はーい！すいませーん！
Okay! Thank you so much!

2032
01:33:46,328 --> 01:33:51,328
はい、ちょっと別件で質問があるので一瞬下に来てもらうのって…順番待ちしてます？今。
Yes, I have a question about another matter, could you come downstairs for a sec... Are you waiting in line right now?

2033
01:33:51,328 --> 01:33:52,328
あ、大丈夫です。
Ah, it's fine.

2034
01:33:52,328 --> 01:33:55,328
はい、ちょっと下にお願いします。すいません。
Yes, please come downstairs. Sorry about that.

2035
01:33:54,828 --> 01:33:57,328
下チーム、えっと2の方ですか？ボイシー。
Downstairs team, uh, VC 2?

2036
01:33:57,328 --> 01:34:00,128
はい、ビビさんが居るところに…あ、分かりました。移動しまーす。
Yes, where Bibi-san is... Ah, understood. Moving over~

2037
01:34:00,828 --> 01:34:02,828
あ、メディカルブリューこれ。
Ah, here's the Medical Brew.

2038
01:34:02,328 --> 01:34:03,328
ありがとう！
Thank you!

2039
01:34:03,328 --> 01:34:05,328
プテラノドン何してるの？
What is the Pteranodon doing?

2040
01:34:06,828 --> 01:34:09,328
これ乗ったまま飲むとどうなるの？ペット回復する？
What happens if you drink this while riding? Does the pet heal?

2041
01:34:09,328 --> 01:34:11,828
自分かな？どうなんだろう？
Just yourself, maybe? I wonder.

2042
01:34:11,328 --> 01:34:12,828
自分か。
Just yourself, huh.

2043
01:34:12,828 --> 01:34:13,828
うん。
Yeah.

2044
01:34:13,828 --> 01:34:20,828
メディカルブリュリュリュ…ブリュリュリュ…ブリュリュリュリュリュ…ありがとうございます！
Medical brew-ryu-ryu... brew-ryu-ryu... brew-ryu-ryu-ryu-ryu... Thank you very much!

2045
01:34:20,828 --> 01:34:21,828
はい！
Yup!

2046
01:34:21,828 --> 01:34:24,328
いけまっせー。これもう降り得じゃん。
Here we go. Isn't this just pure profit?

2047
01:34:24,828 --> 01:34:29,328
いや、時間になったらって言ってるからまだなのかな？どうなんだろう？もういいかな？
No, she said "once the time comes," so is it not time yet? I wonder. Should we just go?

2048
01:34:28,328 --> 01:34:30,828
降りて、待って…
Dismount, wait...

2049
01:34:30,828 --> 01:34:32,328
あれ？なんか…
Huh? Wait...

2050
01:34:32,328 --> 01:34:35,328
あ、重くなった。あ、動けるか、動けるか。
Ah, it lagged. Ah, can we move, can we move?

2051
01:34:35,328 --> 01:34:36,828
動ける？動ける？
Can you move? Can you move?

2052
01:34:37,828 --> 01:34:40,828
あ、なんかモヤモヤしてる、あそこ！
Ah, something's misty over there!

2053
01:34:40,328 --> 01:34:41,828
モヤモヤしてるよ。
Yeah, it's misty.

2054
01:34:41,528 --> 01:34:43,328
来るっぽいね！行こ、行こう！
Looks like it's coming! Let's go, let's go!

2055
01:34:43,328 --> 01:34:44,828
オッケー！オッケー！
Okay! Okay!

2056
01:34:44,828 --> 01:34:46,328
行きます？
Ready to go?

2057
01:34:46,128 --> 01:34:48,528
うわああ！行けー！
Whoaaa! Gooo!

2058
01:34:48,328 --> 01:34:52,328
行けー！あれじゃない？モヤモヤしてるとこじゃない？あ、来た来た来た来た！
Go! Isn't that it? That misty place? Ah, here it comes, here it comes!

2059
01:34:52,328 --> 01:34:54,328
なんか…
Wait...

2060
01:34:54,328 --> 01:34:55,828
あれ？
Huh?

2061
01:34:55,828 --> 01:34:58,328
うわあああああ！
Whoaaaaaa!

2062
01:35:00,828 --> 01:35:02,328
来た！
It's here!

2063
01:35:02,828 --> 01:35:04,328
うおおお！
Whoaaa!

2064
01:35:06,229 --> 01:35:07,549
え？ どこ行った？
Huh? Where did it go?

2065
01:35:08,199 --> 01:35:09,099
どこ行った？
Where did it go?

2066
01:35:09,199 --> 01:35:10,699
待って待って待って！
Wait, wait, wait!

2067
01:35:10,749 --> 01:35:12,849
やめてー！ユウティが！
Stop! The Yuty is...

2068
01:35:12,849 --> 01:35:14,299
やめてー！
Stop it!

2069
01:35:14,949 --> 01:35:17,549
おりゃおりゃー！
Take that!

2070
01:35:18,149 --> 01:35:21,649
ユウティ逃げる！ユウティ逃げる！ユウティ逃げて！
Yuty is running! Yuty is running! Run, Yuty!

2071
01:35:21,749 --> 01:35:24,849
逃げて、ユウティ！
Run away, Yuty!

2072
01:35:25,399 --> 01:35:26,349
燃えてる
It's burning.

2073
01:35:26,849 --> 01:35:28,949
みんな頑張ってー
Everyone, hang in there!

2074
01:35:29,149 --> 01:35:30,849
よいしょ、ふぅ、どこだどこだ
Alright, phew, where is it?

2075
01:35:30,949 --> 01:35:33,149
ナイス！ユウティはやめて！
Nice! Leave the Yuty alone!

2076
01:35:33,349 --> 01:35:36,749
いやー！やめてー！ダメー！
Nooo! Stop it! No!

2077
01:35:38,349 --> 01:35:39,649
行けー！
Go!

2078
01:35:39,649 --> 01:35:41,149
行けー！
Go for it!

2079
01:35:41,199 --> 01:35:43,349
吸い込まれそうになっちゃう
It's almost sucking us in!

2080
01:35:44,149 --> 01:35:46,549
頑張ってー！
You can do it!

2081
01:35:47,149 --> 01:35:48,349
よいしょ
Alright.

2082
01:35:48,549 --> 01:35:51,649
わおーん、わおーん
*howl* *howl*

2083
01:35:52,349 --> 01:35:54,949
どこだ？ ヘイト買ってる、ヘイト買ってるけど
Where is it? It's drawing aggro, taking the aggro, but...

2084
01:35:55,149 --> 01:35:57,349
ま、ユウティが一番ヘイト高いからな
Well, Yuty draws the most aggro after all.

2085
01:35:57,349 --> 01:35:59,349
ヤバイヤバイヤバイ
Bad, bad, bad, bad!

2086
01:35:59,349 --> 01:36:01,149
ユウティ持っていかれる！
Yuty is gonna get taken out!

2087
01:36:01,349 --> 01:36:02,549
ヤバい？ ダメー！
Is it bad? Nooo!

2088
01:36:02,549 --> 01:36:04,349
早く削りたい削りたい
Gotta whittle it down fast!

2089
01:36:04,449 --> 01:36:07,749
お願い、テリジ、テリジノも出そうか？
Please... Should we bring out Therizino too?

2090
01:36:07,849 --> 01:36:10,349
出してほしいかも、早めに
Yeah, maybe bring it out soon.

2091
01:36:10,349 --> 01:36:12,849
でも結構きついなこれ
This is pretty tough though.

2092
01:36:12,849 --> 01:36:14,349
倒れてる
It went down!

2093
01:36:15,149 --> 01:36:17,549
テリジノ出すよ、これ
Bringing out Therizino.

2094
01:36:18,349 --> 01:36:21,349
おらオラオラー！
Take that, take that!

2095
01:36:21,849 --> 01:36:23,349
よいしょ
Alright.

2096
01:36:24,149 --> 01:36:25,349
変わる変わる
Swapping, swapping.

2097
01:36:27,549 --> 01:36:30,349
ヤバい、ユウティ駄目かも
Oh no, Yuty might not make it.

2098
01:36:30,649 --> 01:36:32,049
あ！
Ah!

2099
01:36:32,049 --> 01:36:34,149
えー！ナイスー！
Whoa! Nice!

2100
01:36:35,349 --> 01:36:38,349
ケラチンめっちゃ手に入る
We get so much keratin!

2101
01:36:38,549 --> 01:36:40,849
おー、よかったよかった。ナイス！
Oh, thank goodness. Nice!

2102
01:36:40,849 --> 01:36:42,149
オッケーい
Okay.

2103
01:36:42,349 --> 01:36:43,349
うわ、重たすぎ
Whoa, way too heavy.

2104
01:36:43,349 --> 01:36:44,349
重っ
Heavy!

2105
01:36:44,349 --> 01:36:48,849
重っ。ちょっと、捨てよう捨てよう捨てよう。捨てよう捨てよう捨てよう。
So heavy. Hold on, let's dump stuff, dump, dump, dump.

2106
01:36:51,849 --> 01:36:53,349
めっちゃ入ってる
There's so much in here!

2107
01:36:53,349 --> 01:36:56,849
めっちゃある！ヤバいこれ！めっちゃある！
There's so much! This is crazy! There's a ton!

2108
01:36:57,349 --> 01:36:59,849
アルゲンって出せる？今
Can you bring out an Argent now?

2109
01:36:59,849 --> 01:37:02,849
アルゲンここで出せんのかな？
Can we bring out an Argent in here?

2110
01:37:02,849 --> 01:37:04,349
かな？
Wonder if we can?

2111
01:37:04,349 --> 01:37:07,349
ま、こんなに別にいらないけどね。出せるわ、どうぞどうぞ
Well, we don't really need this much anyway. I can bring it out, go ahead.

2112
01:37:08,349 --> 01:37:10,349
えーっと
Umm...

2113
01:37:11,349 --> 01:37:13,349
あれほら、アイス...
Look at that, the Ice...

2114
01:37:13,349 --> 01:37:17,349
どこに、アイテムどこに入ったんだ？フブちゃんとか入ったのか？
Where did the items go? Did Fubu-chan get them?

2115
01:37:18,349 --> 01:37:22,849
ん？あ、これアイテム？なんか倒したら何か出るとかじゃないんだ、これ
Hm? Ah, is this the loot? So items don't just drop from defeating it?

2116
01:37:23,349 --> 01:37:25,549
あー、ではない。このクレートかな？
Ah, nope. Probably from these crates?

2117
01:37:25,549 --> 01:37:27,849
うん、4つぐらいあるやつか。
Yeah, the ones where there's around four of them.

2118
01:37:27,849 --> 01:37:29,349
うん、回収しよう
Yeah, let's grab them.

2119
01:37:29,549 --> 01:37:31,849
あ、至高のライフルに...
Ah, an Ascendant rifle and...

2120
01:37:32,349 --> 01:37:34,149
ここ、あ、あっちか
Here... ah, over there?

2121
01:37:34,349 --> 01:37:36,849
ちょっとアルゲンの中に入れさせてもらうわ
I'll stash some in the Argent.

2122
01:37:36,849 --> 01:37:39,349
ポンプショットガンとかいっぱいあるわ
There are tons of pump shotguns and stuff.

2123
01:37:39,349 --> 01:37:40,349
うん
Yeah.

2124
01:37:40,349 --> 01:37:41,849
あれ？アルゲンどこかいる？
Huh? Where's the Argent?

2125
01:37:42,349 --> 01:37:44,349
ここにいるよー
Over here~

2126
01:37:44,349 --> 01:37:45,549
あ、あそこか
Ah, over there.

2127
01:37:46,149 --> 01:37:48,349
大丈夫。こっち行くか。
Alright. Head this way?

2128
01:37:48,349 --> 01:37:49,849
ちょっと走ってきます
I'll run over for a sec.

2129
01:37:49,849 --> 01:37:50,849
インベントリ開く
Opening inventory.

2130
01:37:50,849 --> 01:37:54,849
えーっと、サドル、こんがり肉、セミオート式... なんかまあ全部持って帰ればいいか
Umm, saddle, cooked meat, semi-auto... Guess we can just take everything back.

2131
01:37:56,149 --> 01:37:57,149
うん
Yeah.

2132
01:37:58,849 --> 01:38:00,349
クレート、あー
Crates, ah...

2133
01:38:00,349 --> 01:38:03,149
至高のライフル、激ウマすぎるだな
Ascendant rifle, that's insanely good.

2134
01:38:03,149 --> 01:38:04,149
いいね
Nice.

2135
01:38:04,349 --> 01:38:06,349
待って、入れてます入れてます
Wait, putting stuff in, putting stuff in.

2136
01:38:06,849 --> 01:38:08,849
クレートはもうないかな？
No more crates?

2137
01:38:09,349 --> 01:38:12,349
4つだね、なさそう
Four, right? Doesn't look like any more.

2138
01:38:12,849 --> 01:38:13,849
うん
Yeah.

2139
01:38:14,149 --> 01:38:16,849
ナイスー！ナイスー！ナイスー！
Nice! Nice! Nice!

2140
01:38:17,349 --> 01:38:20,849
ちょっと湧くの怖いから出ちゃおうよ、一回。ポイって
Spawns are scary, so let's get out of here. Dump and run.

2141
01:38:20,849 --> 01:38:21,849
うん、出よう
Yeah, let's head out.

2142
01:38:21,849 --> 01:38:23,849
重くない？大丈夫？
Aren't you heavy? You okay?

2143
01:38:23,849 --> 01:38:25,349
大丈夫ー。オッケー。
I'm good. Okay.

2144
01:38:29,849 --> 01:38:31,849
こっちでいいのかな？出口
Is this way right? For the exit?

2145
01:38:31,849 --> 01:38:34,349
あ、多分...ちょっと重かった
Ah, probably... It was a bit heavy.

2146
01:38:34,549 --> 01:38:36,349
これ何が重たいんだ？
What is making me heavy?

2147
01:38:37,549 --> 01:38:41,349
生肉が重たいか。生肉がまだ重たかったっぽいな
Raw meat is heavy? Seems raw meat was still weighing me down.

2148
01:38:43,349 --> 01:38:45,349
あと道なりか。回収しようか？
Just follow the path then? Shall we pick them up?

2149
01:38:45,549 --> 01:38:49,149
いや、多分捨てるやつだから大丈夫だと思う、割り。
Nah, it's stuff to throw away, so we're probably fine.

2150
01:38:49,349 --> 01:38:50,349
オッケー
Okay.

2151
01:38:50,349 --> 01:38:52,349
よいしょ。ああー
Alright. Ahh~

2152
01:38:54,849 --> 01:38:58,349
ま、一旦お肉だけ、お肉だけ取って、この辺は全部ポイポイっ
Well, for now just take the meat, and dump the rest here.

2153
01:38:56,349 --> 01:38:57,849
お、すげえ、卵がある
Oh wow, there's an egg.

2154
01:39:02,349 --> 01:39:03,349
オッキー
Okey-dokey.

2155
01:39:03,849 --> 01:39:06,849
えーで、みんな待ち
And now, waiting for everyone.

2156
01:39:09,149 --> 01:39:11,349
オッケーです、出ますー
All set, heading out~

2157
01:39:11,349 --> 01:39:12,349
はーい
Okay!

2158
01:39:12,349 --> 01:39:14,349
右左どっちからだ？
Right or left, which way was it?

2159
01:39:14,349 --> 01:39:17,849
右じゃね？これ。上なんか擦り抜けられそうにないけどな
Isn't it right? Though it doesn't look like we can slip through the top.

2160
01:39:17,849 --> 01:39:19,849
気持ち悪っ
Gross.

2161
01:39:19,349 --> 01:39:20,849
キモすぎる
Too gross.

2162
01:39:21,149 --> 01:39:22,849
そもそもそれ行けなくね？
Can we even go through that in the first place?

2163
01:39:22,849 --> 01:39:26,149
アーティファクト回収、アーティファクト、アーティファクトどこにあるんだ？
Artifact retrieval... Artifact, where's the artifact?

2164
01:39:26,149 --> 01:39:28,349
アーティファクトあります？
Is there an artifact?

2165
01:39:28,349 --> 01:39:31,849
これこれこれだと思う。これだけど今湧いてないから
I think this is it right here. But it hasn't spawned right now.

2166
01:39:32,349 --> 01:39:34,849
写真撮ったらいいみたいに言ってなかったっけ？
Didn't they say we just need to take a photo?

2167
01:39:35,149 --> 01:39:36,849
あ、確かに。なんか言ってた気がする
Ah, true. I think someone mentioned that.

2168
01:39:36,849 --> 01:39:38,349
アーティファクト
Artifact.

2169
01:39:38,149 --> 01:39:40,349
とりま写真撮っとくわ。オッケー。はい。
I'll snap a pic for now. Okay. Done.

2170
01:39:40,549 --> 01:39:41,849
撮った
Got it.

2171
01:39:41,849 --> 01:39:42,849
ふんふんふん
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

2172
01:39:42,849 --> 01:39:45,349
右、ここですかね
Right side... through here, maybe?

2173
01:39:46,349 --> 01:39:47,849
そこかな？
Maybe there?

2174
01:39:52,349 --> 01:39:53,349
よし
Alright.

2175
01:39:53,349 --> 01:39:55,849
スクショ助かるー
Thanks for the screenshot~

2176
01:39:55,849 --> 01:39:56,849
右？
Right?

2177
01:39:57,349 --> 01:40:00,849
こっちかな？このまま行ったら出れるのかな？
This way? If we keep going like this, will we get out?

2178
01:40:04,370 --> 01:40:05,370
あれ？
Huh?

2179
01:40:05,370 --> 01:40:07,870
もう、どうやって右行った？あれ？
Wait, how did you go right? Huh?

2180
01:40:07,870 --> 01:40:08,870
あ…
Ah...

2181
01:40:08,870 --> 01:40:09,870
出れなくなった？
Can't get out?

2182
01:40:09,870 --> 01:40:11,870
あ、あ、あ、引っかかってる。
Ah, ah, ah, it's stuck.

2183
01:40:11,870 --> 01:40:13,870
穴から出て？
Come out of the hole?

2184
01:40:13,870 --> 01:40:16,870
これ、ちょっと回収しなきゃいけないかも。
I might need to put it away and retrieve it.

2185
01:40:17,370 --> 01:40:20,370
それ上すり抜けられないもんね。
Yeah, you can't slip through the top.

2186
01:40:20,370 --> 01:40:21,870
うん。
Yeah.

2187
01:40:21,870 --> 01:40:23,370
閉じ込められたか。ん？
Got trapped, huh? Hm?

2188
01:40:23,870 --> 01:40:26,370
もしや回収できない？
Wait, can I not put it away?

2189
01:40:26,870 --> 01:40:32,370
なんかあれかも…ワンチャン、運営案件。
It might be... potentially an admin issue.

2190
01:40:33,870 --> 01:40:39,370
あのボス部屋通れなくなっちゃってるから、閉じ込められたわ。
Since we can't pass through that boss room, we're trapped.

2191
01:40:40,370 --> 01:40:41,370
あー、閉じ込められ案件もしや。
Ah, trapped situation, maybe.

2192
01:40:41,370 --> 01:40:43,370
あ、間違えて降りちゃった。
Ah, I accidentally dismounted.

2193
01:40:43,370 --> 01:40:45,870
かな？こっちじゃないのか、じゃあ。
Maybe? So it's not this way, then?

2194
01:40:46,370 --> 01:40:48,870
いや、フブちゃんたちの方で合ってる、多分。
No, Fubu-chan's way is the right one, probably.

2195
01:40:48,870 --> 01:40:49,870
あ、そうなんだ。
Ah, is that so?

2196
01:40:49,370 --> 01:40:50,870
そっちが、そうそうそう。
That way is—yeah, yeah, yeah.

2197
01:40:50,870 --> 01:40:52,870
あーなるほどね。じゃあこっちで…
Ah, I see. Then over here...

2198
01:40:52,870 --> 01:40:55,870
え、何この…え、何これ？ティラノ生きてるんだけど。
Wait, what is this... Huh? The Rex is alive!

2199
01:40:54,870 --> 01:40:56,370
しまって行こう。
Let's store it and go.

2200
01:40:56,370 --> 01:40:58,370
マジ？倒しとく？
Seriously? Should I kill it?

2201
01:40:58,370 --> 01:41:01,370
収納して、出るのかな？
Store it away, and then we get out, maybe?

2202
01:41:01,870 --> 01:41:05,370
これアキちゃんに言って出してもらわないとかも。
We might need to ask Aki-chan to get us out.

2203
01:41:08,370 --> 01:41:10,370
あ、あそこ重い。
Ah, it's laggy over there.

2204
01:41:10,370 --> 01:41:12,870
よいしょ。じゃーん。
Heave-ho. Ta-da!

2205
01:41:12,870 --> 01:41:15,370
イナ多分出れたかな？
Did Ina manage to get out, maybe?

2206
01:41:15,370 --> 01:41:17,370
運営連絡でいいか。あれ？
I'll just contact the admin. Huh?

2207
01:41:17,370 --> 01:41:18,370
うん。
Yeah.

2208
01:41:18,370 --> 01:41:19,370
戻った？
Did you go back?

2209
01:41:19,370 --> 01:41:20,870
あれ？イナがいない。
Huh? Ina isn't here.

2210
01:41:20,870 --> 01:41:23,870
また戻ってしまった。
Ah, you went back again!

2211
01:41:23,870 --> 01:41:26,370
あらら、さっきのとこで良かったんだね。
Oh dear, the earlier spot was the right one!

2212
01:41:27,370 --> 01:41:29,370
I thought I saw it.

2213
01:41:29,370 --> 01:41:33,370
泳い…泳いだと、思ったけど…
I swam... I thought I swam, but...

2214
01:41:34,870 --> 01:41:36,370
あら、いるかな？
Oh, is someone there?

2215
01:41:36,370 --> 01:41:38,370
戻ってしまった。えへへへ。
I went back again. Hehehe.

2216
01:41:38,370 --> 01:41:39,870
いいよ。
It's all right.

2217
01:41:41,370 --> 01:41:44,370
重い、またここ重い。
Laggy... it's laggy here again.

2218
01:41:44,370 --> 01:41:47,370
登れない、そして。
And I can't climb up.

2219
01:41:47,370 --> 01:41:50,870
なんだっけ、写真…写真はどこに行けばいいんだ？
What was it, the photo... Where do we go for the photo?

2220
01:41:50,870 --> 01:41:53,370
これでプテラしまっちゃって…
Store the Ptera like this...

2221
01:41:53,870 --> 01:41:58,370
カクカク…あ、登れない、登れない。
So stuttery... Ah, can't climb, can't climb.

2222
01:41:58,370 --> 01:42:00,870
なんでこんな登れないの、ここ？
Why is it so hard to climb up here?

2223
01:42:01,370 --> 01:42:04,370
えっと、ここですよ。ここ。先輩。
Um, it's over here! Over here, Senpai!

2224
01:42:04,370 --> 01:42:07,370
で、このまままっすぐ、水渡って行こう。
And straight ahead like this, let's cross the water.

2225
01:42:09,370 --> 01:42:11,370
おいしょ。
Heave-ho.

2226
01:42:14,370 --> 01:42:18,370
うーん…あ、そっか、ここか。
Mmm... Ah, right, here it is.

2227
01:42:19,870 --> 01:42:21,370
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

2228
01:42:21,870 --> 01:42:25,370
外だー！
It's outside!

2229
01:42:25,870 --> 01:42:27,870
ナイスー！
Nice!

2230
01:42:28,370 --> 01:42:30,370
オッケー。うわ。
Okay. Whoa.

2231
01:42:30,370 --> 01:42:34,370
あ、ここから滝に落ちるしかない、もしかして？
Ah, is falling down the waterfall from here the only way, maybe?

2232
01:42:34,870 --> 01:42:38,370
ふー！あ、ジャンプできた。あははは。
Phew! Ah, I managed to jump! Ahahaha.

2233
01:42:38,870 --> 01:42:41,370
アーティファクト部屋から抜けられないらしい。
Looks like we can't escape from the artifact room.

2234
01:42:41,370 --> 01:42:44,370
いーやーーー！
Noooo!

2235
01:42:44,370 --> 01:42:46,370
イナァーーー！
Inaaaa!

2236
01:42:48,370 --> 01:42:49,870
イナ大丈夫か？！
Is Ina okay?!

2237
01:42:50,370 --> 01:42:57,370
生きてます、生きてます、生きてます！
I'm alive, I'm alive, I'm alive!

2238
01:42:57,370 --> 01:43:00,370
あ、痛い痛い痛い…
Ah, ow, ow, ow...

2239
01:43:00,870 --> 01:43:02,870
よかったー！
Thank goodness!

2240
01:43:03,370 --> 01:43:07,870
ふぅ…ふぅー…
Phew... whew...

2241
01:43:08,370 --> 01:43:11,370
よーし。くふぅー。
All right. Hehe.

2242
01:43:11,370 --> 01:43:14,870
ほなら帰るか。
Then, shall we head back?

2243
01:43:12,870 --> 01:43:17,370
え、何？え、何？
Eh, what? What?

2244
01:43:17,370 --> 01:43:19,370
痛い痛い！
Ow, ow!

2245
01:43:19,370 --> 01:43:22,370
なんか落とされて、う、動かん！
I got knocked off and c-can't move!

2246
01:43:22,370 --> 01:43:24,370
ああ。
Ah.

2247
01:43:24,870 --> 01:43:28,370
一旦運営さんにも連絡してみた、メンションして。
I messaged the admin just in case, mentioning them.

2248
01:43:28,370 --> 01:43:29,370
オッケー。
Okay.

2249
01:43:28,870 --> 01:43:30,870
はい。あ、ついた。
Yes. Ah, made it.

2250
01:43:30,370 --> 01:43:31,870
セーフ。
Safe.

2251
01:43:30,870 --> 01:43:33,370
帰ろー！
Let's head back!

2252
01:43:32,870 --> 01:43:34,870
帰る場所ー。
The place to return to...

2253
01:43:34,870 --> 01:43:36,370
おいしょ。
Heave-ho.

2254
01:43:36,870 --> 01:43:41,370
え、でもこれ歩いていける場所ないよね、多分。そもそも通り抜けできないから。
Wait, but there's no way to walk through here, probably. Since we can't pass through in the first place.

2255
01:43:42,870 --> 01:43:45,370
アーティファクト部屋監禁されてる？
Confined in the artifact room?

2256
01:43:45,370 --> 01:43:49,370
そう、アーティファクト部屋監禁…だと思う、これ。
Yeah, artifact room confinement... I think, with this.

2257
01:43:53,370 --> 01:43:55,870
「ちょっと待ってね」だって。
They said "Please wait a moment."

2258
01:43:55,870 --> 01:43:57,370
はーい。
Okay.

2259
01:43:56,870 --> 01:43:58,370
いいよー。
Take your time~

2260
01:43:58,370 --> 01:44:02,870
この後はじゃあ、えっと何になるのかな？えっと…
After this, so what's next? Um...

2261
01:44:03,370 --> 01:44:06,370
ボス部屋にも戻れないんだよね、そもそも。
We can't even go back to the boss room in the first place, either.

2262
01:44:06,370 --> 01:44:09,870
なんか見れない壁が見えるよね、多分ね。
Like, you can see invisible walls, probably.

2263
01:44:09,870 --> 01:44:12,870
そうそう、オーロラの壁が。
Yeah, yeah, aurora walls.

2264
01:44:10,870 --> 01:44:13,370
なんかね、見えない壁が見える。
Yeah, you can see invisible walls.

2265
01:44:13,870 --> 01:44:16,370
見えない壁は見え…見える。
Invisible walls are not see—visible.

2266
01:44:16,370 --> 01:44:19,870
はい、失礼しますー。アキロゼですー。
Hi, pardon the intrusion. This is Akirose.

2267
01:44:19,870 --> 01:44:26,370
アーティファクト部屋閉じ込められてる牡丹ちゃんとトワピは、テレポートして洞窟の外に出します。
For Botan-chan and Towapi trapped in the artifact room, I will teleport you outside the cave.

2268
01:44:26,370 --> 01:44:28,370
あ、ありがとうございます！
Ah, thank you very much!

2269
01:44:28,370 --> 01:44:30,870
はい、そちらでよろしくお願いいたしますで、少々お待ちくださーい。
Yes, please leave it to me, and hold on just a moment.

2270
01:44:30,870 --> 01:44:32,370
はーい。
Okay.

2271
01:44:32,370 --> 01:44:34,870
あいつどこだ？イナ。
Where is that guy? Ina.

2272
01:44:34,870 --> 01:44:37,870
どこだろうね？イナ帰り道これ。
Where is it, I wonder? This is Ina's way back.

2273
01:44:37,870 --> 01:44:40,870
帰りどこだ、そもそもこれ？
Where's the way back in the first place?

2274
01:44:41,870 --> 01:44:43,370
ちょっと嬉しい。
A little happy.

2275
01:44:44,370 --> 01:44:45,870
迷子になってちょっと嬉しい奴。
The kind of person who's a little happy getting lost.

2276
01:44:45,870 --> 01:44:48,370
これ秘密の話だけど、めっちゃちょっと嬉しい。
This is a secret, but I'm super a little happy.

2277
01:44:48,370 --> 01:44:51,370
行けるかな？あー、ちょっと嬉しい？
Can I go? Ah, a little happy?

2278
01:44:51,370 --> 01:44:53,370
たったー！
Ta-da!

2279
01:44:52,870 --> 01:44:55,370
誰にも言えないけどね。
Can't tell anyone, though.

2280
01:44:55,370 --> 01:44:58,370
あと、ししろんが出てきてくれたら、あれでわかるかな？
Also, once Shishiron comes out, will we know from that?

2281
01:44:58,370 --> 01:45:00,870
あ、そうだね。待っとくわ。
Ah, right. I'll wait.

2282
01:44:59,870 --> 01:45:01,370
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

2283
01:45:01,370 --> 01:45:04,370
これそしたらあれだね、このアーティファクト…えっと、アーティファクトじゃなく…
So then, this artifact... um, not artifact...

2284
01:45:04,391 --> 01:45:05,391
で... / うん
So... / Yeah.

2285
01:45:05,441 --> 01:45:08,591
このトロフィー、飾りに行かないとね。
We need to go display this trophy, right?

2286
01:45:08,591 --> 01:45:09,491
そうだね / 確かに
Yeah. / Indeed.

2287
01:45:09,491 --> 01:45:11,291
なんか納品するって。
They said we turn it in.

2288
01:45:11,291 --> 01:45:13,191
そうだよね、そうだよね。
Right, right.

2289
01:45:13,291 --> 01:45:14,891
こっちかー？
Is it this way?

2290
01:45:15,191 --> 01:45:18,991
そしたらそのあとがチームミッションが何だー？
Then after that, what was our team mission?

2291
01:45:21,391 --> 01:45:23,791
あとはあれだよ、ツェッペリン。
After that is the Zeppelin, you know.

2292
01:45:24,891 --> 01:45:28,291
乗って、みんなでわちゃわちゃやろうだぜ。
Let's ride it and mess around together.

2293
01:45:28,291 --> 01:45:29,091
イエイ！
Yay!

2294
01:45:29,891 --> 01:45:34,191
大型恐竜テイムするだ。大型恐竜テイムする。
Taming large dinosaurs. We tame large dinosaurs.

2295
01:45:34,791 --> 01:45:37,591
近くにティラノとかいたから...
There were Tyrannosaurs and stuff nearby, so...

2296
01:45:37,691 --> 01:45:39,691
あの、仮拠点のどこね。
You know, over by the temporary base.

2297
01:45:39,791 --> 01:45:40,791
うん。
Yeah.

2298
01:45:41,391 --> 01:45:42,591
行ってきた。
I went there.

2299
01:45:42,591 --> 01:45:45,291
あ、戻ってきた？え、これどこだ？
Ah, you're back? Huh, where is this?

2300
01:45:45,291 --> 01:45:47,391
あ、自分の地図バグってんだよな。
Ah, my map is bugged.

2301
01:45:47,391 --> 01:45:51,191
あとあれだよ、アキちゃんにさ、あの1時間に1回の申請やっとかないと。
Also, we gotta do that once-an-hour application with Aki-chan.

2302
01:45:51,691 --> 01:45:54,091
一応チャレンジ申請っつって。
For the challenge application.

2303
01:45:54,091 --> 01:45:56,591
あ、そうだ。チャレンジ申請だから、もうすぐやっちゃうじゃん。
Ah right. Since it's a challenge application, we can do it right away.

2304
01:45:57,191 --> 01:46:00,091
いいんじゃない？ / トワ様見えます。
Sounds good! / Towa-sama is visible.

2305
01:46:00,091 --> 01:46:02,291
あ、戻っち...あ、あっちだ、あっちだ。
Ah, go back... ah, that way, over there!

2306
01:46:02,591 --> 01:46:04,991
おいでー。
Come on over~

2307
01:46:05,391 --> 01:46:07,291
トワのこと見える？
Can you see Towa?

2308
01:46:07,391 --> 01:46:08,391
トワ様ー！
Towa-sama~!

2309
01:46:08,391 --> 01:46:10,791
地図で、地図で見える。
On the map, I can see you on the map.

2310
01:46:11,091 --> 01:46:12,391
遠い！
So far!

2311
01:46:12,391 --> 01:46:15,391
みんなもう合流してんのか。ごめんごめん、今行きます。
Has everyone regrouped already? Sorry, sorry, coming now.

2312
01:46:15,391 --> 01:46:18,391
テレポ場所が分からなくて迷子なんですが、こっち。
I don't know where the teleport spot is and got lost, but I'm over here.

2313
01:46:18,591 --> 01:46:21,691
あ、テレポ場所はもっと...
Ah, the teleport spot is further...

2314
01:46:21,891 --> 01:46:24,391
もっと雪山の方。
Further towards the snowy mountain.

2315
01:46:24,491 --> 01:46:25,791
え、どこだ？
Eh, where?

2316
01:46:27,391 --> 01:46:29,091
こっちかな？
This way?

2317
01:46:30,891 --> 01:46:32,391
山の方よね。
Towards the mountain, right?

2318
01:46:32,391 --> 01:46:36,791
あの雪山を近くにして回ったら...
If you keep that snowy mountain close and go around...

2319
01:46:36,891 --> 01:46:38,391
ここかな？
Around here?

2320
01:46:38,391 --> 01:46:41,791
先輩たち、すいません、ちょっと共有していいですか？
Senpais, sorry, can I share something real quick?

2321
01:46:41,791 --> 01:46:42,591
はいはーい。
Sure thing~

2322
01:46:42,791 --> 01:46:47,391
なんか、ムキロゼのやつ、ムキロゼミッションちょっと事前申請しとかないといけなくて...
Um, for the Mukiroze one, we have to apply in advance for the Mukiroze mission...

2323
01:46:47,491 --> 01:46:48,291
そうそうそう。
Right, right.

2324
01:46:48,291 --> 01:46:51,691
事前申請、今書いて21時だから一旦申請しといたんですけど...
I filled out the advance application and since it's 21:00, I submitted it for now, but...

2325
01:46:51,691 --> 01:46:53,191
オッケー！ / ありがたい！今帰ってます！
Okay! / Thank you! We're on our way back now!

2326
01:46:53,391 --> 01:46:58,991
ユウティラかギガノト、見つけられたやつで始められるので、どっちかを今頑張ってみんな血眼になって探してもらっていいですか？
We can start with whichever one is found, Yutyrannus or Giganotosaurus, so could everyone please look frantically for either one right now?

2327
01:46:58,991 --> 01:47:02,591
今下で開会式んとこのマンボウ太鼓やってます、こっち。
Right now I'm playing the mambo drums down at the opening ceremony area, over here.

2328
01:47:06,191 --> 01:47:08,291
あ、了解！ / オッケー、ありがとう！
Ah, roger! / Okay, thank you!

2329
01:47:08,391 --> 01:47:11,391
じゃ戻ったら探しに行こう！ / マンモスが大人になり出したか...
Then let's go search once we're back! / Did the mammoths start becoming adults...?

2330
01:47:11,391 --> 01:47:14,291
ユウティラ、どんなやつだろう？
What kind of creature is a Yutyra?

2331
01:47:14,891 --> 01:47:16,891
ユウティラ...
Yutyra...

2332
01:47:16,891 --> 01:47:19,891
なんか雪山にいるとか言ってなかった？気のせい？
Didn't they say it was in the snowy mountains? Or am I imagining it?

2333
01:47:20,391 --> 01:47:24,191
ユウティラは...ユウティラはトワがさっき乗ってたやつだよ。
Yutyra is... Yutyra is the one Towa was riding earlier.

2334
01:47:24,191 --> 01:47:26,391
あ、そうなんだ。あの毛、毛むくじゃらのやつ？
Ah, is that so? That furry one?

2335
01:47:26,391 --> 01:47:28,391
あ、そうそうそうそう。
Ah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

2336
01:47:31,891 --> 01:47:34,391
着いたー！ここだね。
Arrived! Here it is.

2337
01:47:34,391 --> 01:47:39,391
うわー、スタミナがあああ。
Uwah, my stamina is ahhh!

2338
01:47:40,891 --> 01:47:42,591
ほい。
There we go.

2339
01:47:45,191 --> 01:47:46,891
じゃ、探すか。
Well, shall we go look?

2340
01:47:46,891 --> 01:47:48,591
はい、そうだね。
Yes, let's.

2341
01:47:48,591 --> 01:47:50,391
ユウティラ、ギガノト...
Yutyra, Giganoto...

2342
01:47:52,391 --> 01:47:54,391
ユウティラかギガノト...
Yutyra or Giganoto...

2343
01:47:55,391 --> 01:47:58,291
オッケー。ほなじゃあ、テレポします。
Okay. Well then, I'll teleport.

2344
01:47:58,391 --> 01:48:00,391
はーい。
Okay~

2345
01:48:00,391 --> 01:48:01,391
あざっす。
Thanks.

2346
01:48:02,391 --> 01:48:04,391
ふぅー。
Phew~

2347
01:48:04,391 --> 01:48:07,891
あ、集会場行かなきゃじゃない？
Ah, shouldn't we go to the assembly hall?

2348
01:48:07,891 --> 01:48:09,891
あ、そっか、集会場もか。
Ah, right, the assembly hall too.

2349
01:48:11,391 --> 01:48:16,391
トロフィーが、えっと待って、もしかするとアルゲンに入ってるかも。
The trophy is... wait, it might be in the Argentavis.

2350
01:48:16,391 --> 01:48:17,891
あ、オッケーオッケー。
Ah, okay, okay.

2351
01:48:21,391 --> 01:48:24,391
ちょっと見たいとこあるから、お願いしていいっすか？
There's somewhere I want to check, so can I leave it to you?

2352
01:48:24,391 --> 01:48:25,391
オッケーオッケー。
Okay, okay.

2353
01:48:25,891 --> 01:48:28,391
えっと、どれだどれだどれだ？
Um, which one is it, which one?

2354
01:48:28,391 --> 01:48:30,891
あ、これか！アイスワーム女王のトロフィー、オッケー。
Ah, this one! Iceworm Queen Trophy, okay.

2355
01:48:30,891 --> 01:48:32,091
取った！
Got it!

2356
01:48:32,091 --> 01:48:33,891
お、キター！
Oh, nice!

2357
01:48:34,391 --> 01:48:36,891
ドレッドノート出すって何だ？
What's "summon a Dreadnoughtus"?

2358
01:48:37,891 --> 01:48:40,891
あれかな？銃乗っけられる亀かな？
Is that it? That turtle you can put guns on?

2359
01:48:40,891 --> 01:48:43,391
おおー / へえー
Ooh~ / Huh~

2360
01:48:44,391 --> 01:48:46,891
よっしょ。オッケー、ありがとう。
Alrighty. Okay, thank you.

2361
01:48:47,391 --> 01:48:49,391
あ、ごめん、集会場来ちゃった。
Ah sorry, I came to the assembly hall.

2362
01:48:49,391 --> 01:48:51,391
いいよー。
It's fine~

2363
01:48:51,891 --> 01:48:55,891
なんかライフルとか革靴とかは...
As for the rifles and leather boots and stuff...

2364
01:48:57,391 --> 01:48:59,891
あ、一旦これ借りちゃおうかな。
Ah, maybe I'll borrow this for now.

2365
01:48:59,891 --> 01:49:03,391
えっと、トロフィーどこだっけ？なんかどっかの樽の中だっけ？
Um, where was the trophy again? Was it in one of the barrels?

2366
01:49:04,391 --> 01:49:06,391
こっちやでーす。
It's over this way~

2367
01:49:06,891 --> 01:49:09,891
あのー、中央の... / あ、ここで合ってた。
Um, the center... / Ah, this was the right spot.

2368
01:49:09,891 --> 01:49:11,891
中央...
The center...

2369
01:49:12,891 --> 01:49:15,391
なんかトロフィーはどこどこみたいなの無かったっけ？
Wasn't there something saying where the trophies go?

2370
01:49:15,391 --> 01:49:18,391
えっと、集会所の樽...あ、樽にアーティファクトを納品してくだ...
Um, the assembly hall barrel... ah, "Deliver artifacts to the barrel..."

2371
01:49:18,391 --> 01:49:21,391
樽、樽。
Barrel, barrel.

2372
01:49:21,891 --> 01:49:24,391
集会場の近くの樽？
A barrel near the assembly hall?

2373
01:49:24,391 --> 01:49:25,891
あ、これか？
Ah, this one?

2374
01:49:26,391 --> 01:49:28,391
あ、これだ！
Ah, it's this!

2375
01:49:28,891 --> 01:49:30,891
あ、ユーティね。
Ah, Yuty, right.

2376
01:49:30,891 --> 01:49:32,391
ユーティ探さ...
Search for Yuty...

2377
01:49:32,391 --> 01:49:34,391
ユーティは、あの...
Yuty is, um...

2378
01:49:34,391 --> 01:49:36,891
ユーティ、冷蔵庫の中。
Yuty is in the fridge.

2379
01:49:36,891 --> 01:49:38,891
あ、はいはい、お願いします。
Ah, right, right, please do.

2380
01:49:38,891 --> 01:49:40,891
オッケーオッケー。入れとくねー。
Okay, okay. I'll put it in~

2381
01:49:40,891 --> 01:49:41,891
はーい。
Okay.

2382
01:49:42,391 --> 01:49:44,891
ユーティ、ボロボロね。
Yuty is all battered, huh.

2383
01:49:45,191 --> 01:49:46,891
いや、頑張りましたね。
Yeah, it worked hard.

2384
01:49:46,891 --> 01:49:51,891
いや、でもユーティあの、あれ持ってますよ。死んでも戻れる...
Yeah, but Yuty has that, you know. The thing that revives it even if it dies...

2385
01:49:52,891 --> 01:49:55,891
あー、確かに確かに。 / 入れましたので。
Ah, true, true. / I put it in.

2386
01:49:56,891 --> 01:49:58,891
ほんなら戻るか。
Well then, shall we head back?

2387
01:50:03,391 --> 01:50:04,391
よししょ。
Alrighty.

2388
01:50:04,412 --> 01:50:07,212
トロフィーとアーティファクト もしかして違うか？
Could trophies and artifacts be different?

2389
01:50:07,612 --> 01:50:08,612
ビビさん…
Bibi-san...

2390
01:50:08,612 --> 01:50:10,112
１個１個別だね それ
Those are separate items.

2391
01:50:10,412 --> 01:50:13,212
えっ じゃあ待って トロフィーはどこだ？
Wait then, where's the trophy?

2392
01:50:13,412 --> 01:50:15,312
あ ビビ飛ばしてもらおう
Ah, I'll have Bibi fly me.

2393
01:50:15,412 --> 01:50:17,812
トロ… トロフィーの納品所は違うか？
Is the drop-off spot for trophies different?

2394
01:50:17,912 --> 01:50:19,412
だから重いが…
That's why it's heavy...

2395
01:50:19,612 --> 01:50:21,412
I dropped all...

2396
01:50:21,412 --> 01:50:22,912
えっ Oops...
Um... Oops...

2397
01:50:24,212 --> 01:50:26,212
ポータル1回使っても…
Even if I use the portal once...

2398
01:50:26,312 --> 01:50:30,912
ちょっと待ってくださいね すみません なんかバグってマンモスが出ちゃった 失礼 どうぞ オッケー
Please wait a moment, sorry. A mammoth popped out due to a bug. Sorry about that, go ahead. Okay.

2399
01:50:31,212 --> 01:50:34,212
ナイスマンモスクエスト！ ナイスー！
Nice mammoth quest! Nice!

2400
01:50:34,312 --> 01:50:37,612
終わりまして 報酬ももらってきましたー
We finished it, and I got the rewards too!

2401
01:50:37,712 --> 01:50:40,412
あれ？ なんかいつの間にか自分の上にダキスに乗ってたわ
Huh? Without realizing it, Dakis was riding on top of me.

2402
01:50:40,512 --> 01:50:43,412
いいよ 戻った戻った
That's fine. Ah, I'm back, I'm back.

2403
01:50:43,412 --> 01:50:49,212
あと約10分くらいで もう見つけなきゃいけなくて ユウティラか ええと 何だっけ？
In about 10 minutes, we have to find it... Yuty or, um, what was it?

2404
01:50:49,412 --> 01:50:54,212
ユウティラが多分 一番見つかりやすいかな？ 見つけようと思ったら 多分
Yuty is probably the easiest to find, if we try looking. Probably.

2405
01:50:54,312 --> 01:50:55,412
なるほど
I see.

2406
01:50:55,612 --> 01:51:00,812
で この何だ ツェッペリンがちょっと今からテレポートができるのか ちょっ試します
And I'll test right now whether this Zeppelin can teleport.

2407
01:51:00,912 --> 01:51:01,612
はい
Okay.

2408
01:51:01,712 --> 01:51:04,412
はー これってモンボに入れられるのか？
Huh, can this be put into a Cryopod?

2409
01:51:04,412 --> 01:51:05,412
来た 来た 来た
It's here, it's here!

2410
01:51:05,612 --> 01:51:08,412
え？ 入れられないんじゃない？
Huh? You probably can't, right?

2411
01:51:08,412 --> 01:51:09,412
どうなんやろう？
I wonder?

2412
01:51:09,512 --> 01:51:11,912
ちょっやってみます 物は試し
I'll try it out. Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

2413
01:51:12,012 --> 01:51:12,912
よしよし
Alright.

2414
01:51:13,012 --> 01:51:15,212
お前は恐竜なのか？ どっちなんだい？
Are you a dinosaur? Which one are you?

2415
01:51:15,412 --> 01:51:18,912
でも テレポ場所に載せれば 一緒に行くんじゃないの？
But if you put it on the teleport spot, wouldn't it go together?

2416
01:51:21,212 --> 01:51:24,212
果たして… 果たして… うーん…
Will it...? Will it...? Hmm...

2417
01:51:24,412 --> 01:51:26,412
By the snow area.

2418
01:51:27,412 --> 01:51:30,912
これ出張センターの9時から10時までってこと？
Does this mean the mission terminal is from 9:00 to 10:00?

2419
01:51:31,012 --> 01:51:34,212
そうなんですよ その1時間枠で みたいな
That's right. During that 1-hour slot, basically.

2420
01:51:34,312 --> 01:51:35,212
なるほどね
I see.

2421
01:51:35,212 --> 01:51:38,912
だからまあユウティラやるんだったら9時45分までにやんなきゃいけないし ギガノトやるんだったら…
So if we do Yuty, we have to do it by 9:45, and if we do Giga...

2422
01:51:39,012 --> 01:51:42,912
いや 多分着いた時点で なんかスタートらしくて…
No, apparently it starts the moment you arrive...

2423
01:51:43,912 --> 01:51:45,612
なるほど あれ？ アルゲン…
I see. Huh? If Argent...

2424
01:51:45,712 --> 01:51:49,412
だから9時になった瞬間もう始まっちゃうから 今すぐ見つけとかないといけない
So it starts the moment it hits 9:00, so we have to find it right now.

2425
01:51:49,412 --> 01:51:50,412
え そうなの？
Oh, really?

2426
01:51:50,412 --> 01:51:53,412
多分 らしいです で 次の枠が10時らしくて…
Apparently so. And the next slot is at 10:00...

2427
01:51:53,412 --> 01:51:54,412
いいよ
Got it.

2428
01:51:54,412 --> 01:51:58,412
ちょっと… 多分雪山にユウティラいると思うから 雪山… ぐるっと回ってたら…
Wait... I think Yuty is on the snowy mountain, so if we go around the mountain...

2429
01:51:58,412 --> 01:51:59,412
だよね
Right.

2430
01:51:59,412 --> 01:52:01,912
ちょっとこれ違うとこ… 慌てて… 雪山ね これ火山
Wait, this is a different place... In a rush... Snowy mountain, yeah. This is the volcano.

2431
01:52:02,212 --> 01:52:06,412
そう あ だからもうツェッペリン乗って雪山集会所一緒に行ってもいいかもね みんなで
Yeah! Ah, so maybe we can all ride the Zeppelin to the snowy mountain meeting point together.

2432
01:52:06,412 --> 01:52:09,412
オッケーです 今雪山で走ってます
Okay. I'm running around the snowy mountain right now.

2433
01:52:09,412 --> 01:52:12,412
あ ツェッペリン集会場置いといてもらえたら嬉しい
Ah, I'd appreciate it if you could leave the Zeppelin at the meeting point.

2434
01:52:12,412 --> 01:52:14,912
ツェッペリン集会場 はい ちょっと待って
Zeppelin meeting point, okay, wait a moment.

2435
01:52:15,212 --> 01:52:17,412
じゃあツェッペリン一緒に乗っていこうかな
Then should I ride the Zeppelin with you?

2436
01:52:17,412 --> 01:52:19,412
そうそうそう みんなで一緒に乗っていこう オッケー
Yes yes yes, let's all ride together. Okay.

2437
01:52:19,612 --> 01:52:22,412
え だったらみんなもう弓 麻酔矢持った方がいいんじゃない？
In that case, shouldn't everyone bring bows and tranq arrows?

2438
01:52:22,412 --> 01:52:23,912
そうだね 麻酔矢と…
Right, tranq arrows and...

2439
01:52:23,912 --> 01:52:26,412
はーい 分かりました 了解でーす
Okay! / Understood! / Roger that!

2440
01:52:26,412 --> 01:52:29,412
ちょっとごめん 先行っててもらっていい？ 後で合流するわ
Sorry, can you go ahead? I'll catch up later.

2441
01:52:29,412 --> 01:52:30,912
オッケー はーい
Okay. Sure.

2442
01:52:30,912 --> 01:52:34,912
ちょっと待って これ降ろせない 今 恐竜が下にいっぱい居すぎて…
Wait a second, I can't land this. There are too many dinosaurs below right now...

2443
01:52:35,412 --> 01:52:37,912
あ 外でよかった 外で 行けます？
Ah, outside is fine, outside. Can you make it?

2444
01:52:37,912 --> 01:52:40,912
はい オッケー これで…
Yes, okay. With this...

2445
01:52:41,412 --> 01:52:45,912
えーっと 降りました？ 麻酔矢もちょっと後で分けてもらうかもです 誰かに
Um, did you get off? I might need someone to share some tranq arrows later.

2446
01:52:46,412 --> 01:52:49,412
私今142本だな 足りないか
I have 142 right now. Not enough?

2447
01:52:49,412 --> 01:52:52,212
あ いや 多分みんなで撃てば足りるはず
Ah, no, if everyone shoots it should be enough.

2448
01:52:52,212 --> 01:52:53,412
足りるか
Should be enough, yeah.

2449
01:52:53,912 --> 01:52:56,212
えー 50本ある はい
Uh, here's 50, here.

2450
01:52:56,212 --> 01:52:59,212
ありがとうございます 84本だけ置いとく
Thank you. I'll leave 84.

2451
01:52:59,412 --> 01:53:00,912
ありがとうございます
Thank you very much.

2452
01:53:00,912 --> 01:53:02,912
あれ？ 取れねえ 何だと？
Huh? Can't pick it up. What?

2453
01:53:03,412 --> 01:53:06,412
よし ちょっと待ってください あれだ
Alright. Please wait a sec, that's it.

2454
01:53:06,412 --> 01:53:10,412
ふんふん この中にこれ入れっぱだ 危ねー
Mm-hmm, left this inside here. That was close.

2455
01:53:10,412 --> 01:53:12,912
ビビも麻酔198個持ってるから
Bibi has 198 tranqs too.

2456
01:53:12,912 --> 01:53:15,212
あ オッケーオッケー じゃあ ビビも乗ってくれ
Ah, okay okay. Then Bibi, get on too!

2457
01:53:15,212 --> 01:53:18,412
よし 乗った！ 私も行きます！ 乗って乗ってー！ みんなで行こうぜー！
Alright, got on! / I'm coming too! / Get on, get on! / Let's all go together!

2458
01:53:18,412 --> 01:53:20,912
拠点の上集合！
Assemble above the base!

2459
01:53:21,212 --> 01:53:23,912
頑張ってー！ 後で行く！ 絶対に！
Good luck! I'll come later! Absolutely!

2460
01:53:23,912 --> 01:53:26,912
ビビ 後ろから こっちか ちょっと待って 今作ってたという…
Bibi, from behind! / This way? Wait a bit, I was just crafting...

2461
01:53:26,912 --> 01:53:30,912
体重てえ あいつ！ 重たい！ 動け ビビ 走れ！
His body is heavy! / Heavy! Move, Bibi! Run!

2462
01:53:31,412 --> 01:53:34,412
一旦キャンセルしてもいいかも？ は はい 分かる
Maybe you can cancel it once? / Y-Yes, got it.

2463
01:53:34,412 --> 01:53:37,412
一旦降りました 乗れた いいよいいよ
Got off once. I'm on! / Great, great.

2464
01:53:37,412 --> 01:53:39,412
ちょっとワイバーンで追いかけますわ 自分も
I'll chase after on my Wyvern too.

2465
01:53:39,412 --> 01:53:41,912
これアルゲン持っていかなくていいですか？ いらない
Don't we need to bring the Argent? / No need.

2466
01:53:41,912 --> 01:53:43,912
ヴァルキで拾ってもらう オッケーオッケー
I'll have them pick it up with the Valk. / Okay okay.

2467
01:53:43,912 --> 01:53:45,412
待って 門に… はい 居ない
Wait, at the gate... okay. Not there.

2468
01:53:45,412 --> 01:53:48,412
麻酔矢… 麻酔矢撃った後の流れは？
Tranq arrows... what's the plan after shooting tranq arrows?

2469
01:53:48,412 --> 01:53:51,412
麻酔矢 撃つだけでいい 撃つだけでいい？ オッケー
Tranq arrows, just shooting is fine. / Just shooting is fine? Okay.

2470
01:53:51,412 --> 01:53:55,412
そう 一旦 で 寝たらお肉を誰か入れに行く感じだな ああ なるほど
Yeah, for now. And once it's asleep, someone goes put meat in. / Ah, I see.

2471
01:53:55,412 --> 01:53:58,412
お肉持ってる？ みんな 私お肉持ってない
Does everyone have meat? I don't have meat.

2472
01:53:58,412 --> 01:54:01,412
お肉ある 霜降り肉3個だけある
I have meat. / I only have 3 prime meats.

2473
01:54:01,412 --> 01:54:06,412
お肉ある人 じゃあ… ジャンプで… はい あ お肉持ちました あざす オッケー
Whoever has meat then... / Jump... yes. / Ah, I got meat. / Thanks. / Okay.

2474
01:54:06,412 --> 01:54:09,912
水が… えーっと… あ… うわ…
Water... Um... Ah... Whoa...

2475
01:54:10,412 --> 01:54:14,912
やばい これ引っかかった？ いや 大丈夫か
Oh no, did this get stuck? No, is it okay?

2476
01:54:15,412 --> 01:54:19,412
あれ？ 引っかかった？ 大丈夫か
Huh? Is it stuck? Is it okay?

2477
01:54:19,412 --> 01:54:22,412
上に行けないかも… 猫かわいいー！ 出てしまった
Might not be able to go up... / The cat is so cute! / It came out.

2478
01:54:22,412 --> 01:54:26,412
待って まさかの引っか… 引っかかったかも！ 引っかかったー！
Wait, no way, it might be stu... stuck! / It got stuck!

2479
01:54:26,412 --> 01:54:29,412
行けた 行けた 行けた ちょっとコツが コツがありまして それ
Got it, got it, got it! / There's a bit of a trick, a trick to it.

2480
01:54:29,412 --> 01:54:33,412
やりましょうか？ 大丈夫か？ 大丈夫ですか？
Shall I do it? Is it okay? Are you okay?

2481
01:54:33,412 --> 01:54:37,912
引っかかって… どあ！ あ 行けた行けた行けた！ 行けた行けた行けた！ イエーイ！
Stuck and... Whoa! Ah, got through, got through! / Got through, got through! / Yay!

2482
01:54:38,412 --> 01:54:41,412
いいね 行こう行こう行こう！ いいねいいねいいねー！
Nice, let's go, let's go! / Nice, nice, nice!

2483
01:54:41,412 --> 01:54:45,412
よし シフトで浮上で大丈夫だよね 多分 あ いい
Alright, ascending with Shift should be fine, probably. Ah, good.

2484
01:54:45,412 --> 01:54:50,412
で 一応 あ シフトっていうかダッシュボタン入れると走れます
And just in case, ah, rather than Shift, pressing the dash button lets it sprint.

2485
01:54:50,412 --> 01:54:52,412
だよね オッケーオッケー
Right, okay okay.

2486
01:54:52,412 --> 01:54:57,412
ちょっとユウティラ ちょっと足速い恐竜で探しながらにしようかな ちょっと待って
Should I search for Yuty using a fast dino? Wait a sec.

2487
01:54:57,412 --> 01:55:01,412
なんかこれ上 上に飛ばないんだよね なんでだろう これ？
Somehow this doesn't fly upwards. Why is that?

2488
01:55:01,412 --> 01:55:04,412
ちょっとモフモフの…
A fluffy...

2489
01:55:07,233 --> 01:55:10,033
上に、上に向かって進んでこれない？
Can you not move while facing upwards?

2490
01:55:10,433 --> 01:55:14,433
あ、えっと、カーソルを上に向けたままWの発進で...
Ah, um, keep the cursor aimed up and press W to move forward...

2491
01:55:14,533 --> 01:55:17,133
あ、これか、これかこれか。こうだ、こうだこうだ。
Ah, this? Is it this, this? Like this, like this, like this.

2492
01:55:17,633 --> 01:55:19,933
なんかダスキンが死んでいる。
Looks like Duskin is dead.

2493
01:55:21,233 --> 01:55:23,433
ツェッペリンの上でダスキン死んでました。
Duskin died on top of the Zeppelin.

2494
01:55:23,633 --> 01:55:26,433
え、嘘！あ、しま...しまったよ。
What, really?! Ah, put... I put it away.

2495
01:55:26,533 --> 01:55:29,433
あ、しまった？あ、じゃあ死んでないんだ。これ何だ？お肉が残って...
Ah, stored? Ah, so it's not dead. What's this? Meat left behind...

2496
01:55:29,533 --> 01:55:31,433
多分お肉が残ってるんじゃないかな？
Maybe some meat was left behind?

2497
01:55:31,533 --> 01:55:32,933
あ、もらいました。
Ah, I took it.

2498
01:55:33,033 --> 01:55:35,233
よっしゃ、じゃあ周りにユウティラいないか。
Alright, let's see if there are any Yutyrannus around.

2499
01:55:35,433 --> 01:55:40,933
あ、やばい、やばい今。あー、ござるの皿の、膝の皿がバリバリバリバリ...
Ah, oh no, oh no. Ah, my kneecaps are grinding and shaking...

2500
01:55:41,433 --> 01:55:44,433
落ち着いて、落ち着いて。大丈夫？
Calm down, calm down. You okay?

2501
01:55:44,533 --> 01:55:48,133
遅いからワイバーンがいいかもしれないね、もしかすると。
It's slow, so maybe a Wyvern would be better.

2502
01:55:48,433 --> 01:55:50,933
ワイバーン、ワイバーンどこにいる？
A Wyvern... where's the Wyvern?

2503
01:55:51,033 --> 01:55:52,733
トワ今ワイバーン乗ってる。
Towa is riding a Wyvern right now.

2504
01:55:52,833 --> 01:55:55,233
そうですね。トワに探せてもらえたら嬉しいな。
Right. It'd be great if Towa could search for one.

2505
01:55:55,433 --> 01:55:58,033
探してー。アルゲンでめっちゃ探してます。
Please search! I'm searching everywhere on the Argentavis.

2506
01:55:58,133 --> 01:55:59,733
オッケー。マジ遅いけど。
Okay. Though it's super slow.

2507
01:55:59,833 --> 01:56:02,233
ね、ビビの肩見て、ぼたん先輩。
Hey, look at Vivi's shoulder, Botan-senpai.

2508
01:56:02,333 --> 01:56:03,233
何？何乗ってんの？
What? What's riding on it?

2509
01:56:03,333 --> 01:56:04,433
膝の皿がバリバリ...
My kneecaps are grinding...

2510
01:56:04,533 --> 01:56:05,733
ニャーニャー。猫乗ってる？
Meow meow. Is there a cat on you?

2511
01:56:05,833 --> 01:56:08,433
可愛いでしょ。かわいい。
Cute, right? - Cute.

2512
01:56:08,533 --> 01:56:11,933
なんかワイバーン飛んでる。え、あれは知り合いのワイバーンなのか？
There's a Wyvern flying. Is that an acquaintance's Wyvern?

2513
01:56:12,033 --> 01:56:13,533
あれはトワのワイバーンじゃない？
Isn't that Towa's Wyvern?

2514
01:56:13,633 --> 01:56:16,133
いや、水色のワイバーンなんです。
No, it's a light blue Wyvern.

2515
01:56:16,433 --> 01:56:18,933
じゃあ知らないワイバーンかも。知らないワイバーンだ。
Then it might be an unknown Wyvern. It's a wild Wyvern.

2516
01:56:19,033 --> 01:56:22,233
あ、水色ワイバーンはアイスワイバーンだね。雪山にいるんだよ。
Ah, light blue Wyverns are Ice Wyverns. They live in the snowy mountains.

2517
01:56:22,433 --> 01:56:24,533
この下のやつ、それじゃないの？
The one below us, isn't that it?

2518
01:56:24,633 --> 01:56:26,433
あ、あれか！あれかも！
Ah, that one?! Might be that one!

2519
01:56:26,533 --> 01:56:28,433
あれじゃない？あのモフモフどう？
Isn't that it? How about that fluffy one?

2520
01:56:28,533 --> 01:56:31,433
え？これモフ...これモフそうじゃない？あれ。
Huh? Isn't this fluff... isn't that fluffy?

2521
01:56:31,533 --> 01:56:35,433
あ、今ちょうど下下下下！これこれこれ！
Ah, right now right below, down, down, down! This, this, this!

2522
01:56:35,533 --> 01:56:37,433
居た居た居た！
There it is, there it is!

2523
01:56:37,533 --> 01:56:40,933
これ麻酔撃っていいやつ？撃っちゃっていいと思う。オッケー。
Can we shoot tranqs at this? - I think you can shoot it. Okay.

2524
01:56:41,433 --> 01:56:45,233
えー、47の51、47の51に居る。
Um, 47, 51. It's at 47, 51.

2525
01:56:45,333 --> 01:56:47,933
47、51了解です。
47, 51, copy that.

2526
01:56:48,633 --> 01:56:50,733
うわ、すごい音するな。
Whoa, that's making an intense sound.

2527
01:56:50,833 --> 01:56:52,433
ほな待っとくか。
Guess we'll wait then.

2528
01:56:52,933 --> 01:56:57,433
え、なんかフブさんと、ぼたん先輩、イナ先輩の肩に乗ってるの猫？
Wait, is that a cat on Fubu-san, Botan-senpai, and Ina-senpai's shoulders?

2529
01:56:57,533 --> 01:56:58,633
猫やで。
It's a cat.

2530
01:56:58,733 --> 01:57:02,033
ニャーン。停止しました。
Meow~ I stopped.

2531
01:57:04,233 --> 01:57:08,433
おや？よいしょ、これで...
Huh? Up we go, with this...

2532
01:57:08,533 --> 01:57:11,933
寒そう、ギリースーツ。これ要るかな？
The Ghillie suit looks cold. Do we need this?

2533
01:57:12,033 --> 01:57:14,933
オッケーです。発見、発見。えー。
Okay. Spotted, spotted. Ehhh.

2534
01:57:15,233 --> 01:57:18,433
まあまあ、大丈夫です。なんとなく。
Well, well, it's fine. Somehow.

2535
01:57:18,533 --> 01:57:19,933
良かった。
That's good.

2536
01:57:21,433 --> 01:57:24,933
これって自分運転席から離れていったら落ちる？
If I leave the driver's seat, will it fall?

2537
01:57:25,433 --> 01:57:29,933
あー、1回着陸させて...からのほうがいいかも。
Ah, maybe it's better to land it once first.

2538
01:57:30,933 --> 01:57:33,933
あれは何？あれブロントじゃないよね？
What is that? That's not a Bronto, right?

2539
01:57:34,433 --> 01:57:37,933
えっと、もっと結構でかめなやつよ。
Um, it's a pretty big one.

2540
01:57:38,933 --> 01:57:42,433
あ、やべ。アルゲンやっちゃった。アルゲンやっちゃった。
Ah, shoot. I hit the Argentavis. I hit the Argentavis.

2541
01:57:42,533 --> 01:57:44,933
なんかビビ落ちた。何で？
Wait, Vivi fell. Why?

2542
01:57:45,033 --> 01:57:49,933
ビビビビ乗って！助けて！ビビー！
Vivi, Vivi, get on! Help! Viviii!

2543
01:57:50,433 --> 01:57:54,433
動きが重たんだが、お前！痛い！ビビー！
Your movement is so slow! Ouch! Viviii!

2544
01:57:54,533 --> 01:57:56,433
掴める？
Can you grab it?

2545
01:57:56,533 --> 01:57:59,933
いや、ああ、ちょっと待って。ビビさんを掴め...痛い！
No, ah, wait a sec. Grab Vivi-san... Ouch!

2546
01:58:00,433 --> 01:58:03,933
むずい、人突つくの。痛い！大丈夫か？
It's hard to peck people. Ouch! You okay?

2547
01:58:04,433 --> 01:58:08,933
ちょっと誘導できないかな。ビビー！離れたとこ行きます。
Can't I lure it? Viviii! I'll move further away.

2548
01:58:09,033 --> 01:58:11,433
こっち、こっち来れる？こっち来れる？
Over here, can you come here? Can you come here?

2549
01:58:11,533 --> 01:58:14,433
どこにいる？あ、それ上。ここここここ。崖の上。
Where are you? - Ah, up there. Here here here. Top of the cliff.

2550
01:58:14,533 --> 01:58:17,433
居た居た居た居た！オオカミに追われてる！
There, there, there, there! I'm being chased by wolves!

2551
01:58:17,933 --> 01:58:19,933
オオカミ...
Wolves...

2552
01:58:20,033 --> 01:58:21,933
あ、じゃあちょっと待ってね。タゲ取りに行こうか。
Ah, wait a second then. Should I go draw aggro?

2553
01:58:22,033 --> 01:58:24,933
大丈夫、ヘイト取った、ヘイト取った、ヘイト取った。オッケーオッケー。
It's fine, got aggro, got aggro, got aggro. Okay, okay.

2554
01:58:25,233 --> 01:58:29,933
はい、失礼いたします。アキロゼです。21時になりましたが、そちらの準備いかがでしょうか？
Hello, excuse me. This is Akirose. It's now 21:00, how are your preparations coming along?

2555
01:58:30,033 --> 01:58:33,433
はい、大丈夫です。ござるのところに飛んできてもらえると...
Yes, we're ready. If you could fly over to Gozaru's position...

2556
01:58:33,533 --> 01:58:35,433
はい、今もう飛んで見ております。
Yes, I am already flying and looking at it.

2557
01:58:35,533 --> 01:58:39,433
あ、じゃあやりましょう。正面いる、正面いる。
Ah, then let's do it. It's right in front, right in front.

2558
01:58:39,533 --> 01:58:43,433
はい、それでは今から15分間カウントいたします。頑張ってください。
All right, I will now count 15 minutes starting from now. Good luck!

2559
01:58:43,533 --> 01:58:45,433
はーい。
Okay~

2560
01:58:45,533 --> 01:58:48,933
よし、お騒がせしました。スタートの合図？スタートの合図。今からでしょ？
Alright, sorry for the chaos. Is that the start signal? The start signal. It starts now, right?

2561
01:58:49,033 --> 01:58:53,433
もう良い？スタートで良い？撃ってくれ、撃ってくれ、撃ってくれ！撃ってくれ、撃ってくれ！
Ready? Can we start? Shoot it, shoot it, shoot it! Shoot it, shoot it!

2562
01:58:53,533 --> 01:58:55,433
下下下下！撃って撃って撃って撃って！
Below, below, below, below! Shoot, shoot, shoot, shoot!

2563
01:58:55,533 --> 01:58:57,433
撃った！やばい、なんか...
Shot it! Oh no, something...

2564
01:58:57,533 --> 01:59:00,433
撃ったの誰？撃った？あ、ござるです、ござるです。気にしないで。
Who shot it? Did you shoot? - Ah, it's Gozaru, it's Gozaru. Don't worry.

2565
01:59:00,533 --> 01:59:03,433
あ、逃げた？逃げた？逃げたっぽい。
Ah, did it run away? Run away? Looks like it ran away.

2566
01:59:03,533 --> 01:59:05,233
追いかけてる。
I'm chasing it.

2567
01:59:05,433 --> 01:59:09,933
え？鳥に食べられた？！食べられた！食べられたー！
What? Did the bird eat it?! It got eaten! It got eaten!

2568
01:59:10,233 --> 01:59:12,933
え？！誰？食べたやつ。
What?! Who ate it?

2569
01:59:13,233 --> 01:59:16,933
オオカミが食ったんだ。オオカミか！オオカミ？そんなに早く？
The wolf ate it. - A wolf?! A wolf? That fast?

2570
01:59:17,033 --> 01:59:18,733
また探す？ここからだ。
Search again? Back from square one.

2571
01:59:18,833 --> 01:59:21,433
マジかよ！最悪だー！
Seriously?! That's the worst!

2572
01:59:21,533 --> 01:59:23,933
何でー！何でやー！
Whyyy! Whyyy!

2573
01:59:24,233 --> 01:59:28,433
オオカミ殺しますか、先に。もう周りにいたら。周りにいたらそうだね。
Should we kill the wolves first if they're around? - If they're around, yeah.

2574
01:59:28,533 --> 01:59:31,933
チェイスするわ、頑張って。え、どこ行こう？
I'll chase it, do your best. Um, where should I go?

2575
01:59:32,433 --> 01:59:34,933
どっか居ないかー。
Isn't there any around...?

2576
01:59:35,433 --> 01:59:39,933
えー、継続して探されますか？それとも一度キャンセルにしますか？
Um, will you continue searching, or would you like to cancel for now?

2577
01:59:40,233 --> 01:59:43,433
キャンセルなら10時だもんね。10時ですよね。
If canceled, it'd be at 10:00, right? 10:00, yeah.

2578
01:59:43,533 --> 01:59:53,433
えーと、一応キャンセル扱いにさせていただきまして、えーと21時30分までであれば、もう一度再、早く予約が入ったところ優先になりますが...
Um, we'll treat it as canceled for now, but if it's before 21:30, though priority goes to earlier reservations...

2579
01:59:53,533 --> 01:59:57,433
えー、チャレンジは可能とさせていただきます。
you will still be allowed to challenge again.

2580
01:59:57,533 --> 02:00:00,933
30分からにするか。30分からにしましょう。
Let's do it from 30 then. Let's make it from 30.

2581
02:00:01,033 --> 02:00:04,433
やばい、水がなくて枯れる、体が。じゃあ30分...
Oh no, with no water, my body is withering. Then at 30...

2582
02:00:04,454 --> 02:00:05,454
これでお願いします
Please take this.

2583
02:00:05,454 --> 02:00:06,254
あ、はい
Ah, okay.

2584
02:00:06,254 --> 02:00:09,954
枠としてもう一度再チャレンジをさせてくださいということにしますか？
Shall we make it so we do a rematch in another stream slot?

2585
02:00:09,954 --> 02:00:11,254
はい、お願いします
Yes, please!

2586
02:00:11,254 --> 02:00:13,954
分かりました。では一旦失礼します
Understood. I will take my leave for now.

2587
02:00:13,954 --> 02:00:16,254
はーい、すいませーん
Okay, thank you so much!

2588
02:00:16,454 --> 02:00:20,454
痛たさーい、まさかの死んでしまわれた
Ouch... They actually ended up dying.

2589
02:00:20,454 --> 02:00:21,954
いやー、しゃあないしゃあない
Man, it can't be helped, it can't be helped.

2590
02:00:21,954 --> 02:00:24,454
着陸できるかな？アルゲンで
I wonder if I can land with the Argentavis.

2591
02:00:24,454 --> 02:00:27,454
あ、多分無理だから着地するね。ほいよ
Ah, it's probably impossible, so I'll land below. Here goes.

2592
02:00:27,454 --> 02:00:30,954
ああー！
Aaaaah!

2593
02:00:31,254 --> 02:00:32,454
Oh my god.

2594
02:00:32,454 --> 02:00:33,454
Oh my god?

2595
02:00:33,454 --> 02:00:34,454
はい
Yes.

2596
02:00:34,454 --> 02:00:37,954
うわー、いやー、いないかー、次
Uwah... Man, none around. Next!

2597
02:00:37,954 --> 02:00:39,454
アイスワイバーンがいるわ
There's an Ice Wyvern.

2598
02:00:39,454 --> 02:00:43,454
じゃ、なんかやっぱりちょっと釣って人いないとこ行かないとダメなんだな
Then I guess we really have to lure it somewhere with no people.

2599
02:00:43,454 --> 02:00:45,954
そうですね。ちょ、乗ってもいいですか？
That's true. Ca- can I hop on?

2600
02:00:45,954 --> 02:00:48,454
乗ってほしい？逆に。早めに？
You want to hop on? Early?

2601
02:00:48,454 --> 02:00:50,454
アイスワイバーンが後ろにいるからちょっと...
The Ice Wyvern is right behind us, so...

2602
02:00:50,454 --> 02:00:54,454
シフト、シフトじゃない、シフト、あ、ジャンプ、あの、着陸してほしい！
Shift... no not shift, shift... ah, jump, I need you to land!

2603
02:00:54,454 --> 02:00:57,454
ちょっと待って！乗れないです！
Wait a sec! I can't get on!

2604
02:00:57,454 --> 02:01:00,454
ちょ、乗れないです！
I can't get on!

2605
02:01:00,454 --> 02:01:03,454
落ちた！落とされた！
I fell! I got dropped!

2606
02:01:04,454 --> 02:01:06,954
これだこれだこれだこれ！
This is it, this is it, this is it!

2607
02:01:06,954 --> 02:01:08,454
待って、斜面...
Wait, the slope...

2608
02:01:08,454 --> 02:01:10,954
斜面が風船です！
The slope is the balloon!

2609
02:01:10,454 --> 02:01:11,454
ちょっと待ってよ
Wait a bit.

2610
02:01:11,454 --> 02:01:13,954
いや、いや、もう... プテラで戻るよ
No, no, I'll... just go back on the Ptera.

2611
02:01:13,954 --> 02:01:16,254
あいよ、あいよ、あいよ、あいよ
Alright, alright, alright, alright.

2612
02:01:16,454 --> 02:01:17,954
だから前側から...
So from the front...

2613
02:01:16,954 --> 02:01:18,454
これで乗ってほしい
Hop on with this.

2614
02:01:18,454 --> 02:01:21,454
じゃ、乗れない。またこの引っ掛かり。よし、オッケーです
Can't get on. Caught on this again. Alright, OK.

2615
02:01:21,454 --> 02:01:22,454
よいしょ
There.

2616
02:01:22,454 --> 02:01:23,454
オッケー
Okay.

2617
02:01:23,454 --> 02:01:24,954
運転やろうかな？
Should I drive?

2618
02:01:23,954 --> 02:01:25,454
じゃ、プテラもしまいます
Then I'll put away the Ptera too.

2619
02:01:25,454 --> 02:01:26,454
乗ったから大丈夫
Since you're on, we're good.

2620
02:01:26,454 --> 02:01:27,454
オッケイ
Okay.

2621
02:01:27,454 --> 02:01:30,454
んー、じゃあ探すか、ユティラ
Hmm, then shall we look for Yutyrannus?

2622
02:01:30,454 --> 02:01:31,454
はーい
Yes.

2623
02:01:31,454 --> 02:01:32,954
毛がフサフサですもんね
They have fluffy fur, right?

2624
02:01:32,954 --> 02:01:33,954
そう、毛がフサフサ
Yeah, fluffy fur.

2625
02:01:33,954 --> 02:01:37,954
フサフサー。フッサフッサー、おいでー
Fluffy~ Fluffy fluffy, come here~

2626
02:01:37,954 --> 02:01:39,954
よいしょ、よいしょー
Yoisho, yoisho~

2627
02:01:39,954 --> 02:01:41,954
フッサフッサー
Fluffy fluffy~

2628
02:01:41,954 --> 02:01:44,454
あ、やばい、あと水ありますか？
Ah shoot, do you have any water by the way?

2629
02:01:44,454 --> 02:01:45,454
あるよ
Yeah, I do.

2630
02:01:45,454 --> 02:01:46,954
あ、渡しますね
Ah, I'll pass it over.

2631
02:01:46,954 --> 02:01:47,954
流石
As expected.

2632
02:01:47,954 --> 02:01:49,954
あ、じゃあここに置いとくよ
Ah, I'll leave it right here.

2633
02:01:49,954 --> 02:01:50,954
んー
Mm.

2634
02:01:50,954 --> 02:01:53,454
わ、アイスワイバーンの巣がある、あそこ
Whoa, there's an Ice Wyvern nest over there.

2635
02:01:53,454 --> 02:01:57,954
へー、あれ... 右手に、右手に見えますのは、アイスワイバーンの巣でございます
Heh~ On your right side, what you can see is the Ice Wyvern nest.

2636
02:01:57,954 --> 02:01:58,954
落としたよー
I dropped it~

2637
02:01:58,954 --> 02:02:00,954
ありがとうございますー、助かりましたー
Thank you so much~ That helps a lot~

2638
02:02:00,954 --> 02:02:03,454
ちなみにそれ、イナの水筒
By the way, that's Ina's canteen.

2639
02:02:04,454 --> 02:02:06,954
輪廻転生してる、その水筒
That canteen has gone through reincarnation.

2640
02:02:06,954 --> 02:02:08,454
輪廻を...
Reincarnation...

2641
02:02:08,454 --> 02:02:09,454
よいしょ
Up we go.

2642
02:02:09,454 --> 02:02:11,454
え、まだ残ってますか？お水
Um, is there any water left?

2643
02:02:11,454 --> 02:02:13,954
あ、あと自分のだから、なあ
Ah, the rest is mine, so yeah.

2644
02:02:13,954 --> 02:02:15,454
あ、オッケーです
Ah, OK.

2645
02:02:16,954 --> 02:02:18,454
よーし
Alright.

2646
02:02:18,454 --> 02:02:20,454
どっかで水あれば汲もう
If there's water somewhere, let's scoop some.

2647
02:02:20,454 --> 02:02:23,454
マンモス、ユティラ、いるかな？
Mammoths, Yutyrannus, wonder if they're here?

2648
02:02:23,454 --> 02:02:25,454
マンモス、ユティラ...
Mammoths, Yutyrannus...

2649
02:02:25,954 --> 02:02:30,954
あー、ワイバーンとかで周りをね、なんとか... ちょっと待って、ええっと
Ah, clearing out the surroundings with a Wyvern or something... wait a bit, umm.

2650
02:02:30,954 --> 02:02:33,454
探しに行ってもいいけどね
We could go search, though.

2651
02:02:33,454 --> 02:02:34,454
ねー
Yeah.

2652
02:02:34,454 --> 02:02:38,454
あ、ま、そうだ、プテラ今持ってる人はむしろ探しに行ってくれた方が嬉しいかも
Ah, well, yeah, anyone with a Ptera right now, we'd appreciate if you went searching.

2653
02:02:38,454 --> 02:02:39,954
じゃ、行きます
Then I'll go.

2654
02:02:40,454 --> 02:02:42,954
ちょっと待ってねー、着陸しますねー
Wait a sec, I'll land~

2655
02:02:42,954 --> 02:02:43,954
はーい
Okay.

2656
02:02:44,454 --> 02:02:45,954
ほいよ
Here you go.

2657
02:02:47,454 --> 02:02:48,954
あい
Got it.

2658
02:02:50,454 --> 02:02:51,954
気をつけてー
Be careful~

2659
02:02:51,954 --> 02:02:52,954
あい
Yep.

2660
02:02:52,954 --> 02:02:57,954
任せな！あ、ちょっと寒いから服持ってこようかな
Leave it to me! Ah, it's a bit cold, maybe I'll go get some clothes.

2661
02:02:58,454 --> 02:03:00,954
服置いてきたの？それはヤバい
You left your clothes behind? That's bad.

2662
02:03:01,454 --> 02:03:04,454
寒いなー。毛皮ないと、毛皮ないと死んじゃう
It's cold. Without fur... without fur you'll die.

2663
02:03:04,454 --> 02:03:06,954
ここはね、ちょっと寒いからねー
Because it's a bit cold here~

2664
02:03:06,954 --> 02:03:08,954
ちょっと服持ってきます
I'll go grab some clothes.

2665
02:03:08,954 --> 02:03:09,954
はーいよ
Alrighty.

2666
02:03:09,954 --> 02:03:11,954
よーっしゃい
Alright!

2667
02:03:11,954 --> 02:03:15,954
え、じゃ、水、お水をね。お水行こう
Um, then water, water. Let's go get water.

2668
02:03:15,954 --> 02:03:17,254
ありがとうございます
Thank you very much.

2669
02:03:20,954 --> 02:03:22,954
えーっと
Umm...

2670
02:03:23,454 --> 02:03:24,954
こいつか？
Is it this one?

2671
02:03:24,454 --> 02:03:25,654
でっかいのいる
There's a big one.

2672
02:03:25,654 --> 02:03:28,454
これ？ムズい。お、なんか... いた？いたかも
This? It's hard. Oh... was that one? Might've been.

2673
02:03:28,454 --> 02:03:29,654
動く動く
It's moving, moving.

2674
02:03:29,654 --> 02:03:32,454
あ、オッケー。座標教えてほしい
Ah, OK. I want to know the coordinates.

2675
02:03:32,454 --> 02:03:36,454
え、ちょっと待って、リスナーさん... いや、言うてもこれ30分だからな、ちょっと時間あります
Wait a sec, chat... Well, but it's 30 minutes, so we have some time.

2676
02:03:36,454 --> 02:03:38,454
これユティラですか？
Is this Yutyrannus?

2677
02:03:38,454 --> 02:03:40,954
30分からだから...
Because it starts after 30 minutes...

2678
02:03:40,954 --> 02:03:41,954
いたいたいた
Found it, found it, found it.

2679
02:03:41,954 --> 02:03:43,454
なんとなく居場所を
Roughly the location.

2680
02:03:43,454 --> 02:03:47,954
ただ、ここ人がちょっと多... あのね、多い
However, there are a bit too many people... well, too many.

2681
02:03:47,954 --> 02:03:48,954
人が多い？
Too many people?

2682
02:03:48,954 --> 02:03:51,454
あの、モブ、モブが多すぎる
I mean mobs, way too many mobs.

2683
02:03:51,454 --> 02:03:52,454
あ、なるほど
Ah, I see.

2684
02:03:52,454 --> 02:03:54,454
うん、あの、氷のところなんだけど
Yeah, it's at the ice place, though.

2685
02:03:54,454 --> 02:03:57,454
はい、はい、はい、はい
Right, right, right, right.

2686
02:03:57,954 --> 02:04:01,454
今から早めてもらうこと無理なんか。ワガママすぎか
Is it impossible to ask them to move it earlier? Maybe asking too much.

2687
02:04:01,454 --> 02:04:05,254
30分から、ですね。とりあえず45の51だね
From the 30-minute mark, right. For now it's 45, 51.

2688
02:04:05,454 --> 02:04:07,954
オッケー、じゃ、その辺りにいるかもってことで
OK, so it might be around there then.

2689
02:04:07,954 --> 02:04:08,954
はい
Yes.

2690
02:04:08,954 --> 02:04:11,954
ただマンモスとか周り野生生物多すぎて多分厳しい、ここ
However, there are too many wild creatures like mammoths around, so it's probably tough here.

2691
02:04:11,954 --> 02:04:14,454
狼さえやれればオッケー
As long as we take out the wolves, it's OK.

2692
02:04:14,454 --> 02:04:19,454
多分。まあ、それかの、誰かワイバーンで一掃してもらうか、かな？
Probably. Or maybe having someone wipe them out with a Wyvern?

2693
02:04:19,454 --> 02:04:21,454
いやー、ちょっと広いね
Yeah, it's quite a wide area.

2694
02:04:23,454 --> 02:04:28,454
かー、誘導... めちゃめちゃ下に誘導してくるか、かな？ユティを
Or lure it... maybe lure the Yuti way down below?

2695
02:04:28,454 --> 02:04:29,454
なるほど
I see.

2696
02:04:29,454 --> 02:04:30,454
うん
Yeah.

2697
02:04:31,454 --> 02:04:33,454
囲っとく？
Trap it inside?

2698
02:04:33,454 --> 02:04:36,454
あ、でも罠ありだと思うんですよね
Ah, but I think traps are allowed, right?

2699
02:04:36,454 --> 02:04:39,454
罠なし、でも罠なしテイムでしょ？
No traps, but isn't it no-trap taming?

2700
02:04:39,454 --> 02:04:42,954
囲っとくのはだ、いけない、ダメかなー？
Is enclosing it... no, not allowed?

2701
02:04:42,954 --> 02:04:46,954
見せ物用においといて、で、戦うときは出せばいいと思うから
Keep it for display, and when fighting, we can just release it.

2702
02:04:46,954 --> 02:04:47,954
なるほど
I see.

2703
02:04:47,954 --> 02:04:48,954
そう
Yeah.

2704
02:04:48,954 --> 02:04:51,954
あ、そういうことね。じゃあ、あ、連れて行けばいいのか？
Ah, that's what you mean. Then, ah, we just lead it there?

2705
02:04:51,954 --> 02:04:53,454
かな？
Maybe?

2706
02:04:53,454 --> 02:04:58,454
でもこいつ結構手負いなんだよな。違うやつ探したほうがいい、ワンチャンいいかもあるんだ
But this guy is pretty injured. Might be better to look for another one, there's a chance.

2707
02:04:58,454 --> 02:05:01,454
手負いのやつワンチャンね、倒れちゃう...
An injured one might accidentally die...

2708
02:05:01,454 --> 02:05:03,454
そう、倒れちゃいそうなんだよね、麻酔矢撃ってるときに
Yeah, it feels like it might collapse while shooting tranquilizer arrows.

2709
02:05:03,454 --> 02:05:04,454
よいしょ
There.

2710
02:05:04,475 --> 02:05:05,475
あったあったあった
There it is, there it is!

2711
02:05:05,675 --> 02:05:07,475
どうなんだろうか
I wonder how it'll go...

2712
02:05:07,475 --> 02:05:09,975
その場でもう見つけていくしかダメかな
Do we just have to find one on the spot?

2713
02:05:11,475 --> 02:05:12,975
うーん
Hmm...

2714
02:05:14,475 --> 02:05:18,675
周りの状況もありでのテイムかな、15分だろう
Taming will depend on the surroundings, probably 15 minutes.

2715
02:05:19,275 --> 02:05:21,275
やばっ、な-なんか挟まった
Oh no, s-something got stuck.

2716
02:05:21,475 --> 02:05:22,975
よいしょ
There.

2717
02:05:23,975 --> 02:05:25,975
えーっと、もうちょい探してみるわ
Um, let me look around a bit more.

2718
02:05:26,275 --> 02:05:27,475
オッケー
Okay.

2719
02:05:27,975 --> 02:05:29,475
よし、じゃあちょっと...
All right, let's...

2720
02:05:30,475 --> 02:05:31,475
せい
Hyah!

2721
02:05:32,475 --> 02:05:33,975
えっと...
Um...

2722
02:05:34,275 --> 02:05:37,475
なんかオオカミいる近くにいる率高いよな、こう...
They tend to spawn near direwolves, like...

2723
02:05:37,675 --> 02:05:40,675
トワにギリースーツ渡したまんまかもしや...
I might have left the ghillie suit with Towa...

2724
02:05:40,975 --> 02:05:43,475
あー、ギリー...
Ah, ghillie...

2725
02:05:43,475 --> 02:05:45,475
アルゲンに入ってるかも
It might be in the Argentavis.

2726
02:05:45,475 --> 02:05:47,475
アルゲンはどこだー？よいしょ
Where's the Argentavis? Up we go.

2727
02:05:47,475 --> 02:05:50,475
アルゲンは降りてきてる。あの、拠点に。
The Argentavis landed back at base.

2728
02:05:50,675 --> 02:05:52,475
あー、あれか！ありがとう！
Ah, that one! Thank you!

2729
02:05:52,475 --> 02:05:53,975
拠点かもしかして
Maybe at the base?

2730
02:05:53,975 --> 02:05:56,475
あ、ちょちょちょ...ここが...
Ah, wait, wait, wait... here is...

2731
02:05:59,975 --> 02:06:01,475
よいしょ
Alright.

2732
02:06:02,975 --> 02:06:04,275
んー、いるかなー？
Hmm, is it here?

2733
02:06:04,475 --> 02:06:06,475
あいつかな？
Is that it?

2734
02:06:06,475 --> 02:06:07,975
えっと...
Let's see...

2735
02:06:09,975 --> 02:06:11,475
えっ、あったあったあった！
There it is, there it is!

2736
02:06:11,975 --> 02:06:14,975
お肉燃やして置こ
Let's cook some meat and leave it here.

2737
02:06:14,975 --> 02:06:15,975
っと
There.

2738
02:06:17,475 --> 02:06:18,975
えっと...
Um...

2739
02:06:19,975 --> 02:06:21,475
これ違うな
That's not it.

2740
02:06:21,475 --> 02:06:23,475
あー、生肉欲しいかも
Ah, we might need raw meat.

2741
02:06:23,475 --> 02:06:24,975
生肉？
Raw meat?

2742
02:06:24,975 --> 02:06:26,675
あります、あります
We have some, we have some.

2743
02:06:26,675 --> 02:06:28,975
てかアルゲンの中にめっちゃありそう
Actually, there's probably a ton in the Argentavis.

2744
02:06:28,975 --> 02:06:32,475
生肉ここのね、餌箱の中に一旦入れてますよ
I put raw meat in the feeding trough here for now.

2745
02:06:32,975 --> 02:06:34,475
欲しかったらどうぞ
Help yourself if you need any.

2746
02:06:34,975 --> 02:06:37,975
よーし、あちちちち
Alright... Ah, hot hot hot!

2747
02:06:42,975 --> 02:06:46,975
えっ、この間にやっていないミッションが何だ？
Um, what mission haven't we done yet during this time?

2748
02:06:47,475 --> 02:06:49,475
大型恐竜テイム！
Taming a large dino!

2749
02:06:49,975 --> 02:06:51,975
大型恐竜のテイム！
Taming a large dinosaur!

2750
02:06:52,275 --> 02:06:54,975
ギノ、ティラノ、デイノ...
Giga, Rex, Deino...

2751
02:06:54,975 --> 02:06:57,975
バイソン... 気合でティラノかな！
Bison... Maybe Rex with some guts!

2752
02:06:57,975 --> 02:07:01,475
ティラノの近くにありましたね
There was one near the Rex.

2753
02:07:01,475 --> 02:07:03,975
いいよ、いいよね！ティラノ行くか！
Sounds good! Shall we go for the Rex?

2754
02:07:03,975 --> 02:07:06,975
この間に... サクッと行けそうだよね
In the meantime... Looks like we can do it quickly.

2755
02:07:07,475 --> 02:07:10,975
じゃあちょっとこれで行きます？練習がてら...
Shall we go with this then? As practice...

2756
02:07:10,975 --> 02:07:12,475
そうだね、そうだね
Yeah, let's do that.

2757
02:07:12,475 --> 02:07:14,475
運転します！ちょっと待って
I'll pilot! Hold on.

2758
02:07:14,475 --> 02:07:16,475
オッケー！ツェッペリンで行こう！
Okay! Let's go in the Zeppelin!

2759
02:07:16,475 --> 02:07:18,975
ツェッペリンどこやー？ツェッペリ〜ン！
Where's the Zeppelin? Zeppeliiin!

2760
02:07:19,475 --> 02:07:20,975
よいしょ
Hup.

2761
02:07:21,275 --> 02:07:23,975
自分ちょっと、あれしよう
I'm gonna go do that real quick.

2762
02:07:24,475 --> 02:07:26,475
あらららら
Oh dear, dear.

2763
02:07:26,975 --> 02:07:28,475
よいしょ。一旦拠点行きます。
Alright. Going to base for a moment.

2764
02:07:28,475 --> 02:07:30,975
あ、違う、これワイバーンの卵か？
Ah wait, is this a Wyvern egg?

2765
02:07:30,975 --> 02:07:32,475
お、ちょっとととと
Whoa, wait, wait, wait...

2766
02:07:32,475 --> 02:07:34,975
ワイバーン卵取った瞬間に来ちゃうからね
Wyverns will come the moment you grab the egg.

2767
02:07:36,975 --> 02:07:38,975
よいしょ
Hup.

2768
02:07:39,475 --> 02:07:40,275
へい
Yup.

2769
02:07:40,275 --> 02:07:41,475
今はそれじゃない
That's not what we're after right now.

2770
02:07:41,475 --> 02:07:42,675
行けます！
Ready to go!

2771
02:07:42,975 --> 02:07:44,975
オッケー、じゃあ乗ってください！
Okay, please hop on!

2772
02:07:45,475 --> 02:07:46,675
オッケー
Okay.

2773
02:07:46,975 --> 02:07:48,675
どこにいたんだろう？
Where was it?

2774
02:07:48,975 --> 02:07:51,475
えっと、み...左！左の草原！
Um, righ... left! The meadow on the left!

2775
02:07:51,475 --> 02:07:52,475
あいつワイバーンの卵
That's a Wyvern egg.

2776
02:07:52,475 --> 02:07:54,475
え？オッケーです
Eh? Understood.

2777
02:07:54,975 --> 02:07:56,475
乗ってます？これ、みんな
Is everyone on board?

2778
02:07:56,475 --> 02:07:58,475
乗ってます！なんとなく
We're on! More or less.

2779
02:07:58,675 --> 02:08:00,975
なんとなく、なんとなく乗ってる了解！
More or less? Got it, roughly on board!

2780
02:08:01,475 --> 02:08:04,475
ここ全部乗れるんかい！
You can stand on all of this?!

2781
02:08:04,475 --> 02:08:06,475
挟まってる今
I'm stuck right now.

2782
02:08:06,675 --> 02:08:09,475
ここ全部乗れるんかい！
You can stand on all of this?!

2783
02:08:09,475 --> 02:08:11,475
乗れてるのかこれ
Are we actually on?

2784
02:08:11,475 --> 02:08:13,675
乗ってます！一応乗ってます！
We're on! More or less on board!

2785
02:08:13,975 --> 02:08:15,675
怖い怖い
Scary, scary!

2786
02:08:15,975 --> 02:08:19,975
この先ね、まっすぐ行ったとこのどこかにね、多分いると思うんだよな
Somewhere straight ahead up here, I think it's there.

2787
02:08:20,475 --> 02:08:21,675
了解です
Roger that.

2788
02:08:21,675 --> 02:08:24,975
ワープポイント見つけたい
I want to find a warp point.

2789
02:08:26,475 --> 02:08:29,975
あ、いたいたいたいたいたいた！
Ah, there it is, there it is!

2790
02:08:29,975 --> 02:08:31,475
お、これだよな？
Oh, this is it, right?

2791
02:08:31,475 --> 02:08:32,475
うん
Yeah.

2792
02:08:32,475 --> 02:08:34,975
ここちょっとすっきりしてるかも。えっとね、
It's a bit clearer around here. Um...

2793
02:08:34,975 --> 02:08:36,675
座標言っていい？
Can I read out the coordinates?

2794
02:08:36,675 --> 02:08:37,675
うん
Yeah.

2795
02:08:37,675 --> 02:08:38,975
43...

2796
02:08:39,275 --> 02:08:41,975
ちょっと待って、ええとな...
Wait a second, um...

2797
02:08:42,275 --> 02:08:43,275
うん
Yeah.

2798
02:08:43,275 --> 02:08:44,975
43、58
43, 58.

2799
02:08:44,975 --> 02:08:47,475
43、58、オッケー！メモった！
43, 58, okay! Noted!

2800
02:08:47,975 --> 02:08:51,975
じゃあ20分くらいになったらそこ行くか、あとちょっと10分くらい
Let's head there around the 20-minute mark, in about 10 minutes.

2801
02:08:51,975 --> 02:08:53,675
あ、あれティラノか？
Ah, is that a Rex?

2802
02:08:53,975 --> 02:08:55,675
あれティラノですか？
Is that a Rex?

2803
02:08:55,975 --> 02:08:57,675
あれティラノだね
That is a Rex.

2804
02:08:57,675 --> 02:08:59,475
あれティラノか？あれティラノじゃなくね？
Is that a Rex? That's not a Rex, is it?

2805
02:08:59,475 --> 02:09:02,475
え、奥にいる、奥にいるめっちゃでかいやつ...
The really huge one further in the back...

2806
02:09:02,475 --> 02:09:04,475
いや、ティラノか？
Wait, is it a Rex?

2807
02:09:04,475 --> 02:09:05,975
えー？ティラノ？
Eh? Rex?

2808
02:09:05,975 --> 02:09:08,975
この声は... 奥にいるやつはあれティラノか？あれティラノじゃないですか？
That roar... Is that one in the back a Rex? Isn't that a Rex?

2809
02:09:09,475 --> 02:09:12,975
あれティラノじゃないか？いやティラノだ、あれきっと多分
Isn't that a Rex? No, that's a Rex, definitely, probably.

2810
02:09:12,975 --> 02:09:15,975
え、後ろにいるやつ？アクロカントか？あいつでもいい、さっきのやつでも
The one behind? An Acrocantho? That one's fine too, the earlier one is good too.

2811
02:09:16,975 --> 02:09:19,475
もう何でもいいや、なんかすげえやつ...
Whatever works, just something awesome...

2812
02:09:19,975 --> 02:09:21,475
え、どこだどこだどこだ？
Eh, where is it, where is it?

2813
02:09:21,475 --> 02:09:22,975
正面正面正面！
Straight ahead, straight ahead!

2814
02:09:22,975 --> 02:09:24,975
あ、オッケーオッケー正面ね！そこで止まってほしい！
Ah, okay okay, straight ahead! Please stop right there!

2815
02:09:24,975 --> 02:09:25,975
はい
Got it.

2816
02:09:25,975 --> 02:09:26,975
ティラノ〜
Rex~

2817
02:09:27,475 --> 02:09:28,975
おらっ！
Take that!

2818
02:09:28,975 --> 02:09:30,475
届きます？
Does it reach?

2819
02:09:30,475 --> 02:09:31,975
もうちょい寄ります
I'll get a little closer.

2820
02:09:31,975 --> 02:09:33,975
よし、こんなもんでどうでしょう？
All right, how's this?

2821
02:09:34,975 --> 02:09:35,975
はい
Yes.

2822
02:09:36,475 --> 02:09:38,675
当たった！あ、ちょっと上...
Hit! Ah, a bit too high...

2823
02:09:38,975 --> 02:09:40,475
うわ、すごい音した！
Whoa, that made a huge sound!

2824
02:09:40,475 --> 02:09:41,975
ちょっと上、真上すぎるかな？
A bit too high, is it too directly above?

2825
02:09:41,975 --> 02:09:43,475
やばい、ビビまた落ちる！
Oh no, Bibi's falling again!

2826
02:09:42,975 --> 02:09:45,475
落ちちゃった！もう〜！
I fell off! Jeez!

2827
02:09:45,475 --> 02:09:46,975
なにこれ〜
What is this?!

2828
02:09:46,975 --> 02:09:48,475
回りますね
I'll turn around.

2829
02:09:48,475 --> 02:09:49,975
ういしょ
Alright.

2830
02:09:49,975 --> 02:09:51,975
ほい！これでどうでしょう？
There! How's this?

2831
02:09:52,975 --> 02:09:55,475
オッケー、ビビが囮になってる！ビビ走り続けて！
Okay, Bibi became the bait! Bibi, keep running!

2832
02:09:55,475 --> 02:09:57,475
やばーい！助けてー！
Oh no! Help me!

2833
02:09:56,975 --> 02:09:58,975
戻ってきてほしい！
Please come back!

2834
02:09:58,975 --> 02:10:00,475
戻ります！
Coming back!

2835
02:10:00,975 --> 02:10:02,975
ビビまた餌やった、やっぱりビビって餌だ
Bibi became bait again, Bibi really is bait.

2836
02:10:02,975 --> 02:10:04,475
ビビ餌やん、お前
Bibi, you're just bait!

2837
02:10:04,496 --> 02:10:06,296
あ、撃て撃て撃て撃て！
Ah, shoot, shoot, shoot, shoot!

2838
02:10:08,296 --> 02:10:09,796
ワープポイント
Warp point.

2839
02:10:11,296 --> 02:10:14,296
一応下がってるけどバックのスピード遅っそ、こいつ。
I'm backing up for now, but this thing reverses so slowly.

2840
02:10:14,296 --> 02:10:15,296
あ。
Ah.

2841
02:10:15,596 --> 02:10:18,296
どうですか？頭狙えそうな位置ですか、これ？
How's that? Is this a good spot to aim for the head?

2842
02:10:18,496 --> 02:10:20,296
うーん、いける... 壊れた！
Hmm, it works... It broke!

2843
02:10:20,296 --> 02:10:21,796
めっちゃ入ってる入ってる。
Tons of shots are landing, landing.

2844
02:10:21,796 --> 02:10:22,996
はい、オッケー。
Alright, okay.

2845
02:10:23,096 --> 02:10:24,796
あっちのほうかなー？
Over that way maybe?

2846
02:10:25,096 --> 02:10:26,896
肝っ玉でかい...
Big guts...

2847
02:10:26,296 --> 02:10:27,496
うまい。
Nice.

2848
02:10:27,596 --> 02:10:29,496
誰か木刀あれ...
Does anyone have wood and...

2849
02:10:30,696 --> 02:10:36,196
持ってますか？あの... 私の武器壊して...
have some? Um... My weapon broke...

2850
02:10:36,496 --> 02:10:39,396
武器？ちょっと待って、くれとまる。
Weapon? Wait a second, I'll give you one.

2851
02:10:39,996 --> 02:10:41,796
一瞬もうちょっとめっちゃ下がる。
I'll back up a whole lot more for a second.

2852
02:10:41,796 --> 02:10:43,596
あ、壊れちゃったのがクロスボウ？
Ah, the broken one was a crossbow?

2853
02:10:43,596 --> 02:10:45,796
クロスボウじゃなくて、普通のボウです。
Not a crossbow, a regular bow.

2854
02:10:45,796 --> 02:10:46,696
拾う...
Pick up...

2855
02:10:46,696 --> 02:10:51,796
あ、ボウ？弓持ってないや。これ使ってこれ使って。落と、落とした落とした。
Ah, a bow? I don't have a bow. Use this, use this! Dropped it, dropped it.

2856
02:10:51,796 --> 02:10:52,796
よいしょ。
There we go.

2857
02:10:53,096 --> 02:10:55,296
届かんの足元...
I can't reach its feet...

2858
02:10:56,896 --> 02:10:59,096
Bibiやっておきます。
I'll take care of Bibi.

2859
02:10:59,696 --> 02:11:00,996
はい、ありました。
Yes, found it.

2860
02:11:00,996 --> 02:11:04,696
あ、ちょっとあ、真下になっちゃって狙えないかも。
Ah, wait, it went right underneath us, we might not be able to aim.

2861
02:11:07,296 --> 02:11:09,996
イナ先輩取れました？あ、待って、後ろ...
Ina-senpai, did you pick it up? Ah, wait, behind us...

2862
02:11:09,996 --> 02:11:12,196
真っすぐ通しな、そうだ、ああ...
Go straight through, yeah, aaah...

2863
02:11:12,196 --> 02:11:14,996
左行くと崖だから戻ってほしいかも。
If you go left it's a cliff, so maybe head back.

2864
02:11:14,996 --> 02:11:15,796
取れなかった。
I couldn't grab it.

2865
02:11:15,796 --> 02:11:17,996
ちょっとあいつですよね？ちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいね。
It's that one, right? Pl-please wait a moment.

2866
02:11:17,996 --> 02:11:19,996
ねえ、逃げてる？逃げてる、逃げてる。
Hey, is it running away? It's fleeing, fleeing.

2867
02:11:19,996 --> 02:11:22,996
あ、オッケーオッケーオッケー。逃げてるならもうちょっとかな。
Ah, okay okay okay. If it's fleeing, it's almost down.

2868
02:11:23,296 --> 02:11:24,096
よいしょ。
Up we go.

2869
02:11:24,096 --> 02:11:25,496
逃げてないわ。後ろ...
It's not fleeing. Behind us...

2870
02:11:25,496 --> 02:11:26,496
う、後ろです！
B-Behind us!

2871
02:11:26,696 --> 02:11:27,696
え、後ろ？
Eh, behind?

2872
02:11:27,796 --> 02:11:30,496
あ、後ろかごめん、恐竜間違いした。
Ah, behind? Sorry, I mistook the dinosaur.

2873
02:11:30,496 --> 02:11:32,996
あ、こいつじゃないのか！こいつ...
Ah, it's not this one?! This...

2874
02:11:32,996 --> 02:11:34,996
Bibiんとこ、Bibiんとこ！
Where Bibi is, where Bibi is!

2875
02:11:34,996 --> 02:11:37,696
違う恐竜撃っちゃったかも！オッケーオッケー。
I might've shot the wrong dinosaur! Okay, okay.

2876
02:11:37,696 --> 02:11:38,996
Bibiんとこー！
Where Bibi is-!

2877
02:11:38,996 --> 02:11:41,496
オッケーオッケー、Bibi、Bibi頑張ってくれ！
Okay okay, Bibi, Bibi hang in there!

2878
02:11:41,696 --> 02:11:43,696
あれ？あれ、もう一匹いたの？怖っ。
Huh? Huh, there was another one? Scary.

2879
02:11:43,696 --> 02:11:47,496
もう一匹のほう釣っちゃったかも！間違えてる！
I might've aggroed the other one! I made a mistake!

2880
02:11:47,496 --> 02:11:48,696
やべー！
Oh no-!

2881
02:11:48,696 --> 02:11:49,796
いてっ。
Ow.

2882
02:11:49,796 --> 02:11:51,496
うわー！
Uwaah!

2883
02:11:50,496 --> 02:11:51,696
ワープポイント...
Warp point...

2884
02:11:51,696 --> 02:11:53,296
餌になってる。
I'm becoming bait.

2885
02:11:53,296 --> 02:11:54,496
や、こっち行くか。
Yeah, let's head this way.

2886
02:11:54,496 --> 02:11:55,696
よいしょ。
Alright.

2887
02:11:56,496 --> 02:11:57,496
どこ行った？
Where did it go?

2888
02:11:59,796 --> 02:12:01,696
ええ？2匹...
Ehhh? Two of them...

2889
02:12:01,696 --> 02:12:02,696
ほい。
Here.

2890
02:12:04,496 --> 02:12:04,796
これで頭狙ってほしい。
I want you to aim for the head with this.

2891
02:12:04,796 --> 02:12:06,796
体が青っぽいほうだよね？青っぽいほう。
It's the one with the bluish body, right? The bluish one.

2892
02:12:06,796 --> 02:12:08,996
あ、そうそう、今ね、正面来てるほう。
Ah yes yes, the one coming from the front right now.

2893
02:12:08,996 --> 02:12:09,996
オッケーオッケー。
Okay, okay.

2894
02:12:09,996 --> 02:12:10,996
よいしょ。
There.

2895
02:12:11,996 --> 02:12:15,796
いやー、これバックオーライ、バックオーライ、ぐるぐるぐる...
No, keep backing up, backing up, spinning around...

2896
02:12:14,996 --> 02:12:16,996
あ、渡せた？いい感じいい感じ。
Ah, did you get it? Nice, nice.

2897
02:12:19,296 --> 02:12:21,496
おりゃ、イナこれ撃てるー？
Here! Ina, can you shoot this?

2898
02:12:21,496 --> 02:12:22,996
ちょっと、まだ...
Wait, not yet...

2899
02:12:22,996 --> 02:12:26,296
待って、もう1匹にBibiやられてる！なんだこいつ！
Wait, Bibi is getting beaten by another one! What's with this guy?!

2900
02:12:26,496 --> 02:12:27,996
壊れてて、ちょっと...
It was broken, so...

2901
02:12:27,296 --> 02:12:29,496
逃げてるかもあいつ。
That one might be fleeing.

2902
02:12:29,996 --> 02:12:31,996
壊れてる？こっち...
It's broken? Here...

2903
02:12:30,996 --> 02:12:32,996
ちょっと、ちょっと落ちて...
Wait, dropping down for a sec...

2904
02:12:32,996 --> 02:12:34,496
いい加減...
Seriously...

2905
02:12:34,496 --> 02:12:37,696
ちょっと落ちて、なんか素材... あ！
Dropping down for a bit, some materials... Ah!

2906
02:12:39,796 --> 02:12:41,796
飛んでるー！
I'm flying!

2907
02:12:41,796 --> 02:12:44,196
飛んでるの乗っていいですか？一瞬。
Can I ride the flying one? For a second.

2908
02:12:44,696 --> 02:12:46,996
えっ、右にプテラ持ってる...
Eh, Ptera on the right...

2909
02:12:47,496 --> 02:12:49,796
プテラ... 私飛んでる！
Ptera... I'm flying!

2910
02:12:49,796 --> 02:12:51,796
え、大丈夫大丈夫大丈夫！
Eh, I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm okay!

2911
02:12:51,796 --> 02:12:53,496
大丈夫？あれどこ行った？
You okay? Where did it go?

2912
02:12:53,496 --> 02:12:55,496
大丈夫じゃない、私が...
I'm not okay, I'm...

2913
02:12:55,496 --> 02:12:56,696
イナ先輩どこ？イナ先輩...
Where is Ina-senpai? Ina-senpai...

2914
02:12:56,696 --> 02:12:59,296
イナ逃げて、イナ逃げていいよ、どっか遠くに。
Ina, run away! Ina, you can run away somewhere far!

2915
02:12:59,296 --> 02:13:00,196
やばいやばい。
Oh no, oh no.

2916
02:13:00,196 --> 02:13:02,996
ポンプアクションショットガン...
Pump-action shotgun...

2917
02:13:01,696 --> 02:13:03,696
いやー！
Nooo!

2918
02:13:03,496 --> 02:13:05,496
行けー！
Go-!

2919
02:13:05,496 --> 02:13:08,496
待って待って、イナ先輩... こっち来て！
Wait, wait, Ina-senpai... Come over here!

2920
02:13:08,496 --> 02:13:10,496
ごめんなさい、Bibiが...
Sorry, Bibi...

2921
02:13:09,496 --> 02:13:10,996
いやいや、大丈夫大丈夫！
No no, it's fine, it's fine!

2922
02:13:10,996 --> 02:13:12,996
乗って乗って乗って！乗って乗って！
Hop on, hop on, hop on! Hop on, hop on!

2923
02:13:12,296 --> 02:13:13,496
え、大丈夫？
Eh, are you okay?

2924
02:13:13,496 --> 02:13:14,996
Bibiー！
Bibi-!

2925
02:13:15,696 --> 02:13:17,696
イナ先輩のあの...
Ina-senpai's...

2926
02:13:17,696 --> 02:13:19,996
あ、じゃあ私が、私が...
Ah, then I'll, I'll...

2927
02:13:19,996 --> 02:13:21,296
こうやる。
do this.

2928
02:13:21,296 --> 02:13:23,996
ちょっと1人は時間かかるよー！
It's gonna take a while alone-!

2929
02:13:23,496 --> 02:13:24,996
わちゃわちゃ...
Chaos, chaos...

2930
02:13:24,996 --> 02:13:27,496
1人は時間かかるよー！誰かもー！
It's gonna take a while alone! Someone else too-!

2931
02:13:27,496 --> 02:13:30,296
撃ってくれー！ごめんなさい！
Shoot it! Sorry!

2932
02:13:28,696 --> 02:13:30,996
撃ってくれー！頼むー！
Shoot it! Please!

2933
02:13:29,996 --> 02:13:31,996
興奮で話せん...
Too excited to talk...

2934
02:13:30,996 --> 02:13:32,996
撃つ撃つ撃つ。
Shooting, shooting, shooting.

2935
02:13:32,996 --> 02:13:34,496
どっち行こうかな、どっちや？
Which way should I go? Which one?

2936
02:13:34,496 --> 02:13:37,996
ちょっとごめんなさい、体が青いほう！体が青いほう！
Wait, I'm sorry, the one with the blue body! The blue body one!

2937
02:13:37,996 --> 02:13:39,496
はい、青いほう行ってます。
Yes, heading towards the blue one.

2938
02:13:39,496 --> 02:13:40,996
青いほう、青いほう！
The blue one, the blue one!

2939
02:13:41,196 --> 02:13:43,496
ほい、あ、やばい、ちょっと遠くなりすぎました。
Hop. Ah crap, got a bit too far.

2940
02:13:43,496 --> 02:13:44,496
ここですか？
Is it here?

2941
02:13:44,496 --> 02:13:45,996
あ、いける！
Ah, we can do it!

2942
02:13:45,996 --> 02:13:46,996
ほい。
There.

2943
02:13:46,496 --> 02:13:48,696
でも赤湧きして白か... 行っちゃった。
Though red spawned so maybe white... It left.

2944
02:13:48,696 --> 02:13:49,796
よいしょ。
Alright.

2945
02:13:49,796 --> 02:13:52,296
ちょっとごめんなさい、回ります。崖すぎて...
Wait, sorry, I'll turn around. It's too steep a cliff...

2946
02:13:51,696 --> 02:13:53,496
オッケーオッケー、助かる助かる助かる。
Okay, okay, that helps, that helps, that helps.

2947
02:13:54,496 --> 02:13:55,996
待って、飛んでる。
Wait, flying.

2948
02:13:55,996 --> 02:13:57,496
マジでムズイ。
This is seriously hard.

2949
02:13:57,496 --> 02:13:59,296
今何してるの、それ？
What are you guys doing right now?

2950
02:13:59,296 --> 02:14:02,696
ええっと、テイム？大型恐竜のテイム。
Uhm, taming? Taming a giant dinosaur.

2951
02:14:02,696 --> 02:14:03,996
どうやるの、それ？
How do you do that?

2952
02:14:03,996 --> 02:14:06,996
ええと、今ツェッペリンに乗ってティラノにずっと麻酔撃ってる。
Uhm, we're riding on the zeppelin and constantly shooting tranqs at the Rex.

2953
02:14:07,296 --> 02:14:08,696
なんだ、撃つわ...
What, I'll shoot...

2954
02:14:06,996 --> 02:14:09,496
2匹おる... 2匹やめてくれ、マジで頼むよ。
There's two... Please not two, I'm seriously begging here.

2955
02:14:09,496 --> 02:14:13,996
はい、お願いします！あの正面です、このツェッペリン正面の青とオレンジのやつ。
Yes, please! It's right in front, that blue and orange one right in front of the zeppelin.

2956
02:14:13,996 --> 02:14:14,996
オッケー。
Okay.

2957
02:14:14,996 --> 02:14:16,496
痛すぎやろ。
That hurts way too much.

2958
02:14:16,496 --> 02:14:18,496
よいしょ、よいしょ。
Up we go, up we go.

2959
02:14:19,296 --> 02:14:22,496
ちょっと麻酔矢が足りないかも、自分。
I might be running out of tranq arrows.

2960
02:14:22,496 --> 02:14:24,296
私来てるよ、撃ってるよ。
I'm here, I'm shooting.

2961
02:14:24,296 --> 02:14:25,496
オッケー。
Okay.

2962
02:14:25,496 --> 02:14:27,996
もうすぐ着きます！しばし！
Arriving soon! One moment!

2963
02:14:27,996 --> 02:14:28,996
ほいよ。
Alright.

2964
02:14:30,296 --> 02:14:31,496
よいしょ。
Hup.

2965
02:14:31,996 --> 02:14:33,496
もう一票...
One more...

2966
02:14:33,996 --> 02:14:36,496
ごめんなさい、乗り上げました。
Sorry, got stuck on top.

2967
02:14:36,496 --> 02:14:38,696
オッケーオッケー。
Okay, okay.

2968
02:14:37,496 --> 02:14:38,996
これどうすか？
How's this?

2969
02:14:38,996 --> 02:14:39,996
オッケー。
Okay.

2970
02:14:42,496 --> 02:14:44,496
これ距離届かないな、ここから。
The distance won't reach from here.

2971
02:14:44,296 --> 02:14:46,496
これ、これですか？
This, is it this one?

2972
02:14:45,296 --> 02:14:46,696
もうちょっと前行きますね。
Moving a bit more forward.

2973
02:14:46,996 --> 02:14:48,996
ああ、壊れちゃった、クロスボウが。
Ah, it broke, the crossbow.

2974
02:14:48,996 --> 02:14:52,296
あ、ちょっと待って、逃げてるからもうちょっとなのかもしれない。
Ah, wait, it's fleeing so it might be almost knocked out.

2975
02:14:52,296 --> 02:14:55,496
ごめん、自分がもう役に立たなくなってしまったー。
Sorry, I've become completely useless now-.

2976
02:14:55,496 --> 02:14:56,996
弓あるよー。
I have a bow-.

2977
02:14:58,496 --> 02:15:00,996
いや、きついな。やばい、ちょっと...
No, this is tough. Oh man, wait...

2978
02:15:00,296 --> 02:15:02,296
デキスン借りて一旦帰るわ。
I'll borrow Dekisun and head back for a bit.

2979
02:15:01,696 --> 02:15:02,696
いいよ。
Sure thing.

2980
02:15:02,696 --> 02:15:04,496
は？ちょ待って、もう1匹攻撃して...
Huh? Wait a sec, another one is attacking...

2981
02:15:04,517 --> 02:15:06,617
来てる！痛い！死ぬ！
It's coming! Ouch! I'm gonna die!

2982
02:15:06,617 --> 02:15:09,417
こっちの青い方、青い方。青い方を狙って... 右です。
Shoot this blue one, the blue one. Aim for the blue one... on the right.

2983
02:15:09,417 --> 02:15:11,917
右ね。うわー、最悪やー。よいしょ。
The right, got it. Ugh, this is the worst. Up we go.

2984
02:15:12,017 --> 02:15:14,917
ウサギの穴にやられている。
I'm getting overwhelmed at the rabbit hole.

2985
02:15:15,017 --> 02:15:18,817
もうやだー！イナ先輩、ちょっともう一匹離してほしいかも。
Ugh, no way! Ina-senpai, could you maybe lure one of them away?

2986
02:15:18,917 --> 02:15:21,517
ティラノサウルスに殺された。
I got killed by a Tyrannosaurus.

2987
02:15:21,517 --> 02:15:25,017
ちょっと、えーっと... どこ、どこだ？
Wait, um... where, where is it?

2988
02:15:25,317 --> 02:15:27,017
こいつか。
Is this it?

2989
02:15:27,017 --> 02:15:28,717
イナ先輩、どうすか？そっから撃てます？
Ina-senpai, how is it? Can you shoot from there?

2990
02:15:28,717 --> 02:15:32,517
撃ってはいるけど、距離がね、ちょっと遠いかも。あ、追突した。
I'm shooting, but the distance might be a bit too far. Ah, it collided.

2991
02:15:32,617 --> 02:15:36,917
睡眠金属... オッケー、寝た！寝た寝た！もうすぐ寝る！寝る寝る寝る寝る！寝た！
Tranqs... Okay, it's down! It's going down! Almost down! Down, down, down, down! It's asleep!

2992
02:15:36,917 --> 02:15:38,517
お肉入れちゃって！お肉入れちゃって！
Put the meat in! Put the meat in!

2993
02:15:38,517 --> 02:15:40,017
入れるわ。
Putting it in.

2994
02:15:40,117 --> 02:15:42,317
ほらー！
Take that!

2995
02:15:43,317 --> 02:15:46,017
肉でいい？ 肉でいいよ。入れちゃって！
Regular meat is fine? Regular meat is fine. Put it in!

2996
02:15:46,017 --> 02:15:49,817
入れたら周りの敵に注意しといて。一応。
Once it's in, watch out for nearby enemies. Just in case.

2997
02:15:50,017 --> 02:15:52,817
イロハ、降りれる、それ？ 降りたい、降りたいけど...
Iroha, can you get off that? I want to, I want to get off, but...

2998
02:15:52,917 --> 02:15:54,517
大丈夫ですか？
Are you okay?

2999
02:15:54,517 --> 02:15:57,017
ちょっと待って、来てる来てる。あ、オッケーオッケー、ちょっと待って。
Hold on, they're coming. Ah, okay okay, hold on.

3000
02:15:57,017 --> 02:16:00,117
オッケー、乗っていい、飛んでいい。あ、乗った乗った、イロハ。オッケーオッケー。
Okay, you can get on and fly. Ah, Iroha got on. Okay, okay.

3001
02:16:00,117 --> 02:16:03,517
あ、乗ってきたかも。あー、ごめん！降りた、あたし。
Ah, someone might've hopped on. Ah, sorry! I got off.

3002
02:16:03,517 --> 02:16:05,517
あ、了解です。あ、これ作業台か。
Ah, roger that. Ah, is this a smithy?

3003
02:16:05,517 --> 02:16:09,317
ち、痛いんですけど、ちょ、降りてもらえます？奥さん。
Ow, that hurts! C-Could you step off me, ma'am?

3004
02:16:09,317 --> 02:16:11,517
よいしょ、作業台...
Up we go... a smithy...

3005
02:16:11,517 --> 02:16:15,717
ボタン先輩、中央の真ん中... この、こいつが邪魔すぎる！こいつを...
Botan-senpai, dead in the center... this guy is way too in the way! This guy...

3006
02:16:15,717 --> 02:16:18,217
こいつがプテラを食っちゃう。あ、食っちゃうな。
This guy's gonna eat the Ptera. Ah, yeah, it will.

3007
02:16:18,217 --> 02:16:19,717
大丈夫か？
You okay?

3008
02:16:19,817 --> 02:16:21,817
やばい、ちょっとこいつ離せない。
Oh no, I can't shake this one off.

3009
02:16:21,817 --> 02:16:25,017
え、誰、誰？ なんか攻撃できないから、中で。
Eh, who, who? I can't attack from inside here.

3010
02:16:25,017 --> 02:16:28,517
ティラノ乗ってる人、誰か攻撃してあげれない？ヘイト取れない？
Whoever's riding the Rex, can someone attack it? Draw aggro?

3011
02:16:28,517 --> 02:16:31,317
あ、ヘイト取ってくれてます。あ、オッケー。
Ah, they're drawing aggro for me. Ah, okay.

3012
02:16:31,317 --> 02:16:34,517
よし、ボタン行きます。行きます。挟まれてるから無理。
Alright, Botan going in. Going in. I'm pinned, so I can't.

3013
02:16:34,517 --> 02:16:36,917
こいつ倒すわ、こいつ倒す、こいつ倒す。
I'll kill this one, kill this one, kill this one.

3014
02:16:36,917 --> 02:16:41,017
ナイスナイスナイス！倒した倒した倒した倒した！ナイスナイスナイス！
Nice, nice, nice! Killed it, killed it, killed it! Nice, nice, nice!

3015
02:16:41,017 --> 02:16:46,017
ふう。奥まで連れてきました、Rex。
Phew. I lured the Rex all the way to the back.

3016
02:16:46,517 --> 02:16:52,517
すいません、クロスボウと麻酔矢、多分ござる落としたやつ... 落ちちゃったのかな、イナ先輩に渡そうと思って。
Excuse me, the crossbow and tranq arrows I dropped... maybe they fell, I wanted to hand them to Ina-senpai.

3017
02:16:52,517 --> 02:16:57,017
あー、気づかなくて、多分...
Ah, I didn't notice, probably...

3018
02:16:57,017 --> 02:17:01,017
いや、ごめん！ 大丈夫です。ええと、なんか...
Ah, sorry! It's okay. Um, like...

3019
02:17:01,317 --> 02:17:08,017
可能であればクロスボウを作ってきてもらえると、多分ユウティラ戦に間に合うかも。ごめんなさい。
If possible, if you could craft a crossbow and bring it, maybe it'll make it in time for the Yutyrannus fight. Sorry.

3020
02:17:08,517 --> 02:17:12,017
あ、じゃあクロスボウ作っちゃうね、自分が。ありがとうございます。
Ah, then I'll just craft a crossbow myself. Thank you very much.

3021
02:17:12,017 --> 02:17:15,517
あ、後ろから来てるわ、ボタン先輩。またちっこいやつ。
Ah, there's one coming from behind, Botan-senpai. Another tiny one.

3022
02:17:15,517 --> 02:17:19,317
ちっこいやつ？どれ？ あ、こっちこっち。ん？どれ？ ここここここ。
A tiny one? Which one? Ah, over here. Hm? Which one? Right here, here, here.

3023
02:17:19,517 --> 02:17:22,517
あと10分だー。いけるか。
10 minutes left! Can we make it?

3024
02:17:22,517 --> 02:17:27,017
あと10分でユウティラのお時間が... やべえ。ユウティラかー。
In 10 minutes it's Yutyrannus time... Oh shoot. Yutyrannus, huh...

3025
02:17:28,517 --> 02:17:34,017
あるけど43の58ってのがなんとなく分かってるから、とりあえずは... あ、そうやね。多分。
But roughly knowing it's at 43, 58, for now... Ah, yeah. Probably.

3026
02:17:35,317 --> 02:17:40,017
え、どうなったんですか？ティラノもう死んだ？ ううん、あの、昏睡してるよ、今。テイムしてるよ。
Wait, what happened? Did the Rex die? No, um, it's unconscious right now. We're taming it.

3027
02:17:40,017 --> 02:17:43,517
あ、よかったー！ありがとうございます。43.6%！
Ah, thank goodness! Thank you very much. 43.6%!

3028
02:17:44,017 --> 02:17:49,517
クロスボウ何個か作っといてもいいかもですね。ござる、どうせユウティラの時も操縦するんで。
It might be good to craft a few crossbows. I'll be steering during the Yuty fight anyway.

3029
02:17:50,017 --> 02:17:53,017
イナ先輩あたりに予備として持ってててもらって。
So having someone like Ina-senpai carry spares would be good.

3030
02:17:53,017 --> 02:17:56,017
あ、了解了解。クロスボウじゃあ作っとくね。
Ah, roger roger. I'll make the crossbows then.

3031
02:17:56,017 --> 02:18:01,017
てか、あたし... 今... 捕まえてた奴、霜降り持ってませんか？ボタン先輩。霜降り...
Wait, did... the one you caught just now have prime meat, Botan-senpai? Prime meat...

3032
02:18:01,017 --> 02:18:04,517
生肉ならある。霜降り... あ、どっかにあるかも。ここ。
I have raw meat. Prime meat... ah, might be somewhere. Here.

3033
02:18:05,017 --> 02:18:09,017
あ、それかな。霜降りだったら早いんじゃないかな、確か。
Ah, that might be it. If it's prime meat, it should be faster, I think.

3034
02:18:09,017 --> 02:18:13,017
マジ？入れて入れて。今テイム中43%だね。
Really? Put it in, put it in. It's at 43% taming right now.

3035
02:18:13,017 --> 02:18:17,517
やべ、こいつ体... 霜降りってそういえば重てえんだった。
Shoot, my body... Oh right, prime meat is super heavy.

3036
02:18:17,517 --> 02:18:21,517
よいしょ。霜降り... あ、これ入れた方がいい？
Up we go. Prime meat... Ah, should I put this in?

3037
02:18:21,517 --> 02:18:26,517
そう、これ入れた方がいい。一回降ろしちゃった、いろんな恐竜の... いいよー。
Yeah, better put this in. I dumped out various dinos'... Go ahead.

3038
02:18:27,017 --> 02:18:29,017
いって！
Ouch!

3039
02:18:30,517 --> 02:18:35,517
えーっと... あたしのプテラどこ行った？
Um... Where did my Ptera go?

3040
02:18:36,017 --> 02:18:39,517
あ、待ってね。今からそっち行く。あいよ。
Ah, hold on. Heading over there now. Alright.

3041
02:18:40,517 --> 02:18:46,017
俺のプテラどっか行っちゃった。イロハ乗って帰っちゃってるな。あ、オッケーオッケー。あ、じゃあ...
My Ptera went somewhere. Iroha rode it back. Ah, okay okay. Ah, then...

3042
02:18:46,517 --> 02:18:50,017
たすけ... いやー！ビビの猫死んだかも。
Help... Nooo! Bibee's cat might have died.

3043
02:18:50,017 --> 02:18:53,517
猫いるよ！ 死んでない？よかった。猫ここ！
The cat is here! It didn't die? Thank goodness. Cat's right here!

3044
02:18:53,517 --> 02:18:59,017
ツェッペリン... なんか猫、名前見えた気がする。
Zeppelin... I feel like I saw the cat's name.

3045
02:18:59,017 --> 02:19:01,517
どこ？ビビの死んだ... あれ？
Where? Did Bibee die... huh?

3046
02:19:01,517 --> 02:19:05,517
あ、ここだよ！なんかツェッペリンをフォローしてる、猫ちゃん。
Ah, it's here! The kitty is following the Zeppelin.

3047
02:19:06,017 --> 02:19:09,317
そう、ツェッペリンの下にいるわ。キャット。
Yeah, it's under the Zeppelin. Cat.

3048
02:19:09,517 --> 02:19:13,017
ちょっと待って、ツェッペリン浮かせたるわ。
Hold on, I'll lift the Zeppelin up.

3049
02:19:13,017 --> 02:19:17,017
どこの？ ツェッペリンの下。ここ！
Where? Under the Zeppelin. Right here!

3050
02:19:17,017 --> 02:19:21,517
イナ先輩、このツェッペリンの追従外せるかな、こいつの。
Ina-senpai, can you unfollow the Zeppelin for this one?

3051
02:19:21,517 --> 02:19:25,517
あ、ちょっと待ってください。えーっと、フォロー...
Ah, please wait a moment. Um, follow...

3052
02:19:25,517 --> 02:19:30,017
あ、ないぞ。そろそろ行かないと行けないから... とおー！
Ah, not there. I have to get going soon, so... Hyah!

3053
02:19:30,017 --> 02:19:33,517
ユウティラに羊肉いる？
Do we need mutton for the Yutyrannus?

3054
02:19:33,517 --> 02:19:38,017
要らないかー。オッケー。あー、できたー！
Guess not. Okay. Ah, done!

3055
02:19:38,017 --> 02:19:42,017
はい。こいつでもどうする？ ビビ？ 置いといていいよ、もう。置いといていい、置いといて。
Yep. What should we do with this one though? Bibee? Just leave it, it's fine. Leave it, leave it.

3056
02:19:42,017 --> 02:19:45,517
猫ちゃん、ここだよー。ティラノ、置いてっていい？
Kitty, over here! Can we leave the Rex here?

3057
02:19:45,517 --> 02:19:49,517
ビビ、DVDロストしたかもしれない。
Bibee, you might have lost your death bag.

3058
02:19:49,517 --> 02:19:52,517
ティラノさんこれ置いとくの？ ここだよ、猫ちゃん。どこでやられたん？
Are we leaving Mr. Rex here? Right here, kitty. Where did you get killed?

3059
02:19:52,517 --> 02:19:56,517
そっか、マップに猫、あ、猫ありがとうございます。さぼらねえもんな。
I see, on the map the cat... Ah, thank you for the cat. Doesn't slack off, huh.

3060
02:19:56,517 --> 02:20:00,517
ビビはマップに自分の死亡した場所書いてない？
Bibee, isn't your death location marked on your map?

3061
02:20:00,517 --> 02:20:04,517
書いてて、それを今探してるんですが見つからなくて... えっと
It's written, and I'm looking for it right now, but I can't find it... um

3062
02:20:04,538 --> 02:20:07,038
ティラノのサドルがでも入ってるわカバンの中に
The Rex's saddle is in the bag though.

3063
02:20:07,138 --> 02:20:08,738
ほんとに？乗れる？
Really? Can you ride it?

3064
02:20:08,738 --> 02:20:11,538
いや、でも待ってよ。あ、ポッ...ポッと入れ、ポッと入れます。
No, but wait... Ah, I'll pop it into a cryopod.

3065
02:20:12,038 --> 02:20:13,038
はい。
Okay.

3066
02:20:13,138 --> 02:20:14,138
行こう。
Let's go.

3067
02:20:14,338 --> 02:20:16,338
ユウティラの時間がちょっとやばいから...
The Yutyrannus's timer is getting tight, so...

3068
02:20:16,338 --> 02:20:17,738
はい、じゃあ乗ってください！
Okay, please get on!

3069
02:20:17,738 --> 02:20:19,138
え？ちょっと待ってね。
Huh? Wait a second.

3070
02:20:20,038 --> 02:20:21,538
ん？じゃ...
Hm? Then...

3071
02:20:23,038 --> 02:20:24,538
え、嘘でしょ？
Wait, you're kidding, right?

3072
02:20:24,738 --> 02:20:27,538
待って、の...もしかしてモンボにしまえない？
Wait... can it not be stored in a cryopod?

3073
02:20:27,738 --> 02:20:31,038
待って、ししろんにもティラノが追随...
Wait, the Rex is following Shishiron...

3074
02:20:31,338 --> 02:20:32,338
ついてる？
Is it following?

3075
02:20:32,338 --> 02:20:34,538
追従しちゃってるかも。
It might be set to follow.

3076
02:20:34,538 --> 02:20:38,038
あ、ちょっと、ちょっとあの... 間違えたー
Ah, wait, wait, um... I messed up!

3077
02:20:38,338 --> 02:20:41,738
私フォローしてるからちょっと呼んでて。ビビちゃん。
I have it following me, so call it over, Bibi-chan.

3078
02:20:42,038 --> 02:20:43,538
はい。
Yes.

3079
02:20:44,038 --> 02:20:46,038
ビビちゃんのところに。
Over to Bibi-chan.

3080
02:20:46,538 --> 02:20:49,338
猫？うん、猫。はい。
The cat? Yeah, the cat. Okay.

3081
02:20:49,538 --> 02:20:52,338
えっと待って、ビビの荷物は...あった。
Um, wait, Bibi's inventory... found it.

3082
02:20:52,338 --> 02:20:54,038
荷物ありました。
Found the inventory.

3083
02:20:54,038 --> 02:20:56,538
うん、オッケー。ほんならじゃあ行こう。
Yeah, okay. Well then, let's go.

3084
02:20:56,538 --> 02:21:01,038
ティラノ、ティラノ大丈夫か？もうじゃあ猫もいいや。ティラノはもうピストルで撃ってもらって...
Is the Rex okay? The cat's fine now too. Shoot the Rex with a pistol...

3085
02:21:01,038 --> 02:21:02,138
ビビちゃん
Bibi-chan.

3086
02:21:02,138 --> 02:21:03,338
ありがとう。
Thank you.

3087
02:21:03,338 --> 02:21:05,038
うん。あ、自分のですか？
Yeah. Ah, is it mine?

3088
02:21:05,038 --> 02:21:06,538
しまったー。よいしょ。
Oh darn. Up we go.

3089
02:21:06,538 --> 02:21:10,038
43の58にいるかな？まだ。
I wonder if it's still at 43, 58?

3090
02:21:10,038 --> 02:21:12,038
まだいると思うよ。
I think it's still there.

3091
02:21:12,038 --> 02:21:14,038
ビビ、プテラだと嬉しい？
Bibi, would you like a Ptera?

3092
02:21:14,038 --> 02:21:15,338
ビビプテラ、はい。
Bibi Ptera, yes.

3093
02:21:15,338 --> 02:21:17,738
うん、オッケー。このまま行っちゃいますね。
Yeah, okay. We'll head straight there.

3094
02:21:17,738 --> 02:21:21,338
よいしょ、よいしょ。43の50...
Alright, alright. 43, 50...

3095
02:21:21,338 --> 02:21:25,038
58あたりにいるっていう。
They say it's around 58.

3096
02:21:25,038 --> 02:21:26,338
了解です。
Roger that.

3097
02:21:26,338 --> 02:21:28,038
猫ちゃん。
Cat-chan.

3098
02:21:30,038 --> 02:21:32,038
どこだ、あっちか。
Where is it? Over there?

3099
02:21:32,338 --> 02:21:36,038
イナ先輩猫じゃあビビが持っていきます、いません。
Ina-senpai, Bibi will bring the cat, no problem.

3100
02:21:36,538 --> 02:21:39,538
よいしょ。あ、来てる。
Up we go. Ah, it's here.

3101
02:21:40,338 --> 02:21:42,538
はい。あーごめん、なんか落ちた。
Okay. Ah, sorry, I fell off somehow.

3102
02:21:42,538 --> 02:21:45,038
あ、まじ？あ、でもプテラある、プテラある。
Ah, really? But there's a Ptera, there's a Ptera.

3103
02:21:45,038 --> 02:21:47,538
行けます？いける、おー。
Can you go? I can, ooh.

3104
02:21:48,538 --> 02:21:51,538
プテラあるんで。あの、オッケー。
Since there's a Ptera. Um, okay.

3105
02:21:52,038 --> 02:21:55,038
どうせアンキロの確認1回入るからその時に。
Since we'll check on the Ankylo once anyway, at that time...

3106
02:21:55,038 --> 02:21:58,538
あー、うん。乗っちゃいましょう。うん、こっちかな？
Ah, yeah. Let's get on. Yeah, this way?

3107
02:22:01,038 --> 02:22:05,538
んー... よいしょ。アルゲンってあったりします？基地に。
Hm... Alright. Are there any Argies at the base?

3108
02:22:06,338 --> 02:22:10,038
プテラの方が速いからプテラだとありがたい？
Since Ptera is faster, would a Ptera be appreciated?

3109
02:22:10,038 --> 02:22:12,038
プテラ、プテラ...
Ptera, Ptera...

3110
02:22:12,338 --> 02:22:20,038
ごめん、ワンチャン... ワンチャンこれユニコーンいたかもしれないらしく、ちょっと見てる、今。
Sorry, there's a chance... apparently there might have been a unicorn, so I'm checking right now.

3111
02:22:20,038 --> 02:22:24,538
いいよ。オッケー！ユニコーン、ギリースーツとベリーあればオッケー。
Go ahead. Okay! For unicorn, if you have a ghillie suit and berries, you're set.

3112
02:22:26,538 --> 02:22:29,538
熱い、ユニコーンは。よいしょ。
Unicorn is hype. Alright.

3113
02:22:29,738 --> 02:22:32,038
ついでにみんな麻酔矢どれくらい持ってる？
By the way, how many tranq arrows does everyone have?

3114
02:22:32,038 --> 02:22:34,538
117。0。94。
117. Zero. 94.

3115
02:22:34,538 --> 02:22:36,738
なら行けるかな、オッケー。
Then we should be good, okay.

3116
02:22:36,738 --> 02:22:40,538
ビビはめっちゃ持ってるけど、今全然向かえてない。
Bibi has a ton, but can't head over at all right now.

3117
02:22:40,538 --> 02:22:43,538
そしてプテラが荷物パンで持て... 乗れな...
And the Ptera is full of luggage and can't... can't fly...

3118
02:22:43,538 --> 02:22:45,538
荷物捨てろーい！
Dump your stuff!

3119
02:22:45,738 --> 02:22:47,538
はーい。
Okay.

3120
02:22:47,538 --> 02:22:51,038
よいしょっと。荷物を置いてくるんだ！
Alright. Go drop off your luggage!

3121
02:22:53,038 --> 02:22:54,538
43の58。
43, 58.

3122
02:22:54,538 --> 02:22:57,538
ござる、このまま真っ直ぐ行くとね、アイスワイバーンいるわ。
Gozaru, if you go straight like this, there's an Ice Wyvern.

3123
02:22:57,538 --> 02:23:00,538
なるほど、ちょっと待って、それはもう聞いてないわ。
I see, wait a moment, I didn't hear about that!

3124
02:23:00,538 --> 02:23:03,038
えっと、こっちか。
Um, this way?

3125
02:23:04,538 --> 02:23:07,538
左側にいたやつですよね？
The one that was on the left side, right?

3126
02:23:07,538 --> 02:23:11,038
多分右... 今ね右のほうにいて...
Probably right... right now it's towards the right...

3127
02:23:11,038 --> 02:23:15,038
43の58はこっち... めっちゃ体熱いんだけど。雪山のくせに。なんで？
43, 58 is this way... My body is super hot, even though it's a snowy mountain. Why?

3128
02:23:16,038 --> 02:23:20,538
雪山のくせに体熱すぎだろ。どうなってんねん。
Way too hot for a snowy mountain. What's up with that?

3129
02:23:20,538 --> 02:23:24,538
なんか燃えてるよね。うん、体熱い。
It looks like it's burning. Yeah, body is hot.

3130
02:23:25,038 --> 02:23:27,538
58こっちか。
58 is this way?

3131
02:23:29,038 --> 02:23:31,538
座標いくつだったっけ？45の...
What were the coordinates again? 45...?

3132
02:23:31,538 --> 02:23:34,038
43の58って言ってたかな？
I think they said 43, 58?

3133
02:23:34,038 --> 02:23:35,538
43の58。
43, 58.

3134
02:23:35,538 --> 02:23:38,538
あー、スタミナがゆっくり降りてるー。
Ah, stamina is slowly dropping...

3135
02:23:38,538 --> 02:23:41,538
ちょっと左迂回して行ったほうがいいかも。
Might be better to detour to the left.

3136
02:23:41,538 --> 02:23:44,038
です。よいしょ。
Agreed. Alright.

3137
02:23:44,038 --> 02:23:47,538
なんかとんでもねえでっけえかまくらいる。
There's an insanely huge igloo.

3138
02:23:47,538 --> 02:23:51,038
頑張ってゆっくり降りるんだ。
Do your best and land slowly.

3139
02:23:51,038 --> 02:23:56,538
え、寒くなったんだが。はあ？お前... どう... 体...
Wait, it got cold! Huh? You... what's with... your body...

3140
02:23:56,538 --> 02:23:59,538
なんか死んだ気でノースタイルで行こう。
Let's just go casually like our lives depend on it.

3141
02:23:59,538 --> 02:24:01,538
どうした、お前。
What's wrong with you?

3142
02:24:01,538 --> 02:24:04,538
あ、まだユウティラいます、います、います。
Ah, the Yutyrannus is still here, here, here.

3143
02:24:04,538 --> 02:24:08,038
オッケー。ワイバーンいるんだけど。やっばいやっばいやっばい。
Okay. There's a Wyvern though. Oh no oh no oh no.

3144
02:24:08,038 --> 02:24:12,538
アイスワイバーンがね、私ユウティラの上で待機しとくよ。
The Ice Wyvern... I'll wait on top of the Yutyrannus.

3145
02:24:12,538 --> 02:24:14,038
はーい。
Okay.

3146
02:24:16,538 --> 02:24:20,038
怖っ怖っ怖っ、誰か乗ってるワイバーンがいる。
Scary scary scary, there's a Wyvern someone's riding.

3147
02:24:20,038 --> 02:24:24,538
ん？なんだって？どうしたんだ、君？なんか... よいしょ。バグってる、もしや君？
Hm? What was that? What's wrong with you? Is it... alright. Are you bugged by any chance?

3148
02:24:25,038 --> 02:24:27,538
今ね、どこだろ、48の... あ、45？
Right now, where is it, 48... ah, 45?

3149
02:24:27,538 --> 02:24:31,538
私ね今いるよ。ピンって出せんのかな、ここ。
I'm here right now. Can I drop a pin here?

3150
02:24:31,538 --> 02:24:32,538
あ、出せると助かります。
Ah, that would be a big help.

3151
02:24:32,538 --> 02:24:33,538
はい、ここです。
Here you go, right here.

3152
02:24:33,538 --> 02:24:35,038
あ、そこか！オッケー、ありがとう。
Ah, over there! Okay, thank you.

3153
02:24:35,038 --> 02:24:36,038
はいはい。
Okay okay.

3154
02:24:36,038 --> 02:24:37,538
はいはいはいはい。
Yes yes yes yes.

3155
02:24:37,538 --> 02:24:40,538
番号に行けばいいですか？緯度経度。
Should I go to the coordinates? Latitude and longitude.

3156
02:24:41,038 --> 02:24:45,538
えっとね、M押すとたぶんね、今ピンが出てる... ここに行けってやつが。
Um, if you press M, I think a pin appears now... showing where to go.

3157
02:24:45,538 --> 02:24:47,538
はい、ありがとうございます。
Yes, thank you very much.

3158
02:24:47,538 --> 02:24:48,738
うん、はい。
Yeah, okay.

3159
02:24:48,738 --> 02:24:51,538
プテラいない、いない、ビビ。
There's no Ptera, none for Bibi.

3160
02:24:51,538 --> 02:24:54,538
え、人のやつでも乗れたら乗ってほしいかも。
Eh, if you can ride someone else's, I'd like you to ride it.

3161
02:24:54,538 --> 02:24:56,038
はい。
Okay.

3162
02:24:56,038 --> 02:24:58,038
遅れてますが向かいますー。
I'm running late, but I'm on my way!

3163
02:24:58,038 --> 02:24:59,538
はーい。
Okay.

3164
02:25:00,038 --> 02:25:04,038
ただね、アイスワイバーンちょっと近くいたから気をつけてね。
Just be careful, the Ice Wyvern was pretty close.

3165
02:25:04,919 --> 02:25:06,359
今度アイスワイバーン湧いた。
An Ice Wyvern spawned this time.

3166
02:25:06,559 --> 02:25:07,759
あ、本当だ。
Ah, you're right.

3167
02:25:07,759 --> 02:25:10,559
それかビビワンのライトニングワイバーン乗ってきてもいい。
Or you could ride Bibi-one's Lightning Wyvern over.

3168
02:25:10,559 --> 02:25:11,959
冷蔵庫の中にある。
It's inside the fridge.

3169
02:25:11,959 --> 02:25:13,059
これか？どれ？
Is it this one? Which one?

3170
02:25:13,059 --> 02:25:14,159
はーい。
Okay.

3171
02:25:14,159 --> 02:25:18,059
移動させた方がいいんだったら...
If it's better to move it...

3172
02:25:18,059 --> 02:25:20,559
ちょっと移動しさ...
I'll move it a bit...

3173
02:25:21,059 --> 02:25:23,959
あ、大丈夫だ、大丈夫だ。周りのクマやっちゃうわ。
Ah, it's fine, it's fine. I'll take out the bears around here.

3174
02:25:23,959 --> 02:25:25,359
お願いしまーす。
Please do!

3175
02:25:25,559 --> 02:25:27,059
よいしょ。
Alright.

3176
02:25:28,259 --> 02:25:30,359
あ、これ、アルゲンだった。
Ah, this was an Argent.

3177
02:25:30,359 --> 02:25:31,459
バグってる。
It's glitching.

3178
02:25:31,559 --> 02:25:32,559
もう何で...
Geez, why...

3179
02:25:32,559 --> 02:25:35,359
エビさん大丈夫か？大丈夫か？落ち着いて。
Ebi-san, are you alright? Are you okay? Calm down.

3180
02:25:35,559 --> 02:25:38,559
それかビビ、グリフィンでも、グリフィンでも乗れるかも。
Or Bibi, you might be able to ride a Griffin too.

3181
02:25:39,059 --> 02:25:40,959
はーい。
Okay.

3182
02:25:40,959 --> 02:25:44,059
滑って...グリフィン...
It's sliding... Griffin...

3183
02:25:45,559 --> 02:25:47,559
ちょっとスタミナが...
My stamina is a bit...

3184
02:25:47,559 --> 02:25:49,359
グリフィン？グリフィン？
Griffin? Griffin?

3185
02:25:49,559 --> 02:25:52,859
グリフィンでもライトニングワイバーンでも飛べるやつだったら。
Either a Griffin or a Lightning Wyvern, as long as it flies.

3186
02:25:53,559 --> 02:25:56,059
何これ、めちゃくちゃ重いんだけど。
What is this? It's insanely heavy.

3187
02:25:56,559 --> 02:25:59,759
めちゃくちゃ重いのは毛皮持ってたりとかするかな？
If it's super heavy, is it carrying pelts or something?

3188
02:26:00,059 --> 02:26:02,759
いや、重量じゃなくって...
No, it's not the weight...

3189
02:26:03,359 --> 02:26:05,159
あ、なんかバグってたわ。
Ah, it was just bugged.

3190
02:26:05,159 --> 02:26:07,059
飛べたー。
It flew!

3191
02:26:07,059 --> 02:26:08,559
あー、バグってたー。
Ah, it was bugged.

3192
02:26:08,759 --> 02:26:10,559
行けた？
Did it work?

3193
02:26:12,059 --> 02:26:13,559
うー。
Ugh...

3194
02:26:14,259 --> 02:26:15,759
ワイバーン！
Wyvern!

3195
02:26:15,759 --> 02:26:19,159
周りのタゲとってくれると嬉しいです。
I'd appreciate it if you could draw aggro from the surroundings.

3196
02:26:19,359 --> 02:26:20,559
いいよー。
Sure thing.

3197
02:26:20,559 --> 02:26:21,859
おいしょ。
Alright.

3198
02:26:21,859 --> 02:26:26,359
わため先輩もしかしてワイバーンで飛んでるのワンチャンあれですか？
Watame-senpai, could you flying on a Wyvern possibly be that?

3199
02:26:27,059 --> 02:26:33,059
わため先輩！ユウティラ探しの旅ですか？もしかしてユウティラこれやろうとしてる？
Watame-senpai! Are you searching for a Yuty? Are you trying to hunt this Yuty by any chance?

3200
02:26:34,859 --> 02:26:35,759
おいしょ。
Alright.

3201
02:26:35,759 --> 02:26:37,959
やべ、あ、火！声の範囲が届かず。
Oh shoot, fire! My voice couldn't reach in time.

3202
02:26:37,959 --> 02:26:39,059
あ、火！
Ah, fire!

3203
02:26:39,059 --> 02:26:45,059
ウルフ、あ、ウルフを、あ、ウルフを倒してほしい。クマと戦って...あ、ウルフあ...
Wolf... Ah, the wolves... I need the wolves killed. Fighting a bear... Ah, wolves...

3204
02:26:45,559 --> 02:26:47,059
大丈夫ですか？
Are you alright?

3205
02:26:47,059 --> 02:26:49,559
オオカミが来てるー！
Wolves are coming!

3206
02:26:51,059 --> 02:26:52,559
おいしょ。
Alright.

3207
02:26:52,559 --> 02:26:55,359
オオカミと戦っちゃってる。
They're fighting wolves.

3208
02:26:56,359 --> 02:26:57,559
おいしょ。
Alright.

3209
02:26:58,059 --> 02:27:00,559
グリフィンに乗って向かってまーす。
I'm heading over on a Griffin.

3210
02:27:00,559 --> 02:27:01,859
はーい。
Okay.

3211
02:27:02,159 --> 02:27:05,559
ユウティラがなんかサイに結構ボコボコに...
The Yuty is getting beat up pretty bad by a rhino...

3212
02:27:05,559 --> 02:27:06,559
マジ？
Seriously?

3213
02:27:07,359 --> 02:27:11,059
このサイだけ何とかならないものか。あのサイの...あ、これ違うチームなのか？
Can't we do something about just this rhino? That rhino's... Wait, is this from a different team?

3214
02:27:11,059 --> 02:27:13,259
サイ、ボロボロやろ？
The rhino is battered, isn't it?

3215
02:27:13,259 --> 02:27:18,259
そう、これ違うチームなんですよ。なんか狙ってるのか分かんなくてどうしたらいいんだろう。
Yeah, this is from a different team. I don't know if they're targeting it, so what should we do?

3216
02:27:18,859 --> 02:27:20,059
おいしょ。
Alright.

3217
02:27:20,359 --> 02:27:22,059
来た来た来た来た！
Here they come, here they come!

3218
02:27:22,059 --> 02:27:23,559
ちょっと話しかけてみよう。
Let me try talking to them.

3219
02:27:23,559 --> 02:27:25,559
このユウティラ持っていっていいですかー？
Can we take this Yuty?

3220
02:27:26,059 --> 02:27:31,059
あ、このユウティラ、ごめん、このユウティラ、あの、今ミッション予約してて...
Ah, this Yuty... Sorry, this Yuty is reserved for a mission right now...

3221
02:27:31,559 --> 02:27:33,059
あ、何何？
Oh, what is it?

3222
02:27:33,059 --> 02:27:39,059
あのね、このユウティラちょうど9時半からのミッションで使う予定で今持ってきちゃったんだよね。ごめんねー。
You see, we were planning to use this Yuty for the 9:30 mission, so we just brought it over. Sorry!

3223
02:27:39,059 --> 02:27:41,059
あ、了解です。他のでやりますー。
Ah, understood. We'll use a different one.

3224
02:27:41,059 --> 02:27:42,759
すいませんー。
Sorry about that!

3225
02:27:43,059 --> 02:27:44,559
おいしょ。
Alright.

3226
02:27:43,759 --> 02:27:47,059
すまんなー。すまんなー。
Sorry about that~. Sorry~.

3227
02:27:47,359 --> 02:27:48,759
おいしょ、おいしょ。
Alright, alright.

3228
02:27:48,759 --> 02:27:50,559
こよりさんか。
Oh, it's Koyori-san.

3229
02:27:52,859 --> 02:27:54,559
おいしょ、ござるさん。
Alright, Gozaru-san.

3230
02:27:54,059 --> 02:27:55,759
あ、ユウティどこ行く？
Ah, where is the Yuty going?

3231
02:27:55,759 --> 02:27:58,159
着陸させてますね。
They're landing it.

3232
02:27:58,159 --> 02:27:59,359
あ、乗れてる。
Ah, they're mounted on it.

3233
02:27:59,359 --> 02:28:00,759
マンモスと戦ってる。
It's fighting a mammoth.

3234
02:28:00,759 --> 02:28:02,359
えっと、あれだ。クロスボウ！
Um, that thing... A crossbow!

3235
02:28:02,759 --> 02:28:06,559
あー、ちょっと待ってくださいね。これ取れないんですよね、運転...
Ah, please wait a moment. I can't take it out while piloting...

3236
02:28:06,059 --> 02:28:07,559
あ、そっかそっか。
Ah, I see, I see.

3237
02:28:07,559 --> 02:28:11,059
多分ござるどうせ撃てないんで、持てたままで大丈夫です。
Gozaru probably can't shoot anyway, so it's fine if you just hold it.

3238
02:28:11,059 --> 02:28:12,359
あ、了解！
Ah, got it!

3239
02:28:13,059 --> 02:28:15,059
修理してから来たらよかった。
I should've repaired it before coming.

3240
02:28:15,059 --> 02:28:17,059
おいしょ。行けるかな？
Alright. Wonder if we can make it?

3241
02:28:20,059 --> 02:28:22,059
ちょ、作ってこ。
I'll go craft some.

3242
02:28:25,059 --> 02:28:27,059
狼つえー。
Wolves are so strong.

3243
02:28:27,059 --> 02:28:33,059
失礼いたします、アキロゼです。ただいま21時30分を間もなく迎えますが、準備いかがでしょうか？
Excuse me, this is Aki Rosenthal. It will be 21:30 shortly, how are your preparations going?

3244
02:28:33,359 --> 02:28:34,859
どうでしょうか、皆さん？
How is everyone doing?

3245
02:28:34,859 --> 02:28:37,159
はい！私は行けるー。
Yes! I'm good to go.

3246
02:28:37,559 --> 02:28:38,559
行けるかな？
Are we ready?

3247
02:28:38,559 --> 02:28:39,559
行けます！
We can go!

3248
02:28:39,359 --> 02:28:42,759
大丈夫だと思います。あ、ちょっとテレポートされてきます？来ました？どこにいるか...
I think we're fine. Ah, will we get teleported over? Did they arrive? Where are they...

3249
02:28:42,759 --> 02:28:44,759
あ、えっと間もなくテレポート...
Ah, um, teleporting shortly...

3250
02:28:44,759 --> 02:28:47,559
狼、狼ちょっとあれだな...
The wolves, the wolves are a bit...

3251
02:28:47,559 --> 02:28:49,359
狼倒しますか？
Shall we defeat the wolves?

3252
02:28:49,559 --> 02:28:52,359
少々時間も込みで...カウント開始になったら...
With a little bit of time included... Once the countdown starts...

3253
02:28:52,759 --> 02:28:56,059
はい、それではカウントさせていただきます。
Alright, then I will begin the countdown.

3254
02:28:56,559 --> 02:28:58,159
よろしいでしょうか？
Is everyone ready?

3255
02:28:58,159 --> 02:28:59,559
はい！はい！
Yes! Yes!

3256
02:28:59,559 --> 02:29:01,759
ミッションスタート！
Mission Start!

3257
02:29:02,359 --> 02:29:03,559
おい！
Hey!

3258
02:29:03,559 --> 02:29:07,059
よし、じゃあ着陸してもらって...
Alright, let's have it land...

3259
02:29:07,559 --> 02:29:09,559
ウルフ殺す。
I'll kill the wolves.

3260
02:29:10,559 --> 02:29:13,059
で、狼ちょっと殺さないと...
We really need to kill the wolves...

3261
02:29:13,059 --> 02:29:15,059
うん、寄りますね、まず。
Yeah, I'll pull closer first.

3262
02:29:15,059 --> 02:29:16,559
なんだよ、こいつら。
What's with these guys...

3263
02:29:17,759 --> 02:29:20,059
おい、狼、尻尾やめろ。
Hey, wolves, stop biting the tail!

3264
02:29:20,059 --> 02:29:22,559
私麻酔矢持ってるから、私は麻酔矢撃ってるよ。
I have tranq arrows, so I'll be shooting tranq arrows.

3265
02:29:22,559 --> 02:29:24,559
どこかにトラップ照らす都市も何もなくって...
We don't have any traps or anything to lure it to...

3266
02:29:24,559 --> 02:29:26,059
あ、いいよ。
Ah, okay.

3267
02:29:26,059 --> 02:29:28,059
ユウティ...どこだユウティ？
Yuty... Where is the Yuty?

3268
02:29:28,059 --> 02:29:30,359
いる、ユウティラ下いるんだけど...
It's there, the Yutyrannus is below, but...

3269
02:29:30,359 --> 02:29:34,059
周りのモブをちょっとやらないと多分寝た瞬間...
If we don't clear the mobs around it, the moment it falls asleep...

3270
02:29:34,559 --> 02:29:37,759
寝た瞬間グリフィンとかでやってもらって...
Have someone on a Griffin deal with them the moment it sleeps...

3271
02:29:37,759 --> 02:29:43,359
そうだね、グリフィンで。ビビワン、ユウティラの周りのマンモスとかを狩ってほしいかも。
Yeah, on a Griffin. Bibi-one, could you hunt the mammoths and stuff around the Yuty?

3272
02:29:43,559 --> 02:29:45,359
はい、分かりました。
Yes, understood.

3273
02:29:45,359 --> 02:29:46,759
え、これ麻酔矢もう撃っていい？
Um, can I start shooting tranq arrows now?

3274
02:29:46,759 --> 02:29:48,559
撃っていい、撃っていい。撃ってください。
You can shoot, you can shoot. Please fire away.

3275
02:29:48,759 --> 02:29:51,559
マンモスやるよ。ほらっ！
I'll take on the mammoth. Take that!

3276
02:29:51,559 --> 02:29:54,559
ちょっとユウティラに当てないようにだけ気をつけてね、攻撃。
Just be careful not to hit the Yuty with your attacks.

3277
02:29:54,559 --> 02:29:56,559
はい、ちょっと離れます。
Okay, I'll pull back a bit.

3278
02:29:56,559 --> 02:29:58,159
寝てから撃ち込んだ...
Shooting after it sleeps...

3279
02:29:58,159 --> 02:29:59,759
寝てからの方がいいかもね、確かに。
It might be better after it falls asleep, true.

3280
02:29:59,759 --> 02:30:01,559
うん、寝てからでもいいや。
Yeah, after it sleeps is fine too.

3281
02:30:01,559 --> 02:30:04,559
やべ、ユウティラが...見失ったわ。
Shoot, the Yuty... I lost sight of it.

3282
02:30:04,580 --> 02:30:05,880
下にいる？あ、もう大丈夫だよ。
Is it down there? Ah, it's fine now.

3283
02:30:05,880 --> 02:30:07,380
空きです。
It's clear.

3284
02:30:07,380 --> 02:30:09,680
うん。これ見えてます？皆さん視点。
Yeah. Can you see this from your POV?

3285
02:30:09,680 --> 02:30:11,180
見えてる、見えてる、見えてる。
I can see it, I see it, I see it.

3286
02:30:11,180 --> 02:30:12,580
オッケーオッケー。
Okay, okay.

3287
02:30:13,680 --> 02:30:15,680
これ撃っちゃっていいんだよね？
We can shoot this, right?

3288
02:30:15,680 --> 02:30:18,480
いいよいいよ。で、寝たら肉、寝たら肉。
Go ahead. And once it's asleep, meat. Meat once it sleeps.

3289
02:30:18,580 --> 02:30:21,380
回りますね。よいしょ。はい。
I'll circle around. Heave-ho. Okay.

3290
02:30:26,580 --> 02:30:29,580
あ、落ちちゃった。全然落ちちゃっていいよ。
Ah, I fell off. / It's totally fine if you fall off.

3291
02:30:30,380 --> 02:30:33,080
これグリフィン乗りながら...むずいな。あ、落ちた。いや、大丈夫。
While riding a Griffin... it's tough. Ah, fell off. No, it's fine.

3292
02:30:33,080 --> 02:30:36,580
...乗りながらね、ムズイですね。ムズイな。
...riding while shooting is tricky. It is tricky.

3293
02:30:37,480 --> 02:30:41,580
マンモスがヘイト買ってくれてるから大丈夫。うん。よいしょ。
The mammoth is drawing aggro, so we're good. / Yeah. / Heave-ho.

3294
02:30:44,580 --> 02:30:48,780
そろそろ...乗れそうだったら今着陸させてるんで乗っちゃってください、フブキ先輩。
Almost... If you can board, I'm landing it now so hop on, Fubuki-senpai.

3295
02:30:48,780 --> 02:30:50,380
いいよ。
Okay.

3296
02:30:50,480 --> 02:30:53,080
当ててはいるけど...イエーイ！
I am hitting it, though... / Yay!

3297
02:30:53,380 --> 02:30:55,580
お尻に撃ち込めー！
Shoot it in the butt!

3298
02:30:55,580 --> 02:30:57,580
挟まりに行った。
It went and got stuck.

3299
02:30:57,580 --> 02:31:00,080
どうだ？浮上します。
How is it? Ascending.

3300
02:31:00,480 --> 02:31:02,580
マンモス死んだね。うん。
The mammoth died. / Yeah.

3301
02:31:02,580 --> 02:31:05,180
今だ今だ今だ！
Now's our chance, now, now!

3302
02:31:05,580 --> 02:31:08,080
撃てー！よいしょ。
Fire! / Heave-ho.

3303
02:31:09,880 --> 02:31:13,080
あ、やばい。ヘイトが...こっち向いてたかな？
Oh crap, the aggro... was it turned towards us?

3304
02:31:15,780 --> 02:31:19,080
お。竜っての体力が持ってくれればいいけど。
Oh. As long as the dragon's HP holds out...

3305
02:31:19,080 --> 02:31:20,580
持つかなー。
Will it hold?

3306
02:31:20,580 --> 02:31:24,080
頭に当てれる、当てられてないんだよね。あ、逃げる。逃げてる。
Can we hit the head... We haven't been hitting the head. Ah, it's running. It's running away.

3307
02:31:25,180 --> 02:31:26,680
これ狙えてます？
Can you aim at this?

3308
02:31:26,680 --> 02:31:28,580
うん。一応。
Yeah. For the most part.

3309
02:31:28,580 --> 02:31:31,080
胴体に当てたり...やばいこいつ。
Hitting the torso... this guy is crazy.

3310
02:31:31,280 --> 02:31:32,580
見えない。
I can't see.

3311
02:31:32,680 --> 02:31:34,380
くっ！
Shoot!

3312
02:31:34,580 --> 02:31:36,580
よいしょ。うわーっ！
Heave-ho. Whoaaa!

3313
02:31:36,580 --> 02:31:38,580
あ、やばい。行けー！
Ah, oh no. Go!

3314
02:31:38,580 --> 02:31:41,080
あ、落ちた、落ちたけどむしろ落ちてもいい。
Ah, I fell off, but honestly falling off is fine.

3315
02:31:42,280 --> 02:31:47,380
やばばば...もうこれ、あの視点変...変われーい！
Oh crap crap crap... man, the POV... change already!

3316
02:31:47,580 --> 02:31:48,780
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

3317
02:31:48,780 --> 02:31:50,880
ちょっと距離が...あ、落ちちゃった。
The distance is a bit... Ah, I fell.

3318
02:31:50,880 --> 02:31:52,880
やばい、みんなが落ちてる。
Oh no, everyone is falling off.

3319
02:31:52,880 --> 02:31:56,580
逃げてます？あいつ何にもしてこないの？
Is it running away? It's not doing anything to us?

3320
02:31:56,580 --> 02:31:59,780
もうね、体力が少なくなって逃げてんのかも。
Maybe its HP is low and that's why it's fleeing.

3321
02:31:59,780 --> 02:32:01,780
確かに。よいしょ。
True. Heave-ho.

3322
02:32:02,380 --> 02:32:04,780
あー、奥に...待てーい！
Ah, further in... Wait up!

3323
02:32:05,180 --> 02:32:07,580
視点変わんない。入ってきたら頭。
The view won't change. / Aim for the head when it enters.

3324
02:32:07,580 --> 02:32:09,980
Kでね、視点変わるから...
Pressing K changes the POV, so...

3325
02:32:09,980 --> 02:32:11,580
はい。分からなくなったらK1回押して。
Got it. / If you're lost, press K once.

3326
02:32:11,580 --> 02:32:14,080
1回降りてるから乗りたい人どうぞ。はい。はーい。
I've landed once, so whoever wants to ride, hop on. / Yes. / Okay.

3327
02:32:15,580 --> 02:32:18,480
もういいかな？ありがとうございます。乗りたい。
Are we good? Thank you. I want to ride.

3328
02:32:18,480 --> 02:32:21,380
あ、ごめん、ちょっと木に挟まれた。鬱陶しい。
Ah, sorry, got a bit stuck in a tree. So annoying.

3329
02:32:21,380 --> 02:32:23,580
乗りました。ありがとう。あ、行けた行けた。あ！
I'm on. Thank you. / Ah, got it, got it. Ah!

3330
02:32:23,580 --> 02:32:26,580
オッケーオッケーオッケー。お肉入れちゃおう。お肉入れ...
Okay, okay, okay. Let's put the meat in. / Put the meat...

3331
02:32:26,580 --> 02:32:29,380
お、ナイスー。入れた。ナイスナイスー。
Oh, nice! / Put it in. / Nice, nice!

3332
02:32:29,580 --> 02:32:32,580
周りの敵の警戒を...はい。ほい。
Keep watch for surrounding enemies... / Yes. / Yup.

3333
02:32:34,380 --> 02:32:37,580
よいしょ。マンモス近くにいるな。
Heave-ho. There's a mammoth nearby.

3334
02:32:37,580 --> 02:32:41,080
守るぜ。逃げて...守ってこ守ってこ。
I'll protect it. / Run... / Let's protect it, protect it.

3335
02:32:41,580 --> 02:32:44,580
ふー。ナイスー。よいしょ。
Phew. / Nice! / Heave-ho.

3336
02:32:44,580 --> 02:32:47,580
ナイスー！ナイスー！ナイスー！
Nice! / Nice! / Nice!

3337
02:32:47,580 --> 02:32:51,580
倒れてたやつから霜降り持ってきたら早くテイムできるか？
If we bring Prime Meat from the fallen ones, can we tame it faster?

3338
02:32:52,380 --> 02:32:56,080
霜降り持ってる人います？あ、生肉...あ、霜降りあれだな...
Does anyone have Prime Meat? / Ah, raw meat... Ah, Prime Meat is...

3339
02:32:56,080 --> 02:32:57,880
置いてきたな。いいよ。
Left it behind. / It's fine.

3340
02:32:57,880 --> 02:33:00,580
あ、なんかアルゲントビスに入ってなかったっけ？
Ah, wasn't there some in the Argentavis?

3341
02:33:00,580 --> 02:33:01,880
どうだろうね。
I wonder.

3342
02:33:01,880 --> 02:33:04,080
あ、周りにもいない。あいつ食っちゃったか。
Ah, none around either. Did that guy eat it?

3343
02:33:04,080 --> 02:33:06,580
食っちゃったんだ。こんがり肉でもいいかもね。
Ate it, huh. Cooked meat might be good too.

3344
02:33:06,580 --> 02:33:09,580
こんがりしようかな。こんがりか。よいしょ。
Maybe I'll cook it. / Cooked meat, huh. / Heave-ho.

3345
02:33:10,580 --> 02:33:13,580
羊肉があったら一番早いんだっけよ。
If we had mutton, that would be the fastest.

3346
02:33:13,580 --> 02:33:16,580
で、ここに何かいるの羊じゃないですか？ここに。
And isn't that thing over here a sheep? Right here.

3347
02:33:16,580 --> 02:33:18,880
え？これ羊？羊？
Eh? Is this a sheep? Sheep?

3348
02:33:18,880 --> 02:33:22,080
それはね、違うやつだけど...あ、羊みたいね。
That's a different one, but... / Ah, it looks like a sheep.

3349
02:33:22,080 --> 02:33:24,080
待て、何か来てる。いた。
Wait, something's coming. / There it is.

3350
02:33:24,080 --> 02:33:27,080
何の音？何？何か来てるよ。
What's that sound? / What? / Something's coming.

3351
02:33:27,080 --> 02:33:28,580
何？虫か？
What? A bug?

3352
02:33:28,580 --> 02:33:31,480
虫か？虫かもですね、ちっちゃい虫。
A bug? / Might be bugs, tiny bugs.

3353
02:33:31,580 --> 02:33:33,080
虫！
Bugs!

3354
02:33:34,580 --> 02:33:37,580
よいしょ。痛たたたた...
Heave-ho. / Ow ow ow ow ow...

3355
02:33:37,580 --> 02:33:39,980
ちょっと離れるわ。いいよ。
I'll back off a bit. / Okay.

3356
02:33:39,980 --> 02:33:44,080
嫌やね、この虫。やめといてー！痛い痛い痛い...
I hate these bugs. Stop it! Ouch ouch ouch...

3357
02:33:44,080 --> 02:33:49,580
だるだるだる...だるい、だるい、だるい。だる、だる、だるい。だ、だるい、だるい、だるい、ちょっと。
Annoying annoying annoying... annoying, annoying, so annoying. Slow, slow, annoying. S-so annoying, annoying, annoying, wait!

3358
02:33:50,080 --> 02:33:54,580
エイムガバ！だるい、やめて！
My aim is trash! So annoying, stop it!

3359
02:33:56,080 --> 02:34:00,080
これサイって殺したら霜降り肉になりますっけ？
If we kill this rhino, will it drop Prime Meat?

3360
02:34:00,580 --> 02:34:04,580
ビビり...サイはなんないかなー。ビビり、や、やめとこう。
Scared... Rhinos might not. / Scaredy-cat, l-let's not.

3361
02:34:04,580 --> 02:34:08,080
あはは、やめとこう。
Hahaha, let's not.

3362
02:34:08,580 --> 02:34:12,580
なんか、ど、なんかすげえ、てんやわんやになる気がしてきた、今。
I feel like things are about to get super hectic right now.

3363
02:34:13,080 --> 02:34:15,080
サイ強いからな。うん。
Rhinos are strong, after all. / Yeah.

3364
02:34:15,080 --> 02:34:18,580
そう。あれ？思ったより、思ったより死なないっつってこっち帰ってきてなんか...
Yeah. Like, "Huh? It's not dying as fast as I thought!" and coming back running...

3365
02:34:18,580 --> 02:34:22,080
何これ。...全員食べられる未来が今見えた。
What is this? / ...I just saw a future where we all get eaten.

3366
02:34:22,580 --> 02:34:25,580
まずそうな可能性は高い。
High chance it'll taste gross.

3367
02:34:25,580 --> 02:34:27,580
ええ、まずそう...
Eh, tastes bad...

3368
02:34:28,580 --> 02:34:31,080
やめとこ。あいつってまだ捕まえてないよね？
Let's not. We haven't caught that guy yet, right?

3369
02:34:31,080 --> 02:34:33,580
まだ。まだ気絶中だね。
Not yet. Still knocked out.

3370
02:34:33,580 --> 02:34:35,580
羊、この羊みたいなやつ。
The sheep, this sheep-like thing.

3371
02:34:35,580 --> 02:34:37,780
ああ、あれはまだかな。
Ah, not that one yet.

3372
02:34:37,780 --> 02:34:40,580
これを...待てーい！
This one... Wait up!

3373
02:34:40,580 --> 02:34:42,780
ついでテイムね、ついでテイム。
Bonus taming, bonus taming.

3374
02:34:42,780 --> 02:34:44,980
そう、ついでテイム。霜降り肉取ってきた。
Right, bonus taming. Brought prime meat.

3375
02:34:44,980 --> 02:34:47,080
お、ナイスナイス。ありがとうございまーす。
Oh, nice nice. / Thank you very much!

3376
02:34:47,080 --> 02:34:49,080
よいしょー。
Heave-ho.

3377
02:34:49,580 --> 02:34:53,080
ついでテイムしたいのに。ナイスついでテイム。
I wanted a bonus tame too. / Nice bonus tame.

3378
02:34:54,080 --> 02:34:57,580
なんかついでテイムできそうなやついねえかなー。
Wonder if there's anything else we can bonus tame.

3379
02:34:57,580 --> 02:34:59,580
オシリス？確かに。
Osiris? / True.

3380
02:34:59,580 --> 02:35:04,080
あ、なんかマンモス近づいてきてる？マンモス？ああー。
Ah, is a mammoth approaching? Mammoth? Aah.

3381
02:35:04,601 --> 02:35:06,401
大丈夫かな？大丈夫かな？
Is it okay? Is it gonna be okay?

3382
02:35:06,401 --> 02:35:07,801
大丈夫。右側にいる。
It's fine. It's on the right.

3383
02:35:07,801 --> 02:35:09,801
あいつ来ても足ちょっと遅いかな？
Even if it comes, its movement is pretty slow, maybe?

3384
02:35:09,801 --> 02:35:11,401
まあなんとかなりそう。
Well, looks like we can manage.

3385
02:35:11,601 --> 02:35:14,101
え、入ってきたらやります？これ。
Eh, if it comes inside, should we fight it?

3386
02:35:15,101 --> 02:35:16,601
いや、まだ大丈夫。
No, it's still fine.

3387
02:35:16,601 --> 02:35:18,401
まだ、まだ大丈夫かな。あ、いよーん。
Still... still okay, I think. Alright~

3388
02:35:19,501 --> 02:35:22,401
あ、これでいいかな？霜降りだけ入れたいな。
Ah, is this good? I just want to put in prime meat.

3389
02:35:22,601 --> 02:35:26,601
なんか... ああー！来たー！
Something's... Aaaah! It's here!

3390
02:35:26,601 --> 02:35:28,401
ナイス！ナイスー！
Nice! Nice!

3391
02:35:28,601 --> 02:35:30,801
はい、おめでとうございます！
Yes, congratulations!

3392
02:35:30,801 --> 02:35:32,601
いやー、助かりました。
Man, that really helped.

3393
02:35:32,601 --> 02:35:35,101
ミッション達成しましたー！
Mission accomplished!

3394
02:35:35,101 --> 02:35:36,601
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

3395
02:35:36,601 --> 02:35:38,601
いえーい！
Yay!

3396
02:35:38,601 --> 02:35:41,901
じゃあ次あれだよ、ギガノトも予約しといた方がいいんじゃないか？
Then next, shouldn't we reserve the Giga too?

3397
02:35:41,901 --> 02:35:45,601
ね、ギガノトもこの調子で10... 10時からかってなると...
Right, if Giga goes like this, starting from 10... 10 o'clock?

3398
02:35:45,601 --> 02:35:47,101
10時だな。
10 o'clock, yeah.

3399
02:35:47,101 --> 02:35:50,101
え、予約が既に埋まっている所もありますので、
Um, some reservation slots are already filled up,

3400
02:35:50,101 --> 02:35:53,101
えっムキロゼミッションのそちら情報確認し、
so please check the Mukirose Missions info,

3401
02:35:53,101 --> 02:35:55,601
えとテキストにて申請をお願い致しますー。
and apply via text message, please~

3402
02:35:55,601 --> 02:35:58,101
おめでとうございます。引き続き頑張ってください！
Congratulations! Keep up the good work!

3403
02:35:58,101 --> 02:36:00,101
お願いしまーす。はーい！
Please do~ / Okay!

3404
02:36:00,101 --> 02:36:01,601
ありがとうございまーす。
Thank you very much!

3405
02:36:01,601 --> 02:36:03,601
やったー！やったぜ！
Yay! / We did it!

3406
02:36:03,601 --> 02:36:05,101
草食？
Herbivores?

3407
02:36:05,101 --> 02:36:07,101
23時からが...
Starting from 23:00 is...

3408
02:36:07,101 --> 02:36:09,101
誰かポッド持ってる？
Does anyone have a cryopod?

3409
02:36:09,101 --> 02:36:10,601
ポッド持ってます、ビビ。
I have a pod, Vivi.

3410
02:36:10,601 --> 02:36:14,101
あ、じゃあムキムキミッションを入れて欲しいな。
Ah, then I'd like you to enter the Mukimuki Mission.

3411
02:36:14,101 --> 02:36:15,601
分かりましたー。
Understood~

3412
02:36:15,601 --> 02:36:16,601
ありがとよー。
Thank you~

3413
02:36:16,601 --> 02:36:19,101
結構埋まってるかも。今Discord見たんですけど...
It might be pretty full. I just looked at Discord...

3414
02:36:19,101 --> 02:36:20,601
うん。
Yeah.

3415
02:36:21,101 --> 02:36:25,101
22時からHMのムキロゼミッションやってて...
From 22:00, HM is doing Mukirose Mission...

3416
02:36:25,101 --> 02:36:26,601
はいはいはい。
Right, right, right.

3417
02:36:26,601 --> 02:36:31,101
あ、でもクロスボウ無理、無理なのかな？ギ... ギガノト？
Ah, but is a crossbow impossible? For the Gi... Giga?

3418
02:36:31,101 --> 02:36:34,101
クロスボウでもいいんだけど、一番はそのショットガンで
A crossbow works, but ideally with that shotgun,

3419
02:36:34,101 --> 02:36:38,601
麻酔弾を作ってやった方が気絶は早いんだよね。
making tranq darts and using that knocks it out faster.

3420
02:36:38,601 --> 02:36:42,101
へぇー。さっきショットガンのなんか良い設計図手に入れたよ。
Heh~ Earlier we got a good shotgun blueprint, though.

3421
02:36:42,101 --> 02:36:45,101
そうそう。あと弾が作れるかどうかかな。
Right, right. Also whether we can craft the ammo or not.

3422
02:36:45,101 --> 02:36:46,601
ああ、なるほどね。
Ah, I see.

3423
02:36:46,601 --> 02:36:49,401
だったらさ、ティラノを倒しに行くか。ティラノ倒すのまだミッションあれか。
In that case, should we go defeat Rexes? Do we still have that Rex mission?

3424
02:36:49,401 --> 02:36:53,601
ティラノ10体倒さないといけないミッションがまだチームミッションで残ってるので、
The mission to kill 10 Rexes is still left in team missions, so...

3425
02:36:53,601 --> 02:36:55,601
あ、じゃあこれでもいいかもね。
Ah, then that might be good too.

3426
02:36:55,601 --> 02:36:59,101
全員でやって、もしあれだったら...
Doing it with everyone, and if needed...

3427
02:36:59,101 --> 02:37:01,101
えっ...
Um...

3428
02:37:01,101 --> 02:37:04,601
20体テイムがあと残り9体なんで、様々なやつをテイムするのが
Taming 20 species has 9 left, so taming various creatures

3429
02:37:04,601 --> 02:37:08,601
良いかなという感じですね。
would be good, I think.

3430
02:37:08,601 --> 02:37:13,601
で、一応これ繰り返しができるミッションなんで、ARKの世界にどんだけ恐竜がいるかよく分かってないんですけど...
And this is repeatable, though I don't really know how many dinos exist in ARK...

3431
02:37:13,601 --> 02:37:15,601
ユニコーンのテイムは？
What about taming a Unicorn?

3432
02:37:15,601 --> 02:37:17,601
あー、どうですか？
Ah, how about that?

3433
02:37:17,601 --> 02:37:20,101
ユニコーン全然わかんないね。
I have no idea where the Unicorn is.

3434
02:37:20,101 --> 02:37:24,101
だったら、あれじゃない？ラバ... ラバエレメンタルとか？
Then how about... Lava... Lava Elemental or something?

3435
02:37:24,101 --> 02:37:25,601
ラバ行く？
Go to Lava?

3436
02:37:25,601 --> 02:37:27,601
行ってみるか。いいねー。
Shall we try? / Sounds good~

3437
02:37:27,601 --> 02:37:30,101
ラバ、ティラノだね、今。
Lava or Rex right now, yeah.

3438
02:37:30,101 --> 02:37:34,601
ラバいいと思うし、あれ作ってるから、ロケランあるから...
I think Lava is good, and we made those, we have rocket launchers...

3439
02:37:34,601 --> 02:37:36,601
ワンチャン... じゃあ行こうか。
There's a chance... / Let's go then.

3440
02:37:36,601 --> 02:37:39,101
お前ティラノじゃなかった。削るんだ。
You weren't a Rex. Shave it down.

3441
02:37:39,101 --> 02:37:43,601
あれだったら、ラバエレメンタルチーム4、ティラノ...
If so, Lava Elemental team 4, Rex...

3442
02:37:43,601 --> 02:37:45,101
お、ギュギュットがカルノにやられてる。
Oh, Gyugyutto is getting attacked by a Carno.

3443
02:37:45,101 --> 02:37:49,101
流石にチーム2かな？強い恐竜結構手に入れたから、それでこう齧り付きながら...
Team 2 probably? We got quite a few strong dinos, so biting away with them...

3444
02:37:49,101 --> 02:37:51,601
そういう感じでどうでしょうか？
How about something like that?

3445
02:37:51,601 --> 02:37:53,601
あーやられた！オッケー。
Ah, it's down! / Okay.

3446
02:37:53,601 --> 02:37:57,101
オッケー！一旦まず拠点、カリカリ拠点に戻りましょう。
Okay! First, let's head back to base, the kibble base.

3447
02:37:57,101 --> 02:37:58,601
戻りましょう。オッケー。
Let's head back. / Okay.

3448
02:37:58,601 --> 02:38:00,101
まだカリカリやったんやこれ。
It was still kibble, this one.

3449
02:38:00,101 --> 02:38:02,101
ギュギュットがお亡くなりになった。
Gyugyutto passed away.

3450
02:38:02,101 --> 02:38:03,401
あーなギュギュットー！
Ah, no, Gyugyutto-!

3451
02:38:03,401 --> 02:38:05,601
あ、ってことは多分あそこに居るわ。えっと...
Ah, which means it's probably over there. Um...

3452
02:38:05,601 --> 02:38:07,601
あのカルノがいたな、カルノが。
That Carno was there, the Carno.

3453
02:38:07,601 --> 02:38:09,101
ああ、じゃあカルノ...
Ah, then the Carno...

3454
02:38:09,101 --> 02:38:13,101
カルノまだテイムしてないから、いい感じにアルゲンの中に入ってくんねえかなあいつ。
We haven't tamed a Carno yet, so I wonder if it'll walk nicely into the trap.

3455
02:38:13,101 --> 02:38:15,601
ユウティラみたいに。
Just like the Yuty.

3456
02:38:16,101 --> 02:38:18,601
ちょっとやってみますw
I'll give it a try lol

3457
02:38:18,601 --> 02:38:21,601
やってみて！馬鹿、馬鹿、馬鹿！入れ！
Try it! Dummy, dummy, dummy! Get in!

3458
02:38:22,101 --> 02:38:25,101
え、どれだ？なんかサイもいる。
Eh, which one? There's a rhino too.

3459
02:38:25,101 --> 02:38:28,101
この下にもいたやん、ユウティラ。耐えるね、良かった。
There was a Yuty down here too. It held out, nice.

3460
02:38:28,601 --> 02:38:30,101
これ？こいつかも。ユウティラ。
This one? Might be this guy. Yutyrannus.

3461
02:38:30,101 --> 02:38:33,601
また水がなくなった... あんなにガブ飲みしたのにどうして？
Out of water again... Even though I gulped down so much, why?

3462
02:38:33,601 --> 02:38:36,101
こいつら結構水... すぐ喉乾くぞ。
These guys... get thirsty really quickly.

3463
02:38:36,101 --> 02:38:39,601
ね。さっき飲んで、もう駄目なのかお前。
Right. You just drank, and you're empty already?

3464
02:38:40,601 --> 02:38:43,601
飲み過ぎだろ。飲み過ぎだー。
Drank way too much. / Drank too much~

3465
02:38:43,601 --> 02:38:45,601
こっちだよー。
Over here~

3466
02:38:45,601 --> 02:38:47,101
えーっと...
Uuum...

3467
02:38:47,101 --> 02:38:50,101
なんかナメクジみたいな角生えてる恐竜ですか？
Is it the dino with slug-like horns?

3468
02:38:50,101 --> 02:38:51,601
あ、そうそうそう！
Ah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

3469
02:38:51,601 --> 02:38:53,601
こっちだよー。
Over here~

3470
02:38:53,601 --> 02:38:56,101
あ、ここもユウティか。
Ah, this is a Yuty too.

3471
02:38:57,101 --> 02:38:59,401
ユウティいっぱいですね。
So many Yutys.

3472
02:38:59,401 --> 02:39:01,101
ユウティいっぱいですねー。
There sure are a lot of Yutys~

3473
02:39:01,101 --> 02:39:03,601
これフラフラしてたら落ちるんだよな。
If you wobble around here, you'll fall off.

3474
02:39:03,601 --> 02:39:05,601
えーっと...
Uuum...

3475
02:39:08,601 --> 02:39:10,601
いた！
Found it!

3476
02:39:10,601 --> 02:39:12,101
いたー！
There it is!

3477
02:39:12,101 --> 02:39:13,601
あっ、死ぬかも！
Ah, I might die!

3478
02:39:13,601 --> 02:39:15,101
え？なんでこいつ？
Eh? Why this guy?

3479
02:39:15,101 --> 02:39:18,601
23匹狩るか... めっちゃ血出ている。なんで？
Hunting 23 creatures... It's bleeding so much. Why?

3480
02:39:21,101 --> 02:39:23,101
えーっと... 飛べなくなってる！
Uuum... It can't fly!

3481
02:39:23,101 --> 02:39:24,601
大丈夫か？
Are you okay?

3482
02:39:24,601 --> 02:39:28,101
グリフィン... 飛べない... カバーしてあげる、カバー。
Griffin... can't fly... I'll cover you, cover.

3483
02:39:29,601 --> 02:39:31,101
えーっと...
Uuum...

3484
02:39:31,101 --> 02:39:33,601
いいよ、ビビ逃げていいよ。
It's okay, Vivi, go ahead and run.

3485
02:39:33,601 --> 02:39:35,601
はい、逃げますー。F方向、F方向。
Yes, running away~ / Towards F, towards F.

3486
02:39:35,601 --> 02:39:38,101
火薬、火薬... 空の旅。
Gunpowder, gunpowder... sky journey.

3487
02:39:39,601 --> 02:39:41,601
火薬火薬火薬火薬...
Gunpowder gunpowder gunpowder gunpowder...

3488
02:39:41,601 --> 02:39:43,601
空の旅ー。
Sky journey~

3489
02:39:43,601 --> 02:39:45,101
火薬ー。
Gunpowdeeeer~

3490
02:39:45,101 --> 02:39:48,101
いや良かった、ツェッペリン役に立った。
Man, good thing the Zeppelin came in handy.

3491
02:39:48,101 --> 02:39:49,601
いや良かったツェッペリン本当に。
Seriously, so glad we had the Zeppelin.

3492
02:39:49,601 --> 02:39:51,601
良かったー！
So glad~!

3493
02:39:51,601 --> 02:39:53,601
本当に神！
Seriously a godsend!

3494
02:39:53,601 --> 02:39:56,101
何これ！？
What is this?!

3495
02:39:56,101 --> 02:39:59,101
アスレチックってさ、何ポイントだっけ？
How many points was the obstacle course again?

3496
02:39:59,101 --> 02:40:01,601
10ポイントだった気がする。10か。10か。
I think it was 10 points. / 10, huh. 10...

3497
02:40:02,601 --> 02:40:04,601
え、なんかさ、これ何？手前、これ何？
Eh, what is this? Right in front, what is this?

3498
02:40:04,622 --> 02:40:05,922
ティラノ
Tyranno.

3499
02:40:07,122 --> 02:40:09,622
えっと連れてたの、アクロなんとかみたいなやつじゃなかったっけ？かな？
Wait, wasn't the one we brought something like Acro-whatever?

3500
02:40:09,622 --> 02:40:10,622
バイソン？
Bison?

3501
02:40:10,622 --> 02:40:11,422
ああ
Ah.

3502
02:40:11,622 --> 02:40:15,422
あの、ビビこが死んだってことは、やっぱあのアルゲン罠にいるぞ、奴が。
Since Bibiko died, that means that guy is definitely in that Argentavis trap.

3503
02:40:15,622 --> 02:40:18,822
え？え？ビビこ？ビビこも？え、ビビそこ今何いました？
Eh? Bibi-ko? Bibi-ko too? What was over there just now, Bibi?

3504
02:40:18,822 --> 02:40:21,422
ここは、あのバイソンがいます
There is a Bison here.

3505
02:40:22,122 --> 02:40:25,122
あれ？バイソンもテイムできるかな？じゃあ。
Huh? Can we tame the Bison too then?

3506
02:40:26,422 --> 02:40:29,122
できるん…あ、こっちじゃない、こっち、逆だ
Can we... Ah, not this way, this way, the opposite.

3507
02:40:29,422 --> 02:40:32,122
なんとまだドードーに出会えていません。
Believe it or not, I still haven't met a Dodo.

3508
02:40:33,422 --> 02:40:34,622
ていうかドードー…
I mean, Dodos...

3509
02:40:39,122 --> 02:40:41,122
と、あ、飛べない、何？
And, ah, can't fly, what?

3510
02:40:41,422 --> 02:40:43,422
フック、フック
Hook, hook.

3511
02:40:43,622 --> 02:40:45,122
グリフォン…
Griffin...

3512
02:40:46,122 --> 02:40:50,622
まだドードーに出会えていない、この世界で一番最初に出会うべき、
I still haven't met a Dodo. It's supposed to be the very first tameable creature...

3513
02:40:50,622 --> 02:40:54,622
テイムできる生物のはずなのに、なぜか出会えていない！
you meet in this world, but for some reason I haven't met one!

3514
02:40:54,622 --> 02:40:57,622
な、なぜ…お前どこに、ああ、膝が…
W-Why... Where are you, ah, my knees...

3515
02:40:58,122 --> 02:40:59,822
もういなかったのか
Was it already gone?

3516
02:41:00,122 --> 02:41:02,622
バイソンもテイムできますか？
Can we tame the Bison too?

3517
02:41:03,122 --> 02:41:05,622
やった！バイソンいけるはず！
Yay! Bison should work!

3518
02:41:05,622 --> 02:41:08,122
じゃあ、パイソン…ビビ、ここ！
Then, Bison... Bibi, here!

3519
02:41:08,622 --> 02:41:10,122
いた
Found it.

3520
02:41:11,622 --> 02:41:14,122
パイソンまた麻酔矢とかかな？
Does Bison use tranq arrows again?

3521
02:41:14,622 --> 02:41:17,122
パイソンここ入ってくれない。
The Bison won't go in here.

3522
02:41:17,622 --> 02:41:21,622
えっ…あ、待って待って、ビビこれでもここ入っちゃったらビビが抜けれないから
Wait, wait, if Bibi goes in here, Bibi won't be able to get out.

3523
02:41:22,422 --> 02:41:25,622
いな先輩、あ、ビビじゃあそれを…押す
Ina-senpai, ah, Bibi, then that... push.

3524
02:41:25,622 --> 02:41:27,122
閉じる
Close.

3525
02:41:28,622 --> 02:41:31,122
できたー！おお、できた！
I did it! Oh, we did it!

3526
02:41:31,122 --> 02:41:32,622
なーいす
Nice.

3527
02:41:32,622 --> 02:41:34,622
これで麻酔矢撃てばいい？
Should I shoot tranq arrows now?

3528
02:41:35,122 --> 02:41:38,622
設計図ってどうしたらいいんだ、これ？なんかも分かんないから預けてる。
What do I do with blueprints? I don't understand, so I'm storing them.

3529
02:41:38,622 --> 02:41:41,122
なんか、作業台か何かに入れてませんでしたっけ？
Didn't we put them in a workbench or something?

3530
02:41:41,422 --> 02:41:44,122
そうだね、作業台に入れて使うやつだね。
Yeah, it's the kind you put in the workbench to use.

3531
02:41:44,622 --> 02:41:46,122
よいしょ
Heave-ho.

3532
02:41:47,622 --> 02:41:51,622
バイソンは何食べるんですかね？ベリー？
What does the Bison eat? Berries?

3533
02:41:51,622 --> 02:41:56,122
ベリーかな？ベリーとお肉一緒に入れといたら安全かも？
Berries, maybe? Might be safer to put both berries and meat in?

3534
02:41:56,122 --> 02:41:57,122
あ、そうですね。
Ah, that's right.

3535
02:41:57,622 --> 02:42:00,122
顔可愛い、パイソン。
Its face is cute, the Bison.

3536
02:42:00,622 --> 02:42:01,622
えーっと
Umm...

3537
02:42:03,122 --> 02:42:04,622
つぶらな瞳。
Beady eyes.

3538
02:42:05,622 --> 02:42:07,622
こっちだよ。あれ？
Over here. Huh?

3539
02:42:08,122 --> 02:42:09,122
セメント
Cement.

3540
02:42:10,622 --> 02:42:13,622
置いてきたティラノってずっとあの場にいるのかな？
Is the Tyranno we left behind staying there forever?

3541
02:42:13,622 --> 02:42:15,622
あ、ティラノはね、回収した。
Ah, the Tyranno, I retrieved it.

3542
02:42:15,622 --> 02:42:17,122
あ、ありがとう。
Ah, thank you.

3543
02:42:18,422 --> 02:42:21,422
逝ったー！おー、近づいて溜めよう。
It went down! Oh, let's get closer.

3544
02:42:21,622 --> 02:42:25,122
じゃあそのティラノとかを使ってティラノを討伐しに行こうかな。
Then maybe I'll use that Tyranno or something to go hunt the Tyranno.

3545
02:42:25,122 --> 02:42:29,622
ビビとトワがね、あれ？色違いとビビもさ、ボスみたいなやつやってきたら？
Bibi and Towa... Huh? A shiny, and Bibi, what if you do something like a boss?

3546
02:42:30,122 --> 02:42:32,122
ちょっとグリフィーン
Wait, Griffin!

3547
02:42:32,622 --> 02:42:34,622
そうですね。
That's true.

3548
02:42:35,122 --> 02:42:38,622
ド迫力狩りしてくるからさ、あの、大きいの行ってみよう。
I'll go do some epic hunting, so let's go for a big one.

3549
02:42:39,122 --> 02:42:42,122
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

3550
02:42:43,122 --> 02:42:44,622
お互い感謝。
Mutual gratitude.

3551
02:42:44,622 --> 02:42:47,622
待って、グリフィン、グリフィンちょっと呼んでほしい、ああ
Wait, Griffin, Griffin, please call it a bit, ahh.

3552
02:42:47,622 --> 02:42:49,622
グリフィン、ちょっとこっち来てー
Griffin, come over here a bit~

3553
02:42:50,622 --> 02:42:52,122
セメント
Cement.

3554
02:42:52,622 --> 02:42:54,622
ティラノのサドルいるよね、じゃあ。
Then we need a Tyranno saddle, right?

3555
02:42:55,122 --> 02:43:00,122
そうですね、ティラノのサドルがいる。ティラノのサドル…
That's right, need a Tyranno saddle. Tyranno saddle...

3556
02:43:00,622 --> 02:43:03,122
あ、大きい奴何？
Ah, what's the big one?

3557
02:43:03,122 --> 02:43:04,622
ラヴァエレメンタルですかね？
Is it Lava Elemental?

3558
02:43:05,122 --> 02:43:10,122
ラヴァエレメンタルだとめちゃめちゃフィールドが狭くて恐竜がなかなか立てないのね。
With Lava Elemental, the field is super narrow and dinos can barely stand.

3559
02:43:10,622 --> 02:43:17,122
ティラノがでかい奴だとちょっと厳しいか、いや、まあ行くだけ行っても囮になってもらう感覚でいい感じかな？
If it's a huge Tyranno it might be tough, or maybe just go and use it as a decoy?

3560
02:43:17,622 --> 02:43:21,622
ほうほうほう、何が出せたら一番いいんだろう？ちょっと待ってね。
Ho ho ho, what would be best to bring out? Wait a sec.

3561
02:43:21,622 --> 02:43:24,622
小っちゃいやつが、基本はロケランぶっぱなんだよね。
For small ones, basically it's just spamming rocket launchers.

3562
02:43:24,622 --> 02:43:25,622
はい、はい、はい。
Yes, yes, yes.

3563
02:43:25,622 --> 02:43:29,122
そうそうそう。で、ロケランの弾が全然ちょっと足りなくて、今。
Right, right. And rocket launcher ammo is totally lacking right now.

3564
02:43:29,622 --> 02:43:32,122
え、ビビなんか生肉持ってる？
Eh, Bibi, are you holding raw meat?

3565
02:43:32,622 --> 02:43:38,622
じゃあ、えっとロケランの弾を生成してもらうのは、ちょっとフブキ先輩にお願いして大丈夫ですか？
Then, can we ask Fubuki-senpai to craft the rocket launcher ammo?

3566
02:43:39,122 --> 02:43:41,622
オッケー、オッケー。
Okay, okay.

3567
02:43:39,622 --> 02:43:43,622
手伝ってってなったら、えっと自分のこのパイいるかな？
If you need help, would my Pyro be needed?

3568
02:43:43,622 --> 02:43:45,622
こっち？メジョベリー
This? Mejoberry.

3569
02:43:46,122 --> 02:43:51,622
だったりとか、頭一応パイロ、多分パイロがいれば大丈夫な気がする。
or maybe, one Pyro, I feel like if we have Pyro we'll be fine.

3570
02:43:51,622 --> 02:43:52,622
了解です。
Understood.

3571
02:43:52,622 --> 02:43:59,622
で、プラス、えっと他の人で、えっとティラノの討伐をまず最優先でチームミッションクリアしたくて、
And plus, the other people, I want to clear the team mission with Tyranno hunting as top priority first,

3572
02:44:00,622 --> 02:44:05,622
それをちょっと強い恐竜に乗ってできればやってほしいのと、
and I want them to ride strong dinosaurs to do that if possible,

3573
02:44:05,622 --> 02:44:13,122
トワ先輩が、あのシートに貼ってくれたやつ今チャットに貼ったんですけど、テイム簡単な生き物っていうのを載っけたんで、
and Towa-senpai posted in chat what was in the sheet, listing creatures that are easy to tame,

3574
02:44:13,122 --> 02:44:21,122
それをちょっとテイムしてもらいつつ数を稼ごうかなという作戦で、いかがでしょうか？
so while having people tame those to build up the numbers, how does that plan sound?

3575
02:44:21,622 --> 02:44:22,622
オッケー。
Okay.

3576
02:44:22,622 --> 02:44:23,622
オッケー。
Okay.

3577
02:44:24,122 --> 02:44:26,122
トワ、1回ティラノ行ってきたちゃうね。
Towa, I'll go check out the Tyranno once.

3578
02:44:26,122 --> 02:44:28,122
お願い、ありがとう。
Please do, thank you.

3579
02:44:28,622 --> 02:44:33,122
じゃ、ティラノのサドルを作ってこっちも何人か行きたい気持ち。
Then let's craft Tyranno saddles, a few of us here want to go too.

3580
02:44:33,622 --> 02:44:36,622
1回アスレチック見てきたいかも。
I might want to check out the obstacle course once.

3581
02:44:36,622 --> 02:44:40,622
いいね、じゃあそっちのアスレチックで、じゃあえっとラヴァ行く人？
Nice, then obstacle course over there, and who's going to Lava?

3582
02:44:40,622 --> 02:44:42,122
ラヴァ行く人行きます。
Those going to Lava will go.

3583
02:44:42,122 --> 02:44:43,122
行きます。
I'll go.

3584
02:44:43,122 --> 02:44:44,622
ミーシャにも来てもらおうかな。
I think I'll have Misha come too.

3585
02:44:44,622 --> 02:44:48,122
あ、でもラヴァ行きたい、ラヴァ、ラヴァも行きたい。ラヴァ行こうかな。
Ah, but I want to go to Lava, Lava, I want to go to Lava too. Maybe I'll go to Lava.

3586
02:44:48,122 --> 02:44:49,622
じゃ、ラヴァも行きましょう。
Then let's go to Lava too.

3587
02:44:49,622 --> 02:44:56,122
だったらえっとね、皆各自、えっとグラップリングフックっていうのを作ってほしいのね。
In that case, everyone, I want each person to make something called a Grappling Hook.

3588
02:44:56,122 --> 02:44:57,622
グラップリングフック。
Grappling Hook.

3589
02:44:57,622 --> 02:44:58,622
そう。
Yeah.

3590
02:45:00,122 --> 02:45:01,622
うわ、でも防虫剤とかいるかな？道中…
Whoa, but do we need bug repellent? On the way...

3591
02:45:02,403 --> 02:45:06,503
蜘蛛とかムカデとかがめちゃめちゃいて毒になったりとかするのよね
There are tons of spiders and centipedes that poison you and stuff, right?

3592
02:45:06,503 --> 02:45:07,803
へぇー
I see.

3593
02:45:07,803 --> 02:45:08,703
うん
Yeah.

3594
02:45:08,703 --> 02:45:12,403
まぁでもパイロいたら大丈夫かな 攻撃したら
Well, but if we have Pyromanes, we should be fine if we attack.

3595
02:45:12,903 --> 02:45:16,003
グラップリングフック、セメント...
Grappling hook, cementing paste...

3596
02:45:16,003 --> 02:45:19,603
行く人は各自グラップリングフックを作ってほしい
I'd like everyone who's going to craft their own grappling hook.

3597
02:45:19,603 --> 02:45:22,203
グラップリングフック... 了解でーす
Grappling hook... Roger that.

3598
02:45:22,903 --> 02:45:28,903
よいしょ で、多分石がすごい今足りなくて、セメントとかも作れないから、ちょっと石とかも必要かも
Alright. And we're probably really low on stone right now, so we can't make cementing paste either, so we might need stone too.

3599
02:45:28,903 --> 02:45:34,803
あ、じゃあえっと風真一旦ちょっとアンキロと、もうあれでアルゲンで行ってきます
Ah, then Kazama will head out for a bit with an Ankylo on the Argentavis.

3600
02:45:34,803 --> 02:45:36,203
石集め
To gather stone.

3601
02:45:36,403 --> 02:45:38,903
石が圧倒的に足りないね
We're overwhelmingly short on stone, huh.

3602
02:45:38,903 --> 02:45:41,403
やべ、アルゲンどこだ？ あ、おった
Shoot, where's the Argentavis? Ah, there it is.

3603
02:45:41,403 --> 02:45:44,903
もしもし あ、あった！あった500あった、500あった！
Hello? Ah, we have some! There was 500, there was 500!

3604
02:45:44,903 --> 02:45:47,403
石か、今石取るかじゃあ
Stone, huh. Guess I'll go gather stone now.

3605
02:45:47,403 --> 02:45:48,403
うん
Yeah.

3606
02:45:48,403 --> 02:45:51,203
もしもし、お前はサドルがついていますか？
Hello, do you have a saddle on?

3607
02:45:51,203 --> 02:45:53,403
ええと... ついている、よし
Umm... It's on, alright.

3608
02:45:53,403 --> 02:45:57,003
キチン、キチン、ケラチン...
Chitin, chitin, keratin...

3609
02:45:57,003 --> 02:46:05,403
え、これ、グラップリングフック、なんか武器とか他に作っといた方がいいヤツみたいなもんある？
Hey, are there any other weapons or things we should craft besides the grappling hook?

3610
02:46:05,403 --> 02:46:11,903
あとはギリースーツさえ持っていれば大丈夫かな 道中はパイロでやりつつ、ボス戦もパイロで行きつつ...
Other than that, as long as you have a Ghillie Suit, we should be fine. We'll fight our way through with Pyromanes, and do the boss battle with Pyromanes too...

3611
02:46:11,903 --> 02:46:15,603
で、えっとアスレチックみたいなとこがあるのよね、ちょっと
And, um, there's kind of like an obstacle course section.

3612
02:46:15,603 --> 02:46:17,903
道中穴が開いてたりとか...
Pits along the way and stuff...

3613
02:46:17,903 --> 02:46:24,903
そういうとこがあるから、そこはグラップリングフックっていうフックショットで使っ、伝っていくから、そこでワンチャン事故って死ぬ可能性もある
There are places like that, so we use grappling hooks like hookshots to make our way across, so there's a chance of accidentally dying there.

3614
02:46:24,903 --> 02:46:26,403
了解です
Understood.

3615
02:46:26,403 --> 02:46:27,403
うん
Yeah.

3616
02:46:27,403 --> 02:46:28,903
あー！バイソン！
Ah! Bison!

3617
02:46:28,903 --> 02:46:35,403
他にやることない人、今やることなくて困ったような人がいたら、あの焼き肉を大量に持っ、作って行ってもらいたいかな
If anyone has nothing else to do and is at a loss, I'd like them to cook and bring a large batch of cooked meat.

3618
02:46:35,403 --> 02:46:38,903
右の作業台からグラップフック...
Grappling hook from the right smithy...

3619
02:46:38,903 --> 02:46:42,903
あ、そう、この作業台 肉、500個くらいあの冷蔵庫に入れてるよ
Ah, yeah, this smithy. There's about 500 cooked meats in that fridge.

3620
02:46:42,903 --> 02:46:44,903
おー、ありがたやー！
Ohh, that's awesome!

3621
02:46:44,903 --> 02:46:47,403
バイソンテイムできましたー！
Bison tamed!

3622
02:46:47,403 --> 02:46:50,903
ナイスー！ ナイス！ ナイスー！
Nice! Nice! Nice!

3623
02:46:50,903 --> 02:46:52,903
助かりすぎる
That helps so much.

3624
02:46:52,903 --> 02:46:56,403
ええと... ば、バーンさんが... バーンさん乗っちゃった
Umm... Ba- Barn-san is... I accidentally rode Barn-san.

3625
02:46:56,403 --> 02:46:58,403
近接？ 降りたい...
Melee? I want to get off...

3626
02:46:58,403 --> 02:47:00,903
ちょっとバーンさん避けますね、トワ様一旦
Let me move Barn-san out of the way, Towa-sama, hold on.

3627
02:47:00,903 --> 02:47:02,903
あ、ごめんごめんごめん
Ah, sorry, sorry, sorry.

3628
02:47:02,903 --> 02:47:05,903
あ、これ攻撃しないでね、今捕まえようとしてる
Ah, don't attack this one, I'm trying to catch it right now.

3629
02:47:05,903 --> 02:47:07,403
あーい
Okaay.

3630
02:47:07,403 --> 02:47:10,903
オッケー、終わった これ終わったでしょ
Okay, finished. This should be done.

3631
02:47:10,903 --> 02:47:12,903
修理できない？
Can't repair?

3632
02:47:12,903 --> 02:47:16,203
風真ちょっと石取り行ってきます
Kazama is heading out to gather some stone.

3633
02:47:16,203 --> 02:47:17,903
はーい おーい
Okay! Alright!

3634
02:47:17,903 --> 02:47:19,903
で、焼き肉も大丈夫だ
And the cooked meat is all set too.

3635
02:47:19,903 --> 02:47:22,403
10時には出発したいかな
I'd like to depart at 10 o'clock.

3636
02:47:22,403 --> 02:47:25,403
セメン、セメントとインゴットがない セメントどれ？
Cemen- There's no cementing paste or ingots. Where's the cementing paste?

3637
02:47:25,403 --> 02:47:27,403
あ、待って、セメント入れる
Ah, wait, I'll put cementing paste in.

3638
02:47:27,403 --> 02:47:30,903
インゴットは燃やしているはずですね えっと...
The ingots should be smelting right now. Umm...

3639
02:47:30,903 --> 02:47:33,903
炉の中にあった セメント作業台に入れた
Found some in the forge. / I put cementing paste into the smithy.

3640
02:47:33,903 --> 02:47:35,403
ありがとー
Thank you.

3641
02:47:35,403 --> 02:47:36,903
足りなかったらちょっと待ってね
If it's not enough, hold on a moment.

3642
02:47:36,903 --> 02:47:38,403
あと金属だな
Next is metal.

3643
02:47:38,403 --> 02:47:41,903
金属は、えっと旋盤の中にあるか... ちょっと待ってよ
Metal is... um, is it in the fabricator... wait a sec.

3644
02:47:41,903 --> 02:47:44,403
いや、炉の中に入ってると思います
No, I think it's in the refining forge.

3645
02:47:44,403 --> 02:47:46,403
あ、さっき取っちゃったんだよね
Ah, I took it earlier though.

3646
02:47:46,403 --> 02:47:48,903
あ、じゃ燃やしてもらう感じか
Ah, so we just need to smelt more.

3647
02:47:48,903 --> 02:47:50,403
あと1個あればいいのに...
I just need one more...

3648
02:47:50,403 --> 02:47:53,403
はい、入れた 作れるはず
Okay, put it in. You should be able to craft it.

3649
02:47:53,403 --> 02:47:57,903
グラップ1個でいいの？ グラップ、予備で2個かな 2個作っといてもらえたら
Is one grapple enough? Grapple... maybe 2 as spares. If you could make 2.

3650
02:47:57,903 --> 02:48:01,903
はい、自分の分も作んなきゃいけないかな えっと、炉が足りるかな
Yes. Guess I should make mine too. Umm, is there enough in the forge?

3651
02:48:01,903 --> 02:48:07,903
あ、もしそのまま作れるんだったら、ござるのも作ってあげてほしいかも
Ah, if you can craft it right away, maybe make one for Gozaru too.

3652
02:48:07,903 --> 02:48:09,903
そうですね、助かります！
Yes please, that would help!

3653
02:48:09,903 --> 02:48:12,403
じゃあ... ビビのもいいですか？
Then... Can you make one for Bibi too?

3654
02:48:12,403 --> 02:48:15,903
あ、じゃあビビのも作ってあげてくれ 1人2個ずつくらいかな一応
Ah, then please make one for Bibi too. About two per person just in case.

3655
02:48:16,403 --> 02:48:21,903
植えようかな そうしたら... よいしょ こうして...
Should I plant them? If I do that... Hup. Like this...

3656
02:48:21,903 --> 02:48:23,403
あ、でセメントがないんだよね
Ah, and there's no cementing paste.

3657
02:48:23,403 --> 02:48:27,903
あの作業台の中に入ってるから、い、取ってください
There's some inside that smithy, so, take it please.

3658
02:48:27,903 --> 02:48:30,403
ありがてぇ ありがとうございます
Thank you. / Thank you very much.

3659
02:48:30,403 --> 02:48:31,903
ゲットしたー
Got it.

3660
02:48:31,903 --> 02:48:36,403
掴んでから... えーっと... 掴め、掴... つかめないだと、お前！
Grab it and then... umm... Grab it, gra... You can't grab it, you?!

3661
02:48:36,403 --> 02:48:39,403
こ、こうすぎなくなってね
D- Don't go too far.

3662
02:48:39,403 --> 02:48:43,903
ええと... ちょっと待ってね 順番にやってるから...
Umm... Hold on a second. I'm doing them in order, so...

3663
02:48:43,903 --> 02:48:46,903
引っかかった... どこ行った？
Got stuck... Where did it go?

3664
02:48:46,903 --> 02:48:49,403
くそ、気絶中
Shoot, it's knocked out.

3665
02:48:50,403 --> 02:48:54,903
ひっか、引っかかったのか、これは、もしや
Did it get... get stuck, by any chance?

3666
02:48:54,903 --> 02:48:59,403
発砲がない...
There's no firing...

3667
02:48:59,403 --> 02:49:02,403
おい、あろ、追試...
Hey, alo... follow-up test...

3668
02:49:02,403 --> 02:49:05,903
引っ越...
Moving...

3669
02:49:06,403 --> 02:49:11,403
やべー、掴めねぇ なんでこいつ掴めねぇんだ？ 行けるか
Crap, can't grab it. Why can't I grab this guy? Can I do it?

3670
02:49:11,403 --> 02:49:14,903
えーっと... 掴め... 来た！
Umm... Grab it... There we go!

3671
02:49:14,903 --> 02:49:17,403
いらないのちょっともう預けといていいか
Can I go ahead and deposit the stuff I don't need?

3672
02:49:17,403 --> 02:49:20,403
これ2個でいいのかな？ 2個でいいですか？
Are two of these okay? Are two enough?

3673
02:49:20,403 --> 02:49:22,403
はーい
Yes.

3674
02:49:22,903 --> 02:49:27,403
え、石じゃない これは石じゃないのか アンキロにとっての石とは...
Eh, not stone. Is this not stone? What even is "stone" to an Ankylo...

3675
02:49:27,403 --> 02:49:29,903
哲学始まった
Philosophy has begun.

3676
02:49:29,903 --> 02:49:33,403
お前にとっての石はどれだ？ 石とは一体...
Which one is stone to you? / What on earth is stone...

3677
02:49:33,903 --> 02:49:38,403
クラフト... 崖をよじ登ることができる
Craft... Allows you to scale cliffs.

3678
02:49:38,403 --> 02:49:40,903
お前にとっての石を俺に教えてくれ
Tell me what stone is to you.

3679
02:49:40,903 --> 02:49:43,903
待って、1回撃つと1個消費だっけ、フックって？
Wait, does the hook consume one per shot?

3680
02:49:43,903 --> 02:49:46,903
なんか費用... 1回ごとに1個... あれ？
Like a cost... One per use... Huh?

3681
02:49:46,903 --> 02:49:50,903
もしかしてよ、グラップリングフックめちゃめちゃいる？
Could it be that we need a ton of grappling hooks?

3682
02:49:50,903 --> 02:49:52,403
マジ？
Seriously?

3683
02:49:52,403 --> 02:49:57,903
そしたら割と少数精鋭の方が消費が少なくて済む説あります？ もしや あるかもね
Then wouldn't fewer elite members mean less consumption theory be true? / Perhaps. / That might be true.

3684
02:49:58,403 --> 02:50:02,903
ちなみに、なんかアルゲンに「至高のライフル」入ってるらしいよ
By the way, apparently there's an "Ascendant Rifle" inside the Argentavis.

3685
02:50:02,903 --> 02:50:03,803
え？
Eh?

3686
02:50:04,657 --> 02:50:06,757
ライフルの弾がないんだよね
There's no rifle ammo, right...

3687
02:50:08,057 --> 02:50:09,557
弾結構いるよね
We need quite a lot of ammo, huh?

3688
02:50:09,757 --> 02:50:13,757
そうだね、で火薬がいるんだけど、その火薬を作るのに結構時間がかかっちゃって
Yeah, and we need gunpowder, but crafting that gunpowder takes quite a bit of time...

3689
02:50:13,957 --> 02:50:15,157
はい、はい、はい
Right, right, right.

3690
02:50:15,657 --> 02:50:17,357
クロスボウ...
Crossbow...

3691
02:50:20,457 --> 02:50:21,657
なるほど
I see.

3692
02:50:23,457 --> 02:50:25,657
待って、あたし水ないわ。1回ちょっとお水...
Wait, I don't have any water. Let me grab some water...

3693
02:50:26,657 --> 02:50:29,357
グラップリングフックいっぱい作るか、じゃあ
Shall we craft a bunch of grappling hooks then?

3694
02:50:30,657 --> 02:50:34,457
少数精鋭のほうがいいんだよな。あ、ござる置いていってくれて大丈夫ですよ
Elite few is better... Ah, Gozaru, you can leave me behind and go ahead!

3695
02:50:34,857 --> 02:50:37,857
むむ。とりあえず作れるだけ作ってみるか
Mmm. For now, let's try making as many as we can.

3696
02:50:38,357 --> 02:50:41,657
あ、クロスボウ... あれ？
Ah, crossbow... Huh?

3697
02:50:44,657 --> 02:50:47,157
あ、でも30... 30いけそうなら
Ah, but 30... If we can do 30...

3698
02:50:48,657 --> 02:50:51,657
えーっと... / こ、消費式なんだ
Let's see... / Oh, it's consumable?

3699
02:50:54,657 --> 02:50:57,057
あー、そして石が消えた、ついに
Ah, and stone is gone, finally.

3700
02:50:57,157 --> 02:51:02,457
石... あ、でも待って、これ水筒めっちゃ持っていったほうがいい説
Stone... Wait, there's a theory that we should bring a ton of waterskins.

3701
02:51:03,157 --> 02:51:05,957
え、ねえ、拠点の近くて石湧いてますか？
Um, hey, is stone respawning near the base?

3702
02:51:06,457 --> 02:51:09,357
どうだろう、湧いてるかな？
I wonder, is it respawning?

3703
02:51:10,457 --> 02:51:13,157
石何で取ったらいいんやったっけ？恐竜ありましたよね、何か
What was good for gathering stone again? There was a dinosaur, right?

3704
02:51:13,257 --> 02:51:15,557
あ、恐竜はね、こっちでやってて、今
Ah, dinosaurs, we're working on that over here right now.

3705
02:51:18,057 --> 02:51:19,957
じゃあ、大丈夫ですか、石？
Then is stone okay?

3706
02:51:20,157 --> 02:51:24,157
やってるんだけど、手掘りでも必要かも
We're working on it, but we might need hand-mining too.

3707
02:51:26,457 --> 02:51:27,657
手掘り了解
Hand-mining, roger.

3708
02:51:27,657 --> 02:51:29,657
スープのせいかわからんな
I don't know if it's because of the soup.

3709
02:51:30,657 --> 02:51:34,157
手掘りやるんだったら、ござる行ったほうがいいんじゃないのか？
If it's hand-mining, wouldn't it be better if Gozaru went?

3710
02:51:34,657 --> 02:51:41,157
いや、せっかくならね、使う機会も... 1人20本あれば
Well, if anything, this opportunity... if each person has 20,

3711
02:51:41,157 --> 02:51:42,657
いけるかな...
we might make it...

3712
02:51:43,657 --> 02:51:47,957
ま、あのパイルでも正直、ぴょんぴょんっていけば、行けないことはないんだけど
Well, honestly, with that pile, if we just hop and jump, it's not impossible, but...

3713
02:51:48,857 --> 02:51:52,157
全然やって待ってていいっすよ。そしたらござるアスレチックに行ってきます(笑)
You can totally craft while waiting! In that case, Gozaru will go do the parkour!

3714
02:51:52,357 --> 02:51:53,657
あ、なるほど
Ah, I see.

3715
02:51:53,957 --> 02:51:56,657
うん。そしたら俺はアスレチックに行く
Yeah. Then I'll go do the parkour.

3716
02:51:56,657 --> 02:51:57,657
いいね
Sounds good.

3717
02:51:58,157 --> 02:52:00,157
アスレチックも助かる
Parkour helps a lot too.

3718
02:52:00,657 --> 02:52:03,957
じゃ、これ今、あたし何すればいい？石集めればいいか？
So right now, what should I do? Should I gather stone?

3719
02:52:04,657 --> 02:52:09,157
グラップリングフックを作れるだけ今この作業台で作れたら嬉しいけど...
If we could craft as many grappling hooks as possible at this smithy, that'd be great, but...

3720
02:52:09,957 --> 02:52:12,157
何が足りない？何足りない？
What's missing? What is missing?

3721
02:52:12,657 --> 02:52:14,657
今セメントか？
Is it cement right now?

3722
02:52:17,457 --> 02:52:21,057
えーっとね、今のとこ石がめちゃめちゃ足りなくて
Umm, right now we're super short on stone...

3723
02:52:21,057 --> 02:52:23,157
鉄は燃やせばある感じですか？
Do we have metal if we smelt it?

3724
02:52:23,657 --> 02:52:25,157
鉄はね、全然ある。いっぱいある
Metal, we totally have. We have plenty.

3725
02:52:25,257 --> 02:52:26,657
オッケー。じゃあ落としちゃおう
Okay. Then I'll drop it.

3726
02:52:26,657 --> 02:52:28,657
石が圧倒的に足りないかも
Stone is overwhelmingly lacking maybe.

3727
02:52:28,857 --> 02:52:32,157
えー、石って自分でカンカンしないと駄目？
Eh, for stone, do we have to mine it ourselves?

3728
02:52:32,457 --> 02:52:34,457
いや、今アンキロで集めては...
No, collecting with Ankylo now...

3729
02:52:37,057 --> 02:52:39,657
あーん、ちょっと掴めないのやめてー
Aah, stop being unable to grab it~

3730
02:52:40,157 --> 02:52:42,857
やめてー。熱い、ここ
Stop it~ It's hot here.

3731
02:52:43,657 --> 02:52:47,157
ってかアンキロって1人1体だから、実はいるんだよね
Wait, Ankylo is one per person, so there actually is one, right?

3732
02:52:47,157 --> 02:52:48,857
そうだ。押収取りに行けば
Right. If you go get the impounded one.

3733
02:52:51,157 --> 02:52:53,657
あ、チーム1体じゃなかったんだ。勘違い
Ah, it wasn't one per team? Misunderstanding...

3734
02:52:53,657 --> 02:52:55,657
じゃなかったかな、多分。あ、でもどうだっけ？
Probably not. Ah, but how was it again?

3735
02:52:55,957 --> 02:52:58,457
あ、押収のドエディがいい、ドエディ、ドエディ
Ah, the impounded Doedi is better! Doedi, Doedi!

3736
02:52:59,157 --> 02:53:01,857
ドエディクスもいたよね、確か。ドエディクス
Doedicurus was there too, I think. Doedicurus.

3737
02:53:02,457 --> 02:53:03,657
冷蔵庫の中に
Inside the cryofridge.

3738
02:53:03,957 --> 02:53:05,657
いたはず、いたはず
Should be there, should be there.

3739
02:53:05,857 --> 02:53:07,857
ドエディのほうが石がいっぱい取れる
Doedi gathers way more stone.

3740
02:53:08,057 --> 02:53:09,657
何ー！？
Whaaat?!

3741
02:53:10,657 --> 02:53:12,157
じゃ、変えよう
Let's switch then.

3742
02:53:15,157 --> 02:53:17,357
めっちゃ... やばい、なんかずっと熱くて...
Super... Oh no, it's constantly hot...

3743
02:53:17,657 --> 02:53:20,157
今セメント入れたけど、これで作れるかな？あ、ごめんね、石...
I just put cement in, can we craft it now? Ah, sorry, stone...

3744
02:53:20,457 --> 02:53:22,657
またいると思ったら...
If I thought we needed more again...

3745
02:53:24,657 --> 02:53:26,157
39

3746
02:53:26,657 --> 02:53:28,157
え、どこだ？
Eh, where is it?

3747
02:53:30,157 --> 02:53:32,657
イナが今めっちゃテイムしてくれてんのかな？
Ina is taming a ton right now maybe?

3748
02:53:33,457 --> 02:53:34,857
こいつで石って削れんのか？
Can this guy mine stone?

3749
02:53:35,157 --> 02:53:37,057
こいつは石は削れないのか
This guy can't mine stone, huh.

3750
02:53:38,657 --> 02:53:41,657
別の物もテイムしますか？なんか...
Should I tame other things too? Like...

3751
02:53:42,157 --> 02:53:44,657
うん、やってみます
Yeah, I'll give it a try.

3752
02:53:45,157 --> 02:53:47,157
近くに何かあったら
If there's anything nearby.

3753
02:53:47,657 --> 02:53:51,657
こいつ燃えすぎてて、テイムに変えれない
This guy is burning too much, can't change it to tame.

3754
02:53:52,157 --> 02:53:53,457
焼き鳥なんだ...
It's grilled chicken...

3755
02:53:53,657 --> 02:53:55,657
テレポーターに変えれない。やばい
Can't change to teleporter. Oh no.

3756
02:53:55,857 --> 02:53:56,857
なるほど
I see.

3757
02:53:58,657 --> 02:54:01,457
視界悪すぎだろ。なんでこんな視界悪い？
Visibility is way too bad. Why is visibility so bad?

3758
02:54:01,657 --> 02:54:03,657
人数分恐竜いるんでしたっけ？
Were there enough dinos for everyone?

3759
02:54:08,157 --> 02:54:10,157
じゃあ恐竜集めたほうがいいんか？
Then is it better to gather dinosaurs?

3760
02:54:11,157 --> 02:54:13,657
やばい、見えなすぎ
Oh no, can't see at all.

3761
02:54:14,157 --> 02:54:15,857
こいつってテイムできんのかな？
Can this one be tamed?

3762
02:54:16,157 --> 02:54:17,357
いやー...
Well...

3763
02:54:17,657 --> 02:54:19,157
なんでこんな熱い？
Why is it so hot?

3764
02:54:20,157 --> 02:54:21,157
アルゲン使われた
The Argentavis got taken.

3765
02:54:21,457 --> 02:54:24,157
やばい、めっちゃやばいところで使われてるアルゲン。やめて
Oh no, the Argentavis is being used in a super dangerous spot. Stop.

3766
02:54:25,657 --> 02:54:27,157
石待ちしてます
Waiting for stone.

3767
02:54:29,157 --> 02:54:30,657
石待ってます
Waiting for stone.

3768
02:54:31,157 --> 02:54:34,157
動けないし、帰れないし、パニック。ちょっと待って
Can't move, can't go back, panicking. Hold on.

3769
02:54:34,457 --> 02:54:36,157
落ち着いてー
Calm down~

3770
02:54:36,157 --> 02:54:37,057
落ち着いて
Calm down.

3771
02:54:37,157 --> 02:54:38,057
脱いで帰る
I'll strip and go back.

3772
02:54:38,157 --> 02:54:39,157
ありがとう
Thank you.

3773
02:54:39,257 --> 02:54:41,657
重すぎ、荷物パンパンすぎ
Way too heavy, inventory way too full.

3774
02:54:41,957 --> 02:54:44,657
なんかすごい、動けない
Like whoa, can't move.

3775
02:54:44,657 --> 02:54:45,657
落ちちゃった
I fell down.

3776
02:54:45,857 --> 02:54:48,657
え？なんで？これ降りもしないし...
Eh? Why? I can't even get down...

3777
02:54:48,657 --> 02:54:49,657
え？なんで？
Eh? Why?

3778
02:54:49,857 --> 02:54:51,457
動けないよー
Can't move~

3779
02:54:53,657 --> 02:54:56,657
え、やばい、ちょちょちょちょ... ござるが落ちてどうすんねん！
Eh, oh no, wait-wait-wait... Gozaru fell, what are you doing?!

3780
02:54:56,657 --> 02:54:59,457
ちょっとござるが落ちてどうすんねん！
Wait, Gozaru fell, what are you doing?!

3781
02:55:01,457 --> 02:55:02,857
え、バイソンのサドル...
Eh, bison saddle...

3782
02:55:02,957 --> 02:55:04,657
なんか着地もできなかったんですが
I couldn't even stick the landing...

3783
02:55:04,878 --> 02:55:06,478
って ドエディ いるんですか？
Wait, do we have a Doedicurus?

3784
02:55:06,478 --> 02:55:07,478
乗れる
You can ride it.

3785
02:55:07,478 --> 02:55:09,178
えっ / 表
Eh? / Outside.

3786
02:55:10,178 --> 02:55:11,678
ちょっと拠点出た
Just outside the base.

3787
02:55:11,678 --> 02:55:14,678
スタミナ切れてるくせに下に降りれなかった
Even though it ran out of stamina, it couldn't land.

3788
02:55:15,178 --> 02:55:18,178
拠点で石取り... 鉄取ってくるわ
Mining stone at the base... I'll go get some metal.

3789
02:55:19,178 --> 02:55:21,678
石でも言うてそんなだな
Even for stone, honestly it's not that much.

3790
02:55:21,678 --> 02:55:24,178
ビビも手で掘ったから
Bibi also mined by hand, so...

3791
02:55:24,478 --> 02:55:25,678
1500ぐらい...
Around 1500...

3792
02:55:25,678 --> 02:55:27,178
あ、落とすよ、ここで
Ah, I'll drop it here.

3793
02:55:27,178 --> 02:55:29,678
あ、このデバフ何だ？何だこのデバフ
Ah, what is this debuff? What's this debuff?

3794
02:55:29,678 --> 02:55:31,678
Blueprint? あー、なるほど
Blueprint? Ah, I see.

3795
02:55:32,178 --> 02:55:34,178
なんでこのデバフで... / いいっしょ
Why with this debuff... / It's fine.

3796
02:55:35,178 --> 02:55:36,678
え、なにこれ？
Eh, what's this?

3797
02:55:36,978 --> 02:55:37,878
オッケー
Okay.

3798
02:55:37,878 --> 02:55:41,678
待ってやばい、視界不良すぎて前にまっすぐ行けない
Wait, this is bad, my vision is so bad I can't walk straight.

3799
02:55:42,178 --> 02:55:44,678
脱水症状とかなってない、それ？
Aren't you suffering from dehydration or something?

3800
02:55:44,678 --> 02:55:47,678
水は満タンなんですけどね。えーっと...
My water is full, though. Um...

3801
02:55:49,478 --> 02:55:52,178
これ、石まだ必要ですか？
Do we still need stone?

3802
02:55:52,478 --> 02:55:54,678
石あると嬉しいかな
Stone would be nice to have, I think.

3803
02:55:54,678 --> 02:55:55,678
はい
Okay.

3804
02:55:55,678 --> 02:55:58,678
あ、でも、いやビビやっぱテイムのほうが嬉しいかも
Ah, but wait, maybe taming would be better, Bibi.

3805
02:55:58,678 --> 02:56:01,678
テイム？はいはい。え、何がいい？ / 一緒に行くんだよな？一緒に行くから...
Taming? Sure, sure. What do you want? / We're going together, right? Since we're going together...

3806
02:56:01,678 --> 02:56:03,678
オヴィラプトル？
Oviraptor?

3807
02:56:03,678 --> 02:56:07,678
ド... え、痛い痛い！やばい！
Do... Eh, ouch, ouch! Oh no!

3808
02:56:07,678 --> 02:56:08,878
あ、ビビビビ
Ah, Bibi, Bibi!

3809
02:56:08,878 --> 02:56:11,178
ドアのテイムしてるから大丈夫よ、それ
It's being tamed near the door so you're fine.

3810
02:56:11,178 --> 02:56:13,678
あ、オッケー。これでやっちゃって！これで石取ってきてほしい
Ah, okay. Use this and go for it! I want you to get stone with this.

3811
02:56:13,678 --> 02:56:15,878
視界が悪すぎる... わかりました
My vision is so bad... Understood.

3812
02:56:15,878 --> 02:56:18,678
こいつで。近場でいいよ、本当に。目の前のやつでも
With this one. Nearby is fine, honestly. Even the one right in front of you.

3813
02:56:18,678 --> 02:56:21,178
視界が悪い... ドエディで...
My vision is bad... With the Doedicurus...

3814
02:56:21,178 --> 02:56:24,178
えー、なんか後ろから追っかけ回されてるし...
Eh, I'm being chased from behind...

3815
02:56:24,178 --> 02:56:27,178
石を持って帰りたいだけなのよ
I just want to bring back stone.

3816
02:56:27,678 --> 02:56:30,178
これ頼む頼む、殺さないで
Please, please, don't kill it.

3817
02:56:30,178 --> 02:56:32,678
えー、インゴットが足りないからイン...
Um, there's not enough ingots, so in...

3818
02:56:32,678 --> 02:56:34,678
ちょちょちょちょ、平ら！
Wait wait wait wait, it's flat!

3819
02:56:34,678 --> 02:56:37,678
虹のエレベーターの横で湧くな、やめて！
Don't spawn next to the rainbow elevator, stop!

3820
02:56:39,178 --> 02:56:41,178
よいしょ
Up we go.

3821
02:56:44,478 --> 02:56:45,678
なにこれ？
What is this?

3822
02:56:45,678 --> 02:56:49,178
ああ... なにも信じられない
Ah... I can't believe anything.

3823
02:56:49,678 --> 02:56:51,678
いろはーーー！
Irohaaaa!

3824
02:56:51,678 --> 02:56:57,678
ヘルメット死んでしまった。石持って帰れないかも。アルゲンロストするかも。もう無理
Helmet died. I might not be able to bring stone back. I might lose the Argentavis. It's over.

3825
02:56:58,178 --> 02:57:00,178
乗せすぎだ！
You loaded too much!

3826
02:57:00,178 --> 02:57:02,678
絶対乗せすぎだ！
Definitely loaded too much!

3827
02:57:02,678 --> 02:57:05,178
え、なんかすんなり行けないけど...
Eh, I can't move smoothly though...

3828
02:57:05,178 --> 02:57:07,678
飛びまっせ。降りないと飛ばされますよ
It's going to fly. If you don't get off, you'll be blown away.

3829
02:57:07,678 --> 02:57:12,678
視界が... 死ぬほど悪くて、ちょっと何も見つけられない。なんでこんなに...
My vision... is deathly bad, I can't find anything at all. Why is it like this...

3830
02:57:12,678 --> 02:57:17,678
あれ、視界が悪いのは熱中症の可能性ある。モヤモヤって右下になんか出てない？
Huh, bad vision could be heatstroke. Isn't there a hazy icon on the bottom right?

3831
02:57:17,678 --> 02:57:20,178
そう、なんか白い丸いやつ出てて...
Yeah, there's some white round thing showing...

3832
02:57:20,178 --> 02:57:25,678
ああ、それはね、一定時間川の水の中にいないと解消されないから、そっち優先のほうがいいかも
Ah, that won't go away unless you stay in river water for a while, so you should prioritize that.

3833
02:57:25,678 --> 02:57:28,678
なるほど、水の中
I see, inside water.

3834
02:57:28,678 --> 02:57:31,178
待って、すぐいっぱいになっちゃう
Wait, it fills up right away.

3835
02:57:31,478 --> 02:57:34,478
えっと、水... インゴットが足りないのか
Um, water... There are not enough ingots, huh.

3836
02:57:34,678 --> 02:57:37,678
体びしょびしょにして...
Get my body soaking wet...

3837
02:57:37,678 --> 02:57:41,678
一回... で、7番で出して...
Once... and take it out with 7...

3838
02:57:41,678 --> 02:57:43,178
これで...
With this...

3839
02:57:43,178 --> 02:57:45,178
お、こいつ、この子か
Oh, this one, is it this one?

3840
02:57:45,178 --> 02:57:48,678
これを入れている判定なのかな、水に
Does this count as being in the water?

3841
02:57:49,178 --> 02:57:52,678
どっちなんだ？やばい、ちょっと下がった
Which is it? Oh no, it went down a bit.

3842
02:57:53,178 --> 02:57:57,178
わっ、すごい！世界変わる、これ。ドエディ
Whoa, amazing! This changes the world. Doedicurus.

3843
02:57:57,178 --> 02:57:58,678
ドエディ？何これ？
Doedicurus? What's this?

3844
02:57:58,678 --> 02:58:01,178
うん、めっちゃ、一発で千とかよ
Yeah, super... like 1,000 in one hit.

3845
02:58:01,178 --> 02:58:05,478
あれ？いや、待って。じゃあゴザルのアンキロもう意味ないかもしれない。置いてきていいぐらいのレベルでも...
Huh? Wait. Then Gozaru's Ankylosaurus might be pointless now. Even to the level where we could just leave it behind...

3846
02:58:05,678 --> 02:58:08,678
うりゃ。ダメだ。出られない
Hup. No good. Can't get out.

3847
02:58:08,678 --> 02:58:12,178
あー、溶鉱炉行ったら今度は... 暑いか。うりゃ
Ah, if I go to the forge, now it's... too hot? Hup.

3848
02:58:13,178 --> 02:58:16,178
溝でめっちゃ石出てきますよ、これー
A ton of stone comes out in the ditch, this!

3849
02:58:16,178 --> 02:58:19,178
それはちょっと盛ったな、ビビ。盛り癖が
That was a bit of an exaggeration, Bibi. Your exaggeration habit.

3850
02:58:19,678 --> 02:58:22,678
いいね / 転がったほうが早い？ / 鎌じゃなかった
Nice. / Is it faster to roll? / It wasn't a sickle.

3851
02:58:24,178 --> 02:58:26,678
浅い水場でも... / あ、転がったほうが早いらしいぞ、ビビ
Even in shallow water... / Ah, apparently rolling is faster, Bibi.

3852
02:58:26,678 --> 02:58:29,178
へー / 転がります
Oh. / I'll roll.

3853
02:58:29,178 --> 02:58:33,178
転がってどうすんだ、これ / 浅い水で池... / 死んだ
How do you roll in this? / Shallow water pond... / Died.

3854
02:58:34,178 --> 02:58:37,678
え、死んだ？ / あ、いやいやいや、ちょっと...
Eh, you died? / Ah, no no no, wait...

3855
02:58:38,178 --> 02:58:41,678
あ、ゴロゴロゴロ。これは... どうせ...
Ah, roll roll roll. This is... either way...

3856
02:58:41,678 --> 02:58:45,678
待って、どうしよう？かがめないけど、どうしたらいいの、これ？
Wait, what should I do? I can't crouch, what should I do about this?

3857
02:58:46,178 --> 02:58:49,178
ドエディさんも草食ですか？やばい、木材やっちゃった
Is Mr. Doedicurus an herbivore too? Oops, I hit wood.

3858
02:58:49,478 --> 02:58:52,678
ドエディさん草食だよ / これ、倒すのこれでしょうね。ボーラ使って...
Doedicurus is an herbivore. / To knock it down, this is it, right? Using a bola...

3859
02:58:52,678 --> 02:58:56,678
寝かせて
and put it to sleep.

3860
02:58:58,178 --> 02:59:02,678
ドエディさん木の実... / 草食で合ってるよね？
Doedicurus, berries... / Herbivore is correct, right?

3861
02:59:04,678 --> 02:59:07,178
走るのが早い奴か？ほら！
Is it the fast running one? Take that!

3862
02:59:07,678 --> 02:59:10,678
飛んでるー！
It's flying!

3863
02:59:10,678 --> 02:59:13,678
やばい、かがめない。どうしよう
Oh no, I can't crouch. What should I do?

3864
02:59:13,678 --> 02:59:17,178
ということで、なんと22時なんですね / 助けてくださーい！
And with that, it's actually 10 PM, isn't it? / Somebody help meee!

3865
02:59:17,178 --> 02:59:21,678
マジかよ / えー、無理ー！もうやだ、なんだこれ！え？
Seriously? / Eh, no way! I hate this, what is this! Huh?

3866
02:59:21,678 --> 02:59:25,678
いや、かがめないし、水入っても直らないんですけど、これ
No, I can't crouch, and even if I get in the water it doesn't get fixed.

3867
02:59:25,678 --> 02:59:29,178
家の横の川なら行けるよ / 家の横の川？え？
The river next to the house should work. / The river next to the house? Eh?

3868
02:59:29,178 --> 02:59:32,678
敷地内じゃなくて敷地の外？
Not inside the grounds, outside the grounds?

3869
02:59:32,678 --> 02:59:35,678
外でもどこでも川の中なら行けるはず
Outside or anywhere, if you're in the river it should work.

3870
02:59:35,678 --> 02:59:38,178
そう。こっちかな？
I see. Over here?

3871
02:59:38,178 --> 02:59:41,178
しばらくかかるよ、熱中症治すの
It takes a while to cure heatstroke.

3872
02:59:41,178 --> 02:59:44,678
そんなにかかる？ / うん、かかっちゃう / 置いてって、すまない。ドエディじゃなくて...
It takes that long? / Yeah, it does. / Sorry for leaving it behind. Not the Doedi...

3873
02:59:52,178 --> 02:59:55,678
石きた。戻ってます
Got stone. I'm heading back.

3874
02:59:55,678 --> 03:00:00,678
でもあの... アロミッションやってたっけ？ギガの... ギガノト...
But um... were we doing the Allo mission? Giga's... Giganoto...

3875
03:00:00,678 --> 03:00:04,478
ギガノトは、なんかちょっと今上から見たんですけど...
About the Giganotosaurus, I kind of saw it from above just now, but...

3876
03:00:04,699 --> 03:00:07,699
もう23時まで元々いっぱいで...
It was already full until 23:00 to begin with...

3877
03:00:07,699 --> 03:00:09,199
あ、なるほどね。
Ah, I see.

3878
03:00:09,199 --> 03:00:13,199
多分ござる達が入れた後、パパパパッてみんな入れたみたいで、
Looks like after Gozaru and the others queued up, everyone rapidly joined in,

3879
03:00:13,199 --> 03:00:15,499
23時まで埋まっちゃってました。
so it was booked full until 23:00.

3880
03:00:15,499 --> 03:00:16,499
オッケー。
Okay.

3881
03:00:16,499 --> 03:00:20,199
からは多分無理そうで... で、後で、何十種テイムで
So that won't work... and then later, for the taming multiple species,

3882
03:00:20,899 --> 03:00:21,999
オッケー。
Okay.

3883
03:00:22,699 --> 03:00:27,199
その、ラバ、ラバエレメンタルと...
the, Lava, Lava Elemental and...

3884
03:00:27,299 --> 03:00:28,699
石もっと...
More stone...

3885
03:00:27,699 --> 03:00:29,499
あとは、アスレ...
and the obstacle course...

3886
03:00:29,699 --> 03:00:30,699
オッケー。
Okay.

3887
03:00:31,199 --> 03:00:32,499
入んない。
It won't go in.

3888
03:00:32,499 --> 03:00:34,199
えー、肉？
Uh, meat?

3889
03:00:35,499 --> 03:00:36,699
あれ？
Huh?

3890
03:00:38,499 --> 03:00:40,199
ですかねー...
I guess...

3891
03:00:40,699 --> 03:00:42,899
ねえ、マジでちょっとやめて、ホントに...
Hey, seriously, stop it, really...

3892
03:00:43,199 --> 03:00:45,499
一応今、石いっぱい集めてまーす。
For now, I'm gathering lots of stone.

3893
03:00:45,499 --> 03:00:46,499
オッケー。
Okay.

3894
03:00:46,499 --> 03:00:48,899
あ、でももうそろそろ帰ってきてもらっていいよ。
Ah, but you can come back anytime now.

3895
03:00:48,899 --> 03:00:49,699
オッケー。
Okay.

3896
03:00:49,699 --> 03:00:52,699
戻って、もう戻ってきました。ここドエディ入らないよ。
Back... I'm already back. The Doedicurus won't fit here.

3897
03:00:53,499 --> 03:00:56,899
ドエディから石出して手持ちで入れてきてほしいかな。
Could you take the stone out from the Doedi and put it in manually?

3898
03:00:57,199 --> 03:00:59,699
あ、ここ...ちょっと待って。
Ah, here... hold on a second.

3899
03:00:59,899 --> 03:01:00,899
おしょっ。
Oof.

3900
03:01:00,699 --> 03:01:01,899
え、これどうやって置くか？
Wait, how do I place this?

3901
03:01:03,199 --> 03:01:07,699
やばい、この場所の脱水症状タイム早すぎワロタ。
Oh man, dehydration kicks in way too fast here, lol.

3902
03:01:10,699 --> 03:01:13,699
石重すぎて集められないんだったら一回...
If the stone is too heavy to gather all at once...

3903
03:01:13,699 --> 03:01:16,199
ちょっとずつでいいやで、ちょっとずつで。
Just do it little by little, bit by bit.

3904
03:01:15,699 --> 03:01:17,199
膝が割れる、膝が。
My knees are breaking, my knees!

3905
03:01:17,199 --> 03:01:19,499
ぐるぐるぐるぐるぐるぐる...
Spinning around and around...

3906
03:01:19,499 --> 03:01:21,699
これどこに入れたらいいでしょうか？
Where should I put this?

3907
03:01:21,699 --> 03:01:23,699
えー、あの旋盤の中で。
Um, inside that fabricator.

3908
03:01:23,899 --> 03:01:25,699
はーい。膝が...
Okay. My knees...

3909
03:01:26,199 --> 03:01:27,699
石、旋盤の中？
Stone into the fabricator?

3910
03:01:27,699 --> 03:01:31,199
テラーバードまだテイムしてないんですよね。
We haven't tamed a Terror Bird yet, right?

3911
03:01:31,199 --> 03:01:32,699
ちょっとミッション見よ。
Let me check the missions.

3912
03:01:32,699 --> 03:01:34,499
あ、居た居た居た。
Ah, there it is, there it is.

3913
03:01:34,699 --> 03:01:35,699
え？
Eh?

3914
03:01:35,699 --> 03:01:37,699
どこ居たっけ、今逃したの？
Where was it, did I just miss it?

3915
03:01:37,699 --> 03:01:38,699
あれ？
Huh?

3916
03:01:38,699 --> 03:01:40,699
あ、居なくなっちゃった...
Ah, it's gone...

3917
03:01:40,499 --> 03:01:42,699
これだけあれば行けるかな...
I wonder if we have enough with this...

3918
03:01:42,699 --> 03:01:44,199
石、持ってきました。
I brought the stone.

3919
03:01:44,199 --> 03:01:47,199
はい、ありがとう！ということで、じゃ、行きますか。
Alright, thank you! In that case, shall we go?

3920
03:01:47,699 --> 03:01:50,699
ラバ組はじゃあ、一旦じゃボイチャ2で。
Lava team, let's head over to VC 2 for now.

3921
03:01:50,699 --> 03:01:52,199
はーい。
Okay!

3922
03:01:54,699 --> 03:01:56,199
ボイチャ2...
VC 2...

3923
03:01:56,699 --> 03:01:57,699
着た。
All set.

3924
03:02:00,199 --> 03:02:02,699
やばい、なんか席ない。
Oh no, there are no seats.

3925
03:02:02,699 --> 03:02:03,699
あ、できたー！
Ah, it's done!

3926
03:02:04,699 --> 03:02:06,199
ああ、なんだこれ。
Ah, what's this?

3927
03:02:06,199 --> 03:02:07,699
石ね。
Stone, right?

3928
03:02:07,699 --> 03:02:09,199
停止。
Stop.

3929
03:02:09,199 --> 03:02:10,699
Three more!

3930
03:02:14,699 --> 03:02:15,699
なんで？
Why?

3931
03:02:16,699 --> 03:02:18,199
やったー！
Yay!

3932
03:02:18,199 --> 03:02:19,499
お前...
You...

3933
03:02:20,199 --> 03:02:23,199
あ、水、水... あ、でもまだ石持って帰れないから...
Ah, water, water... but since I can't carry stone back yet...

3934
03:02:28,199 --> 03:02:30,199
どうせお前すぐ諦めるやろ。
You're just gonna give up right away anyway.

3935
03:02:30,199 --> 03:02:32,199
水飲もうぜ。知ってんだぞ、こっちは。
Let's drink water. I know your game.

3936
03:02:32,699 --> 03:02:33,699
ほら。
See?

3937
03:02:34,699 --> 03:02:39,699
来いよ！なんだとお前、結構根性ある雪山の時は...
Come at me! What the... you had so much guts back at the snowy mountain,

3938
03:02:39,699 --> 03:02:41,699
そんなことなかったのに、なぜ？
even though you weren't like that before. Why?

3939
03:02:41,699 --> 03:02:45,199
お前、ここのアルゲンは根性がある...
You... the Argentavis here have some serious guts...

3940
03:02:45,699 --> 03:02:47,699
根性ありあり。
Guts for days.

3941
03:02:55,199 --> 03:02:58,699
誰かが持ってるであろう水を飲んで...
Drinking water that someone probably has...

3942
03:03:00,699 --> 03:03:01,699
水飲んで...
Drinking water...

3943
03:03:01,699 --> 03:03:05,699
なんでこういう時に限ってお前は根性があるのか...
Why is it only at times like this that you show some guts...

3944
03:03:06,699 --> 03:03:07,699
えっと...
Um...

3945
03:03:08,199 --> 03:03:10,699
どうして... せっせ、せっせ...
Why... heaving, hoing...

3946
03:03:11,199 --> 03:03:17,199
拠点の近くの雪山のアルゲン、すぐ昨日捕まえようとしたら、やっぱやーめたされたんですけど、
Yesterday, when I tried to catch an Argentavis near base on the snowy mountain, it gave up right away,

3947
03:03:17,699 --> 03:03:22,699
今いるそこのアルゲン、執着心が強すぎて、個体差なのか...
but the one over there right now is so persistent. Is it just individual personality...?

3948
03:03:24,199 --> 03:03:26,699
あ、無事回収できました。
Ah, I managed to retrieve it safely.

3949
03:03:26,699 --> 03:03:28,199
よかったー！
Thank goodness!

3950
03:03:28,199 --> 03:03:30,199
ボスみんな行っちゃった？
Did everyone go to the boss?

3951
03:03:30,199 --> 03:03:31,699
あ、戻ってきた？
Ah, did you come back?

3952
03:03:31,699 --> 03:03:34,699
あ、いや、いいですよ、ござるは。一旦これでアスレ行きます。
Ah, no, it's fine for Gozaru. I'll head to the obstacle course for now.

3953
03:03:35,699 --> 03:03:36,699
オッケーオッケー。
Okay, okay.

3954
03:03:37,199 --> 03:03:39,699
イナが、イナがVCが大丈夫かな？
Is Ina... is Ina okay with VC?

3955
03:03:40,199 --> 03:03:43,199
あ、大丈夫です。今ちょっと、なんか...
Ah, I'm okay. Right now I'm just...

3956
03:03:43,199 --> 03:03:47,499
テイムしやすい奴ら、ちょっとテイムしてます。
taming the ones that are easier to tame.

3957
03:03:47,699 --> 03:03:50,699
オッケー。トワもね、結構テイムできてるよ、今。
Okay. Towa's managed to tame quite a few now too.

3958
03:03:50,699 --> 03:03:53,699
もう3... 6体ぐらいテイムしたかな。
About 3... 6 creatures or so tamed now.

3959
03:03:53,699 --> 03:03:59,199
え、ちょっと待って、今ここで体が弱くなるのは本当にダメで！ちょっとー！
Wait, hold on, getting weak right now in a place like this is really bad! Hey!

3960
03:04:00,499 --> 03:04:04,699
やめてって言ってるじゃん！今はダメだって！着地させて！
I told you to stop! Not right now! Let me land!

3961
03:04:05,199 --> 03:04:08,699
熱中症になったし！助けてー！
I got heatstroke too! Help me!

3962
03:04:08,699 --> 03:04:10,199
大丈夫ー？
Are you okay?

3963
03:04:11,699 --> 03:04:14,699
ちょっと本当に... もう本当にヤバい...
Seriously... this is really bad...

3964
03:04:15,699 --> 03:04:17,699
死体が... よし。
My corpse is... alright.

3965
03:04:18,699 --> 03:04:21,699
もうよく分からん、もう全てにおいて。うーん。
I don't get it anymore, everything about this. Jeez.

3966
03:04:22,199 --> 03:04:27,199
まだテイムしてないの... なんだろう。
What haven't we tamed yet... I wonder.

3967
03:04:27,699 --> 03:04:32,699
掴めないし！くそ、全然掴めない、お前！
I can't grab it! Dammit, I can't grab you at all!

3968
03:04:32,699 --> 03:04:37,699
しかもサボテンが後ろから迫ってきて... ああ！
Plus a cactus is closing in from behind... Aah!

3969
03:04:39,199 --> 03:04:42,699
膝の皿がバリバリバリバリ...
My kneecaps are shattering into pieces...

3970
03:04:44,699 --> 03:04:46,199
よし！
Alright!

3971
03:04:49,699 --> 03:04:53,699
微妙にブロントサウルスも居て...
There's also awkwardly a Brontosaurus here...

3972
03:04:56,699 --> 03:04:58,699
あと3匹だ。あと3匹。
3 more left. 3 more left.

3973
03:04:58,699 --> 03:05:00,199
すごい！ナイス！
Awesome! Nice!

3974
03:05:00,199 --> 03:05:03,199
まだテイムできてないのかどっちか...
Whether we haven't tamed it yet or which one it is...

3975
03:05:03,199 --> 03:05:04,699
どれかわかんないよね。
You can't really tell which one it is, right?

3976
03:05:04,720 --> 03:05:05,720
え、そうですね
Yeah, that's right.

3977
03:05:05,720 --> 03:05:08,220
もうなんか適当に...はっ、はっ！
It feels like going randomly... ha ha!

3978
03:05:08,220 --> 03:05:11,220
確かに、自分も分からんね
Indeed, I don't really know either.

3979
03:05:08,720 --> 03:05:11,320
適当に行くしかなくなっている
We have no choice but to just wander randomly.

3980
03:05:11,320 --> 03:05:14,220
もうリスナーさんに任せてる、もうこれ。
I'm leaving it entirely up to the chat now!

3981
03:05:15,220 --> 03:05:17,020
これみんなの見て、どれが...
Looking at what everyone is doing, which...

3982
03:05:17,020 --> 03:05:20,220
あれ、待って、ティラノって倒しました？まだゼロだけどこれ...
Wait, did we defeat the Rexes? It still says zero though...

3983
03:05:20,520 --> 03:05:23,220
いやそう、ティラノね、いないんだよ。今探して...探し中。
Yeah, there aren't any Rexes around. I'm searching for them right now.

3984
03:05:23,420 --> 03:05:26,720
探し中なのと、あとテイムに寄り道しちゃってる。
I'm searching, and I also got sidetracked by taming.

3985
03:05:27,220 --> 03:05:28,720
あ、了解です、了解です。
Ah, roger that, roger that.

3986
03:05:28,920 --> 03:05:33,520
テイムやめてティラノの方手伝った方がいいか。チームミッションの方が大きいですもんね。
Maybe I should stop taming and help with the Rexes. The team mission is bigger, after all.

3987
03:05:33,520 --> 03:05:35,520
ティラノの方が...
The Rexes would be...

3988
03:05:35,720 --> 03:05:39,220
あれ？イナ、ティラノ見つけたらやれる？
Wait, Ina, if you find a Rex, can you take it down?

3989
03:05:39,520 --> 03:05:41,220
私だけで？
Just by myself?

3990
03:05:41,520 --> 03:05:44,720
トワと一...トワ、トワもね、今ワイバーン乗ってやってるんだよね。
Towa and... Towa is also flying a Wyvern doing it right now.

3991
03:05:44,720 --> 03:05:46,720
あ、じゃあ見つかったら...
Ah, then if I find one...

3992
03:05:46,720 --> 03:05:48,720
いたいたいた！あ、そう、見つかったら...
Found one, found one! Ah yeah, if you find one...

3993
03:05:48,920 --> 03:05:51,220
見つかったらどんどんやってって。
If you find them, keep taking them down.

3994
03:05:51,220 --> 03:05:54,720
やんないと、多分ね、間に合わなくてね、1人じゃ。
If we don't, one person probably won't make it in time.

3995
03:05:54,720 --> 03:05:57,720
1人じゃ10匹見つけられん。
I can't find 10 all by myself.

3996
03:05:59,520 --> 03:06:00,920
これだよな。
It's this one, right?

3997
03:06:01,020 --> 03:06:03,520
これテイム...言ってたっけ？
Did they mention taming this?

3998
03:06:03,520 --> 03:06:08,220
手伝った方が良さそうであれば...
If it seems better to help out...

3999
03:06:08,520 --> 03:06:13,220
「君の名は」忘れる前に、手伝いたい...
Before forgetting "Your Name", I want to help...

4000
03:06:13,520 --> 03:06:16,220
パラケラテリウム
Paraceratherium.

4001
03:06:16,520 --> 03:06:19,220
え、これアクロ？またこれ騙された！
Wait, is this an Acro? I got fooled by this again!

4002
03:06:19,520 --> 03:06:22,720
てめえ、何回騙してくんだよこいつー！お前マジでー！
Damn it, how many times are you gonna fool me?! Seriously!

4003
03:06:22,920 --> 03:06:25,720
騙されたやばい
Fooled again, oh no!

4004
03:06:25,720 --> 03:06:28,720
もうこれもう騙されたもう！これもうマジで顔つきティラノすぎるだろお前！
Fooled again! Seriously, your face looks way too much like a Rex, man!

4005
03:06:28,720 --> 03:06:33,220
それ違うからそれ、やめてー！
You're not one, stop that!

4006
03:06:33,720 --> 03:06:35,720
顔つき？
Its face?

4007
03:06:35,720 --> 03:06:38,220
顔つきがティラノすぎるわ！
Its face looks way too much like a Rex!

4008
03:06:38,220 --> 03:06:41,220
テラバードやめちゃおうかな？...
Maybe I should give up on the Terror Bird?

4009
03:06:41,220 --> 03:06:44,220
ちょ、テラバードやめてマジ、テラバード何？
Seriously, stop it Terror Bird. What's with this Terror Bird?

4010
03:06:44,720 --> 03:06:49,220
んー... できるかな？
Hmm... can I do this?

4011
03:06:49,720 --> 03:06:54,720
ちょ、テラバーやめて、本当に。邪魔だから君！
Hey, stop it Terror Bird, really. You're in the way!

4012
03:07:01,220 --> 03:07:03,720
じわじわ... テラバーほんまに...
Little by little... Terror Bird, seriously...

4013
03:07:03,720 --> 03:07:06,220
人違いで...
Mistaken identity...

4014
03:07:06,220 --> 03:07:11,220
「人違いで何も悪いことしてないのに殺された」ってコメントに書かれてるｗｗ
Chat's saying "Killed for mistaken identity even though it did nothing wrong" lol

4015
03:07:12,220 --> 03:07:15,720
仕方ない、ごめんだけど仕方ないんだよ。
It can't be helped. Sorry, but it really can't be helped.

4016
03:07:16,220 --> 03:07:19,720
似て、出てきたお前が悪い。
It's your fault for showing up looking like one.

4017
03:07:17,720 --> 03:07:20,220
ほら、おいでテラバー。
Come on, over here Terror Bird.

4018
03:07:21,720 --> 03:07:26,720
何でだよお前！本当にいい加減にしなさい！
Why you! Seriously, give me a break!

4019
03:07:27,720 --> 03:07:31,220
先鋒要員残ってないんだから！
I don't have any vanguard dinos left!

4020
03:07:31,220 --> 03:07:34,220
思ったより早かった！
It was faster than I thought!

4021
03:07:35,520 --> 03:07:39,720
すみませんティラノザウルスさん、お願いします。あの、殺させてください。
Excuse me, Mr. Tyrannosaurus, please. Um, please let me kill you.

4022
03:07:39,720 --> 03:07:43,220
本当にお願いしますー。1回周回所...
Please, really. Back to the hub area for a sec...

4023
03:07:46,220 --> 03:07:48,720
あ、やべ。ええっと...
Ah, crap. Uh...

4024
03:07:50,720 --> 03:07:52,720
火山地帯？
Volcano area?

4025
03:07:53,720 --> 03:07:56,220
火山地帯？行きます。
Volcano area? On my way.

4026
03:08:02,720 --> 03:08:05,220
欲しいなあ、あの...
I want that one...

4027
03:08:06,720 --> 03:08:12,220
もう、何だっけ？キャラバンするアクロバティック...アクロバティックじゃなくて、これか？
Geez, what was it? The caravanning acrobatic... not acrobatic, is it this?

4028
03:08:13,220 --> 03:08:15,220
これを麻酔矢で...
Hit this with tranq arrows...

4029
03:08:17,720 --> 03:08:22,220
お前はちゃうやないか、くそー！食らえ！
Not you, damn it! Take that!

4030
03:08:22,220 --> 03:08:24,720
もう...騙され続け...
Fooled again and again...

4031
03:08:24,720 --> 03:08:29,220
もう喜ばさせられてがっくりさせられる。何なんこいつもー！
Getting my hopes up only to be disappointed. What is with this guy too!

4032
03:08:29,220 --> 03:08:31,220
喜びがない！
No joy!

4033
03:08:31,220 --> 03:08:33,720
喜びがないよー！
There's no joy!

4034
03:08:34,220 --> 03:08:37,220
8割もうぶちギレだよこれー！
I'm like 80% enraged at this!

4035
03:08:37,520 --> 03:08:40,220
喜びがないー。
There is no joy~

4036
03:08:40,220 --> 03:08:42,720
うわ、すご！
Whoa, crazy!

4037
03:08:42,720 --> 03:08:45,220
うわはは！
Uwahaha!

4038
03:08:45,220 --> 03:08:50,220
え、でも、あれって...なんかミッションでもらったやつって、あれチームで1体でしたよね？
Wait, but... the ones we got from the missions, was that one per team?

4039
03:08:50,720 --> 03:08:53,220
え、みんなで行ったじゃない？
Eh, didn't everyone go together?

4040
03:08:53,220 --> 03:08:55,720
え、みんな1人1体？
Wait, everyone gets one each?

4041
03:08:55,720 --> 03:08:58,220
じゃ、だと思う。うん、だと思います。
Then, I think so. Yeah, I think so.

4042
03:08:59,220 --> 03:09:03,220
ワイバーン、じゃあもらってないかもござる。もらってこようかな。
Then I might not have gotten a Wyvern. Maybe I should go get one.

4043
03:09:03,520 --> 03:09:04,720
うん。
Yeah.

4044
03:09:05,720 --> 03:09:09,220
で、ティラノやろう。ええっと...
And let's do the Rexes. Um...

4045
03:09:09,720 --> 03:09:12,220
時間が何だっけ？え？
What about the time? Huh?

4046
03:09:13,220 --> 03:09:16,220
逃げれん！あ、ちょ、お水...
Can't escape! Ah, quick drink of water...

4047
03:09:28,720 --> 03:09:32,720
ビーバー昏睡？いやビーバー多すぎて無理だろあれ。
Tranq beavers? No, there are way too many beavers, that's impossible.

4048
03:09:33,220 --> 03:09:39,720
報酬の恐竜たちが1人1体なのかチームで1体なのかがちょっとごちゃごちゃになりすぎてて把握が...
Whether the reward dinos are one per person or one per team is getting a bit too confusing to keep track of...

4049
03:09:41,220 --> 03:09:43,720
ワイバーン...
Wyvern...

4050
03:09:43,720 --> 03:09:46,220
いっぱいあるからね、難しいよね。
There are so many, it's confusing.

4051
03:09:45,220 --> 03:09:48,220
邪魔、邪魔！こいつ、くっ...
In the way, you're in the way! Ugh, this guy...

4052
03:09:48,720 --> 03:09:53,220
キレヤレン...キレヤレンどこ飛ぶの？
Kileyalen... where is Kileyalen flying to?

4053
03:09:53,720 --> 03:09:58,220
バイリンガル喋っとるのにすごいね、イナちゃんは。
It's amazing how you can chat bilingually, Ina-chan.

4054
03:09:58,220 --> 03:10:00,720
そうです、イナ先輩！
That's right, Ina-senpai!

4055
03:10:00,720 --> 03:10:02,220
え？
Huh?

4056
03:10:01,220 --> 03:10:02,520
ごめんで...
Sorry...

4057
03:10:02,220 --> 03:10:04,720
英語の...英語喋れらん...
English... I can't speak English...

4058
03:10:05,741 --> 03:10:07,741
いやいやいやいや
No, no, no, no!

4059
03:10:09,541 --> 03:10:12,241
なんていうか、日本語の練習...
How should I put it... practicing Japanese...

4060
03:10:12,541 --> 03:10:13,741
えらい。
That's admirable.

4061
03:10:13,741 --> 03:10:15,241
できるかね。
I wonder if we can do it.

4062
03:10:15,741 --> 03:10:21,741
でもなんかARK始めた時は、なんかARKの単語もあるから
When I first started ARK, there were so many ARK-specific terms...

4063
03:10:21,741 --> 03:10:23,241
めっちゃ...
...so much that...

4064
03:10:22,741 --> 03:10:24,241
確かに。
That's true.

4065
03:10:24,241 --> 03:10:27,241
なんか言葉が出なくて...
...I couldn't find the right words.

4066
03:10:28,341 --> 03:10:33,241
ムズいよね。こっちもさ、何伝え...伝えたいけど、英語わかんないみたいな。
It's hard, isn't it? For me too, I want to say something, but I don't know the English for it.

4067
03:10:33,541 --> 03:10:37,241
そうです。なんか聞いても...わかんない(笑)
Right? Even if I listen... I don't get it. (laughs)

4068
03:10:37,741 --> 03:10:40,041
「WOOD」って書いてあるでしょ？
Like, it just says 'WOOD', right?

4069
03:10:40,241 --> 03:10:46,741
うーん...なんか英語となんか日本語違うから、なんか...
Yeah... English and Japanese are different, so...

4070
03:10:47,241 --> 03:10:49,541
アイテムの名前とか。
...things like item names.

4071
03:10:49,741 --> 03:10:51,241
いや、これ...なんで？
Wait, why is this...?

4072
03:10:51,541 --> 03:10:57,741
いや、わかる。そう、だから、あの、シートでGoogle自動翻訳を入れたスプシを作った時に、
Yeah, I get it. That's why when I made a spreadsheet with Google Translate,

4073
03:10:57,941 --> 03:11:03,241
「ん？これはゲームと一致しているのか？」っていう一抹の不安がよぎったけど、イナ先輩が...
I had a slight worry like, 'Wait, does this match the game terms?', but Ina-senpai...

4074
03:11:03,241 --> 03:11:05,941
全部理解してくれてて助かった。
...understood everything, which really saved me.

4075
03:11:05,941 --> 03:11:09,741
恐竜の名前はなんとなく翻訳はできてて...
Though somehow... dinosaur names were more or less translatable...

4076
03:11:10,241 --> 03:11:12,741
おー、すげえー。
Oh, that's awesome!

4077
03:11:13,241 --> 03:11:15,941
え、なんで寝ないの？ほら！
Wait, why aren't you falling asleep? Come on!

4078
03:11:16,741 --> 03:11:20,741
ね、「なんで寝ないの、ほら」があまりにも日本語...
Haha, 'Why aren't you falling asleep, come on' sounded so naturally Japanese!

4079
03:11:21,541 --> 03:11:23,241
いやー！
Nooo!

4080
03:11:23,741 --> 03:11:27,741
象はビール、了解。象は無理だね。象は却下。
Elephants need beer, got it. Elephants are impossible then. Elephants are rejected.

4081
03:11:27,741 --> 03:11:29,741
まだまだか...
Not yet, huh...

4082
03:11:30,241 --> 03:11:33,241
こいつももう1体行ったほうがいいのか？
Should we go for another one of these guys too?

4083
03:11:34,241 --> 03:11:37,241
いや、足りないかなー。
No, I might not have enough...

4084
03:11:41,741 --> 03:11:45,241
なんかビール飲む恐竜いるらしい、テイムで。
Apparently there's a dinosaur that drinks beer for taming.

4085
03:11:44,741 --> 03:11:45,941
ビール？
Beer?

4086
03:11:45,541 --> 03:11:46,541
うざっ。
How annoying.

4087
03:11:46,241 --> 03:11:47,741
ビール飲むなよ。
Don't go drinking beer!

4088
03:11:47,741 --> 03:11:49,741
ビール飲むなよ、やばい。
'Don't drink beer', that's crazy.

4089
03:11:49,741 --> 03:11:51,741
昼からビール？
Beer in the middle of the day?

4090
03:11:51,741 --> 03:11:54,741
待って、マジでティラノいないんだけど。
Wait, there really aren't any Rexes around.

4091
03:11:54,741 --> 03:11:57,741
10匹無理すぎるだろ、これ。
Ten of them is way too impossible, isn't it?

4092
03:11:57,941 --> 03:12:00,741
いや、さっきうじゃうじゃいたんですけどねー。
I mean, they were swarming everywhere just a moment ago...

4093
03:12:00,741 --> 03:12:03,241
いや、戻ってー。
No, come back~

4094
03:12:03,741 --> 03:12:06,741
狩り、狩り尽くしすぎた？
Did we... did we overhunt them?

4095
03:12:06,741 --> 03:12:09,241
13...あー！
13... Ahhh!

4096
03:12:13,241 --> 03:12:16,541
いや、足りないかなー。
No, I might not have enough...

4097
03:12:18,241 --> 03:12:20,241
いけるなー。
I can do this...

4098
03:12:22,241 --> 03:12:25,741
今で後3匹、3種類なんだよなー。
Right now we still need 3 more, 3 different species...

4099
03:12:25,741 --> 03:12:30,541
今めっちゃでかい奴ずっとやってるんですけど、
I've been going at this super huge one right now, but...

4100
03:12:30,541 --> 03:12:34,741
めっちゃかかりますね。足りないかも。
...it takes so many hits. I might run out.

4101
03:12:36,741 --> 03:12:40,241
みんなこれは？みんなこいつは？こいつ、こいつ。
Everyone, what about this one? What about this guy? This one, this one!

4102
03:12:40,741 --> 03:12:43,241
さあ、こいつ昏睡、昏睡、こいつ昏睡？
Come on, knock out, knock out, is this guy knocked out?

4103
03:12:43,241 --> 03:12:44,541
逃げた！
It ran away!

4104
03:12:45,541 --> 03:12:47,241
え、これもティラノか？
Wait, is this a Rex too?

4105
03:12:46,741 --> 03:12:49,241
やー！足りなかったー！
Nooo! I didn't have enough!

4106
03:12:49,241 --> 03:12:52,241
なんか似てるだけで違う人？
Is it a different one that just looks similar?

4107
03:12:53,241 --> 03:12:56,241
君はティラノサウルスさんですか？
Are you a Tyrannosaurus?

4108
03:12:56,241 --> 03:12:58,741
あなたのお名前は？
What is your name?

4109
03:12:58,741 --> 03:13:01,241
許して。お名前は...
Forgive me. Your name is...

4110
03:13:01,241 --> 03:13:02,741
どうしよう。
What should I do?

4111
03:13:02,741 --> 03:13:03,741
許してー。
Forgive me~

4112
03:13:07,741 --> 03:13:11,241
なんかちょっと薄いから違うかも。あー。
It looks a bit skinny, so maybe it's different. Ahh.

4113
03:13:11,741 --> 03:13:15,241
殴ったらできる？テイム。(笑)
Can I tame it if I punch it? (laughs)

4114
03:13:16,741 --> 03:13:19,741
ちょっと君、身体薄くない？
Hey, isn't your body a bit skinny?

4115
03:13:21,741 --> 03:13:23,741
殴ったらテイムできますか？
Can we tame it if we punch it?

4116
03:13:23,741 --> 03:13:25,741
アクロなんちゃらー。
Acro-something...

4117
03:13:25,741 --> 03:13:29,741
殴ったらテイム？棍棒ならできんのかな？
Tame by punching? Can we do it with a club?

4118
03:13:32,741 --> 03:13:35,241
こいつどん、やばい、もう...
This guy is... oh no, already...

4119
03:13:36,241 --> 03:13:39,741
「あんま足んねえ」って言われた。やばい、スタミナ足んねえんだ。
Chat said 'Not enough'. Oh no, my stamina is running out.

4120
03:13:41,241 --> 03:13:43,241
え、痛いですけどー。
Hey, that hurts though!

4121
03:13:44,741 --> 03:13:48,741
お前寝なさすぎだろ、こいつ！早よ寝てや！
You just won't go to sleep at all! Go to sleep already!

4122
03:13:49,741 --> 03:13:53,741
あ、こいつに関しては頭はだめ？ふざけんな。
Ah, for this guy the head doesn't work? You've got to be kidding me.

4123
03:13:54,241 --> 03:13:56,241
お、出たー！
Oh, it's out!

4124
03:13:57,241 --> 03:13:59,241
前ですけどー。
Wait, it's forward though...

4125
03:14:00,741 --> 03:14:03,741
君ベリー？ベリーでいいのか？
You want berries? Are berries okay?

4126
03:14:03,741 --> 03:14:05,241
なんでもいい。
Anything is fine.

4127
03:14:07,741 --> 03:14:13,241
ティラノはもうちょっと頭がでかい、確かに。あいつはちょっと顔が小顔すぎる。
Rex has a slightly bigger head, true. That guy's face is way too small.

4128
03:14:13,241 --> 03:14:15,241
また騙されたー？
Was I fooled again?

4129
03:14:15,241 --> 03:14:17,741
騙された！こいつ、てめえ！オラ！
I got tricked! You jerk! Take that!

4130
03:14:17,241 --> 03:14:18,741
Get tamed!

4131
03:14:19,241 --> 03:14:21,741
てかみんなで手分けしたほうがいいのかな？
Wait, should we split up to tame them?

4132
03:14:23,241 --> 03:14:25,541
Taming punch!

4133
03:14:28,241 --> 03:14:30,241
てめえ騙しやがって！
How dare you trick me!

4134
03:14:29,741 --> 03:14:31,541
Taming punch!

4135
03:14:31,541 --> 03:14:36,241
痛いけ、痛いけど、ARK初心者を騙しやがって！てめえ！てめえ！オラ！
It hurts, it hurts, but how dare you trick an ARK beginner! You jerk! Take this!

4136
03:14:36,241 --> 03:14:38,241
こいつ！てめえ！
You! Take that!

4137
03:14:38,741 --> 03:14:40,741
あー、あああ...
Ah, ah-ah-ah...

4138
03:14:39,741 --> 03:14:41,741
騙されてます。
We're being tricked.

4139
03:14:42,241 --> 03:14:44,241
痛たたたた...
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

4140
03:14:46,741 --> 03:14:49,741
あ、やばいやばい、膝の、膝の皿が割れる。
Ah, oh no, my kneecaps are gonna shatter!

4141
03:14:49,741 --> 03:14:52,741
どうした？膝の皿が割れる？
What's wrong? Your kneecaps are shattering?

4142
03:14:52,741 --> 03:14:58,241
あのござるのところはイライラすると、視聴者とござるの膝の皿割れるんで。
In Gozaru's stream, when things get frustrating, my viewers and Gozaru's kneecaps shatter.

4143
03:14:59,241 --> 03:15:02,541
イラ...イライラ、イライラダメよー。
Fru-... Frustration, you shouldn't get frustrated~

4144
03:15:02,741 --> 03:15:04,741
あ、あ、あ、大丈夫よ。
Ah, ah, ah, it's okay.

4145
03:15:04,762 --> 03:15:06,562
ああ、助かっていく
Ah, they're being saved.

4146
03:15:13,562 --> 03:15:16,762
リスナーをイライラさせないために代わりにイライラしている。
To keep the listeners from getting frustrated, I'm getting frustrated for them.

4147
03:15:16,762 --> 03:15:17,962
膝の皿が…
My kneecap is...

4148
03:15:17,962 --> 03:15:19,762
あー、イライラしないでー
Ah, don't get frustrated~

4149
03:15:19,762 --> 03:15:21,262
無理かなー
Maybe it's impossible...

4150
03:15:22,762 --> 03:15:25,262
難しかったから、100本ぐらいないと…
It was tricky, so without like a hundred of them...

4151
03:15:25,562 --> 03:15:29,262
いやなんか、弓がもっと欲しい…
No, like, I want more arrows...

4152
03:15:29,562 --> 03:15:31,262
足りなかったです
I didn't have enough.

4153
03:15:32,762 --> 03:15:34,762
あ、矢が… 作んないとね
Ah, arrows... We have to craft them.

4154
03:15:34,762 --> 03:15:36,262
矢ね
Yeah, arrows.

4155
03:15:37,762 --> 03:15:39,762
ちょっと作って戻りまーす
I'll craft some and head back~

4156
03:15:40,262 --> 03:15:43,262
代わりにイライラしそう。ティラノどこだよ！
I might get frustrated instead. Where are the Rexes?!

4157
03:15:43,362 --> 03:15:45,962
いやマジでティラノどこだよ！
Seriously, where are the Rexes?!

4158
03:15:46,062 --> 03:15:49,762
ティラノさ、全然いないじゃーーーん！
There are no Rexes at all!

4159
03:15:51,262 --> 03:15:53,262
あ、モモンガきた
Ah, a flying squirrel came.

4160
03:15:53,762 --> 03:15:57,262
え、モモンガの、いろはって声真似できる？
Wait, Iroha, can you do an impression of a flying squirrel?

4161
03:15:57,762 --> 03:16:01,262
ものまねそんな得意じゃないけど、なんちゃってくらいだったら…
I'm not that good at impressions, but maybe just a silly attempt...

4162
03:16:01,762 --> 03:16:03,762
良いよ、何があんの？
That's fine, what do you have?

4163
03:16:04,262 --> 03:16:05,762
え、セミ
Uh, a cicada.

4164
03:16:06,762 --> 03:16:10,762
なんだろうな、みんなすごいのチョイスですね
Man, everyone picks such incredible choices.

4165
03:16:10,762 --> 03:16:12,262
え、セミ？
Eh, cicada?

4166
03:16:12,562 --> 03:16:14,262
セミやってみて？
Can you try doing a cicada?

4167
03:16:14,762 --> 03:16:15,962
行きますよ？
Here I go?

4168
03:16:15,962 --> 03:16:16,762
うん
Yeah.

4169
03:16:16,762 --> 03:16:18,762
あ、でもこれマイク入るかな？
Ah, but will this get picked up by the mic?

4170
03:16:21,262 --> 03:16:22,762
すごい！
Amazing!

4171
03:16:22,762 --> 03:16:25,762
うま！うまっ！
So good! That's awesome!

4172
03:16:25,762 --> 03:16:27,962
え、めっちゃうまいよそれ！
Whoa, that's crazy good!

4173
03:16:28,262 --> 03:16:31,262
あ、行けます？これでご飯食べて行けますかね自分？
Ah, really? Can I make a living off of this?

4174
03:16:31,562 --> 03:16:33,262
行けるわ。やっば
Totally. That's nuts.

4175
03:16:33,262 --> 03:16:34,562
すごい
Amazing.

4176
03:16:34,562 --> 03:16:36,262
両手を口元に当てて…
Put both hands to your mouth and...

4177
03:16:36,262 --> 03:16:37,762
うまいわ
That's good.

4178
03:16:43,262 --> 03:16:44,762
やったぜ
Hell yeah.

4179
03:16:44,762 --> 03:16:46,762
夏感じたわ、今
I felt summer just now.

4180
03:16:46,762 --> 03:16:48,262
夏感じました？
Did you feel summer?

4181
03:16:48,562 --> 03:16:51,262
終わったはずなのですが…
It was supposed to be over, though...

4182
03:16:51,762 --> 03:16:56,762
で、ごめん、ティラノのとこ… ティラノ…
So, sorry, about the Rexes... Rex...

4183
03:16:57,262 --> 03:17:00,762
のついでにもう1回だけユニコーン見させて
While at it, let me check for the unicorn just one more time.

4184
03:17:00,762 --> 03:17:02,762
もち、もちです！
Of course, absolutely!

4185
03:17:03,762 --> 03:17:05,762
Arch is passable, you're right.

4186
03:17:05,762 --> 03:17:10,562
え、待って、こいつはさ、待って、こいつはテイムいけんじゃね、こいつ？ベリーテイムじゃないの、こいつ？
Wait, can't we tame this guy? Isn't it a berry tame?

4187
03:17:11,262 --> 03:17:13,262
っしゃ、おらぁ！
Alright, let's go!

4188
03:17:13,262 --> 03:17:18,262
もう一回ティラノ探し行くか。拠点の近くにいないですかー？何かの間違いで。
Let's go look for Rexes again. Are there none near the base by any chance?

4189
03:17:17,762 --> 03:17:19,562
あ、なんかいるぞ！
Ah, there's something!

4190
03:17:19,562 --> 03:17:20,762
お前は誰だ！
Who are you!

4191
03:17:20,762 --> 03:17:22,762
こいつあれだった、肉食でした。
Oh, this one was a carnivore.

4192
03:17:22,762 --> 03:17:24,762
ん？お前は…？
Hm? Who are you...?

4193
03:17:25,762 --> 03:17:30,262
なんかちょっと顔が薄い気がする。お前ちょっと薄顔だな。
I feel like its face is a bit faint. You have a rather plain face.

4194
03:17:30,562 --> 03:17:32,762
ばっちり守っとー
Well protected.

4195
03:17:32,762 --> 03:17:34,762
強いかもー
It might be strong~

4196
03:17:35,762 --> 03:17:39,262
薄いのは最新型のノートパソコンだけにしてくれ
Keep being thin to the latest laptops only, please.

4197
03:17:39,762 --> 03:17:43,262
おっ、体が薄すぎる、あいつは。
Oh, its body is way too thin, that one.

4198
03:17:43,562 --> 03:17:47,762
うわ、怖い！お前はなんだ！お前も…
Woah, scary! What are you! You too...

4199
03:17:48,262 --> 03:17:51,262
体が薄いなー。
Its body is thin...

4200
03:17:51,262 --> 03:17:53,562
薄いのは…
The thin things are...

4201
03:17:53,762 --> 03:17:55,762
ユニコーン！
Unicorn!

4202
03:17:55,762 --> 03:17:58,762
ユニコーーーン！
Unicooorn!

4203
03:17:58,762 --> 03:18:01,762
ユニコーーーン！
Unicooorn!

4204
03:18:04,762 --> 03:18:11,262
お前に会いたいんだ！どんだけここにいると思ってんだ、お前！頼むよ、ユニコーン！
I want to see you! How long do you think I've been here, man! Please, unicorn!

4205
03:18:11,762 --> 03:18:13,762
お前に吸う空気などない。
There's no air for you to breathe.

4206
03:18:13,262 --> 03:18:16,762
俺たちのチームに光を与えてくれ！
Bring light to our team!

4207
03:18:16,762 --> 03:18:19,262
ユニコーーーン！
Unicooorn!

4208
03:18:24,262 --> 03:18:30,262
やだ、イナ先輩そのノリで乗られると… 頭が… 助けてー
No, Ina-senpai, joining in with that vibe makes my head... Save meee!

4209
03:18:31,262 --> 03:18:32,762
おかしくなっちまったよ、みんな。
Everyone's gone crazy.

4210
03:18:32,762 --> 03:18:35,262
みんな壊れちゃったんだ。
Everyone just broke.

4211
03:18:35,562 --> 03:18:37,762
ありがとう、ありがとう
Thank you, thank you.

4212
03:18:43,762 --> 03:18:48,262
昨日のティラノの集会場あたり集計、見てみるか、もう一回。
Should I go check around yesterday's Rex gathering spot one more time?

4213
03:18:48,762 --> 03:18:51,762
本当にね。もういなかったらもう…
Seriously. If there are none left, then...

4214
03:18:52,262 --> 03:18:54,762
いない。
None.

4215
03:18:56,262 --> 03:19:03,262
でもそれか、ちょっとガチ究極、もう向こうの部隊が帰ってきたら、とりあえず捕まえたティラノを殺す？
Or, as an ultimate measure, once the other squad gets back, should we just kill the Rexes they caught?

4216
03:19:03,262 --> 03:19:05,762
1体だけじゃ意味ないだろう！
Just one won't make a difference!

4217
03:19:06,262 --> 03:19:12,262
え、でも10体ですよね？最悪数合わせには… ならないか…
Wait, but isn't it 10? At worst, to match the count... nevermind, that won't work...

4218
03:19:15,262 --> 03:19:17,262
麻酔薬…
Narcotics...

4219
03:19:20,762 --> 03:19:24,762
集会場にもいたはずなんだよな、ティラノ…
There should have been some at the gathering spot too, the Rexes...

4220
03:19:26,262 --> 03:19:33,262
ねー。なんかでも集会場の近くに拠点あるから、その拠点周りの人が結構狩っちゃったのかもね
Right? But there's a base near the gathering spot, so maybe people around there hunted them all.

4221
03:19:33,262 --> 03:19:35,262
あー、可能性は…
Ah, the possibility...

4222
03:19:35,262 --> 03:19:37,762
もう狩られ済み、すべて
Already all hunted down.

4223
03:19:42,262 --> 03:19:44,762
でもやれることはやっている、我々も
Still, we're doing what we can.

4224
03:19:44,762 --> 03:19:45,762
ねー
Yeah.

4225
03:19:45,762 --> 03:19:48,762
アスレチック行っちゃっても良さそうだけどなー
It feels like we could just go do the obstacle course though~

4226
03:19:48,762 --> 03:19:53,762
まあ半ぐらいになってちょっとあんまり見つかんなかったら、ござるちょっとアスレ行ってこようかな
Well, if it gets to around half past and we still haven't found much, I might go try the obstacle course.

4227
03:19:53,762 --> 03:19:57,262
I know, farm 100 berries at a time.

4228
03:19:57,262 --> 03:19:59,262
But... which dino?

4229
03:20:01,262 --> 03:20:02,762
いますかー？
Are you here?

4230
03:20:02,762 --> 03:20:04,762
Dinosaur, dinosaur~

4231
03:20:05,583 --> 03:20:06,883
もう、お前は！
Jeez, come on!

4232
03:20:06,883 --> 03:20:09,683
え？誰になんか引っかかってる？
Huh? Is it caught on someone?

4233
03:20:11,783 --> 03:20:15,583
てめぇ！面の皮が薄いんじゃねえかよ！
You jerk! Why are you so thin-skinned?!

4234
03:20:17,083 --> 03:20:18,383
違いましたか？
Was I wrong?

4235
03:20:18,483 --> 03:20:21,583
ああ！なんかクマが...誰の？
Ah! A bear is... Whose is it?

4236
03:20:22,083 --> 03:20:24,483
ちょっと皮が薄すぎるんだんだ！
Its skin is just way too thin!

4237
03:20:24,783 --> 03:20:27,683
いやー！逃げろんだよ！
Nooo! Run away!

4238
03:20:28,183 --> 03:20:30,483
あああー！
Ahhh!

4239
03:20:31,083 --> 03:20:33,583
訪問の叫び声のとこだけ必死なんだよな。
The screams are the only desperate part of her.

4240
03:20:33,583 --> 03:20:37,183
お前も皮薄いし、皮薄すぎやろみんな！
You're thin-skinned too! Why's everyone so thin-skinned?!

4241
03:20:37,583 --> 03:20:39,683
いやー！
Nooo!

4242
03:20:39,883 --> 03:20:42,183
今草原で暴れてる。
It's running wild in the plains right now.

4243
03:20:43,283 --> 03:20:45,483
草原で暴れてる。
Running wild in the plains.

4244
03:20:59,483 --> 03:21:02,383
この辺に馬はいなかったか？昨日の夜邪魔してきてた...
Wasn't there a horse around here? It was getting in the way last night...

4245
03:21:02,383 --> 03:21:03,483
いた！
There it is!

4246
03:21:03,483 --> 03:21:05,583
痛たたたた...
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

4247
03:21:06,883 --> 03:21:08,683
イナもチイかわ好き？
Ina, do you like Chiikawa too?

4248
03:21:08,783 --> 03:21:10,083
好きです。
I like it.

4249
03:21:10,583 --> 03:21:12,483
お、誰が好きなの？推しなんだ？
Oh, who do you like? Who's your favorite?

4250
03:21:12,583 --> 03:21:15,283
ああ、ちいかわとハチワレかな。
Ah, Chiikawa and Hachiware, I guess.

4251
03:21:15,683 --> 03:21:18,183
おお、王道コンビ。
Ooh, the classic duo.

4252
03:21:19,483 --> 03:21:20,783
いいですね。
They're great.

4253
03:21:20,883 --> 03:21:24,683
ちいかわ見直してるわ、今。めっちゃ、なんか可愛いわ。
I'm rewatching Chiikawa right now. It's just so cute.

4254
03:21:24,983 --> 03:21:27,183
お、見直しているんですね。
Oh, you're rewatching it?

4255
03:21:27,983 --> 03:21:29,383
ほっこりする。
It's heartwarming.

4256
03:21:29,683 --> 03:21:33,583
ああ、ほっこりしてるんですか？じゃあ...え、一回全部見たんですか？
Ah, it's heartwarming? Well... wait, did you watch all of it once?

4257
03:21:34,583 --> 03:21:38,183
いや、見てない。途中でね、やめ...やめて。
No, I didn't. I quit... quit halfway through.

4258
03:21:38,783 --> 03:21:40,583
あ、なるほど。ああ、じゃあまだ全然...
Ah, I see. Ah, so you're still...

4259
03:21:41,483 --> 03:21:47,783
きっと可愛い...可愛いちいかわを見れて、「あ、ちいかわって可愛いな」を楽しめているタイミングですね。
...definitely at the point where you're watching cute Chiikawa and enjoying how cute it is.

4260
03:21:47,883 --> 03:21:48,983
うん。
Yeah.

4261
03:21:50,583 --> 03:21:56,783
ちいかわに...ちいかわ見ててイライラする人は、多分ストレス溜まってるみたいなやつを言ってた。
Someone said that people who get annoyed watching Chiikawa are probably just stressed out.

4262
03:21:57,583 --> 03:21:59,383
ストレス溜まってるとやばい。
If stress builds up, that's bad.

4263
03:21:59,683 --> 03:22:04,383
そう、ちいかわ見て、なんかイライラしてる人はストレス溜まってるらしい。
Yeah, apparently if you get irritated watching Chiikawa, you're stressed.

4264
03:22:06,883 --> 03:22:13,283
「うわ、うわ、うわー」みたいな感じになってるやつ見て、「こいつ、もっとちゃんとしやがって」とか思ってた。確かにそれは溜まってそうだな。
Watching it go "Wah, wah, wah," I used to think, "Get your act together!" That definitely felt like stress.

4265
03:22:17,983 --> 03:22:19,383
これで、着た。
There, I put it on.

4266
03:22:22,083 --> 03:22:23,583
ちいかわな...
Chiikawa, huh...

4267
03:22:24,183 --> 03:22:27,983
可愛いだけじゃ...いられなくなっちゃったよ。
It couldn't just stay cute anymore.

4268
03:22:28,683 --> 03:22:34,583
ちなみに昔マジでちいかわにイライラしてた。「何なんだよ、お前「わぁ」しか言わないで、何なんだ」って。
By the way, I used to get seriously annoyed at Chiikawa. Like, "What's with you? All you say is 'Wah!' What's your problem?!"

4269
03:22:35,083 --> 03:22:37,183
「何なんだ」ってだけど...
Like "what's with you," but...

4270
03:22:37,583 --> 03:22:41,483
映画見てから...映画見て、その考察を見てから...
After watching the movie... watching the movie and reading the theories about it...

4271
03:22:42,383 --> 03:22:44,683
ちいかわも可愛いやって。
...I realized Chiikawa is cute too.

4272
03:22:44,783 --> 03:22:46,783
色々考えてるやん、こいつみたいな。
Like, "Look at him, actually thinking things through!"

4273
03:22:46,783 --> 03:22:52,083
そう、「こいつはこういう性格なんだな」って思って、なんか可愛く見えるようになって、穏やかに見れるようになっている。
Yeah, thinking "So that's just his personality," made him look cute to me, and now I can watch peacefully.

4274
03:22:52,383 --> 03:22:54,783
穏やかな気持ちで...ああ、よかった。
With a peaceful mindset... Ah, that's good.

4275
03:22:56,583 --> 03:23:01,583
よかった。マジで穏やかな気持ちで見れなかったらどうしようかと思いました。
Good. I was seriously wondering what to do if you couldn't watch it peacefully.

4276
03:23:01,983 --> 03:23:04,583
大丈夫、穏やかになったから。
Don't worry, I'm peaceful now.

4277
03:23:04,783 --> 03:23:07,283
で、僕が穏やかに見れてない時は...
And when I couldn't watch it peacefully...

4278
03:23:07,383 --> 03:23:08,183
うん。
Yeah.

4279
03:23:08,783 --> 03:23:10,483
多分あれだったんだろうね。
...I guess it was just that.

4280
03:23:10,683 --> 03:23:11,883
疲れてたんだろうね。
I was probably just tired.

4281
03:23:12,083 --> 03:23:13,883
多分疲れてたんですよ。
You were probably just tired.

4282
03:23:14,683 --> 03:23:16,183
あ、もう...
Ah, jeez...

4283
03:23:17,083 --> 03:23:21,583
なんか、パキ...放置された恐竜を発見。
Found an abandoned... dinosaur.

4284
03:23:26,983 --> 03:23:29,483
うーん、マジでいないな。
Hmm, there really isn't any.

4285
03:23:29,783 --> 03:23:31,083
肉いっぱいあった。
There's plenty of meat.

4286
03:23:31,083 --> 03:23:32,683
馬探し行くか。
Shall we go look for horses?

4287
03:23:34,383 --> 03:23:37,583
てか、めっちゃ真っ黒な馬はいるのにな。
Though there is a pitch-black horse over there.

4288
03:23:44,783 --> 03:23:46,083
お、え...
Oh, uh...

4289
03:23:47,783 --> 03:23:49,683
ポチポチ押さないかんか。
Do I have to click through one by one?

4290
03:23:49,783 --> 03:23:50,783
ふぅい。
Whew.

4291
03:23:50,983 --> 03:23:52,783
その一言だけで泣ける。
I could cry just from that one line.

4292
03:23:52,883 --> 03:23:53,783
笑うわ。
It's hilarious.

4293
03:23:53,883 --> 03:23:57,783
大丈夫だよ、あとは。もうみんな落ち着いてるよ。
It'll be fine now. Everyone's calmed down already.

4294
03:23:58,783 --> 03:24:02,083
うん、クマ。くそっ！いないのか。
Yeah, a bear. Shoot! None here?

4295
03:24:06,083 --> 03:24:09,883
馬の色塗りたくって白にしてやろうかな。
Maybe I should just paint the horse all white.

4296
03:24:09,883 --> 03:24:11,083
え？
Eh?

4297
03:24:11,583 --> 03:24:14,083
で、ユニコーンって名前つけたるか。
And name it Unicorn.

4298
03:24:15,683 --> 03:24:17,983
「君は今日からユニコーンだ」。
"Starting today, you're a unicorn."

4299
03:24:18,083 --> 03:24:21,583
そう、「君、お前はユニコーン、お前はユニコーン」つって。
Yeah, telling it, "You're a unicorn, you're a unicorn."

4300
03:24:21,683 --> 03:24:23,183
刷り込みね。刷り込みをすることによって...
Imprinting, right? By imprinting it...

4301
03:24:23,283 --> 03:24:24,583
刷り込みしようかな。
Maybe I'll imprint it.

4302
03:24:25,683 --> 03:24:27,783
まるで本物の...
...so that it feels just like...

4303
03:24:28,283 --> 03:24:30,683
がいるかのような。
...a real one is there.

4304
03:24:31,283 --> 03:24:32,483
そう。
Exactly.

4305
03:24:33,783 --> 03:24:36,783
ここら辺そうだけどな。どうなんだろう。
Usually around here, but... I wonder.

4306
03:24:36,883 --> 03:24:39,283
なんか羊多すぎじゃん。
There are way too many sheep.

4307
03:24:46,583 --> 03:24:48,483
うーん、戻るか。
Hmm, guess I'll head back.

4308
03:24:48,983 --> 03:24:51,183
うわ、邪魔ぁ！
Whoa, out of the way!

4309
03:24:55,583 --> 03:24:58,383
いや、ちょこちょこ湧いてるんだけどな。
Man, they are spawning here and there, though.

4310
03:24:58,783 --> 03:25:00,483
あと3体か、これも。
3 more left for this, too?

4311
03:25:00,683 --> 03:25:02,983
Yeah, get him, SCARY!

4312
03:25:07,804 --> 03:25:08,804
ん？
Hm?

4313
03:25:10,504 --> 03:25:14,304
これは光に紛れてないユニコーン
This unicorn isn't blending into the light.

4314
03:25:15,304 --> 03:25:17,104
なんかこの下にいない？
Wait, isn't there something down here?

4315
03:25:17,404 --> 03:25:21,604
お前も顔薄いじゃねえかよー！
You've got a pale face too, damn it!

4316
03:25:22,104 --> 03:25:26,804
どんだけ顔薄いんだよお前たち！最近薄顔が流行っとるんか？
How pale are all your faces?! Is having a pale face trending lately?

4317
03:25:30,804 --> 03:25:33,804
修理できないのか？クロスボウって修理できないのか？
I can't repair it? Crossbows can't be repaired?

4318
03:25:34,104 --> 03:25:36,304
あ、作業台の中で！
Ah, in the smithy!

4319
03:25:36,404 --> 03:25:38,204
作業台の中です
In the smithy.

4320
03:25:38,304 --> 03:25:39,804
わかりました！
Got it!

4321
03:25:41,804 --> 03:25:47,804
いやー、なんかちょこちょこ粘ってるけど、マジでいないなあ
Man, I've been hanging around looking, but there really aren't any.

4322
03:25:48,304 --> 03:25:54,304
なんか起きてくれよーって思って回って人参も取ったのに
I ran around gathering carrots hoping one would wake up...

4323
03:25:56,804 --> 03:25:58,504
うわー！
Whoa!

4324
03:25:59,404 --> 03:26:01,204
The King...

4325
03:26:01,304 --> 03:26:03,304
フブキ先輩、大丈夫かな？
I wonder if Fubuki-senpai is okay?

4326
03:26:04,804 --> 03:26:09,304
おい、ティラノじゃない？あ、ティラノだよね？これティラノな気がしてます！
Hey, isn't that a Rex? Ah, that's a Rex, right? I feel like that's a Rex!

4327
03:26:09,704 --> 03:26:11,304
ティラノいた？
Was there a Rex?

4328
03:26:11,404 --> 03:26:18,304
え、待って！ブロントに殺され...てめえ！よくも火つけ...お前たちー！
Wait, what?! Killed by a bronto?! You bastard! How dare you set fire to... You guys!

4329
03:26:18,604 --> 03:26:20,304
今、クソ気持ち悪い虫が目の前にいます
There's an utterly disgusting bug right in front of me.

4330
03:26:20,604 --> 03:26:24,804
本当に許しませんよ、本当にー！あんた達！
I really won't forgive you, seriously! You guys!

4331
03:26:25,304 --> 03:26:26,804
飛んでるどこだ？
Where is Tonderu?

4332
03:26:27,804 --> 03:26:33,304
許さないよ、本当にさあ！人が体力を回復してる間に、なんてことしてくれますの本当！
I won't forgive this, seriously! While I was recovering stamina, how could you do something like this?!

4333
03:26:33,604 --> 03:26:35,604
おら！てめえ！
Take that! You bastard!

4334
03:26:40,304 --> 03:26:42,304
飛んでるー
Tonderu...

4335
03:26:43,604 --> 03:26:44,804
よし
Alright.

4336
03:26:49,604 --> 03:26:53,604
いって、今めっちゃ体力回復なう
Ouch, currently recovering my stamina right now.

4337
03:26:56,804 --> 03:27:01,804
あのボロボロブロント、お前てめえだよ、てめえ！絶対やってやるからな！
That beat-up bronto, you, yeah you, bastard! I'm definitely taking you down!

4338
03:27:06,604 --> 03:27:08,804
おし、おめえだ、おめえ！
Alright, you're the one!

4339
03:27:16,804 --> 03:27:19,804
いろはもう荒れてきましたねー
Iroha is really getting rowdy, huh?

4340
03:27:19,804 --> 03:27:26,804
ゆ、許せねえ！さっきからこいつに邪魔をされ...うわー！こいつぇ！
Un-unforgivable! Getting messed with by this guy non-stop... Whoa! This guy!

4341
03:27:29,804 --> 03:27:32,304
待つが良い、此方の呪いを
Just wait and face my curse!

4342
03:27:34,304 --> 03:27:38,804
いろはさん、30分になりました。どうしますか？
Iroha-san, it's been 30 minutes. What should we do?

4343
03:27:38,804 --> 03:27:42,304
あ、行きますか！じゃあいろはが行くか
Ah, shall we go? Then Iroha will go.

4344
03:27:42,804 --> 03:27:44,804
行っちゃった
She left.

4345
03:27:45,304 --> 03:27:51,804
なんか小屋のとこ今一匹ティラノいて、おっ、おっ！もしかしたら見つけられるかもかワンチャン
There's one Rex by the hut right now, and oh, oh! Maybe there's a chance we can find it.

4346
03:27:53,804 --> 03:27:57,804
じゃあ、テレポーター遠いんでござるが...
Well, the teleporter is far away, but...

4347
03:27:57,804 --> 03:28:01,804
じゃあ、行こうかな。ちょ、頑張って
Well, maybe I'll go. Hang in there.

4348
03:28:02,804 --> 03:28:07,804
なんかちょうどブロント、あと一匹倒したら1ポイントもらえるんで、やっちゃおうかな
Since defeating one more bronto gives 1 point, maybe I'll take it out.

4349
03:28:08,304 --> 03:28:13,304
オッケーオッケー。やべ、谷底に落とされていくー
Okay, okay. Oh crap, I'm getting knocked down to the bottom of the valley!

4350
03:28:13,304 --> 03:28:15,304
え、これって...
Wait, is this...

4351
03:28:18,304 --> 03:28:22,304
キラー？ Not tranq? Not tranq?
Killer? Not tranq? Not tranq?

4352
03:28:22,804 --> 03:28:29,804
ち、ち、ち、ち、ここでワープってできなかったっけ？うーん、できた気がしたんだけど、うーん、できなかったっけ？
Wait, wait, wait, couldn't we warp from here? Hmm, I thought we could... Hmm, couldn't we?

4353
03:28:30,804 --> 03:28:36,804
おし、もう一回行くか！あいつ！おめえよ、絶対に許さない！
Alright, let's go one more time! That guy! You, I'll never forgive you!

4354
03:28:37,304 --> 03:28:39,804
おっ、できなかった
Oh, didn't work.

4355
03:28:40,304 --> 03:28:41,804
あ、これじゃない
Ah, not this.

4356
03:28:42,804 --> 03:28:46,304
え、もう1時間？もう1時間？！えぐ！
Eh, already an hour? An hour already?! That's insane!

4357
03:28:46,804 --> 03:28:49,804
ちょっと待って、ワープした先が...
Wait a second, the place I warped to is...

4358
03:28:50,804 --> 03:28:51,804
See...

4359
03:28:53,304 --> 03:28:58,804
やばい、やばい、やばい！
Oh crap, oh crap, crap!

4360
03:28:59,304 --> 03:29:06,804
お前ブロント、下に行きやがったお前！行くな！行くなよ！でかいとこ苦手なんだから、こっちは！
You bronto, you went down below, damn it! Don't go! Don't you go! I'm not good with huge ones!

4361
03:29:09,804 --> 03:29:11,804
おら！うっ！
Take that! Ugh!

4362
03:29:11,804 --> 03:29:13,804
なんかユタラプトル倒した！
I somehow defeated a Utahraptor!

4363
03:29:13,804 --> 03:29:14,804
いける？
Can you do it?

4364
03:29:14,804 --> 03:29:16,304
なんで？
Why?

4365
03:29:16,804 --> 03:29:17,804
やれる
We can do it.

4366
03:29:17,804 --> 03:29:22,804
なんで、なんで、なんでー！
Why, why, whhyyyy?!

4367
03:29:22,804 --> 03:29:26,804
違う人がお亡くなり...
A different person passed away...

4368
03:29:26,804 --> 03:29:28,804
He's not doing anything.

4369
03:29:28,804 --> 03:29:32,304
1時間は確かにティラノもしんどいかもな
An hour might indeed be tough for a Rex too, huh...

4370
03:29:31,804 --> 03:29:32,804
ですよね
Indeed.

4371
03:29:32,804 --> 03:29:38,304
ねー。その場合はあれかもね、何種類かテイムみたいなやつやった方がいいかもね
Right. In that case, maybe it's better to try taming a few different types.

4372
03:29:41,304 --> 03:29:43,804
テイムわかんないな、全然
I don't understand taming at all.

4373
03:29:43,804 --> 03:29:45,804
いや、穴無いやん、一回これ
Wait, there's no hole here this time.

4374
03:29:45,804 --> 03:29:47,304
テイムどこ？
Where's the tame?

4375
03:29:47,804 --> 03:29:52,304
テイム何やったかが分かんないからむずいですよね
Since I don't know what we've tamed, it's tricky, isn't it?

4376
03:29:55,304 --> 03:30:00,304
一回帰るかじゃあ。ござるもちょっと持ってないや、クロスボウ持って
Shall I head back once then? Since Gozaru doesn't have it either, carrying a crossbow...

4377
03:30:00,804 --> 03:30:03,804
なんか城辿り着いた。何この城？
I reached some castle. What is this castle?

4378
03:30:06,925 --> 03:30:10,025
え、全然いない、ティラノ〜
There are no Rexes at all~

4379
03:30:11,925 --> 03:30:15,325
しかも何気に1時間で10体見つけるのきついかも。
Plus, finding 10 within an hour might be tough.

4380
03:30:15,325 --> 03:30:18,025
もうちょっと変えた方がいいか？
Maybe we should change the goal?

4381
03:30:18,025 --> 03:30:20,325
テイムにするか。テイム何体あと？
Switch to taming? How many left to tame?

4382
03:30:20,925 --> 03:30:22,825
テイムあと3ぐらいだから…
We have about 3 left to tame, so...

4383
03:30:22,825 --> 03:30:27,025
3かあ。何テイムしてないんだろう逆に。
3, huh. What haven't we tamed yet, then?

4384
03:30:27,025 --> 03:30:29,925
なんかめっちゃデカいやつやったんですけど、
I went after a really huge one,

4385
03:30:29,925 --> 03:30:34,625
矢が足りなくて今ちょっと矢作ってます。
but ran out of arrows, so I'm crafting some now.

4386
03:30:37,025 --> 03:30:39,825
アルゲン狩るやつも一応ある。
We also have the mission to hunt Argents.

4387
03:30:40,625 --> 03:30:41,825
なるほど。
I see.

4388
03:30:43,025 --> 03:30:45,825
でも多分アルゲンよりはブロントの方が
But Brontos might be faster

4389
03:30:45,825 --> 03:30:47,825
早いかも。
than Argents.

4390
03:30:47,825 --> 03:30:50,625
大きくて見つけやすいかつ5体なんですよね、ブロントは。
They're big and easy to spot, plus we only need 5 Brontos.

4391
03:30:50,625 --> 03:30:52,225
アルゲン15体なんですよ。
Argents need 15.

4392
03:30:52,225 --> 03:30:53,325
確かに。
That's true.

4393
03:30:53,325 --> 03:30:56,625
で、しかも飛んでるからあいつはちょっとムズい。
And since they fly, they're kind of tricky.

4394
03:31:01,625 --> 03:31:04,625
ワープしたいのにワープの場所が分かんない。
I want to warp, but I don't know where the warp point is.

4395
03:31:05,425 --> 03:31:08,325
とりあえずまた探しながら…
For now, while looking for them again...

4396
03:31:09,025 --> 03:31:10,825
ちなみに置くか。
Let me put this away just in case.

4397
03:31:13,925 --> 03:31:18,025
テイム…え、結局ドードーは誰か見つけられましたか？
Taming... Wait, in the end, did anyone find a dodo?

4398
03:31:18,025 --> 03:31:19,825
ドードーテイムした！ドードーテイムした！
I tamed a dodo! I tamed a dodo!

4399
03:31:19,825 --> 03:31:21,625
ナイス、ナイス、ナイス！
Nice, nice, nice!

4400
03:31:21,625 --> 03:31:27,525
マジでチュートリアルなのに見つけられなくて、「どこの人？」ってなってた。
Seriously, even though it's the tutorial, I couldn't find one and was like, "Where are you?!"

4401
03:31:27,825 --> 03:31:31,525
一応なんか何体かテイムしたけど名前覚えてないや。めっちゃ申し訳ない。
I tamed several creatures, but I don't remember their names. So sorry!

4402
03:31:31,525 --> 03:31:34,625
なんかリスナーさん、教えて。
Listeners, please tell me!

4403
03:31:34,825 --> 03:31:37,025
教えて〜
Tell me~

4404
03:31:38,025 --> 03:31:39,825
グリフィンいる？
Is there a Griffin?

4405
03:31:40,325 --> 03:31:41,825
グリフィンいるわ。
There is a Griffin.

4406
03:31:41,825 --> 03:31:43,625
おちっこ？
Pee-pee?

4407
03:31:45,325 --> 03:31:47,825
なんか今「おちっこ」って言わなかった？
Didn't someone just say "pee-pee"?

4408
03:31:48,825 --> 03:31:49,825
ん？
Huh?

4409
03:31:49,825 --> 03:31:51,325
こっちです。
"Over here" (kocchi).

4410
03:31:52,025 --> 03:31:53,625
え、おしり？
Wait, butt?

4411
03:31:53,625 --> 03:31:55,225
「こっち」と言いました。
I said "Over here" (kocchi)!

4412
03:31:55,225 --> 03:31:56,825
あ、「こっち」か！
Ah, "kocchi"!

4413
03:31:56,825 --> 03:31:58,825
すいません、すいません！もう耳がおか…
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! My hearing is...

4414
03:31:58,825 --> 03:32:00,325
何に聞こえてたんだよｗ
What did you hear?! lol

4415
03:32:00,325 --> 03:32:01,825
何聞こえてるんですかｗ
What are you hearing? lol

4416
03:32:01,825 --> 03:32:05,425
おし…おしっこを可愛く「おちっこ」って言ったのかと思いました。
I thought you said "pee-pee" in a cute way.

4417
03:32:05,425 --> 03:32:06,825
すいません。
I'm sorry.

4418
03:32:06,825 --> 03:32:09,625
もう耳もおかしくなっちゃってるよｗ
Your hearing is going crazy! lol

4419
03:32:10,325 --> 03:32:13,325
疲れているのよ、あなた。そう、疲れてるの。
You're tired. Yes, you're exhausted.

4420
03:32:13,325 --> 03:32:15,325
狂っているのよ。
You're losing your mind.

4421
03:32:17,625 --> 03:32:21,025
はあ、マジでテレポートの場所が分かんなすぎて。
Seriously, the teleport locations are so confusing.

4422
03:32:21,025 --> 03:32:24,325
なんかマップに記載ないから分かんなくなっちゃったんだよな。
They're not marked on the map, so I lost track.

4423
03:32:25,825 --> 03:32:29,325
いや分かる。テレポーター謎すぎるよね。
Yeah, I get it. The teleporters are way too confusing.

4424
03:32:31,325 --> 03:32:35,325
ワンチャンこれ…迷子、迷子の迷子の…
Maybe if... I'm a lost, lost child...

4425
03:32:43,025 --> 03:32:45,625
でも頑張りましたからね、ここまでね。
But we've worked really hard to get this far, right?

4426
03:32:46,325 --> 03:32:49,025
テレポーターに辿り着け…
Reach the teleporter...

4427
03:32:51,625 --> 03:32:54,825
スケドラレラレレレララ〜
Sker dra le ra re re re ra ra~

4428
03:32:55,625 --> 03:32:58,825
うーん、この辺も見たけどいなかったんだよな〜
Hmm, I looked around here too, but didn't find any~

4429
03:32:59,625 --> 03:33:02,325
はああ〜
Haaa~

4430
03:33:03,325 --> 03:33:06,025
困った。あと何がいいんだろう。
Trouble. What else would be good?

4431
03:33:06,025 --> 03:33:11,325
テイムか。パラサウロロロロみたいなやつとかだったらできるのかな、簡単に。
Taming? Maybe something like a Parasaur-ro-ro-ro would be easy.

4432
03:33:18,625 --> 03:33:21,325
あれ、集会場だの？
Wait, is this the gathering area?

4433
03:33:21,825 --> 03:33:24,025
あ、棒2個。
Ah, 2 sticks.

4434
03:33:25,025 --> 03:33:28,825
え、ワンチャンこれ…レース会場辿って行ったら
Wait, maybe if... following the race venue track

4435
03:33:28,825 --> 03:33:32,325
帰れる説。
leads back.

4436
03:33:32,825 --> 03:33:35,325
あ、何だこれ。
Ah, what's this?

4437
03:33:35,825 --> 03:33:38,325
そうだよね、これコース辿ればワンチャン集会場よな。
Right? If I follow this course, it might lead to the gathering hall.

4438
03:33:38,325 --> 03:33:40,825
それで帰ればいいか。
Maybe I should head back that way.

4439
03:33:40,825 --> 03:33:43,825
ござる帰る目途立ちました。なんと！やったぜ！
Gozaru has figured out a way back! Guess what! We did it!

4440
03:33:43,825 --> 03:33:45,225
よかった！
Thank goodness!

4441
03:33:45,225 --> 03:33:48,825
やったけど、あれ、あ、道を見失っていた。危ない危ない。
Nice! But wait, ah, I lost sight of the road. Close one!

4442
03:33:48,825 --> 03:33:52,625
自分も見失う。木乃華サクヤ…
Losing myself too. Konohana Sakuya...

4443
03:33:52,825 --> 03:33:54,825
バレる。うっ。
I'll be exposed. Ugh.

4444
03:33:56,325 --> 03:34:02,625
えっと、どこにあるんだっけ？あの…アスレ？アスレチック。
Um, where was it again? That... obstacle? Athletic course.

4445
03:34:03,025 --> 03:34:04,825
集会場か…
The gathering hall...

4446
03:34:04,825 --> 03:34:08,825
集会場の出口の中の1つ？
One of the exits at the gathering hall?

4447
03:34:08,825 --> 03:34:10,825
OK、ありがとう！
OK, thank you!

4448
03:34:10,825 --> 03:34:14,825
なんか昨日準備中とか書いてあった。
It said "Under Preparation" or something yesterday.

4449
03:34:14,825 --> 03:34:19,825
あ〜〜！あれね！ありがとお、ありがとお、ありがたあ〜〜
Aah~! That one! Thank you, thank you, thank youuu~~

4450
03:34:22,825 --> 03:34:24,825
これか？
Is it this?

4451
03:34:27,325 --> 03:34:30,825
ん、これだ。これを辿れば帰れる。
Yeah, this is it. If I follow this, I can get back.

4452
03:34:32,825 --> 03:34:35,825
え、なんか必要ななんかあるのかな？
Wait, is there anything required for it?

4453
03:34:36,825 --> 03:34:44,825
誰か〜森に〜いませんか〜あの〜
Is anyone~ in the forest~ um~

4454
03:34:44,825 --> 03:34:49,025
本当に〜ティラノいませんか〜
Are there really no Rexes around~?

4455
03:34:49,025 --> 03:34:52,625
ついでに居たっていいんだよ〜
You're welcome to be here on the way~

4456
03:34:52,625 --> 03:34:56,625
帰り際居たっていいんだよ〜
You're welcome to show up on my way back~

4457
03:34:56,625 --> 03:34:59,825
いないよ〜
But you're not here~

4458
03:35:02,825 --> 03:35:04,825
そして…
And then...

4459
03:35:04,846 --> 03:35:06,146
あれ？誰もいなくなった。
Huh? Everyone's gone.

4460
03:35:06,346 --> 03:35:07,346
いない。
Nobody's here.

4461
03:35:08,346 --> 03:35:15,646
なんか…なんかアスレチックに1時間かかるとかいう話がなんか隣から聞こえてくるんだけど、死にそうじゃない、死ぬんだけど。
I'm hearing talk from next door about an obstacle course taking an hour... It's not that I'm about to die, I AM dying.

4462
03:35:16,046 --> 03:35:17,146
きゃ、キャラコ…
C-Characo...

4463
03:35:17,146 --> 03:35:18,646
い、1時間？！
O-One hour?!

4464
03:35:18,646 --> 03:35:22,846
でも行ける！昨日、馬を制したトワ様なら行ける！
But you can do it! Towa-sama, who conquered the horse yesterday, can do it!

4465
03:35:22,846 --> 03:35:23,846
あ、そうですね。
Ah, that's right.

4466
03:35:24,046 --> 03:35:24,646
うん。
Yeah.

4467
03:35:24,846 --> 03:35:27,846
馬を制した？馬…馬？
Conquered a horse? Horse... horse?

4468
03:35:28,646 --> 03:35:31,346
馬、馬レース。レース。
Horse, a horse race. Race.

4469
03:35:32,346 --> 03:35:34,646
バカタレじゃないですか、それ。
Isn't that Bakatare?

4470
03:35:34,846 --> 03:35:35,846
そうそう。
Exactly.

4471
03:35:36,646 --> 03:35:39,346
馬を制したトワ様なら行けますよ。
If it's Towa-sama who conquered the horse, you can do it.

4472
03:35:39,846 --> 03:35:43,346
トワ様を信じろ。私たちを信じてください。
Believe in Towa-sama. Please believe in us.

4473
03:35:43,846 --> 03:35:44,846
そう。
That's right.

4474
03:35:44,846 --> 03:35:47,846
「お前を信じる俺たちを信じろ」キタ！
"Believe in the us that believes in you", it's here!

4475
03:35:47,846 --> 03:35:49,646
ヤバい！
Awesome!

4476
03:35:50,846 --> 03:35:56,346
まさかイナ先輩からそんな構文が出てくるなんて！
To think that meme phrase would come from Ina-senpai!

4477
03:35:57,846 --> 03:36:00,846
お前を信じる俺たちを信じろ。
Believe in the us that believes in you.

4478
03:36:05,346 --> 03:36:07,846
麻酔矢が全然ないんだよなぁ、麻酔矢…
I don't have any tranq arrows at all... Tranq arrows...

4479
03:36:07,846 --> 03:36:09,346
今作ってまーす！
I'm crafting them now~!

4480
03:36:09,346 --> 03:36:11,346
はい！ありがとうございます！
Okay! Thank you very much!

4481
03:36:13,346 --> 03:36:19,046
100個あったら、あれ行けるかな？もう回復したかも。
If I have 100, wonder if I can go for that? Maybe it already recovered.

4482
03:36:21,046 --> 03:36:25,346
はぁ〜、じゃあもう一回チャレンジ…行きます！
Phew~ Alright, let's challenge it once more... Here I go!

4483
03:36:25,646 --> 03:36:26,846
お願いしまーす！
Good luck!

4484
03:36:26,846 --> 03:36:28,846
また歩っかん なぁ…
Will it walk again, I wonder...

4485
03:36:31,846 --> 03:36:34,846
え、なんかティラノ…
Wait, is that a Rex...

4486
03:36:36,346 --> 03:36:37,846
来てません？
coming?

4487
03:36:38,346 --> 03:36:39,346
居る？
It's there?

4488
03:36:39,846 --> 03:36:42,846
ちょっと外にティラノじゃないですか？
Wait, isn't that a Rex outside?

4489
03:36:42,846 --> 03:36:45,846
ティ、ティラノ、ティラノ、ティラノ！来てないですか？
R-Rex, Rex, Rex! Isn't it coming?

4490
03:36:46,346 --> 03:36:50,846
やばい、目ぇ合ってきた。なんとなく殺そう、ムカつくから。
Oh crap, we made eye contact. I'm just gonna kill it, it's annoying me.

4491
03:36:50,846 --> 03:36:52,846
なんか…八つ当たりじゃん！
That's... that's just venting your anger!

4492
03:36:52,846 --> 03:36:55,346
合ってる、BGM合ってる。
It fits, the BGM fits.

4493
03:36:55,346 --> 03:36:59,646
え、待って。これティラノ？いやこれ顔薄くね？お前顔薄くない？
Wait, is this a Rex? No, isn't its face plain? Isn't your face plain?

4494
03:36:59,646 --> 03:37:00,846
ティラノ？
Rex?

4495
03:37:01,046 --> 03:37:04,646
待って、ぎゃぎゃぎゃぎゃぎゃ！ちょちょちょちょちょ！
Wait, gyagyagyagyagya! Whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa!

4496
03:37:09,346 --> 03:37:13,346
うちの適当に捕まえたプテラいじめるのやめてくれる？
Could you stop bullying the Pteranodon I casually tamed?

4497
03:37:15,346 --> 03:37:18,846
おめぇ顔薄いじゃねぇかよぉぉ！
Your face is plain as hell!

4498
03:37:18,846 --> 03:37:22,646
そいつ拠点周りで無視もできないし、この…
I can't even ignore it around the base, you...

4499
03:37:26,346 --> 03:37:28,346
ティラノ、い、行けます？
Can you h-handle the Rex?

4500
03:37:28,346 --> 03:37:32,346
あ、行けると思う多分。このプテラがね、あの…
Ah, I think I can, probably. This Pteranodon, you know, um...

4501
03:37:32,346 --> 03:37:33,846
プテラ〜〜！
Pteraaa~~!

4502
03:37:33,846 --> 03:37:36,846
オラ、てめぇ！どっか行けよ！
Hey, you! Go somewhere else!

4503
03:37:37,346 --> 03:37:39,846
お前に用はねぇんだよ！
We don't have any business with you!

4504
03:37:40,346 --> 03:37:43,846
お前に用はないんだよ！
I've got no business with you!

4505
03:37:45,346 --> 03:37:46,346
はい。
Yep.

4506
03:37:46,346 --> 03:37:51,846
いや〜〜、なんか違うやつ殺した。なんだ？
Man~~ I killed a different one somehow. What was that?

4507
03:37:57,846 --> 03:38:01,846
昨日のあれ行っかな、黒のなん、なんちゃら。
Maybe I should go for that one from yesterday, the black whatchamacallit.

4508
03:38:02,346 --> 03:38:07,346
ちょっと流石にお隣さんにも被害を被りそうだから、こいつは倒そう。
This looks like it'll cause damage to the neighbors too, so let's take this guy down.

4509
03:38:09,346 --> 03:38:13,346
あ、乗れない！ちょっと時間ロスだが…
Ah, can't mount! That's a bit of time lost, but...

4510
03:38:13,346 --> 03:38:18,346
お隣さんが…お隣さんを守ってあげよう、しゃあなし、やむなし。
The neighbors... let's protect the neighbors, guess there's no helping it.

4511
03:38:18,846 --> 03:38:24,346
あ、あ、あ、あ、あ、あ… TONDĒRU? 逝ったか？逝ったか？逝ったか？
Ah, ah, ah... TONDĒRU? Did it go down? Did it? Did it?

4512
03:38:26,846 --> 03:38:29,846
来いお前、こっち来い。
Come on you, come over here.

4513
03:38:32,346 --> 03:38:35,846
ちょ、こっち来い、イエーーイ！
Wait, come over here... YAAAY!

4514
03:38:36,346 --> 03:38:40,346
あれも顔が分厚くて…
That one also has a thick face...

4515
03:38:40,346 --> 03:38:43,346
なぁぁ！分厚くない、分厚くない！こいつは薄いんだ。
What! It's not thick, it's not thick! This one's plain.

4516
03:38:44,346 --> 03:38:48,846
なんでこんな顔の皮薄いやつらしかいねぇ…
Why are there only thin-skinned plain-faced ones around...

4517
03:38:48,846 --> 03:38:52,846
スタックしたけどやめてくんない？ちょっと待って、なんかスタックしたんだけどやめて？
It got stuck, but could you not? Wait a second, it got stuck, stop it?

4518
03:38:52,846 --> 03:38:54,846
あ〜良かった〜〜〜！
Ah~ thank goodness~~~!

4519
03:38:54,846 --> 03:38:56,346
ちょっと…
Wait...

4520
03:38:57,846 --> 03:39:01,346
あの…スタックしたんですが…
Um... it's stuck, but...

4521
03:39:01,346 --> 03:39:03,846
あ、いいよいいよ、この角度良い。
Ah, good, good, this angle is nice.

4522
03:39:09,346 --> 03:39:12,346
ほっ、この角度いいよ、この角度。
Hop, this angle is nice, this angle.

4523
03:39:12,346 --> 03:39:13,846
え、なんかあれ飛んでる？
Eh, is that thing flying?

4524
03:39:13,846 --> 03:39:17,346
なんか体痛くなってきたかも〜。
My body's starting to hurt somehow~.

4525
03:39:17,346 --> 03:39:19,346
あれは何？虫っぽいな。
What is that? Looks like a bug.

4526
03:39:19,346 --> 03:39:20,346
また体力持つ？やばそうだったな、取りに行きたい。
Will stamina hold again? Looked sketchy, I wanna go retrieve it.

4527
03:39:20,346 --> 03:39:21,846
飛んでるとこ行った？
Did it go where it's flying?

4528
03:39:21,846 --> 03:39:24,346
あ、飛んでる、あっちか。え、何？虫っぽい。
Ah, it's flying, over there? Eh, what is it? Looks like a bug.

4529
03:39:24,346 --> 03:39:28,846
やばい、飛べないからワンチャン死ぬかも、ワイバーン。あ、生きてる〜〜〜。
Oh crap, since I can't fly, might die, Wyvern... Ah, it's alive~~~.

4530
03:39:30,846 --> 03:39:32,346
Can we tame the moth?

4531
03:39:32,346 --> 03:39:35,846
生きてるんか〜〜い。
You WERE alive?!

4532
03:39:36,346 --> 03:39:38,346
How do we tame it?

4533
03:39:39,846 --> 03:39:41,346
オッケーイ！
Okay!

4534
03:39:43,846 --> 03:39:44,846
キル？
Kill?

4535
03:39:44,846 --> 03:39:46,346
うん、そうそうそう。
Yeah, right right.

4536
03:39:48,346 --> 03:39:51,846
Bola and tase fast? なるほどなるほど。
"Bola and tase fast"? I see, I see.

4537
03:39:53,846 --> 03:39:55,846
ちょっとやってみよっか。
Let's try doing that.

4538
03:39:56,346 --> 03:39:59,846
あ、TONDERU、戻ってTONDERU、どっか行… 食えお前！
Ah, TONDERU, come back TONDERU, go somewh- Eat, you!

4539
03:39:59,846 --> 03:40:01,346
TONDERU、いいから…
TONDERU, come on...

4540
03:40:02,346 --> 03:40:04,346
ボーラーって…
With a bola...

4541
03:40:07,867 --> 03:40:11,367
モリモリモリモリ...よし。
Nom nom nom nom... Alright.

4542
03:40:13,367 --> 03:40:14,867
あれか...
Is that it...?

4543
03:40:16,367 --> 03:40:18,367
これ食わして...
Feed this to it...

4544
03:40:22,167 --> 03:40:23,867
よいしょ、体が...
Oof, my body is...

4545
03:40:25,367 --> 03:40:28,367
体が水分求めてるよん。
My body is craving water.

4546
03:40:28,367 --> 03:40:29,367
え、水筒...
Wait, canteen...

4547
03:40:31,867 --> 03:40:33,867
バリバリバリバリ...よし。
Munch munch munch... Alright.

4548
03:40:35,867 --> 03:40:36,867
ん？
Hm?

4549
03:40:47,867 --> 03:40:49,367
よっこいしょ、よし。
Alley-oop, alright.

4550
03:40:57,867 --> 03:41:00,367
えい、ほっ、えい、ほっ。
Hup, hop, hup, hop.

4551
03:41:01,667 --> 03:41:03,367
モリモリモリ...
Munch munch munch...

4552
03:41:03,867 --> 03:41:05,667
戻って...
Going back...

4553
03:41:05,867 --> 03:41:08,367
テイムあと3体何がいるんだ？
What are the last 3 tames we need?

4554
03:41:08,867 --> 03:41:10,067
もう分からない。
I don't know anymore.

4555
03:41:10,067 --> 03:41:11,867
もう1つですよ、1匹。
There's only one left, one creature!

4556
03:41:11,867 --> 03:41:13,867
あ、あと1？え、すごい！
Ah, 1 left? Whoa, awesome!

4557
03:41:14,067 --> 03:41:15,667
あと1何だ...
What's the last one...

4558
03:41:15,667 --> 03:41:17,667
飛んでるー！
It's flying!

4559
03:41:17,867 --> 03:41:22,367
飛んでるー！すごい！イナ先輩がめっちゃやってくれてるー！
It's flying! Awesome! Ina-senpai is doing so much for us!

4560
03:41:24,867 --> 03:41:27,867
小春のあれがない間に...
While Koharu's thing isn't happening...

4561
03:41:36,867 --> 03:41:39,367
やば、固まった。あ、ARK落ちた。
Oh no, it froze. Ah, ARK crashed.

4562
03:41:40,867 --> 03:41:41,867
Oh my god.

4563
03:41:42,367 --> 03:41:44,367
ARK落ちまちた...
ARK crashed...

4564
03:41:44,867 --> 03:41:46,367
Oh no...

4565
03:41:46,367 --> 03:41:47,867
Oh my god...

4566
03:41:56,367 --> 03:41:57,867
あれ？
Huh?

4567
03:42:15,367 --> 03:42:21,867
落ちてしまい... 戻る日... 歩き...
Falling down... A day to return... Walking...

4568
03:42:28,867 --> 03:42:31,367
羽ばたいて飛んでった...
It flapped its wings and flew away...

4569
03:42:32,867 --> 03:42:34,867
ARKの画面消して...
Closing the ARK window...

4570
03:42:35,867 --> 03:42:37,867
ん？え、何？
Hm? Wait, what?

4571
03:42:43,867 --> 03:42:45,867
重いんだわ、ARK。
ARK is just so heavy.

4572
03:42:47,367 --> 03:42:51,867
あ、クラッシュ・オブ・クラッシュ・オブ・クラッシュかもしれない、ARKね。
Ah, it might be Crash of Crash of Crash, ARK that is.

4573
03:42:51,867 --> 03:42:53,367
寒気合い...
Brr, so chilly...

4574
03:42:55,867 --> 03:42:58,367
あ、クラッシュ・オブ・クラッシュ・オブ・クラッシュだ。
Ah, it really is Crash of Crash of Crash.

4575
03:42:58,367 --> 03:42:59,867
何だと...
What the heck...

4576
03:43:05,667 --> 03:43:07,367
はひょー。
Whew~

4577
03:43:08,867 --> 03:43:10,367
あ、こっち...
Ah, this way...

4578
03:43:10,867 --> 03:43:13,367
ま、待つ、ずずずず...
W-Wait...

4579
03:43:17,867 --> 03:43:21,367
よみがえり...ええ...で、よいしょ。
Resurrection... yeah... and, heave-ho.

4580
03:43:27,867 --> 03:43:29,367
消えた...
It disappeared...

4581
03:43:29,867 --> 03:43:32,367
やだ...戻って...
No way... Come back...

4582
03:43:35,867 --> 03:43:37,367
よいしょ。
Up we go.

4583
03:43:38,667 --> 03:43:40,367
よみがえり...
Resurrection...

4584
03:43:47,367 --> 03:43:48,867
重てえ...
It's so heavy...

4585
03:43:53,367 --> 03:43:54,867
オッケー、オッケー。
Okay, okay.

4586
03:43:58,867 --> 03:44:01,367
あー、どこ行ったのー？
Ahh, where did you go~?

4587
03:44:01,867 --> 03:44:04,867
これで行けたんだけど...
We were making good progress, but...

4588
03:44:05,667 --> 03:44:07,367
戻れました？
Were you able to get back in?

4589
03:44:07,867 --> 03:44:11,367
OBSに映らなくなったわ。うわー。
It's not showing up on OBS anymore. Ugh.

4590
03:44:15,867 --> 03:44:18,367
え、マジでどこ行った？
Wait, seriously, where did it go?

4591
03:44:20,367 --> 03:44:21,667
これで...
With this...

4592
03:44:21,667 --> 03:44:23,367
あ、来た来た来た！
Ah, it's back, it's back!

4593
03:44:24,867 --> 03:44:27,367
オッケーオッケー、直った直った。
Okay okay, it's fixed, it's fixed.

4594
03:44:29,867 --> 03:44:32,367
さあ向こうはどうかなー。
Now, how are things over there, I wonder~

4595
03:44:34,867 --> 03:44:37,367
イナ先輩どこにいるんだろう？
Where is Ina-senpai, I wonder?

4596
03:44:37,667 --> 03:44:41,867
えっと、雪の山の近くに、なんか虫をテイムしようと...
Umm, near the snowy mountain, I was trying to tame a bug...

4597
03:44:41,867 --> 03:44:46,367
...シュッてしたんですけど、ちょっと逃げて...
...and tranq'd it, but it ran away a bit...

4598
03:44:46,367 --> 03:44:49,867
...どこにいたか、見つからなくて...
...and I can't find where it went...

4599
03:44:49,867 --> 03:44:50,867
なるほど。
I see.

4600
03:44:53,867 --> 03:44:55,867
虫テイム...
Bug taming...

4601
03:44:57,867 --> 03:44:59,867
どこだろう...
Where could it be...

4602
03:45:03,367 --> 03:45:04,667
え、表...
Wait, the front...?

4603
03:45:06,188 --> 03:45:08,388
持ってくれ、俺のARK
Hold on, my ARK!

4604
03:45:08,888 --> 03:45:10,588
がんばってー
Hang in there...

4605
03:45:10,888 --> 03:45:12,888
ARK... もう...
ARK... just...

4606
03:45:12,888 --> 03:45:14,388
あと少し
a little bit more...

4607
03:45:16,588 --> 03:45:18,088
アキちゃーん
Aki-chan!

4608
03:45:19,988 --> 03:45:20,788
はい！
Yes!

4609
03:45:20,988 --> 03:45:24,888
えっーと、ちょっとラグの挙動で抜け出せなく
Um, due to some lag physics, I can't get out...

4610
03:45:24,888 --> 03:45:25,688
はい
Yes.

4611
03:45:25,788 --> 03:45:27,888
えー、助けてほしいです
Um, I'd like some help.

4612
03:45:28,088 --> 03:45:29,988
えっーと、どのような状態になってますか？
Um, what kind of situation are you in?

4613
03:45:30,188 --> 03:45:32,388
えっーと、マグマに落ちてるんですけど
Um, I fell into the magma, but...

4614
03:45:32,388 --> 03:45:32,988
はい
Yeah.

4615
03:45:32,988 --> 03:45:35,188
多分落ち方が悪すぎて
I guess the way I fell was so bad

4616
03:45:35,188 --> 03:45:38,288
壁に挟まれた感じになっちゃってて左右ボタン効かなくて
that I got wedged into the wall, and the left/right buttons don't work.

4617
03:45:38,888 --> 03:45:39,788
なるほど
I see.

4618
03:45:39,788 --> 03:45:40,388
はい
Yes.

4619
03:45:40,688 --> 03:45:42,788
えっーと、ちょっと確認しますので少々お待ちください
Um, I'll go check, so please wait a moment.

4620
03:45:42,788 --> 03:45:43,988
はい、お願いします
Okay, thank you.

4621
03:45:46,788 --> 03:45:48,588
え、麻酔...
Eh, tranquilizer...

4622
03:45:48,688 --> 03:45:49,588
どこ？
Where?

4623
03:45:50,188 --> 03:45:52,188
ベリー無かったっけ？
Didn't we have berries?

4624
03:45:52,188 --> 03:45:52,888
え？
Huh?

4625
03:45:54,688 --> 03:45:56,088
無いよね？
We don't, right?

4626
03:45:58,188 --> 03:45:58,888
え？
Huh?

4627
03:46:00,588 --> 03:46:02,288
ベリー無いの？
There are no berries?

4628
03:46:05,488 --> 03:46:07,188
ちょっと作っといて...
I'll make some...

4629
03:46:08,088 --> 03:46:09,588
さっき行ったよね？
We went earlier, right?

4630
03:46:10,588 --> 03:46:11,388
あら
Oh.

4631
03:46:11,488 --> 03:46:12,588
こんにちはー
Hello!

4632
03:46:12,888 --> 03:46:13,788
こっちはー
Hello!

4633
03:46:13,788 --> 03:46:14,888
こんにちはー
Hello!

4634
03:46:14,888 --> 03:46:17,188
ビビは離脱しました
Bibi has retired.

4635
03:46:17,188 --> 03:46:18,888
足を引っ張るだけでした
I was just holding everyone back.

4636
03:46:18,888 --> 03:46:19,888
いやいやいや
No, no, no!

4637
03:46:19,888 --> 03:46:22,888
ドンマイ！全然全然！ナイストライ！ナイストライ！
Don't worry! Not at all! Nice try, nice try!

4638
03:46:22,888 --> 03:46:24,288
ありがとうございますー
Thank you so much.

4639
03:46:24,288 --> 03:46:25,888
どんな感じでした？
How was it?

4640
03:46:25,888 --> 03:46:26,888
やば
Terrible...

4641
03:46:27,088 --> 03:46:31,388
えっと、今途中で、で、フブさんと
Um, right now they're on their way, and Fubu-san and

4642
03:46:31,388 --> 03:46:34,688
ボタン先輩で向かってて、今ボタン先輩がちょっとスタック？
Botan-senpai were heading there, and now Botan-senpai is stuck?

4643
03:46:34,888 --> 03:46:35,688
はいはい
Right, right.

4644
03:46:35,888 --> 03:46:39,888
みたいなんでちょっとアキロゼ先輩に対応していただいて、みたいな
So they're having Akirose-senpai handle it, or something like that.

4645
03:46:40,188 --> 03:46:42,288
なるほど。増援必要そうだった？
I see. Did it seem like they need reinforcements?

4646
03:46:42,688 --> 03:46:47,088
いや、もう何だったら1人の方が速いみたいな感じで
No, if anything, it felt like it'd be faster solo...

4647
03:46:47,188 --> 03:46:48,588
あー、まぁそうだよね
Ah, well, that makes sense.

4648
03:46:48,188 --> 03:46:51,188
経験のために連れてってくださってたみたいです
It seems they just took me along for the experience.

4649
03:46:51,688 --> 03:46:53,888
なるほどなるほど、了解了解。そしたらー
I see, I see. Roger that. In that case...

4650
03:46:53,888 --> 03:46:54,888
うん
Yeah.

4651
03:46:54,788 --> 03:46:56,188
えっーとねー
Um...

4652
03:46:56,888 --> 03:47:01,388
20種テイムがあと1匹なんで
We only need one more creature for the 20-species tame,

4653
03:46:59,488 --> 03:47:00,188
はい
Yes.

4654
03:47:01,888 --> 03:47:02,488
うんうんうん
Mm-hmm mm-hmm.

4655
03:47:02,288 --> 03:47:04,488
それをやりたい！
so I want to do that!

4656
03:47:02,688 --> 03:47:04,088
お、めっちゃいい！めっちゃいい！
Oh, awesome! Awesome!

4657
03:47:05,888 --> 03:47:08,388
めっちゃいいじゃないですかー！
Isn't that great!

4658
03:47:09,088 --> 03:47:09,988
もっと
More...

4659
03:47:10,988 --> 03:47:13,388
どこ行った？あいつー
Where did that guy go?

4660
03:47:13,688 --> 03:47:18,288
ビビちゃん、なんかギリースーツとかも、ビビ全ロスした
Bibi went and lost everything, even the ghillie suit and all...

4661
03:47:19,188 --> 03:47:21,288
指編まないとな
Gotta do some finger weaving...

4662
03:47:21,888 --> 03:47:25,888
そしたらどうしたらいいんだろう、ユニコーンじゃなくてー
Then what should we do? Instead of a unicorn...

4663
03:47:26,288 --> 03:47:28,888
何取りに行きますか？装備ちょっと揃えたいな
What should we go get? I kinda want to get geared up.

4664
03:47:29,088 --> 03:47:32,888
テイムね、近いとこでなんかテイムしたいよねー
Taming, yeah, I'd like to tame something nearby.

4665
03:47:32,888 --> 03:47:35,688
あと1匹だもんなー
It's just one more, after all.

4666
03:47:36,288 --> 03:47:38,888
いやー、どこ行ったー！
Geez, where did it go?!

4667
03:47:39,288 --> 03:47:40,688
あと30分
30 minutes left.

4668
03:47:46,088 --> 03:47:50,888
ま、その辺にある、アルゲンとか全然乗ってもらってー
Well, you can totally ride an Argent around here or whatever—

4669
03:47:50,888 --> 03:47:51,888
えー
Eh...

4670
03:47:51,888 --> 03:47:54,888
はい。あと何テイムしてないんだ？
Yeah. What else haven't we tamed?

4671
03:47:56,388 --> 03:48:00,088
ちょっと、あれ麻酔矢持ってないんですか？そうか全ロスしたんか
Wait, you don't have tranq arrows? Ah, right, you lost everything.

4672
03:48:00,388 --> 03:48:02,288
そうなんですー！
That's right!

4673
03:48:02,388 --> 03:48:04,188
ドンマイ！違ったよ、もう
Don't mind! Oh man...

4674
03:48:05,488 --> 03:48:09,388
たぶん仮拠点で今作ってるはずです
They're probably crafting some at the temporary base right now.

4675
03:48:09,788 --> 03:48:14,388
あ、10個だけできてたから、ちょっと麻酔をもらってちょっと作ったけど
Ah, only 10 were ready, so I got some narcotics and made a few, but...

4676
03:48:14,788 --> 03:48:17,888
200個持ってたのに、ナ・ビビ。なんてこと...
Even though Na-Bibi had 200 of them. What a disaster...

4677
03:48:18,388 --> 03:48:21,688
ちょっと待って、ウサギの巣すぎる、ここ。まず...
Wait a second, there are way too many rabbit warrens here. First...

4678
03:48:22,188 --> 03:48:24,388
ナルコベリーとかの、あと、え、待って
Narcoberries and... wait...

4679
03:48:25,088 --> 03:48:31,388
そう、ナルコベリー集めて麻酔作ってもらうのが今一番拠点近くでー
Yeah, gathering Narcoberries and having narcotics made near the base is the best thing right now...

4680
03:48:31,488 --> 03:48:36,888
はーい！あ、パチンコじゃなくて、あの、クロスボウってお願いできたりしますか？
Okay! Ah, instead of a slingshot, could I ask for a crossbow?

4681
03:48:37,388 --> 03:48:39,888
クロスボウ？あ、クロスボウも無くなったのか
A crossbow? Ah, you lost your crossbow too?

4682
03:48:40,188 --> 03:48:41,388
えへ、なくなーい
Ehe, it's gone.

4683
03:48:39,888 --> 03:48:42,888
クロスボウね、作業台の中で作れるよ
For a crossbow, you can craft it in the smithy.

4684
03:48:43,788 --> 03:48:44,588
ほうほう
I see, I see.

4685
03:48:44,688 --> 03:48:48,888
多分せっそ、設備っていうかあの、素材は全部入っているはず
I think the equip—I mean, the materials should all be in there.

4686
03:48:49,088 --> 03:48:51,688
わかりました！じゃあ行ってみてちょっとナルコベリー探します
Understood! Then I'll go check and look for Narcoberries.

4687
03:48:51,688 --> 03:48:56,888
ナルコベリーさえあれば、多分勝手にもう作っちゃって大丈夫な気が...
As long as you have Narcoberries, I think it's fine to just craft them on your own...

4688
03:48:57,588 --> 03:49:01,088
ビビの体ムキムキですっごいテッカテカや
Bibi's body is so muscular and shiny!

4689
03:49:01,888 --> 03:49:03,088
なんだこれ
What is this?

4690
03:49:05,488 --> 03:49:08,788
うーん、この辺の子供とか行けないのかなぁ...
Hmm, wonder if we can go for the babies around here...

4691
03:49:12,888 --> 03:49:14,388
あ、心臓痛そう
Ah, that looks painful for the heart.

4692
03:49:15,888 --> 03:49:21,688
え、メガロケロスって結局テイムしてたっけ？視聴者さん。どうだったっけ？
Wait, did we end up taming a Megaloceros? Chat, how was it?

4693
03:49:24,288 --> 03:49:29,888
メガロ...メガロ...誰かテイムしてたっけ？
Megalo... Megalo... did someone tame one?

4694
03:49:31,788 --> 03:49:33,288
お、なんだこいつ、キョロキョロ...
Oh, what's this guy doing, looking around...

4695
03:49:36,288 --> 03:49:38,688
なぁ、分からんよなぁ
Yeah, no way to know, huh?

4696
03:49:38,988 --> 03:49:40,688
死んでは無いよね？
It's not dead, right?

4697
03:49:43,088 --> 03:49:49,588
必死落として逃げてた？あー、ワンチャンあんまないけど、やってみら、やってみていいな。え、ま、ここだったら...
Dropping desperately and running away? Ah, maybe not much chance, but we could try. Well, if it's here...

4698
03:49:51,788 --> 03:49:53,388
石とか拾ってるし
And I'm picking up stones...

4699
03:49:55,888 --> 03:49:57,188
死んだかも？
Maybe it died?

4700
03:49:58,488 --> 03:50:00,088
いや、死んだら...
No, if it died...

4701
03:50:01,088 --> 03:50:02,488
おら！
Take that!

4702
03:50:04,909 --> 03:50:06,509
とりあえず見てみるかー
Let's take a look for now.

4703
03:50:07,709 --> 03:50:09,509
おって、なんかに似てるけど違う。
Oh, it looks similar to something, but no.

4704
03:50:09,509 --> 03:50:10,809
何しようとしたっけ？
What was I trying to do again?

4705
03:50:10,809 --> 03:50:13,409
お肉欲しいんだよなお肉
I really want meat, meat...

4706
03:50:13,709 --> 03:50:15,409
あ、お肉は…
Ah, meat is...

4707
03:50:15,409 --> 03:50:20,409
焼いてあるやつは冷蔵庫、それ以外は餌箱に入っている
Cooked meat is in the fridge, everything else is in the feeding trough.

4708
03:50:20,709 --> 03:50:22,709
はい、もらいましたー
Got it, I took some~

4709
03:50:22,709 --> 03:50:24,709
はーい、よいしょ
Okay, up we go.

4710
03:50:25,809 --> 03:50:29,409
やべえ、船ハメとかやりてえ
Oh man, I want to try boat trapping.

4711
03:50:30,709 --> 03:50:34,709
ナルコベリーと腐った肉か。腐った肉がいるんだ。
Narcoberries and spoiled meat, huh? So I need spoiled meat.

4712
03:50:38,909 --> 03:50:40,909
う、腐った肉ない
Ugh, there's no spoiled meat.

4713
03:50:41,309 --> 03:50:44,409
うーん、諦めた方がいいかもー
Hmm, maybe it's better to give up...

4714
03:50:44,909 --> 03:50:47,409
あれ、どうしたんですか？
Huh, what happened?

4715
03:50:47,409 --> 03:50:52,709
なんかテイム中だったものがあったけど、ずっと…
There was something I was taming, but...

4716
03:50:52,909 --> 03:50:54,709
はいはい
Right, right.

4717
03:50:54,909 --> 03:50:57,709
逃げて、見つからない
It ran away, and I can't find it.

4718
03:50:57,709 --> 03:51:00,409
オオカミだるーい
Wolves are such a pain.

4719
03:51:01,909 --> 03:51:04,409
あ、えーっと、ちょっと飛んで…
Ah, um, let's fly a bit...

4720
03:51:04,909 --> 03:51:07,709
別に何かい…ないなあ
There isn't really anything... nothing here.

4721
03:51:08,109 --> 03:51:11,409
ワイバーン、あの…あの虫、ワイバーンくん虫やってみる？
Wyvern, that... that bug... Wyvern-kun, want to try that bug?

4722
03:51:11,709 --> 03:51:15,409
ワイバーンくん、着陸、着陸。着陸ね、君は。
Wyvern-kun, land, land. Land, okay?

4723
03:51:16,909 --> 03:51:20,409
着陸してもらって、乗りたいのよ、君に。
I need you to land, I want to ride you.

4724
03:51:20,709 --> 03:51:26,409
君に乗りたいのね。こちら、こちら君に乗りたいから着陸をしてください。
I want to ride you. Over here! I want to ride you, so please land.

4725
03:51:26,709 --> 03:51:28,909
ワイバーンくん！
Wyvern-kun!

4726
03:51:29,409 --> 03:51:31,909
ワイバーンくーん
Wyvern-kun~

4727
03:51:32,709 --> 03:51:34,909
ワイバーンくーん
Wyvern-kun~

4728
03:51:35,409 --> 03:51:38,109
あー！君に乗りたい！
Ahh! I want to ride you!

4729
03:51:38,409 --> 03:51:40,409
問題児ない？
Isn't it a problem child?

4730
03:51:40,709 --> 03:51:42,909
ちょっと乗りたーい
I want to ride it~

4731
03:51:42,909 --> 03:51:45,909
ベリーめっちゃ採れるやつ何でしたっけ？マンモス？
What was the one that gathers tons of berries? Mammoth?

4732
03:51:45,909 --> 03:51:49,709
あ、マンモス！マンモス…あれ、木だっけ？マンモスって。あれ？
Ah, mammoth! Mammoth... wait, was mammoth for wood? Huh?

4733
03:51:49,709 --> 03:51:52,709
ちょっと待って、絶対に着地してくんないの？着...
Wait, you really won't land? Land...

4734
03:51:52,909 --> 03:51:56,409
もういいけど、倒してくれたから。ちっ。
Whatever, since you took it down for me. Tch.

4735
03:51:56,409 --> 03:51:59,909
ベリーいっぱい採れるの何ですか？皆さん。
What gathers a lot of berries, everyone?

4736
03:51:59,909 --> 03:52:03,409
アンキ…マンモスじゃないか。マンモスとアンキと…
Anky... Not mammoth? Mammoth and Anky and...

4737
03:52:03,409 --> 03:52:05,909
マンモスとアンキ？
Mammoth and Anky?

4738
03:52:07,409 --> 03:52:10,909
どこにいんだろう？マンモス。居た！
Where could they be? Mammoth... There it is!

4739
03:52:11,409 --> 03:52:13,909
お！That's a terror bird.
Oh! That's a terror bird.

4740
03:52:13,909 --> 03:52:16,409
マンモスか、やっぱり。
Mammoth after all.

4741
03:52:18,909 --> 03:52:22,909
なんか石を使ってもずっと一生使わずに…
Even if I gather stone, without using it forever...

4742
03:52:24,409 --> 03:52:27,909
で、己の身で集めているからな。使わないと。
And I've been gathering with my own body. Gotta use it.

4743
03:52:27,909 --> 03:52:30,409
こいつ寝てくんねえか
Won't this guy go to sleep?

4744
03:52:30,409 --> 03:52:34,409
邪魔だよ、ラッキーキ邪魔。ロッキーキめっちゃ成長してるやん
Get out of the way, Lucky-ki. Rocky-ki has grown so much!

4745
03:52:35,709 --> 03:52:38,409
邪魔すぎるラッキーキ
Lucky-ki is way too in the way!

4746
03:52:38,709 --> 03:52:41,409
まあ、矢もそんなん無いしなー
Well, I don't really have many arrows anyway...

4747
03:52:41,909 --> 03:52:44,909
もうー、て、てめえ…
Jeez, you... you little...

4748
03:52:44,909 --> 03:52:47,409
て、てめえ
You little...!

4749
03:52:49,409 --> 03:52:51,909
うーん、なんてこった…
Hmm, what a mess...

4750
03:52:53,409 --> 03:52:56,409
お供にホイッスルでしょう、今のは
You should whistle your companion, like just now.

4751
03:52:57,409 --> 03:53:01,709
これちょっと何が入ってるか見ようかな、っと
Let me see what's inside this...

4752
03:53:01,909 --> 03:53:04,909
頼む、気絶してくれー
Please, get knocked out!

4753
03:53:04,909 --> 03:53:07,909
なんか石の矢になってね？これ
Wait, aren't these stone arrows?

4754
03:53:08,409 --> 03:53:11,909
ああ、麻酔薬切れてる。駄目だ。
Ah, out of narcotics. No good.

4755
03:53:12,909 --> 03:53:17,409
何もかもが上手くいかないターンきた
Looks like a turn where everything goes wrong has arrived.

4756
03:53:17,909 --> 03:53:19,909
どうしようかなー
What should I do...

4757
03:53:19,909 --> 03:53:21,909
何もかもが上手くいかない
Nothing is going right.

4758
03:53:21,909 --> 03:53:26,909
麻酔薬がぜん…麻酔矢が全然足りなくてー
I just don't have enough narcotic... tranq arrows at all...

4759
03:53:30,409 --> 03:53:33,909
今何個や…え、何個やなんやろ
How many do I have now? Uh, how many is it?

4760
03:53:34,409 --> 03:53:36,909
そう、ビビが死んで泣いてる
Yeah, Bibi died, so she's crying.

4761
03:53:36,909 --> 03:53:40,409
あ、もうそうだ、インベントリにあったわ。10本しかない。
Ah, that's right, it was in my inventory. I only have 10.

4762
03:53:40,409 --> 03:53:45,909
うーん！お腹減ってるし、喉渇いてるー
Ugh! I'm hungry and thirsty~

4763
03:53:45,909 --> 03:53:50,909
テイムしたいけど無理かなー、あれは
I want to tame it, but maybe that one's impossible...

4764
03:53:51,409 --> 03:53:55,909
何か無いかな、テイムできるものー
Isn't there something I can tame?

4765
03:53:55,909 --> 03:54:02,409
もう簡単にテイムできるやつ一覧はね、結構みんなテイムしてそうな感じがするんですよね
The list of creatures that are easy to tame... I feel like everyone has already tamed them.

4766
03:54:02,409 --> 03:54:04,909
ですよねー
True...

4767
03:54:05,409 --> 03:54:09,909
え、なんかキモい虫が戦ってる。何これ？あ、誰か違う人のやつか
Huh, some gross bug is fighting. What's this? Ah, is it someone else's?

4768
03:54:09,909 --> 03:54:11,909
水飲みたい
I want to drink water.

4769
03:54:16,909 --> 03:54:18,909
すでに水欲しいです
I already need water.

4770
03:54:18,909 --> 03:54:22,409
水がなくて死にそうなのか？トワ様これ
Is Towa-sama about to die from lack of water?

4771
03:54:27,409 --> 03:54:31,909
I should get water. 水ー
I should get water. Water~

4772
03:54:34,909 --> 03:54:37,909
あそこ砂漠なのかも、もしかして
That might be a desert over there, perhaps.

4773
03:54:37,909 --> 03:54:42,909
あれ、これは…え、ビビはなんか麻酔矢を作ったらどうしましょう？
Huh, this is... Um, what should Bibi do after crafting tranq arrows?

4774
03:54:42,909 --> 03:54:49,409
もうテイム、テイム。なんか近場にいるちっこい鳥とか虫とか何でもいい、テイムをしたい。
Just tame, tame! Like, a small bird nearby, or a bug, anything is fine. I want to tame!

4775
03:54:49,409 --> 03:54:51,909
え、あと1匹だけですか？
Eh, is there only one left?

4776
03:54:51,909 --> 03:54:54,909
あと1匹だけっぽいね、これ
Looks like only one left.

4777
03:54:54,909 --> 03:54:56,909
もう無いか
None left, huh.

4778
03:54:57,909 --> 03:55:00,409
あれ、あ、これ木だ
Wait, ah, this is wood.

4779
03:55:03,409 --> 03:55:04,076
満タン
Full.

4780
03:55:04,930 --> 03:55:06,430
ナイトメア...
Nightmare...

4781
03:55:07,030 --> 03:55:10,030
あれ？イナ先輩は何を今テイム中？
Wait, Ina-senpai, what are you taming right now?

4782
03:55:10,230 --> 03:55:12,630
いや、もう諦めたー。
No, I already gave up.

4783
03:55:12,930 --> 03:55:14,830
探してくれてて...
We were looking for it, but...

4784
03:55:14,930 --> 03:55:18,930
寝て、誰...何かが食べた気がする。
It fell asleep, and I feel like someone... something ate it.

4785
03:55:19,730 --> 03:55:21,730
ああ、なるほどー。
Ah, I see.

4786
03:55:21,730 --> 03:55:23,330
すぐに消えちゃったから。
Because it vanished right away.

4787
03:55:23,730 --> 03:55:25,030
食べられたんだ。
So it got eaten.

4788
03:55:25,130 --> 03:55:27,430
うーん、しゃあなしですね、それは。
Yeah, nothing you can do about that, then.

4789
03:55:27,530 --> 03:55:28,430
うん。
Yeah.

4790
03:55:32,430 --> 03:55:34,730
え、なんかここ壊れてね？
Wait, isn't this broken here?

4791
03:55:36,130 --> 03:55:37,630
修理...
Repairing...

4792
03:55:38,130 --> 03:55:41,630
すり鉢開かない。開かない。
The mortar and pestle won't open. Can't open it.

4793
03:55:42,730 --> 03:55:44,030
あ、開けた。
Ah, it opened.

4794
03:55:44,730 --> 03:55:46,930
たまに開けない時ありますね。
Sometimes there are times when it won't open.

4795
03:55:47,030 --> 03:55:47,930
バグ？ / うん。
A bug? / Yeah.

4796
03:55:50,230 --> 03:55:53,930
何、あ、あれ？バグかな？ / バグかなー。
What, ah, that? Is it a bug? / Maybe a bug...

4797
03:55:57,830 --> 03:56:00,130
ドードーいないね、確かに。
There really are no Dodos, indeed.

4798
03:56:00,330 --> 03:56:02,030
開けない...
Can't open it...

4799
03:56:05,530 --> 03:56:07,930
何をテイムしたらいいんだ...
What should I tame...?

4800
03:56:08,230 --> 03:56:12,430
ですよね、別のエリアをちょっと...
Right, maybe a different area...

4801
03:56:12,730 --> 03:56:18,430
確かに、別のエリア...いやでもめっちゃ砂漠とか結構すぐ熱中症になっちゃってめっちゃキツかったから、
Indeed, another area... but the desert made me get heatstroke right away and it was super rough,

4802
03:56:18,430 --> 03:56:21,530
普通に平原っぽいとこで探したほうがよさそう。
so searching in a plains-like area might be better.

4803
03:56:22,930 --> 03:56:25,930
あの場所、なん...何て言うんだっけ？
That place... what was it called again?

4804
03:56:26,730 --> 03:56:29,330
始めた場所...
The place where we started...

4805
03:56:30,030 --> 03:56:31,430
あ、集会場？
Ah, the gathering hall?

4806
03:56:31,630 --> 03:56:36,830
はい。そこってなんか、別のものがあった気がします。
Yes. I feel like there were different creatures over there.

4807
03:56:38,130 --> 03:56:39,530
行けるかな？
Can we go?

4808
03:56:39,930 --> 03:56:41,930
確かに、行ってみるか。
True, shall we go check it out?

4809
03:56:42,030 --> 03:56:45,330
イナ先輩、麻酔矢いくつ持ってますか？
Ina-senpai, how many tranq arrows do you have?

4810
03:56:45,530 --> 03:56:47,730
今、88。
Right now, 88.

4811
03:56:48,030 --> 03:56:53,730
じゃあ、それを持って行きましょう。ビビさん、もし...
Then let's take those and go. Vivi-san, if...

4812
03:56:54,930 --> 03:57:01,430
はい、ちょっと拠点...じゃないや、集会場の近くでやってくるんで、
Yeah, we're going near the base... not base, near the gathering hall,

4813
03:57:01,430 --> 03:57:09,430
ちょっとこの麻酔薬、矢をいい感じにしたら、集会場のテレポーターに来てもらっていいですか？
so once you sort out the narcotics and arrows, could you meet us at the gathering hall teleporter?

4814
03:57:10,030 --> 03:57:14,930
ビビなんか開けなくなってしまって、このすり鉢と...
Vivi can't open anything anymore, like this mortar and pestle and...

4815
03:57:14,930 --> 03:57:21,730
あ、三人称にしてやると、多分できるかも。
Ah, if you switch to third-person view and try, maybe it'll work.

4816
03:57:22,230 --> 03:57:23,930
開かないです...
It won't open...

4817
03:57:24,130 --> 03:57:25,930
一旦、リログ？
Maybe relog for a bit?

4818
03:57:26,130 --> 03:57:29,430
ま、そ、そうね、リログがいいかも。うん。
W-Well, yeah, relogging might be good. Yeah.

4819
03:57:29,630 --> 03:57:30,730
ダメそうであれば。
If it still doesn't work.

4820
03:57:30,930 --> 03:57:32,430
はい、出ます。
Okay, I'll log out.

4821
03:57:34,130 --> 03:57:35,930
じゃあ集会場に向かいます。
Then I'll head toward the gathering hall.

4822
03:57:35,930 --> 03:57:37,330
はい。 / はーい。
Okay~ / Okay.

4823
03:57:40,230 --> 03:57:45,930
あ、え、ねぇ、そうじゃん！ちょっと待って！マンモス、カウントされてないからマンモス！
Ah, wait, you're right! Hold on! Mammoths haven't been counted, so a mammoth!

4824
03:57:46,130 --> 03:57:47,430
イナ先輩！
Ina-senpai!

4825
03:57:47,430 --> 03:57:47,930
はい！
Yes!

4826
03:57:48,130 --> 03:57:50,930
マンモス、テイムしたらいける！
If we tame a mammoth, we can do it!

4827
03:57:50,930 --> 03:57:52,730
え？カウントされてないんですか？
Eh? Aren't they counted?

4828
03:57:52,930 --> 03:57:59,530
あのね、これ子供から育てたから、マンモスカウントされてないや！そうだ！ここで...
You see, since we raised this one from a baby, the mammoth wasn't counted! That's it! Here...

4829
03:57:59,630 --> 03:58:01,430
あ、ナイスナイスナイス、そうだ！
Ah, nice nice nice, you're right!

4830
03:58:01,530 --> 03:58:05,530
じゃあ、ちょっと待って、矢を撃ってマンモスの...
Then hold on, let's shoot arrows at the mammoth's...

4831
03:58:08,330 --> 03:58:12,330
え、じゃあこれに乗っていくか、この、これで。
Wait, should we ride on this then, on this thing?

4832
03:58:12,530 --> 03:58:14,430
イナ、イナ先輩、カモン、レッツゴー。
Ina, Ina-senpai, c'mon, let's go.

4833
03:58:15,130 --> 03:58:17,230
あとお水...
Also water...

4834
03:58:17,330 --> 03:58:19,930
あ、お水いっぱい持たないと。
Ah, gotta bring plenty of water.

4835
03:58:20,030 --> 03:58:20,930
ですねー。
True~

4836
03:58:21,130 --> 03:58:22,230
そうじゃん！
Right!

4837
03:58:23,730 --> 03:58:26,730
俺たちはミスをしたゆえに...うん。
Because of the mistakes we made... yeah.

4838
03:58:26,930 --> 03:58:33,330
え、ちょっと待って、なんか「このサーバーに参加するには必要なModをダウンロードしてください」え？空きがありま、え？
Wait a second, it says, \"Please download the required mods to join this server.\" Huh? Is there free space, huh?

4839
03:58:33,430 --> 03:58:38,330
「Modストレージに十分な空きがありません」でビビ、ゲームログインできなくなっちゃった。
\"There is not enough space in Mod Storage\", so now Vivi can't log into the game!

4840
03:58:38,430 --> 03:58:39,530
嘘でしょ！？
You're kidding, right?!

4841
03:58:39,630 --> 03:58:41,930
どういうこと！？もうー！
What does that mean?! Jeez!

4842
03:58:42,030 --> 03:58:43,130
笑った。
That made me laugh.

4843
03:58:43,230 --> 03:58:46,430
何？何が起きてるの？え？どういうこと？
What? What's happening? Huh? What does that mean?

4844
03:58:46,930 --> 03:58:49,130
え、なんで？嘘でしょ...
Wait, why? No way...

4845
03:58:49,230 --> 03:58:52,230
え、さっきまで行けてたのにどういうこと？
Wait, it worked fine until a moment ago, so what does that mean?

4846
03:58:52,230 --> 03:58:53,230
なんで？
Why?

4847
03:58:53,930 --> 03:58:57,430
てか水飲んだと思ったのに飲めてないんだけど。
Also, I thought I drank water, but I didn't get to drink any.

4848
03:58:57,530 --> 03:58:58,830
え、なんで？
Huh, why?

4849
03:58:58,930 --> 03:59:01,730
Modストレージに十分な空きがありません？
Not enough space in Mod Storage?

4850
03:59:01,930 --> 03:59:03,930
ビビのPCがってこと？これ。
Does it mean Vivi's PC? This.

4851
03:59:04,030 --> 03:59:05,930
おそらくPCだもんね。
It's probably the PC.

4852
03:59:05,930 --> 03:59:08,530
閉鎖された...
Shut down...

4853
03:59:08,930 --> 03:59:10,930
あ、30分！
Ah, 30 minutes!

4854
03:59:22,430 --> 03:59:24,930
よし、イナ先輩行きましょう！
Alright, Ina-senpai, let's go!

4855
03:59:24,930 --> 03:59:25,530
はい！
Yes!

4856
03:59:25,630 --> 03:59:27,130
いってらっしゃい！
Have a safe trip!

4857
03:59:32,930 --> 03:59:37,330
あ、マンモスはあ、あれ乗ってやるんですか？
Ah, are we riding that to do the mammoth?

4858
03:59:37,930 --> 03:59:41,630
乗ったほうがいいかな、なんか強いから、あたま...
Might be better to ride it, since it's strong, the head...

4859
03:59:41,630 --> 03:59:42,730
あ、そうですね。
Ah, that's true.

4860
03:59:42,830 --> 03:59:46,430
多分これに乗って撃ってもらったほうがいいかも、乗、乗れる？
Maybe it's better to shoot while riding this. Can- Can you get on?

4861
03:59:48,630 --> 03:59:49,930
ほい。
Yup.

4862
03:59:49,930 --> 03:59:52,730
あ、待って、イナ先輩落とす、危なっ！
Ah, wait, I'm dropping Ina-senpai, whoops!

4863
03:59:56,930 --> 04:00:00,430
あ、なんかユウティラかなんか掴んで連れてきてる。
Ah, looks like she's carrying a Yutyrannus or something and bringing it over.

4864
04:00:05,751 --> 04:00:06,751
オッケー
Okay.

4865
04:00:09,151 --> 04:00:12,751
マンモスと…ま確かに、あと、なんかアルゲンとかでこう捕まえられる…
Mammoths and... Well, certainly, also things you can pick up with an Argentavis...

4866
04:00:12,751 --> 04:00:19,451
右クリックでこう掴めるやつを掴んで、矢を頭に打ち込んで…
Grabbing ones you can carry with right-click and shooting arrows into their heads...

4867
04:00:19,751 --> 04:00:23,451
そうですね。でもなんか何回も回ったんですけど、
Right. But I went around that area multiple times,

4868
04:00:23,451 --> 04:00:27,451
なんか何も無くて、あの場所に。
and there was nothing in that spot.

4869
04:00:27,751 --> 04:00:30,751
バイソン、バイソンはあったんですけど。
Well, there were bisons though.

4870
04:00:33,751 --> 04:00:34,951
あ、マンモス…
Ah, mammoth...

4871
04:00:34,751 --> 04:00:38,451
あ、そこにいる！マンモス！あ、行きましょう。
Ah, there's one over there! Mammoth! Let's go.

4872
04:00:39,751 --> 04:00:41,151
頑張れー！
Go for it!

4873
04:00:41,151 --> 04:00:42,151
はい！
Okay!

4874
04:00:42,151 --> 04:00:44,751
マンモスってベリー…？
Mammoths eat berries...?

4875
04:00:44,751 --> 04:00:45,951
なんだっけ？
What was it?

4876
04:00:45,951 --> 04:00:47,451
肉かな…
Meat, maybe...?

4877
04:00:47,451 --> 04:00:48,451
あ、オッケー。
Ah, okay.

4878
04:00:48,451 --> 04:00:50,451
ま、持ってたから、そのへんは大丈夫。
Well, I have some, so that part's fine.

4879
04:00:50,451 --> 04:00:51,951
こっちも持ってます。
I have some too.

4880
04:00:51,951 --> 04:00:54,951
よし、じゃちょっと待って、今下降しますね。
Alright, wait a second, I'll descend now.

4881
04:00:55,451 --> 04:00:58,951
ちょっとお待ちを。で旋回して…
Wait a moment. And turning...

4882
04:00:59,451 --> 04:01:04,151
これで、イナ先輩、う、撃てますか？こっから。このマンモスに。
With this, Ina-senpai, c-can you shoot from here? At this mammoth.

4883
04:01:04,451 --> 04:01:05,751
後ろ？
Behind?

4884
04:01:05,751 --> 04:01:07,951
あ、前前前！
Ah, front, front, front!

4885
04:01:08,751 --> 04:01:09,951
あ、はい。
Ah, okay.

4886
04:01:22,451 --> 04:01:24,451
こっち側に引き付けようかな。
Maybe I'll lure it towards this side.

4887
04:01:24,451 --> 04:01:26,451
水がありません…
There's no water...

4888
04:01:26,451 --> 04:01:27,451
ケータイ…
Mobile...

4889
04:01:27,451 --> 04:01:29,451
あ！落ちた！
Ah! I fell!

4890
04:01:29,951 --> 04:01:31,451
あ、落ちた？大丈夫？
Ah, you fell? You okay?

4891
04:01:31,451 --> 04:01:34,451
こっち側にいればいつでも登れるように…
If you stay on this side, you can climb up anytime...

4892
04:01:34,951 --> 04:01:38,151
あ、なんかトラップに入ったんです。
Ah, it went into a trap.

4893
04:01:38,951 --> 04:01:40,951
なんか、撃てー！
Shoot it!

4894
04:01:40,951 --> 04:01:42,951
撃てー！
Shoot!

4895
04:01:47,151 --> 04:01:50,951
野生のトラップで草
Lol, it's a wild trap.

4896
04:01:51,451 --> 04:01:53,451
ナイスサポート。
Nice support.

4897
04:01:53,751 --> 04:01:56,451
よっしゃー！ナイスサポート。
Alright! Nice support.

4898
04:01:58,751 --> 04:02:00,951
ござるもりを…
Iroha's harpoon...

4899
04:02:00,951 --> 04:02:04,951
あんま矢がないけど…撃つ。
I don't have many arrows, but... I'll shoot.

4900
04:02:05,751 --> 04:02:07,751
あ、当たってた？
Ah, did it hit?

4901
04:02:10,451 --> 04:02:11,951
おっ
Oh.

4902
04:02:17,951 --> 04:02:21,751
まさかのウサギの罠で草
Lol, caught in a rabbit trap of all things.

4903
04:02:21,751 --> 04:02:22,951
ですよね！
Right?!

4904
04:02:24,451 --> 04:02:25,951
あ、こっち向いた。
Ah, it looked over here.

4905
04:02:31,951 --> 04:02:35,451
イナ先輩、こっち側来れますか？走らせちゃおうかな。
Ina-senpai, can you come to this side? Should I make it run?

4906
04:02:35,751 --> 04:02:37,151
あ、なんか逃げて…る？
Ah, is it running away...?

4907
04:02:37,151 --> 04:02:41,751
いや、逃げてる、あ、逃げてる逃げてる！だから撃ったら気絶するかも。ござるもう矢がないや。
No, it is! Ah, it's fleeing! So shooting it might knock it out. I'm out of arrows though.

4908
04:02:41,951 --> 04:02:44,451
私いっぱい持ってますから。
I have plenty.

4909
04:02:44,451 --> 04:02:46,151
サンキュー！
Thank you!

4910
04:02:46,451 --> 04:02:48,451
お、寝たー！
Oh, it's down!

4911
04:02:48,751 --> 04:02:50,151
ナイスー！
Nice!

4912
04:02:50,151 --> 04:02:51,151
肉…
Meat...

4913
04:02:51,151 --> 04:02:52,451
かな？
maybe?

4914
04:02:52,451 --> 04:02:57,451
アンキロってテイムしたことになってんのかな？もらったやつで。
I wonder if the Ankylo counts as tamed? The one we received.

4915
04:02:57,451 --> 04:02:58,951
あ、そうですね。
Ah, right.

4916
04:02:59,151 --> 04:03:01,151
どうなんだろう。
I wonder.

4917
04:03:03,151 --> 04:03:04,951
マンモスはベリー。
Mammoths eat berries.

4918
04:03:04,951 --> 04:03:07,451
マンモス、ベリーか。オッケーオッケー。
Mammoths eat berries? Okay, okay.

4919
04:03:06,951 --> 04:03:08,451
ベリー…
Berries...

4920
04:03:10,451 --> 04:03:14,451
なんか紫のやつがいいって聞きました。
I heard the purple ones are good.

4921
04:03:14,951 --> 04:03:17,451
紫…オッケー。
Purple... okay.

4922
04:03:17,951 --> 04:03:23,951
ナイスー！これで多分20になる…はず。
Nice! With this it will probably reach 20... hopefully.

4923
04:03:23,951 --> 04:03:30,451
待ってくれ、これでワンチャン駄目だったらそこの目の前にいるアンキロをテイムしたるわ。
Wait up, if this doesn't work, I'll tame the Ankylo right in front of us.

4924
04:03:30,951 --> 04:03:32,451
あ、ちょっと見せて。
Ah, let me see.

4925
04:03:32,451 --> 04:03:33,451
はい。
Sure.

4926
04:03:33,451 --> 04:03:39,451
アスレチックに誰かあの…皮の…皮に、皮袋に入れた水をめっちゃ持ってきてくれませんか？
Can someone bring a bunch of water in waterskins to the obstacle course?

4927
04:03:39,951 --> 04:03:44,451
あー、いいですけど、ちょっと待って…どうしようかな。
Ah, sure, but wait a second... What should we do?

4928
04:03:45,951 --> 04:03:51,451
あ、じゃあ…ござるが行こうかな。イナ先輩、それちょっとお願いしていいですか？
Ah, then... maybe I'll go. Ina-senpai, could you handle this, please?

4929
04:03:51,451 --> 04:03:54,451
あ、いいですよ。いってらっしゃい。
Ah, sure! Take care!

4930
04:03:54,451 --> 04:03:56,451
はーい。
Okay!

4931
04:03:56,451 --> 04:03:58,751
すいません…
Excuse me...

4932
04:03:58,751 --> 04:04:00,751
誰も来なかったですか？
Did nobody come?

4933
04:04:00,751 --> 04:04:08,451
水…来なかったし、マジでここマジ無償、マジ無償。刑務所すぎる！
Water... didn't come, and really, this is totally unpaid, totally unpaid labor! It's way too much like a prison!

4934
04:04:08,751 --> 04:04:10,951
助けて…
Help me...

4935
04:04:14,951 --> 04:04:16,951
いったい何が…
What in the world...

4936
04:04:17,451 --> 04:04:19,451
これは…
This is...

4937
04:04:22,451 --> 04:04:24,451
無償…
Unpaid...

4938
04:04:27,451 --> 04:04:31,451
助けて…助けて…
Help... Help me...

4939
04:04:31,751 --> 04:04:33,451
可哀想w
Poor thing lol

4940
04:04:32,951 --> 04:04:34,451
大丈夫ですか？
Are you okay?

4941
04:04:34,451 --> 04:04:38,151
私…こんなことのために生まれたわけじゃない…
I... wasn't born for something like this...

4942
04:04:37,951 --> 04:04:39,451
そりゃそうよw
Well, of course not lol

4943
04:04:38,451 --> 04:04:40,951
そりゃそうですよトワ様！
Of course you weren't, Towa-sama!

4944
04:04:39,751 --> 04:04:42,451
どうしてこうなったの…？
Why did it turn out like this...?

4945
04:04:42,751 --> 04:04:47,951
こんな…ただ…みんなの役に立ちたくて…
Like this... just... because I wanted to be useful to everyone...

4946
04:04:48,951 --> 04:04:51,951
そうですよね、ポイント稼ぎにね。
Right, just to earn points.

4947
04:04:47,951 --> 04:04:52,451
ポイント…ポイント稼ぎに来ただけなのに…
I just came to earn points... to earn points...

4948
04:04:51,951 --> 04:04:55,451
お手伝いだったんですよね、トワ様ね。そうですよね。
You were just trying to help, right Towa-sama? Right.

4949
04:04:54,751 --> 04:04:59,951
こんなに…うっ…明かりも全くない暗いところで…
In such a... ugh... completely dark place with no light at all...

4950
04:04:59,951 --> 04:05:01,451
明かりもないw
No light either lol

4951
04:05:01,451 --> 04:05:04,951
そっ、鉄…鉄の棒を見て…
L-Looking at iron... iron bars...

4952
04:05:05,272 --> 04:05:06,272
鉄の棒
Iron bar.

4953
04:05:06,272 --> 04:05:08,672
灯りもない、やばい。え、灯りもない？
There's no light, this is bad. Huh, no light?

4954
04:05:08,672 --> 04:05:11,272
え、どんな感じで描き...
What kind of drawing is...

4955
04:05:11,272 --> 04:05:14,472
ちょっと待って、逆に気になるまであるな、これ。
Wait, now I'm almost more curious about it.

4956
04:05:14,572 --> 04:05:18,172
もう水がなくて死にそう！早く助けて！
I'm out of water and dying! Hurry and save me!

4957
04:05:18,172 --> 04:05:20,172
どうでした？あ...
How was it? Ah...

4958
04:05:20,372 --> 04:05:22,272
助けて！助けて！
Save me! Save me!

4959
04:05:22,272 --> 04:05:25,472
やばい、トワ様が...え、何で？どうしたの？
Oh no, Towa-sama is... Wait, why? What happened?

4960
04:05:25,472 --> 04:05:26,772
お願い！
Please!

4961
04:05:26,772 --> 04:05:29,372
ちょっと待って、水作って...あ、帰ってきた、あ、帰ってきた！
Wait a sec, make water... Ah, they're back, they're back!

4962
04:05:29,372 --> 04:05:35,772
あ、帰ってきた！え、え、じゃあ、ちょっとごめん、革袋に水をパンパンに詰めてトワ様に運んであげるミッションが...
Ah, you're back! S-So sorry, but you have a mission to fill waterskins to the brim and bring them to Towa-sama...

4963
04:05:35,972 --> 04:05:38,472
革袋にパンパンに詰めて？
Fill waterskins to the brim?

4964
04:05:38,672 --> 04:05:41,472
わかりました。
Understood.

4965
04:05:41,972 --> 04:05:45,772
詰めて、私のところに来てください！
Fill them and come over to where I am!

4966
04:05:45,772 --> 04:05:47,972
お願いします！
Please!

4967
04:05:47,972 --> 04:05:50,572
あ、またインベントリ開けない。あ、開けた。革袋？
Ah, I can't open my inventory again. Ah, opened it. Waterskins?

4968
04:05:50,772 --> 04:05:53,772
あ、待って、革袋作ってる、革袋作ってる。ちょっと待って、ちょっと...
Ah, wait, I'm crafting waterskins, crafting waterskins. Wait a sec, wait...

4969
04:05:53,772 --> 04:05:55,972
ビビ持ってる、ビビ持ってる、ビビ持ってる！
Bibi has them, Bibi has them, Bibi has them!

4970
04:05:55,972 --> 04:05:58,972
本当に？マンモスできましたー！
Really? The mammoth is done!

4971
04:05:58,972 --> 04:06:01,472
あ、ナイスナイス！ってことは...
Ah, nice, nice! That means...

4972
04:06:01,472 --> 04:06:02,972
できたかな？
Is it done?

4973
04:06:04,972 --> 04:06:08,472
ルーキーロード、あ、できました！達成！
Rookie Road, ah, done! Cleared!

4974
04:06:08,472 --> 04:06:10,972
ナイス！やったー！
Nice! Yay!

4975
04:06:10,972 --> 04:06:12,472
ナイス！
Nice!

4976
04:06:12,472 --> 04:06:13,972
やぁ...
Phew...

4977
04:06:13,972 --> 04:06:16,172
ちょっと待って、水飲めない、ここ。
Wait a sec, I can't drink water here.

4978
04:06:16,172 --> 04:06:18,972
あかん、これだけのことなのに苛知...
No good, getting irritated over such a small thing...

4979
04:06:18,972 --> 04:06:21,972
えっーと、全てに苛知...
Um, irritated by everything...

4980
04:06:21,972 --> 04:06:24,972
待ってね、この今めっちゃEボタンを連打して...
Wait a sec, I'm spamming the E key right now...

4981
04:06:24,972 --> 04:06:27,772
あ、違うわ、ビビ革袋持ってねえやん。
Ah, wait, Bibi doesn't have any waterskins on her.

4982
04:06:27,772 --> 04:06:31,472
落とす落とす、ちょっと待ってね。これ、これもう全部渡すわ、これ。
I'll drop them, I'll drop them, hold on. Here, I'll just give you all of them.

4983
04:06:31,472 --> 04:06:32,972
はーい。
Okay.

4984
04:06:33,972 --> 04:06:38,172
ほら、水を...水を早く！死んじゃいます！
Look, water... hurry with the water! I'm gonna die!

4985
04:06:38,172 --> 04:06:41,772
死んじゃう！早く水をください！あとこんがり肉も。
I'm gonna die! Hurry and give me water! And cooked meat too.

4986
04:06:41,772 --> 04:06:45,372
待って待って、え、なんか待って、とんでもない量の革袋が...
Wait, wait, why are there an insane amount of waterskins...

4987
04:06:45,372 --> 04:06:47,472
え、もうあり得ないぐらい作ったから。
Well, I crafted an absurd number of them.

4988
04:06:47,472 --> 04:06:49,972
もう1個だけでいいから！1個だけでいいから！
Just one is enough! Just one is fine!

4989
04:06:49,972 --> 04:06:52,472
はい、これを持ってきてください、お願いします！
Here, please bring this over, please!

4990
04:06:52,472 --> 04:06:54,972
はい。1個だけでいいからお願い。
Okay. Just one is enough, please.

4991
04:06:54,972 --> 04:06:57,972
飛んで...なんか乗るやつ乗るやつ乗るやつ。
Fly... get a mount, mount, mount.

4992
04:06:57,972 --> 04:07:01,472
あれ？乗るやつ、どこに行けばいいですか？集会場、集会場。
Huh? Mount, where should I go? Meeting hall, meeting hall.

4993
04:07:01,472 --> 04:07:03,972
あれ？あ、集会場じゃあもう飛ばなくてええや。
Huh? Ah, if it's the meeting hall, no need to fly.

4994
04:07:03,972 --> 04:07:05,972
マンモスは入らない？
The mammoth won't fit?

4995
04:07:05,972 --> 04:07:10,472
集会場で水がある？ここから降りちゃうと...集会場、水なかったよね？
Is there water at the meeting hall? If I climb down from here... there wasn't water at the meeting hall, right?

4996
04:07:12,472 --> 04:07:17,972
え、待って、トワ様、待って、それ集会場からアスレでも結構上まで登ってるってことですか？
Wait, Towa-sama, wait, so you climbed pretty far up on the obstacle course from the meeting hall?

4997
04:07:20,972 --> 04:07:22,972
あれ？
Huh?

4998
04:07:22,972 --> 04:07:25,972
あれ？あれ？トワ様いなくなった。
Huh? Huh? Towa-sama disappeared.

4999
04:07:25,972 --> 04:07:27,972
え？レイアウトが...
Huh? The layout is...

5000
04:07:27,972 --> 04:07:29,972
死んだかもしれん。
She might have died.

5001
04:07:29,972 --> 04:07:31,972
死んだ？
Died?

5002
04:07:31,972 --> 04:07:34,472
え、わからん、わからん。
Uh, I don't know, I don't know.

5003
04:07:39,972 --> 04:07:42,472
トワ様どこだ？
Where's Towa-sama?

5004
04:07:42,472 --> 04:07:47,472
え、なんかね、集会場の近くにあるアスレの方にいるんだけど、トワ様今。
Well, Towa-sama is near the obstacle course close to the meeting hall right now.

5005
04:07:47,472 --> 04:07:49,972
アスレ？アスレがどこなのか...
Obstacle course? Where even is the obstacle course...

5006
04:07:49,972 --> 04:07:52,472
あの、あれして...あの、ビビ...
Um, do that... um, Bibi...

5007
04:07:52,472 --> 04:07:54,972
Mで見る？あ、近い！
Check with M? Ah, close!

5008
04:07:54,972 --> 04:07:57,972
アルゲン、アルゲンで来て、アルゲンで。
Argen, come on an Argen, on an Argen.

5009
04:07:57,972 --> 04:08:00,472
え？アルゲン？え、アルゲン？うん。
Huh? Argen? Huh, Argen? Yeah.

5010
04:08:00,472 --> 04:08:03,472
やばい、アルゲン...アルゲンで来て、トワのところ。
Shoot, Argen... Come on an Argen, to Towa.

5011
04:08:03,472 --> 04:08:06,472
えー！来ないでくれー！
Eeh! Don't come here!

5012
04:08:06,472 --> 04:08:08,972
ちょ待って、アルゲンない、アルゲンない。
Wait a sec, I don't have an Argen, no Argen.

5013
04:08:08,972 --> 04:08:13,972
ちょっと待って、え、ちょっと待って、ど、どういう状況？何もわからない。
Wait a sec, huh, wait a sec, w-what's the situation? I don't understand anything.

5014
04:08:13,972 --> 04:08:15,972
もう何でもいいよ。
Anything's fine now.

5015
04:08:15,972 --> 04:08:18,472
え？え、身一つで行っていいんですか？
Huh? Can I just come with just myself?

5016
04:08:18,472 --> 04:08:19,972
うん。来れる？
Yeah. Can you make it?

5017
04:08:19,972 --> 04:08:22,472
なんかビビ行けるとこですか？行けるとこ、上にいます。
Is it somewhere Bibi can reach? Where you can reach, I'm up top.

5018
04:08:22,472 --> 04:08:25,972
え、ちょっと待って、えーと...これでしょう？
Um, wait a second, let's see... this, right?

5019
04:08:25,972 --> 04:08:30,472
え？あ、え、どこや？あ、でもこれアスレチックってこれ？もしかして。
Huh? Ah, where is it? Wait, is this the obstacle course? Maybe?

5020
04:08:30,472 --> 04:08:34,472
アルゲン...アルゲンがいない。
Argen... There's no Argen.

5021
04:08:34,472 --> 04:08:36,972
あ、いたいた！トワ様見えた！
Ah, there! I see Towa-sama!

5022
04:08:36,972 --> 04:08:39,772
何、何、何、何？何があったんだ？
What, what, what, what? What happened?

5023
04:08:39,772 --> 04:08:41,472
来たよ。
I'm here.

5024
04:08:41,472 --> 04:08:42,972
どこ？
Where?

5025
04:08:42,972 --> 04:08:45,972
一旦ビビ入り口に入ってきました。
For now, Bibi went into the entrance.

5026
04:08:45,972 --> 04:08:47,972
ここ、どこ？上！上！
Here? Where? Up! Up!

5027
04:08:47,972 --> 04:08:51,972
上？上、上なんか、え、身一つで来たから上行けない。あれ、どこ？
Up? Up, something up... Wait, I came empty-handed so I can't go up. Huh, where?

5028
04:08:51,972 --> 04:08:54,972
こっちだ！いたいたいたいた！
Over here! Found you, found you!

5029
04:08:54,972 --> 04:08:57,972
何が起きてるんだ、こいつ等...
What is going on with these guys...

5030
04:08:57,972 --> 04:08:59,972
え、ここ登れるんだ。
Oh, you can climb up here.

5031
04:08:59,972 --> 04:09:02,972
はしご登れる。早い早い。
You can climb the ladder. Fast, fast.

5032
04:09:02,972 --> 04:09:03,972
はい。
Here.

5033
04:09:03,972 --> 04:09:05,972
水ください。はい。
Water please. Here.

5034
04:09:05,972 --> 04:09:07,972
そんなに水ない？
There's not that much water?

5035
04:09:07,972 --> 04:09:11,972
え、これやり直ししかないの？なんかもうコメントもそれは不正だとか言って...
Wait, is restarting the only option? Comments are saying that's cheating and all...

5036
04:09:11,972 --> 04:09:15,472
もうダメみたい。
Looks like it's over.

5037
04:09:15,472 --> 04:09:17,472
え、嘘でしょ？
Huh, no way?

5038
04:09:17,472 --> 04:09:18,972
はい。
Yes.

5039
04:09:18,972 --> 04:09:22,972
いやもうちょっとごめん、アスレチック無理だわ、これ。
Nah, sorry, this obstacle course is impossible.

5040
04:09:22,972 --> 04:09:25,472
じゃあ行くか、ゴガルガ！どこだ？
Well, shall we go, Gogaruga! Where is it?

5041
04:09:25,472 --> 04:09:27,472
いやもう多分無理かも。
Nah, it's probably impossible now.

5042
04:09:27,472 --> 04:09:29,472
無理？
Impossible?

5043
04:09:29,972 --> 04:09:31,972
そんなことあるの？
Is that even possible?

5044
04:09:31,972 --> 04:09:33,472
萎えた。
I lost all motivation.

5045
04:09:33,472 --> 04:09:36,972
この今のですべて萎えてしまいました。
That whole thing just completely broke my spirit.

5046
04:09:36,972 --> 04:09:38,472
やばい、萎えてる。
Oh no, she's demoralized.

5047
04:09:38,472 --> 04:09:41,472
もう萎えた。一体何があったと言うんだ。
Totally demoralized. Just what happened here?

5048
04:09:41,472 --> 04:09:42,972
早く降りたい。
I want to get down quickly.

5049
04:09:42,972 --> 04:09:46,472
うーん、何ができる...
Hmm, what can I do...

5050
04:09:46,472 --> 04:09:49,972
もうやり直しならね、これやめた方がいい。
If we have to restart, it's better to just quit this.

5051
04:09:49,972 --> 04:09:51,972
え？そんな？
Huh? Really?

5052
04:09:51,972 --> 04:09:54,972
え、これめっちゃ水ね、めっちゃ水持たないと...
Well, we need a ton of water, if we don't bring tons of water...

5053
04:09:54,972 --> 04:09:57,972
これ水も飲む場所ないし...
There's nowhere to drink water either...

5054
04:09:57,972 --> 04:10:00,972
ご飯も食べる場所ないから...
And nowhere to eat food either...

5055
04:10:00,972 --> 04:10:03,472
こっからね、どんどん渡っていかなきゃいけないんだよね。
We have to keep crossing from here, right?

5056
04:10:03,472 --> 04:10:04,972
あー...
Ahh...

5057
04:10:04,993 --> 04:10:05,993
様子だ...
Looks like it...

5058
04:10:06,393 --> 04:10:09,493
今水もうないからビビもきついの？
Is Bibi struggling too because we're out of water?

5059
04:10:09,893 --> 04:10:11,993
いや、きっつ。でもこれ...
Yeah, it's rough. But you know...

5060
04:10:11,993 --> 04:10:15,493
これ多分何十分かけても10ポイントしか手に入らなくて...
Even if we spend dozens of minutes on this, we'll only get 10 points...

5061
04:10:18,493 --> 04:10:19,993
でも別の縄取りはリタイアしてる。
Though they retired from the other territory capture.

5062
04:10:20,193 --> 04:10:21,993
リタイアしてる。
They retired.

5063
04:10:22,493 --> 04:10:26,993
え、じゃあこのライトニングワイバーン、ビビさんに貸すんで、ブロント図鑑...でこう、チクチクして...
Then I'll lend this Lightning Wyvern to Bibi-san so you can poke the Bronto...

5064
04:10:26,993 --> 04:10:28,493
Hello~

5065
04:10:28,493 --> 04:10:29,993
そうだね。
Yeah.

5066
04:10:29,993 --> 04:10:33,493
もらう仕事お願いして、ゴロゴロ行ってきますよ。
I'll ask for the job and go rolling around.

5067
04:10:33,793 --> 04:10:34,793
はーい。
Okay.

5068
04:10:34,193 --> 04:10:35,793
to check if my mic is working...

5069
04:10:35,493 --> 04:10:36,993
え、手伝ってって何？ブロント？
Wait, what do you need help with? The Bronto?

5070
04:10:36,993 --> 04:10:39,993
で、ライトニングワイバーン... どこ行っちゃったの？
And the Lightning Wyvern... where did it go?

5071
04:10:39,993 --> 04:10:41,493
Eh...

5072
04:10:41,193 --> 04:10:43,193
あ、そう、あいつ乗っちゃって...
Ah, yeah, she's riding that one...

5073
04:10:43,193 --> 04:10:43,993
はい。
Okay.

5074
04:10:44,193 --> 04:10:47,493
え、ちょ、ごめん、水大量にもらっていい？さっきトワ様に落としたやつ。
Ah, sorry, can I get a bunch of water? The one dropped for Towa-sama earlier.

5075
04:10:47,993 --> 04:10:49,993
トワ中入ってるわ。踏みます。
Towa went inside. I'll step on it.

5076
04:10:49,993 --> 04:10:51,993
あ、了解です。渡しちゃいました。
Ah, got it. I already handed it over.

5077
04:10:51,993 --> 04:10:52,993
オッケー、オッケー。
Okay, okay.

5078
04:10:53,193 --> 04:10:54,493
あ、でも持ってる。これ持ってる。
Ah, but I have it. I have this.

5079
04:10:53,993 --> 04:10:56,193
Can you open the door?

5080
04:10:56,493 --> 04:10:58,393
これ、荷解きしていきます？無理？
Should I unpack this now? Impossible?

5081
04:10:58,393 --> 04:11:01,493
あ、本当？じゃあ落としてもらうと...
Ah, really? Then if you drop it...

5082
04:11:01,493 --> 04:11:02,993
Can you hear me? Hello?

5083
04:11:03,993 --> 04:11:04,993
ありました。
Found it.

5084
04:11:04,993 --> 04:11:06,493
Hello, can you hear me?

5085
04:11:05,993 --> 04:11:08,493
でもちょっとしか入ってないから意味なさそう。
But there's only a little bit in it, so it might be pointless.

5086
04:11:08,993 --> 04:11:10,993
Hello? Please?

5087
04:11:08,493 --> 04:11:11,493
一旦飲んでるよ。スィーッス。なってるよ。
Drinking it for now. Slurp. Done.

5088
04:11:12,793 --> 04:11:16,193
一体何があってそんな壊れちまったんだ？
What on earth happened to make it break like that?

5089
04:11:16,193 --> 04:11:18,193
Wait, my mic is not working?

5090
04:11:17,793 --> 04:11:19,193
壊れる？ここだよ。
Break? Over here.

5091
04:11:19,793 --> 04:11:22,493
ビビは、ビビもうこれ飛んでていいですか？
Can Bibi, can Bibi just fly around with this?

5092
04:11:22,993 --> 04:11:26,493
あのブロントサウルスを倒してほしい。大きい奴。
I want you to take down that Brontosaurus. The big one.

5093
04:11:25,493 --> 04:11:27,493
Need to open the door.

5094
04:11:27,993 --> 04:11:31,493
ブロントサウルス？どこに... うん、えーと...
Brontosaurus? Where... Yeah, um...

5095
04:11:31,493 --> 04:11:32,993
Thank you~

5096
04:11:33,493 --> 04:11:34,993
ブロントサウルス？
Brontosaurus?

5097
04:11:34,993 --> 04:11:37,993
そう、めっちゃ大きい奴、首長くて。
Yeah, the really huge one with the long neck.

5098
04:11:38,193 --> 04:11:40,493
Hold on, how come my mic is not working?

5099
04:11:40,193 --> 04:11:44,993
そうそうそうそう。あれを5体で1ポイントもらえるから...
Right, right, right. Because taking down 5 of those gets us 1 point...

5100
04:11:47,993 --> 04:11:49,993
出会ってないな...
Haven't run into one...

5101
04:11:51,793 --> 04:11:53,493
水くれー！
Give me water!

5102
04:11:57,493 --> 04:11:59,493
あ、これどうしたらいいの？
Ah, what should I do with this?

5103
04:11:59,793 --> 04:12:00,793
これは？
What about this?

5104
04:12:00,493 --> 04:12:03,993
In-game chat... ah, do I have like Push to Talk on or something?

5105
04:12:03,993 --> 04:12:08,493
あ、こう行けるのか。はいはいはいはい。
Ah, you can go like this? I see, I see.

5106
04:12:12,493 --> 04:12:14,493
ブロントサウルス...
Brontosaurus...

5107
04:12:16,793 --> 04:12:18,493
ああ、はいはいはいはい。
Ah, okay, okay.

5108
04:12:20,493 --> 04:12:22,493
マイクなどの...
The mic...

5109
04:12:22,193 --> 04:12:23,793
Nyo-on~

5110
04:12:23,793 --> 04:12:26,993
なんか横ですげえ声...
There's an amazing voice next to me...

5111
04:12:27,793 --> 04:12:28,993
Nyo~

5112
04:12:29,193 --> 04:12:32,493
なんか横からすげえ声聞こえるんだけど...
I can hear an amazing voice coming from beside me...

5113
04:12:33,993 --> 04:12:38,193
I think... I think she still can't hear me.

5114
04:12:38,993 --> 04:12:43,993
I guess I never use in-game chat, huh? Or in-game voice.

5115
04:12:44,493 --> 04:12:46,993
急にいないな、ブロントさん。
Suddenly there are no Bronto-sans around.

5116
04:12:46,993 --> 04:12:49,193
一体何が起きていたんだ...
What on earth happened...

5117
04:12:49,493 --> 04:12:51,493
これ登るのむず...
Climbing this is hard...

5118
04:12:56,493 --> 04:13:01,993
Oh, keypad... eh, I don't know. Whatever.

5119
04:13:02,193 --> 04:13:03,993
ま、いっか。
Whatever.

5120
04:13:04,493 --> 04:13:06,993
Wait, I turned it off?

5121
04:13:08,493 --> 04:13:10,993
Oh, I didn't save.

5122
04:13:15,993 --> 04:13:17,493
なるほど。
I see.

5123
04:13:18,993 --> 04:13:21,493
You know, you don't talk to people when...

5124
04:13:21,793 --> 04:13:25,493
もうこれが無所と呼ばれているのか。
So this is what they call prison, huh.

5125
04:13:25,993 --> 04:13:30,993
ござるキャラクターでっけえからな、向いてないかもね、確かに。
Gozaru's character is huge, so it might not be suited, honestly.

5126
04:13:36,493 --> 04:13:38,493
Meow meow~

5127
04:13:39,993 --> 04:13:41,993
Meow meow~

5128
04:13:44,993 --> 04:13:47,493
どうなんだろう、これが...
I wonder how it is, this...

5129
04:13:47,793 --> 04:13:49,493
Wish that was working.

5130
04:13:49,193 --> 04:13:51,493
ああ、はいはいはいはい。やったー！
Ah, yes, yes, yes. Yay!

5131
04:13:51,493 --> 04:13:52,993
We might be back.

5132
04:13:55,993 --> 04:13:59,993
And... back to chop.

5133
04:13:59,993 --> 04:14:01,493
I can talk too.

5134
04:14:01,493 --> 04:14:05,493
着地点が絶妙にわかんないな、このゲーム。
The landing point is subtly tricky to figure out in this game.

5135
04:14:05,493 --> 04:14:08,993
I set up the whatchamacallit input stuff properly.

5136
04:14:07,993 --> 04:14:09,493
むずいっすね。
It is hard.

5137
04:14:09,493 --> 04:14:12,493
あ、いけました。えっと、で...
Ah, made it through. Um, and then...

5138
04:14:12,993 --> 04:14:17,493
ほっ、はいはいはい。え、待って、これキャラコンむずくて草。
Hup, okay okay. Wait, controlling the character is so hard, lol.

5139
04:14:17,493 --> 04:14:19,493
Mmm, I don't know.

5140
04:14:19,493 --> 04:14:20,993
ほうほうほうほう。
I see, I see.

5141
04:14:20,993 --> 04:14:23,993
これどこに行きゃいいんだ？次は。こっちか？
Where should I go next? This way?

5142
04:14:24,493 --> 04:14:26,993
あ、はいはいはい、上？
Ah, okay okay, up?

5143
04:14:27,993 --> 04:14:29,993
お、これか？
Oh, this?

5144
04:14:32,993 --> 04:14:34,993
どこに...
Where...

5145
04:14:35,793 --> 04:14:38,493
どこに... どこに...
Where... where...

5146
04:14:43,993 --> 04:14:47,993
Aah... ugh. Ugh...

5147
04:14:47,993 --> 04:14:50,993
え、これどこから上上がるの？マジ？
Wait, where do you go up from? Seriously?

5148
04:14:51,493 --> 04:14:54,993
That was bad. It works!

5149
04:14:55,493 --> 04:14:57,993
うやー
Uwah...

5150
04:14:59,493 --> 04:15:03,493
I thought it was too quiet, so I pumped up the gain, but that's hot.

5151
04:15:05,614 --> 04:15:07,814
ん？これどこに行くの？
Huh? Where do I go for this?

5152
04:15:07,814 --> 04:15:11,814
目の前が隙間、扉みたいなとこ。あー、はー、はー、はー
A gap right in front, like a door. Ah, okay, okay, okay.

5153
04:15:12,014 --> 04:15:13,514
おっ
Oh.

5154
04:15:14,514 --> 04:15:17,014
飛んでるー
It's flying!

5155
04:15:21,814 --> 04:15:24,014
1時間ぐらいの難易度なんだ。
So it's about an hour's worth of difficulty.

5156
04:15:27,014 --> 04:15:30,014
I sounded like I ate my microphone for a second. I did.

5157
04:15:30,314 --> 04:15:32,214
I did, though. I did.

5158
04:15:32,214 --> 04:15:34,514
心折れてた。やばい。
My spirit was broken. That was crazy.

5159
04:15:34,814 --> 04:15:39,014
Ah, is there anything we can do for the last 15 minutes?

5160
04:15:39,814 --> 04:15:41,014
あ、これか？
Oh, is it this?

5161
04:15:41,014 --> 04:15:42,814
I don't think so.

5162
04:15:43,014 --> 04:15:45,014
あ、あれか？あれ奥に行けんのか？
Ah, is that it? Can you go into the back for that?

5163
04:15:44,814 --> 04:15:46,014
Unicorn?

5164
04:15:46,014 --> 04:15:48,514
あ、これか。はい、はい、はい、はい。
Oh, this is it. Yes, yes, yes, yes.

5165
04:15:49,814 --> 04:15:51,514
Should search it. How to tame...

5166
04:15:51,514 --> 04:15:54,014
あ、理解、理解、理解、理解。
Ah, understood, understood, understood, understood.

5167
04:15:54,214 --> 04:15:58,614
はい、はい、はい、はい。これ確かに、ご飯がなくてキツいねー。
Right, right, right. It's tough without food, indeed.

5168
04:15:59,014 --> 04:16:02,014
Extremely rare. Okay.

5169
04:16:03,814 --> 04:16:08,014
"One unicorn can exist on an active map simultaneously."

5170
04:16:10,014 --> 04:16:11,514
Cool.

5171
04:16:15,814 --> 04:16:17,014
ほっ
Hop.

5172
04:16:17,014 --> 04:16:19,214
Okay, I don't think we're doing that in 15 minutes.

5173
04:16:18,514 --> 04:16:20,514
これ行けんのかな？こっ...
Can I go this way? Here...

5174
04:16:21,814 --> 04:16:22,814
あー
Ah...

5175
04:16:23,014 --> 04:16:25,514
体デケェ。
Its body is huge.

5176
04:16:25,814 --> 04:16:27,514
ラストだけ
Just the last one.

5177
04:16:28,014 --> 04:16:30,014
GPSで飛ぶか。
Should I fly using GPS?

5178
04:16:33,814 --> 04:16:35,014
ほい
There.

5179
04:16:37,014 --> 04:16:38,814
Cuz you need, uh...
'Cause you need, uh...

5180
04:16:38,814 --> 04:16:40,514
あー、はい。
Ah, okay.

5181
04:16:40,514 --> 04:16:45,514
...ghillie, and then feed it berries, right?

5182
04:16:49,214 --> 04:16:51,814
What if we get really lucky?

5183
04:16:52,514 --> 04:16:55,014
Eh, north side of the map?

5184
04:16:57,014 --> 04:17:00,014
Was it the purple berries, right?

5185
04:17:05,014 --> 04:17:06,514
Which area?

5186
04:17:07,514 --> 04:17:11,014
There should be like a map of the spawns.

5187
04:17:13,514 --> 04:17:15,014
In the plains.

5188
04:17:15,514 --> 04:17:18,514
Like where Pachy is? Wait, that's...

5189
04:17:18,514 --> 04:17:20,514
...Ragnarok, okay.

5190
04:17:20,514 --> 04:17:23,814
Oh, and so the north something corner, okay.

5191
04:17:25,014 --> 04:17:28,014
You know what? Row, row, fight the power.

5192
04:17:28,014 --> 04:17:30,014
Do the impossible.

5193
04:17:30,514 --> 04:17:32,214
Where's my hat?

5194
04:17:35,814 --> 04:17:37,514
I lost my hat.

5195
04:17:44,014 --> 04:17:45,514
It's all right.

5196
04:17:46,814 --> 04:17:48,014
Okay.

5197
04:17:58,014 --> 04:18:01,014
Row, row, fight the power.

5198
04:18:01,514 --> 04:18:03,214
こっちかな？
Is it this way?

5199
04:18:05,814 --> 04:18:07,814
で、上に行って
And then go up...

5200
04:18:18,814 --> 04:18:20,514
こっちか。
This way, huh.

5201
04:18:34,014 --> 04:18:37,014
Does it glow in the dark?

5202
04:18:51,814 --> 04:18:55,014
"Fly north until you hit water and turn right."

5203
04:18:55,214 --> 04:18:58,014
Or I can just go straight diagonally.

5204
04:18:58,214 --> 04:19:00,214
10 minutes.

5205
04:19:09,014 --> 04:19:11,014
Oh, Wyverns.

5206
04:19:15,014 --> 04:19:18,514
I should get stamina back.

5207
04:19:30,514 --> 04:19:33,014
えー、これ助かるぅ。
Ah, this is so helpful.

5208
04:19:33,814 --> 04:19:37,514
Yeah. Row, row, fight the power.

5209
04:19:45,814 --> 04:19:47,514
この辺かな？
Around here, maybe?

5210
04:19:49,214 --> 04:19:51,014
よっこいしょ。
Heave-ho.

5211
04:19:54,014 --> 04:19:55,514
ただいまー！
I'm back!

5212
04:19:55,514 --> 04:19:57,014
倒せました！
We defeated it!

5213
04:19:57,014 --> 04:19:59,214
倒せましたー！
We defeated it!

5214
04:19:59,214 --> 04:20:00,514
お見事！
Splendid!

5215
04:20:00,514 --> 04:20:03,214
お疲れ様ー！
Great job everyone!

5216
04:20:05,635 --> 04:20:07,335
アスレチックどこでやんのこれ
Where is this obstacle course being held?

5217
04:20:07,835 --> 04:20:09,135
集会場だったかな？
Was it at the meeting area?

5218
04:20:09,235 --> 04:20:10,135
はい
Yes.

5219
04:20:10,235 --> 04:20:11,335
集会場？
The meeting area?

5220
04:20:11,435 --> 04:20:12,135
うん
Yeah.

5221
04:20:12,235 --> 04:20:13,835
はどこだ？
...Where is that?

5222
04:20:14,635 --> 04:20:15,735
よいしょ
Up we go.

5223
04:20:15,835 --> 04:20:19,235
で 出口…一つ ど 出口…外？
So the exit... one... wh- the exit... outside?

5224
04:20:19,335 --> 04:20:20,535
これか はい
This one? Yes.

5225
04:20:21,035 --> 04:20:23,935
ジャンピングアスレチックができますよ フブキ先輩
You can do the jumping obstacle course, Fubuki-senpai.

5226
04:20:24,035 --> 04:20:24,835
マジで？
Really?

5227
04:20:24,935 --> 04:20:27,035
めっちゃやりてぇ！めっちゃやりてぇ！
I wanna do it so bad! I wanna do it so bad!

5228
04:20:27,135 --> 04:20:28,235
どこどこどこ？
Where, where, where?

5229
04:20:28,335 --> 04:20:29,935
なんかめっちゃ可愛いやつ居る
There's something super cute here.

5230
04:20:30,135 --> 04:20:34,235
ありえないぐらい慣性付きの ジャンピングアスレチックが楽しめますよ
You can enjoy a jumping obstacle course with an insane amount of inertia.

5231
04:20:34,335 --> 04:20:36,235
最高すぎる 最高すぎる
That sounds so awesome, so awesome!

5232
04:20:36,335 --> 04:20:38,235
ちなみにラプトル用です これ
By the way, this is for raptors.

5233
04:20:38,335 --> 04:20:40,035
ラプトル用に作りました
I made it for raptors.

5234
04:20:40,235 --> 04:20:42,435
え これ恐竜で入ったら怒られますか？
Wait, will I get scolded if I enter with a dinosaur?

5235
04:20:42,535 --> 04:20:44,235
怒られると思うｗ
I think you will lol.

5236
04:20:46,135 --> 04:20:48,035
ここ？ここ？どこ？
Here? Here? Where?

5237
04:20:48,135 --> 04:20:52,035
なんか心が折れそうな人が3人ぐらいいる 土台の横に
There are like three people about to lose their minds next to the foundation.

5238
04:20:52,135 --> 04:20:52,935
これか？
Is it this?

5239
04:20:53,035 --> 04:20:54,235
ジャンプしろ！
Jump!

5240
04:20:54,335 --> 04:20:58,035
もうビビもライトニングワイバーンで 探し捲くったけど恐竜…
Bibi searched all over with the lightning wyvern too, but dinosaurs...

5241
04:20:58,135 --> 04:21:00,035
やばい 水分やば
Oh no, my water is really low.

5242
04:21:00,135 --> 04:21:01,235
これ？アスレチック
Is this it? The obstacle course?

5243
04:21:01,335 --> 04:21:02,735
アスレチックやろうかな
Maybe I'll try the obstacle course.

5244
04:21:02,835 --> 04:21:05,235
ええ これだけで…これだけで…
Eh, just with this... just with this...

5245
04:21:05,335 --> 04:21:09,235
ごめんよ水分…水分なさすぎてやばい
Sorry, water... It's bad, I have no hydration.

5246
04:21:09,335 --> 04:21:11,735
そうか 確かに 低体温症…
Right, indeed. Hypothermia...

5247
04:21:12,035 --> 04:21:14,035
全然…ないんですけど
There's none... at all, though.

5248
04:21:14,535 --> 04:21:18,235
無理 上か まずこっちから飛べない
No way... Above? First off, I can't fly from here.

5249
04:21:18,835 --> 04:21:22,235
ふわーって何これ？え？ やべ 分かんない
Whoa, what is this? Huh? Oh no, I don't get it.

5250
04:21:24,835 --> 04:21:28,035
あ ごめんよ 袋ね
Ah, sorry, the bag, right?

5251
04:21:30,535 --> 04:21:33,135
無理…どう？これ こっち？
No way... How about it? This, this way?

5252
04:21:33,235 --> 04:21:34,035
どうぞ
Go ahead.

5253
04:21:34,135 --> 04:21:35,935
ユニコーンって光る？
Does a unicorn glow?

5254
04:21:36,035 --> 04:21:37,435
あ 飛べない 間違えた
Ah, can't fly, my bad.

5255
04:21:37,735 --> 04:21:38,735
見える？
Can you see it?

5256
04:21:38,835 --> 04:21:40,335
あそこ脱出必要？
Do we need to escape from there?

5257
04:21:40,435 --> 04:21:41,835
あれ 遅いのかこれ
Wait, is this slow?

5258
04:21:41,935 --> 04:21:42,735
遅い
Slow.

5259
04:21:42,835 --> 04:21:43,935
見える
I can see it.

5260
04:21:45,035 --> 04:21:47,535
ボタン先輩とか得意そう これ
Botan-senpai seems like she'd be good at this.

5261
04:21:47,635 --> 04:21:48,435
マジ？
Really?

5262
04:21:48,535 --> 04:21:50,835
いや ARKの挙動よく分からないんだよね
Nah, I really don't understand ARK's physics.

5263
04:21:50,935 --> 04:21:53,835
なんか戻り入力入れると その場に…
Like, if you input reverse, right in place...

5264
04:21:53,935 --> 04:21:55,035
ああ なるほど
Ah, I see.

5265
04:21:55,135 --> 04:21:59,835
一瞬の合間にラプトルとかみたいに カチッていうタイプの戻りだったら ストッピングできます
If it's the type of reverse that snaps instantly like a raptor, you can stop on a dime.

5266
04:22:00,135 --> 04:22:01,835
見つけた 見つけた
Found it! Found it!

5267
04:22:01,935 --> 04:22:02,735
そういうことね
That's how it works.

5268
04:22:02,835 --> 04:22:04,735
そうなんですよね カチッて
Exactly, just snap it.

5269
04:22:04,835 --> 04:22:06,335
最悪や
That's the worst...

5270
04:22:09,935 --> 04:22:12,535
I didn't want to barrel roll.

5271
04:22:12,835 --> 04:22:15,035
そういうつもりじゃなかった
I didn't mean to do that!

5272
04:22:15,935 --> 04:22:18,635
一人称視点の方がいいのかな？
I wonder if first-person perspective is better?

5273
04:22:19,035 --> 04:22:23,035
一人称視点の方が 制御しやすい気はしてます 大体
I feel like first-person is generally easier to control.

5274
04:22:23,135 --> 04:22:24,635
誰かクリアした？
Did anyone clear it?

5275
04:22:24,735 --> 04:22:28,235
いや なんかみんな心が折れて ボロボロらしいですよ ここで
No, apparently everyone got heartbroken and is in tatters here.

5276
04:22:28,335 --> 04:22:33,035
うわ めっちゃ行きたいけど ちょっとむずいな 時間的にも間に合わないかな
Ugh, I really wanna go, but it's pretty tough. I probably won't make it in time either.

5277
04:22:37,435 --> 04:22:40,435
ころね おいで
Korone, come here.

5278
04:22:42,435 --> 04:22:44,135
オッケー オッケー オッケー
Okay, okay, okay.

5279
04:22:44,335 --> 04:22:47,535
え すごい早！ボタン先輩 トントン
Whoa, so fast! Botan-senpai, tap-tap.

5280
04:22:48,235 --> 04:22:50,335
ボタン先輩 行けました？
Botan-senpai, did you make it?

5281
04:22:50,435 --> 04:22:54,835
なんかここめっちゃむずいな 足が引っかかるとこと引っかかんないとこある
It's super hard here. There are spots where your feet catch and spots where they don't.

5282
04:22:55,035 --> 04:22:55,835
マジ？
Really?

5283
04:22:55,935 --> 04:22:58,035
すごい！あ 行けた 行けた
Awesome! Ah, I did it, I did it!

5284
04:22:58,135 --> 04:22:59,035
ナイス！
Nice!

5285
04:22:59,135 --> 04:23:02,135
そもそも梯子どうやって 上がるんだっけっていう
First off, how do you even climb ladders again?

5286
04:23:04,835 --> 04:23:06,335
合わせると…
When you line it up...

5287
04:23:06,835 --> 04:23:09,335
これ…出る
This... pops up.

5288
04:23:09,735 --> 04:23:11,635
え これどうやって登んの？
Wait, how do you climb this?

5289
04:23:12,835 --> 04:23:13,835
Eボタン
E button.

5290
04:23:13,935 --> 04:23:14,935
Eボタン？
E button?

5291
04:23:15,035 --> 04:23:16,235
Eボタンかな？
E button, maybe?

5292
04:23:16,335 --> 04:23:17,335
Eボタン
E button.

5293
04:23:17,435 --> 04:23:18,535
助かった
Saved!

5294
04:23:19,035 --> 04:23:20,535
That's not a horse.

5295
04:23:20,635 --> 04:23:22,335
No, five minutes.

5296
04:23:23,035 --> 04:23:25,535
あ これすんげえ遠回り？
Ah, is this a huge detour?

5297
04:23:25,635 --> 04:23:26,535
逆に
In reverse.

5298
04:23:27,035 --> 04:23:29,835
ユニコーン見たかった…
I wanted to see the unicorn...

5299
04:23:32,035 --> 04:23:33,035
斜めだこれ
It's diagonal.

5300
04:23:34,835 --> 04:23:37,035
1個ずつじゃねえ 騙されるなこれ
It's not one by one. Don't get tricked by this.

5301
04:23:37,135 --> 04:23:38,235
なかなか…
Quite...

5302
04:23:38,335 --> 04:23:39,535
1個ずつじゃない？
Isn't it one by one?

5303
04:23:39,635 --> 04:23:40,835
痛い！
Ouch!

5304
04:23:43,235 --> 04:23:45,035
ユニコーン…
Unicorn...

5305
04:23:45,535 --> 04:23:47,035
それでも…
Even so...

5306
04:23:47,135 --> 04:23:48,735
ボタン先輩お疲れ様でした
Good work, Botan-senpai!

5307
04:23:50,035 --> 04:23:52,335
それでもー！
Even so...!

5308
04:23:52,435 --> 04:23:53,335
最悪！
The worst!

5309
04:23:53,435 --> 04:23:55,435
行けたのに！
And I made it, too!

5310
04:23:56,135 --> 04:23:57,435
よいしょ
Alright.

5311
04:23:57,535 --> 04:24:00,335
これ1個あれ どこなんだろう？
Where is that one thing?

5312
04:24:05,035 --> 04:24:06,335
行こうか
Shall we go?

5313
04:24:07,635 --> 04:24:08,935
よいしょ
Up we go.

5314
04:24:10,135 --> 04:24:12,035
みんなやってるなぁ
Everyone's at it.

5315
04:24:15,235 --> 04:24:16,435
Keep to the right.

5316
04:24:16,535 --> 04:24:18,335
めっちゃ煽られてるやん
You're getting totally provoked!

5317
04:24:18,435 --> 04:24:19,235
あれ？
Huh?

5318
04:24:19,335 --> 04:24:21,835
めっちゃ煽られてるトワ様
Towa-sama is getting totally provoked!

5319
04:24:22,035 --> 04:24:23,235
斜めかな？
Diagonal, maybe?

5320
04:24:25,535 --> 04:24:26,835
よいしょ
Alright.

5321
04:24:30,535 --> 04:24:31,935
横かな？
To the side, maybe?

5322
04:24:34,135 --> 04:24:36,535
うわああ！
Uwaaah!

5323
04:24:43,235 --> 04:24:45,035
あれ？ここじゃなかったっけ？
Wait, wasn't it here?

5324
04:24:49,235 --> 04:24:50,935
死に損なった！
I failed to die!

5325
04:24:51,035 --> 04:24:52,335
ダメだ
No good.

5326
04:24:54,035 --> 04:24:57,035
いや まあまあまあやったからいっか
Well, whatever, I gave it a good shot so it's fine.

5327
04:24:57,935 --> 04:24:59,035
よいしょ
Alright.

5328
04:24:59,135 --> 04:25:00,735
ユニコーン…
Unicorn...

5329
04:25:01,035 --> 04:25:02,635
あ バック入れちゃった
Ah, I put it in reverse!

5330
04:25:07,556 --> 04:25:08,456
よいしょ
Here we go.

5331
04:25:08,656 --> 04:25:09,756
ドードー
Dodo.

5332
04:25:09,956 --> 04:25:11,956
あ、これでアスレチック行けるということ？
Ah, does this mean I can do the obstacle course?

5333
04:25:12,856 --> 04:25:13,856
こうだ
Like this.

5334
04:25:14,556 --> 04:25:15,556
よいしょ
Up we go.

5335
04:25:15,856 --> 04:25:18,256
Unicorn~

5336
04:25:18,556 --> 04:25:21,856
末長く溶岩洞窟で一緒ってこと
Does that mean we'll be together in the lava cave forever?

5337
04:25:23,056 --> 04:25:27,056
これどこだ？アスレチック。えーっと
Where is the obstacle course? Let's see...

5338
04:25:30,056 --> 04:25:33,056
んー、アスレチック is どれだ？
Hmm, which one is the obstacle course?

5339
04:25:38,856 --> 04:25:40,056
よいしょ
Up we go.

5340
04:25:41,056 --> 04:25:42,056
これか！
Is this it?!

5341
04:25:42,156 --> 04:25:44,556
アスレチック！あった！みんなやってる！
The obstacle course! Found it! Everyone's doing it!

5342
04:25:45,056 --> 04:25:47,556
あれ、これ戻ってきてるやつじゃん。草
Wait, this is the way back. lol

5343
04:25:50,856 --> 04:25:52,056
ほ
Hop.

5344
04:25:55,556 --> 04:25:56,656
おっ
Oh.

5345
04:25:59,856 --> 04:26:00,856
ほっ
Hop.

5346
04:26:02,056 --> 04:26:03,856
戻ってんじゃん
I'm heading back.

5347
04:26:09,056 --> 04:26:11,556
Unicorn~

5348
04:26:11,856 --> 04:26:14,056
ああ、引っかかっちゃう
Ah, I'm getting caught.

5349
04:26:16,556 --> 04:26:17,856
挟む
Getting stuck.

5350
04:26:23,556 --> 04:26:24,556
よいしょ
Up we go.

5351
04:26:26,056 --> 04:26:27,556
あ、もうちょっと勢いか
Ah, maybe a bit more momentum?

5352
04:26:28,256 --> 04:26:30,056
あっちもある？
Is there one over there too?

5353
04:26:30,856 --> 04:26:31,756
おふ
Oof.

5354
04:26:31,856 --> 04:26:33,556
で真ん中か
And then the middle?

5355
04:26:33,856 --> 04:26:34,856
よいしょ
Up we go.

5356
04:26:34,956 --> 04:26:36,556
へっほっへっほ
Heh-hoh-heh-hoh.

5357
04:26:37,056 --> 04:26:39,556
ああ、なんかジャンプ2回押しちゃった
Ah, I accidentally pressed jump twice.

5358
04:26:42,056 --> 04:26:43,056
ほり
Hup.

5359
04:26:43,856 --> 04:26:47,456
Yeah, it's not about taming it right now, it's about seeing it.

5360
04:26:47,856 --> 04:26:49,256
It's real.

5361
04:26:53,056 --> 04:26:54,056
よいしょ
Up we go.

5362
04:26:57,856 --> 04:26:58,856
おふ
Oof.

5363
04:27:00,856 --> 04:27:02,056
あった
There it is.

5364
04:27:02,856 --> 04:27:04,256
あ、行くか
Ah, shall we go?

5365
04:27:05,056 --> 04:27:06,056
Journey.

5366
04:27:06,156 --> 04:27:06,956
あっ
Ah.

5367
04:27:13,056 --> 04:27:15,056
It's for myself, not the point.

5368
04:27:15,556 --> 04:27:16,856
三角
Triangle.

5369
04:27:17,356 --> 04:27:18,856
三角
Triangle.

5370
04:27:19,056 --> 04:27:20,056
で
And...

5371
04:27:20,556 --> 04:27:22,556
三角？これ何だこれ
Triangle? What is this, what is this?

5372
04:27:23,056 --> 04:27:25,556
これ、これどうすればいいんだ？
This... what should I do with this?

5373
04:27:26,056 --> 04:27:28,056
この三角どうすんだ？
What do I do with this triangle?

5374
04:27:31,056 --> 04:27:32,556
ほ？これどうすんだ？
Huh? What do I do with this?

5375
04:27:33,856 --> 04:27:34,856
ん？
Hm?

5376
04:27:36,556 --> 04:27:38,056
これど、ど
Where do... do...

5377
04:27:40,056 --> 04:27:42,556
Unicorn~

5378
04:27:43,056 --> 04:27:44,056
あれか！
Is that it?!

5379
04:27:47,056 --> 04:27:50,056
あれ、これ戻ってきちゃった。またこれ戻ってきてる？
Wait, I came back here. Am I going back again?

5380
04:27:52,056 --> 04:27:54,556
え？これどこだ？え、どこどここれ？
Eh? Where is this? Eh, where, where is this?

5381
04:27:55,056 --> 04:27:57,056
は？ああ、上か！
Huh? Ah, above!

5382
04:27:59,056 --> 04:28:01,056
上か！
It was above!

5383
04:28:10,056 --> 04:28:11,056
えーっと
Let's see...

5384
04:28:11,856 --> 04:28:13,056
あっちか？
Over there?

5385
04:28:13,856 --> 04:28:14,856
よいしょ
Up we go.

5386
04:28:15,056 --> 04:28:17,856
ああ、誰か見つかったかな？ユニコーン
Ah, I wonder if someone found it? The unicorn.

5387
04:28:18,056 --> 04:28:19,556
んで、あっちか？
And then, over there?

5388
04:28:22,856 --> 04:28:24,056
ほうほう
I see, I see.

5389
04:28:25,056 --> 04:28:26,856
で、あっち、あっちか？
And then, that way, that way?

5390
04:28:28,856 --> 04:28:30,556
あ、落ちちゃった
Ah, I fell down.

5391
04:28:30,856 --> 04:28:31,856
よいしょ
Up we go.

5392
04:28:32,556 --> 04:28:33,556
おー
Oh.

5393
04:28:40,056 --> 04:28:42,056
あ、イベント終了！
Ah, the event has ended!

5394
04:28:42,056 --> 04:28:43,056
わあ！
Waaah!

5395
04:28:43,056 --> 04:28:44,856
ああー
Aaah.

5396
04:28:45,056 --> 04:28:46,256
よいしょ
Up we go.

5397
04:28:53,056 --> 04:28:54,056
よいしょ
Up we go.

5398
04:28:55,056 --> 04:28:57,556
あららら、終わった終わった
Oh dear, it's over, it's over.

5399
04:28:58,356 --> 04:28:59,356
ほ
Hop.

5400
04:29:00,056 --> 04:29:01,056
よいしょ
Up we go.

5401
04:29:01,856 --> 04:29:04,056
まあこれ、アスレチック行けたな
Well, I could have made it through the obstacle course.

5402
04:29:08,056 --> 04:29:10,056
おつー
Good work everyone~

5403
04:29:11,556 --> 04:29:13,556
あ、ちょっと足りない？
Ah, a little not enough?

5404
04:29:16,056 --> 04:29:17,556
よいしょ
Up we go.

5405
04:29:37,056 --> 04:29:41,556
Mama, what a beautiful way to end.

5406
04:29:44,056 --> 04:29:46,056
My first Ark...

5407
04:29:46,556 --> 04:29:49,556
Ark. Ark, ark.

5408
04:29:50,056 --> 04:29:52,556
Oh, so foggy.

5409
04:30:05,877 --> 04:30:07,877
I don't know where I'm going.

5410
04:30:25,577 --> 04:30:27,777
To the moon!

5411
04:30:29,477 --> 04:30:32,777
いや、ないよね、家に帰る...
Wait, no, going home...

5412
04:30:50,377 --> 04:30:54,577
No, it's like I don't remember where the teleporter was. I guess where Shishiron is.

5413
04:30:58,677 --> 04:31:00,777
Yeah, it's so peaceful.

5414
04:31:06,377 --> 04:31:09,677
Oh, big white cave.
Oh, a big white cave...

5415
04:31:11,077 --> 04:31:14,077
ござる、ごめんね。白組ボイチャが使えなくて。
Gozaru, sorry! Team White couldn't use voice chat.

5416
04:31:14,577 --> 04:31:16,277
あ、なるほど。
Ah, I see.

5417
04:31:17,177 --> 04:31:21,077
すまぬ。あのお腹すきすぎて気絶する！ご飯...
Forgive me. I'm so hungry I'm gonna pass out! Food...

5418
04:31:21,577 --> 04:31:23,077
やばい、やばい。
Uh oh, that's bad!

5419
04:31:23,577 --> 04:31:25,677
気絶したらその時や。
If you pass out, then so be it.

5420
04:31:26,077 --> 04:31:28,077
気絶したらその時。
Then so be it...

5421
04:31:29,877 --> 04:31:31,577
これ、なんか...
Is this, like...

5422
04:31:31,777 --> 04:31:32,577
あそこ？
Over there?

5423
04:31:32,677 --> 04:31:33,477
うん。
Yeah.

5424
04:31:34,877 --> 04:31:37,477
よいしょ。ワンチャン立っておくか。
All right. Maybe I'll stand up just in case.

5425
04:31:37,677 --> 04:31:38,477
重っ！
Heavy!

5426
04:31:38,577 --> 04:31:39,977
うわ、ビビ、猫ちゃん。
Whoa, Bibi, a kitty!

5427
04:31:39,877 --> 04:31:41,577
え、ここ何？
Eh, what's here?

5428
04:31:42,277 --> 04:31:45,077
ご飯なんかベリーか何かで凌げそうっすか？
Can you hold out on food with berries or something?

5429
04:31:45,177 --> 04:31:47,577
何もない！全裸で来ちゃった。
I don't have anything! I came here totally naked.

5430
04:31:47,077 --> 04:31:48,077
ベリー...
Berry...

5431
04:31:48,177 --> 04:31:50,977
ベリーならありますよ。ベリー要ります？
I have berries. Do you need berries?

5432
04:31:51,077 --> 04:31:54,077
ベリー欲しいけど、でもここまで来ちゃったから...
I want berries, but I've already made it this far, so...

5433
04:31:54,377 --> 04:31:57,077
じゃあ帰ってきたら取れるベリーを...
Then once you return, grab some berries...

5434
04:31:57,177 --> 04:31:59,677
あざす、あざす...落ちたもう...気絶値がやばい。
Thanks, thanks... I fell... My torpor is bad!

5435
04:32:00,277 --> 04:32:03,277
よいしょ。Over that too.
All right. Over that too.

5436
04:32:04,077 --> 04:32:07,177
Basically where the last death is, I think that's where...

5437
04:32:06,877 --> 04:32:08,977
ライトニングワイバーンだよ、これ。
This is a Lightning Wyvern!

5438
04:32:09,077 --> 04:32:11,277
え、45分までどこまで行けるかな、これ。
How far can we get by 45 minutes?

5439
04:32:10,477 --> 04:32:11,877
さっきのやつや。
That's the one from earlier!

5440
04:32:11,977 --> 04:32:14,077
ビビが乗り捨てたやつ、ワイバーン。
The Wyvern Bibi abandoned.

5441
04:32:14,177 --> 04:32:16,477
ござるのですね名残...
It's Gozaru's leftover...

5442
04:32:15,577 --> 04:32:17,677
It's a green pylon on me.

5443
04:32:17,277 --> 04:32:20,177
乗り捨てたやつ？ござる先輩のやつ乗り捨てた。
Abandoned? You abandoned Gozaru-senpai's mount!

5444
04:32:20,977 --> 04:32:22,077
悲しい。
How sad.

5445
04:32:22,177 --> 04:32:23,577
乗り捨てワイバーン。
An abandoned Wyvern.

5446
04:32:22,677 --> 04:32:24,077
優しくしてほしい。
Please be gentle.

5447
04:32:23,877 --> 04:32:24,877
間違えた。
My bad.

5448
04:32:25,177 --> 04:32:27,977
優しくしてほしい、俺のワイバーンに。
I want you to be gentle to my Wyvern!

5449
04:32:28,277 --> 04:32:31,577
はい。こっちだな。
Yes. This way.

5450
04:32:33,177 --> 04:32:35,077
よいしょ。ほいしょ。Okay.
Heave-ho. Oof. Okay.

5451
04:32:35,277 --> 04:32:37,477
Hm? Ah-ha.

5452
04:32:37,677 --> 04:32:39,077
低体温。
Hypothermia.

5453
04:32:39,177 --> 04:32:40,377
あれ、来ないな。
Huh, it's not coming.

5454
04:32:40,477 --> 04:32:41,977
あ、挟まってしまったんだ。
Ah, it got stuck.

5455
04:32:41,777 --> 04:32:43,277
頭にぶつかれず...
Couldn't hit the head...

5456
04:32:44,177 --> 04:32:45,577
うわ、怖い。
Whoa, scary.

5457
04:32:47,277 --> 04:32:51,377
おいー。なんかあそこの3番目にいつも引っかかっちゃうんだよな。
Hey! I always get caught on that third one over there.

5458
04:32:52,577 --> 04:32:55,577
難しいですよね、この3番目のここ。
That third spot is really tough, isn't it?

5459
04:32:55,677 --> 04:32:56,677
ねー。
Yeah.

5460
04:32:57,077 --> 04:32:57,977
Oh.

5461
04:32:57,877 --> 04:32:59,477
頑張ってー。
Do your best!

5462
04:32:59,577 --> 04:33:03,277
慣性、左に入れたら行きやすくなってたけど、どうなんだろう。
Steering with inertia to the left helped, but I wonder.

5463
04:33:03,677 --> 04:33:08,577
でも慣性早めに入れすぎると、なんか体が弾くのか知らないけど乗れないんですよね。
If you turn too early with inertia, it bounces you off and you can't land on it.

5464
04:33:08,677 --> 04:33:09,577
ねー。
Yeah.

5465
04:33:09,777 --> 04:33:11,077
へー。
Huh.

5466
04:33:12,177 --> 04:33:14,077
あ、来た来た来た来た。
Ah, here it comes!

5467
04:33:14,177 --> 04:33:15,277
起きた？うそ。
It woke up? No way.

5468
04:33:15,377 --> 04:33:16,277
あ、来た来た。
Ah, here it comes.

5469
04:33:16,277 --> 04:33:18,577
あー、行けなかった！行けなかった！
Ah, I didn't make it! I didn't make it!

5470
04:33:19,377 --> 04:33:21,877
うんこでもするか、久しぶりに。
Maybe I should go poop for the first time in a while.

5471
04:33:21,277 --> 04:33:22,577
何言ってるんだ。
What are you saying?!

5472
04:33:22,277 --> 04:33:23,377
久しぶりに...
For the first time...

5473
04:33:23,477 --> 04:33:25,877
トイレで！トイレで。
In the toilet! In the toilet.

5474
04:33:26,077 --> 04:33:27,877
久しぶりのトイレ。
Toilet after so long.

5475
04:33:28,077 --> 04:33:31,577
なんかもう最後うんこする暇なかったからな。
There was no time to poop at the end!

5476
04:33:31,677 --> 04:33:33,477
垂れ流し、垂れ流し！
Just letting it loose, letting it loose!

5477
04:33:33,377 --> 04:33:36,077
ね。トイレ寄る時間がなかったわ。
Yeah. There was no time to stop by the toilet.

5478
04:33:37,077 --> 04:33:39,277
トイレ扱ったのも最初くらい...
Using the toilet was only at the very beginning...

5479
04:33:39,377 --> 04:33:41,077
確かに。ほんまやで。
True. That's for sure.

5480
04:33:41,877 --> 04:33:43,077
ほんまやで。
That's so true.

5481
04:33:44,077 --> 04:33:45,277
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

5482
04:33:45,377 --> 04:33:46,577
楽しかったな。
That was fun.

5483
04:33:46,377 --> 04:33:48,777
白追従してるよ、大丈夫？
It's following Shiro, you okay?

5484
04:33:49,077 --> 04:33:52,877
え？嘘、来てる？あ、ほんまや！来てる来てる。
Eh? No way, it's following? Ah, for real! It is, it is.

5485
04:33:54,077 --> 04:33:56,577
すげー。ワイバーンかっこいいな。
Awesome. Wyverns are so cool.

5486
04:33:58,077 --> 04:34:00,877
どうやって乗るの？こっちにおいで。
How do I ride this? Come over here.

5487
04:34:01,077 --> 04:34:04,277
やばい、なんかバグって時計が...いのちのカウントダウン、あと10分か。
The clock bugged out... 10 minutes until the end of life countdown?

5488
04:34:04,377 --> 04:34:04,977
いのちのカウント...
End of life count...

5489
04:34:05,077 --> 04:34:06,877
結構離れた方がいいかもね。
Might be better to stay far away.

5490
04:34:07,077 --> 04:34:09,777
45分から閉会式ですもんね。
The closing ceremony starts at 45, right?

5491
04:34:09,877 --> 04:34:11,877
うん、そうだね。遊ぼ。
Yeah, that's right. Let's hang out.

5492
04:34:12,077 --> 04:34:14,177
じゃあそれまでここで。
Let's stay here until then.

5493
04:34:14,677 --> 04:34:16,877
着いた着いた着いた着いた。
Arrived, arrived!

5494
04:34:18,377 --> 04:34:20,077
あれ？何何？
Huh? What, what?

5495
04:34:20,177 --> 04:34:22,277
えー！なんか、な、なんだ今の？
Ehh! What was that just now?

5496
04:34:22,077 --> 04:34:23,577
ふーん、ふーん。
Hmm, hmm.

5497
04:34:23,877 --> 04:34:25,077
よいしょ。
Heave-ho.

5498
04:34:26,077 --> 04:34:30,077
どこかなー？
Where could it be...?

5499
04:34:30,277 --> 04:34:37,077
閉会式のステージギリギリに行こうかなと思ってたけど、ちょっとあのーいっぱいいると、集まったら耳が死にそう。
I thought about going right before the closing ceremony stage, but if too many gather, our ears might die.

5500
04:34:38,877 --> 04:34:39,977
確かに。
True.

5501
04:34:40,077 --> 04:34:41,877
確かに、そうだね。
Indeed, that's true.

5502
04:34:42,877 --> 04:34:44,877
よーし。なんかめっちゃアスレチックに...
All right. Really into the obstacle course...

5503
04:34:44,877 --> 04:34:46,877
この、この先なんだ！
Past this point!

5504
04:34:47,577 --> 04:34:50,177
もうここの先行ったらゴールだったのか。
If I just went past here, that was the goal?

5505
04:34:50,377 --> 04:34:51,577
くそー！
Damn it!

5506
04:34:51,677 --> 04:34:53,377
三角のとこね。
At the triangle spot, right?

5507
04:34:53,377 --> 04:34:54,277
ぎゅーって。
Tight squeeze.

5508
04:34:54,377 --> 04:34:56,577
アスレチック、ワンチャンあったなー。
There was totally a chance on that obstacle course...

5509
04:34:56,377 --> 04:34:57,677
絶対行けるよ！
You can definitely make it!

5510
04:34:57,877 --> 04:34:59,377
はい、はい、はい、はい！
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

5511
04:34:59,477 --> 04:35:01,277
絶対行けたからなー！
I could totally have made it!

5512
04:35:01,277 --> 04:35:03,277
いや、全然、全然、全然！
No, no way, no way at all!

5513
04:35:03,577 --> 04:35:05,077
じゃあもう交代して...
Well then, switch over...

5514
04:35:05,698 --> 04:35:07,098
交代すればよかったね。
I should have swapped with you.

5515
04:35:07,398 --> 04:35:09,198
あそこジャンプでいい気…
I feel like a jump there would...

5516
04:35:09,198 --> 04:35:11,998
いやもう1時間くらいはいたけど無理だったわ。
No, I was there for like an hour, but it was impossible.

5517
04:35:12,198 --> 04:35:13,398
あんぬまり散らかしてた？
Were you totally stuck there?

5518
04:35:13,498 --> 04:35:14,198
うん。
Yeah.

5519
04:35:15,498 --> 04:35:18,998
三角のところ何回か行ったけど…
I went over to the triangular part several times, but...

5520
04:35:19,098 --> 04:35:22,198
なんか上にやっぱり板があってジャンプがシビアだから。
there was a board above after all, so the jump timing was really strict.

5521
04:35:22,198 --> 04:35:24,098
あー、ここなのか。なるほどね。
Ah, it's here? I see.

5522
04:35:24,098 --> 04:35:26,098
このね、最後のとこね。
Yeah, right here at the very end.

5523
04:35:26,098 --> 04:35:28,098
うん。そこが結構シビアで。
Yeah, that part is pretty tough.

5524
04:35:28,498 --> 04:35:30,098
お手洗い行ってきます。
Going to wash my hands, be right back.

5525
04:35:30,098 --> 04:35:33,098
閉会式のボ…ゲーム内ボイチャ何も聞こえないんだな、きっと。
The closing ceremony... they probably can't hear in-game VC at all.

5526
04:35:33,198 --> 04:35:34,098
え？
Huh?

5527
04:35:34,098 --> 04:35:36,098
あー、画面見せてもらえばいいのか。
Ah, they can just share screens.

5528
04:35:36,098 --> 04:35:37,098
あー、いいね。
Ah, nice idea.

5529
04:35:36,998 --> 04:35:38,798
助かりんちょ。助かりんちょ。
Super helpful!

5530
04:35:38,898 --> 04:35:40,398
ナイスー！
Nice!

5531
04:35:41,498 --> 04:35:42,498
ナイスー。
Nice.

5532
04:35:42,498 --> 04:35:43,498
よいしょ。
Yoisho.

5533
04:35:43,698 --> 04:35:48,098
もうちょっとがんば…あそこ…なんかタイミングがつかめれば…
If I pushed a bit more... if I could just get the timing down there...

5534
04:35:49,298 --> 04:35:51,598
ワンチャン行けたんかなぁ。
Maybe I could've made it.

5535
04:35:51,698 --> 04:35:52,598
くっ。
Gah.

5536
04:35:53,498 --> 04:35:56,098
どうだった？というかあのボス。
How was it? I mean, the boss?

5537
04:35:57,098 --> 04:36:01,098
いやー、ボスはね、うん、大変だったな。
Well, the boss was, yeah, really tough.

5538
04:36:00,798 --> 04:36:02,698
大変だったよ。一応クリアしてましたよね？
It was rough. But you cleared it, right?

5539
04:36:02,798 --> 04:36:04,098
うん、クリアはできた。
Yeah, we cleared it.

5540
04:36:04,198 --> 04:36:05,698
そう、何があったの？
Yeah, what happened?

5541
04:36:06,098 --> 04:36:08,998
リポップが来なくてね。
The repop didn't happen.

5542
04:36:09,098 --> 04:36:10,198
あー、なるほど。
Ah, I see.

5543
04:36:10,198 --> 04:36:11,898
リポップ待ちだった。
We were waiting for the repop.

5544
04:36:13,598 --> 04:36:19,098
「これ湧くのかな？」みたいな感じに行って、ウエッティさんに言ったら間引いて沸かせてもらえたから。
We wondered, "Is this gonna spawn?" and told Watty-san, who cleared some spawns to make it appear.

5545
04:36:19,398 --> 04:36:20,598
あー。
Ah.

5546
04:36:20,698 --> 04:36:22,098
そうそうそう。よかったね。
Yeah, exactly. Glad to hear.

5547
04:36:22,298 --> 04:36:24,498
よかったよかった。よかった。
That's great, that's great.

5548
04:36:24,998 --> 04:36:28,098
え、あれ上がれたんですか？下から。
Wait, were they able to get up from below?

5549
04:36:28,298 --> 04:36:31,598
あ、下からあれを上げてもらった。ちょっとバグってたからね、挙動が。
Ah, they had it raised from below. The behavior was a bit buggy, after all.

5550
04:36:31,898 --> 04:36:33,998
前だったっけ？こっちだったっけ？
Was it in front? Or over here?

5551
04:36:34,098 --> 04:36:38,998
よかったですね。でもなんか色々バグっちゃってたけど。
Good thing! Though there were various bugs...

5552
04:36:39,098 --> 04:36:41,098
よかったよかった。よいしょ。
Glad it worked out. Yoisho.

5553
04:36:43,298 --> 04:36:44,098
嬉しかったよ、あのあすれで。
I was so happy during the obstacle course.

5554
04:36:46,298 --> 04:36:51,098
アスレにいる時に「お片付けできるもん」が極秘ミッションをクリアしましたって出てきて。
While doing the course, it showed "'Tidying Up' cleared the top-secret mission!"

5555
04:36:51,498 --> 04:36:55,098
出た出た！ギリギリでよかった！
That popped up! Glad we made it just in time!

5556
04:36:55,598 --> 04:36:56,698
よいしょ。
Yoisho.

5557
04:36:57,098 --> 04:37:00,398
ワンチャン間に合わないかも、みたいに言ってたからね。
Because you were saying you might not make it in time.

5558
04:37:00,398 --> 04:37:01,098
ねー。
Yeah.

5559
04:37:01,198 --> 04:37:03,098
あ、結構ギリギリだったんだ。
Ah, it was really down to the wire.

5560
04:37:03,098 --> 04:37:04,098
そうそうそうそう。
Yeah, exactly.

5561
04:37:04,398 --> 04:37:06,098
でもマジでナイス！
But seriously, nice job!

5562
04:37:07,098 --> 04:37:11,598
すみません、私が…アスレできなくて…
I'm sorry... I couldn't do the obstacle course...

5563
04:37:12,498 --> 04:37:15,098
テイムの方は行けたんだっけ？結局。
Were you able to tame in the end?

5564
04:37:15,098 --> 04:37:19,098
テイム行けたんですけど…ティラノが全然見つからなくて…
We went taming, but couldn't find any Rexes at all...

5565
04:37:19,298 --> 04:37:22,098
あー、もうみんなティラノ狩りしてたんだろ、多分。
Ah, everyone was probably Rex hunting.

5566
04:37:22,098 --> 04:37:25,098
そう、もうティラノはいけませんでした。足りなくて。
Yeah, we couldn't get Rexes. Not enough around.

5567
04:37:25,198 --> 04:37:27,098
あらららら。あらら。
Oh dear. Oh my.

5568
04:37:28,098 --> 04:37:32,598
ナイスファイトだよ、ナイスファイト！ナイファイだよ！
Nice fight though, nice fight!

5569
04:37:32,598 --> 04:37:34,598
頑張りましたよ、みんな。
Everyone worked so hard.

5570
04:37:34,698 --> 04:37:39,098
あ、やべ。ティラノ完売！ティラノ完売！もういません！
Oh crap, Rexes sold out! Rexes sold out! None left!

5571
04:37:41,598 --> 04:37:42,698
よいしょ。
Yoisho.

5572
04:37:43,098 --> 04:37:45,598
ユニコーンも見つからずでした。
And we couldn't find a unicorn either.

5573
04:37:45,898 --> 04:37:47,098
あー、ね。
Ah, yeah.

5574
04:37:47,498 --> 04:37:50,098
ユニコーン！
Unicorn!

5575
04:37:51,098 --> 04:37:54,098
人参を持ってめっちゃ待機してたのに。
Even though I was waiting ready with carrots.

5576
04:37:54,098 --> 04:37:55,098
あー。
Ah.

5577
04:37:55,098 --> 04:37:58,998
口で咥えたかったな。ユニコーンも人参食いたかっただろうな。
Wanted to feed it. The unicorn probably wanted to eat carrots too.

5578
04:37:59,098 --> 04:38:02,098
このワールドのどこかで泣いてるよ。
It's crying somewhere in this world.

5579
04:38:02,098 --> 04:38:05,098
しくしく。見つけてもらえなくて悲しい、悲しい。
*Sniff sniff* "Nobody found me, so sad, so sad."

5580
04:38:05,098 --> 04:38:08,098
どっかにいるんかな、ほんまに。どっかには絶対いる。
Is it really out there somewhere? It's definitely somewhere.

5581
04:38:08,698 --> 04:38:10,098
伝説じゃないんだ。
It's not just a legend.

5582
04:38:10,198 --> 04:38:13,598
そう、このワールドに1匹だけ存在する。
Right, only one exists in this entire world.

5583
04:38:14,098 --> 04:38:17,898
1匹だけっていうのはなかなかですよね。ねー。
Having just one is pretty rare, isn't it? Yeah.

5584
04:38:18,098 --> 04:38:22,598
見てみたかったなー、ユニコーン。見てみたかったな。
I really wanted to see one... a unicorn.

5585
04:38:24,898 --> 04:38:27,598
ロマン。この鯖で1匹。
Pure romance. Just one on this whole server.

5586
04:38:29,098 --> 04:38:33,098
でも見つけに行く時間なかった、余裕ない。そうね。
But there was no time to go look for it, no leeway. True.

5587
04:38:33,298 --> 04:38:35,098
ねー。
Yeah.

5588
04:38:35,098 --> 04:38:37,098
もうちょっと範囲あるかな。
Does it have a bit more range?

5589
04:38:37,198 --> 04:38:39,098
へいへいへい。よいしょ。
Hey hey hey. Yoisho.

5590
04:38:41,598 --> 04:38:45,098
ほい。あー、あそこどうやって乗ろう？
Hup. Ah, how do I get on over there?

5591
04:38:46,898 --> 04:38:52,098
なんか雪フクロウが…雪フクロウだ！いいな、雪フクロウ。
There's a Snow Owl... It's a Snow Owl! Lucky, a Snow Owl!

5592
04:38:53,398 --> 04:38:57,098
えーっと待ってよ。雪フクロウ…
Uh, hold on. Snow Owl...

5593
04:38:58,098 --> 04:39:02,098
あー、なんかここ行けなくなっちゃった。なるほど、空中機動変化。
Ah, I can't go here anymore. I see, aerial maneuver change.

5594
04:39:02,498 --> 04:39:09,098
うん。あ、レアポップだけどないんだ。1匹しか湧かないみたいな。
Yeah. Ah, it's a rare pop so there aren't any? Like only one spawns at a time.

5595
04:39:09,598 --> 04:39:12,598
へー。1匹ずつなのかな？
Huh. Maybe just one at a time?

5596
04:39:16,798 --> 04:39:17,598
よいしょ。
Yoisho.

5597
04:39:19,098 --> 04:39:21,098
もうみんなうんちしまくり。
Everyone's pooping all over the place.

5598
04:39:24,098 --> 04:39:27,098
うんち。うんちマンだ。
Poop. It's the Poop Man.

5599
04:39:28,098 --> 04:39:30,098
あー、行けないや。
Ah, can't make it.

5600
04:39:32,098 --> 04:39:35,598
ここの三角1個目までは登れるんだけどな。
I can climb up to the first triangle here, though.

5601
04:39:35,898 --> 04:39:38,098
あ、変なキー入れちゃった、今。
Ah, I hit the wrong key just now.

5602
04:39:39,098 --> 04:39:41,098
ほいっと。
Hup.

5603
04:39:45,098 --> 04:39:48,098
またご飯が足りなくなってなー。
I'm running out of food again...

5604
04:39:48,198 --> 04:39:50,598
水もない。頑張れ頑張れ！
No water either. Hang in there, hang in there!

5605
04:39:51,098 --> 04:39:51,998
よ。
Yo.

5606
04:39:53,098 --> 04:39:57,098
あ、もう水無くなってね？もう水ねえや。
Ah, is the water already gone? No water left.

5607
04:39:58,098 --> 04:40:01,598
水分が…水ないです。
Hydration is... There's no water.

5608
04:40:03,398 --> 04:40:04,898
プテラ…
Pteranodon...

5609
04:40:05,119 --> 04:40:06,119
おいっと
Whoops.

5610
04:40:06,119 --> 04:40:07,219
あれ？まだね、まだね、まだ
Huh? Not yet, not yet, not yet.

5611
04:40:07,219 --> 04:40:09,119
ああ、乗れなくなっちゃった、もう
Ah, I can't ride it anymore, jeez.

5612
04:40:09,219 --> 04:40:11,419
ユキフクロウ可愛い
Snow Owls are so cute.

5613
04:40:11,719 --> 04:40:14,019
ユキフクロウいいよね。回復もできるし
Snow Owls are great. They can heal, too.

5614
04:40:14,419 --> 04:40:16,519
もう大好き、ユキフクロウ
I just love Snow Owls.

5615
04:40:16,819 --> 04:40:18,619
優秀、優秀
They're so useful, so useful.

5616
04:40:21,619 --> 04:40:23,619
これも俺も... 俺も回復してー
Me too... Heal me too!

5617
04:40:23,919 --> 04:40:26,119
一緒に固まってー、頼む。ああー
Gather together, please! Ahh...

5618
04:40:27,119 --> 04:40:29,519
てか、あれを...あれをしたいんだよ
Anyway, I want to do... that thing.

5619
04:40:29,819 --> 04:40:33,119
よいしょ。ちょっと一回出ちゃおう。よいしょ
Alright. Let's just step out for a bit. There we go.

5620
04:40:33,619 --> 04:40:37,119
おお、行って... えーっと、寄付金もして... ふぅ
Oh, go on... Let's see, do some imprinting too... Whew.

5621
04:40:37,619 --> 04:40:39,119
むず
That's hard.

5622
04:40:39,619 --> 04:40:42,019
上空にいるの... やばいやばい何これ
It's in the sky... Oh no, oh no, what is this?!

5623
04:40:42,119 --> 04:40:43,919
ワイバーン君が。よいしょ
The Wyvern is... Up we go.

5624
04:40:44,319 --> 04:40:46,619
止められてただけあるな
Figures it was stopped.

5625
04:40:46,919 --> 04:40:50,619
2期間やってるからですよ。もう、あそこはさらに...
That's because we've been doing it for two terms. Now, over there is further...

5626
04:40:51,119 --> 04:40:53,619
タズタズタズタズ... お、なんか
Tazu tazu tazu... Oh, something...

5627
04:40:55,119 --> 04:40:57,619
よいしょ、ひゅいー
Up we go, wheee~

5628
04:40:59,119 --> 04:41:01,619
今集計中なんだろうなー
They must be tallying up the results right now.

5629
04:41:01,819 --> 04:41:03,619
ね、多分ねー
Yeah, probably.

5630
04:41:04,119 --> 04:41:05,119
にょ
Nyo.

5631
04:41:05,119 --> 04:41:07,619
周会場の恐竜... 周会場の恐竜
Dinosaurs at the meeting ground... Dinosaurs at the meeting ground...

5632
04:41:07,919 --> 04:41:10,619
事故防止のため...
To prevent accidents...

5633
04:41:10,919 --> 04:41:15,619
え、解き放ったワイバーンちょっと... なんで解き放ってきちゃったんですかー
Wait, who released that Wyvern? Why did you let it loose?!

5634
04:41:15,919 --> 04:41:18,619
ワイバーン... ワイバーンどこいんだ？
Wyvern... Where is the Wyvern?

5635
04:41:18,919 --> 04:41:23,119
そこにいるワイバーン... 乗ってるのかい？乗ってるの？乗ってるならいいか
That Wyvern there... Is someone riding it? You're on it? If you're on it, then fine.

5636
04:41:23,319 --> 04:41:26,619
ほな... ほなええか。ほな
Well... Then it's fine. Well then.

5637
04:41:30,619 --> 04:41:32,619
でも、ボンベがないなー
But there's no oxygen tank.

5638
04:41:33,119 --> 04:41:35,619
周会場の中にありよ
It's inside the meeting ground.

5639
04:41:35,919 --> 04:41:36,619
うん
Yeah.

5640
04:41:37,119 --> 04:41:39,619
はい。よいしょ
Okay. Here we go.

5641
04:41:42,119 --> 04:41:43,619
これで
With this...

5642
04:41:43,919 --> 04:41:47,119
ワンワン... ワンワンしまった方がいいか？ワンワン来てるか
Wanwan... Should I put Wanwan away? Is Wanwan here?

5643
04:41:47,619 --> 04:41:49,319
ツェッペリン
Zeppelin.

5644
04:41:49,319 --> 04:41:52,119
やばい、入らない。俺はツェッペリンに乗っていくぜ、周会場に
Oh no, it doesn't fit. I'm riding the Zeppelin to the meeting ground!

5645
04:41:52,119 --> 04:41:55,119
いいね。ツェッペリン持ってきて、スバちゃん！
Nice! Bring the Zeppelin, Suba-chan!

5646
04:41:55,319 --> 04:41:59,919
みんなでツェッペリンに乗ってー、周会場のド真ん中でツェッペリンで鎮座しよう
Let's all ride the Zeppelin and park it right in the middle of the meeting area!

5647
04:42:00,319 --> 04:42:03,319
あ、じゃあツェッペリン取りに行くかー
Ah, guess I'll go get the Zeppelin then.

5648
04:42:03,619 --> 04:42:06,119
今取ってる取ってる！持ってってる持ってってる！
I'm grabbing it now! Bringing it over!

5649
04:42:06,119 --> 04:42:09,319
もう水の耐久値ないから... ごめんごめん！
I'm running out of water... Sorry, sorry!

5650
04:42:09,619 --> 04:42:11,619
邪魔すぎるなこれ
This is way too in the way.

5651
04:42:11,619 --> 04:42:15,119
水ヤバい自分も。ヤバい、水分ヤバかった。水もねえや
My water is low too. Oh man, dehydration is bad. No water either.

5652
04:42:15,619 --> 04:42:17,319
下ろしてー
Let me down~

5653
04:42:17,319 --> 04:42:18,919
ちょっと待ってねー
Hold on a sec~

5654
04:42:18,919 --> 04:42:21,119
はい。体痛っ
Okay. My body aches.

5655
04:42:22,619 --> 04:42:24,619
戻るぞ戻るぞー
Heading back, heading back!

5656
04:42:26,119 --> 04:42:29,119
お、お、お、ごめん。引き込まれる
Whoa, whoa, sorry. I'm getting sucked in.

5657
04:42:30,119 --> 04:42:33,119
あの、どこから行ったらいいのかな？
Um, where should I go from?

5658
04:42:33,119 --> 04:42:35,119
ちょっと... ごめん
Wait... sorry.

5659
04:42:35,119 --> 04:42:37,119
いいで、ちょっと待って
It's fine, hold on.

5660
04:42:38,119 --> 04:42:40,619
お、プションで
Oh, with a potion.

5661
04:42:42,119 --> 04:42:44,119
ちゃうちゃうちゃうちゃう
No no no no.

5662
04:42:44,119 --> 04:42:46,119
はい、お待たせしましたー
Alright, thank you for waiting!

5663
04:42:46,619 --> 04:42:49,619
はい、おむ... すいませーん
Yes, om... Excuse me~

5664
04:42:49,619 --> 04:42:53,119
ツェッペリンってあれテレポート出来たんですか？
Could you teleport with that Zeppelin?

5665
04:42:53,119 --> 04:42:56,619
乗れないから今移動しようとしている
We can't ride it, so we're trying to move it now.

5666
04:42:56,619 --> 04:42:58,119
あ、なるほど
Ah, I see.

5667
04:42:58,119 --> 04:43:01,119
空赤っ！なんだこれ
The sky is so red! What is this?!

5668
04:43:01,119 --> 04:43:03,119
あ、閉会式...
Ah, the closing ceremony...

5669
04:43:03,119 --> 04:43:05,119
よいしょ、ほれ
Up we go, here.

5670
04:43:05,119 --> 04:43:07,619
始まっちゃった？
Has it started?

5671
04:43:07,619 --> 04:43:13,619
ほい。これ閉会式中に絶対めちゃくちゃご飯とか足んなくなるやつやんけ
Yup. This is definitely going to run out of food during the closing ceremony.

5672
04:43:13,619 --> 04:43:15,619
あれ、ワイバーンどこ行った？
Wait, where did the Wyvern go?

5673
04:43:15,619 --> 04:43:18,619
どこだ？会場ってどこにあるんですか？
Where is it? Where is the venue located?

5674
04:43:19,119 --> 04:43:21,119
あ、めっちゃでかいウンチしてる
Ah, it's taking a massive poop.

5675
04:43:21,119 --> 04:43:25,119
緑ポイントに... 最初のところなのかな？
At the green waypoint... Is it at the starting area?

5676
04:43:25,119 --> 04:43:28,119
ツェッペリンってはしご下ろせたらしい
Apparently you can lower a ladder from the Zeppelin.

5677
04:43:28,119 --> 04:43:32,119
へー。そうそう横にはしごってのがあったんだよ
Huh. Yeah, there was a ladder on the side.

5678
04:43:32,119 --> 04:43:34,119
へー、知らなかったー
Oh, I had no idea~

5679
04:43:35,119 --> 04:43:38,119
おいし... 知らなかったー
Tasty... I didn't know that either~

5680
04:43:38,119 --> 04:43:44,119
いっぱいあれだね、今回は新しい知らないことがいっぱいあったけど、みんな頑張れたね
There were so many new things we didn't know this time, but everyone did great.

5681
04:43:44,119 --> 04:43:46,619
いや本当だよー。うん
No kidding. Yeah.

5682
04:43:46,619 --> 04:43:49,119
すごかったー
It was amazing~

5683
04:43:49,619 --> 04:43:55,119
よいしょ。いやー、やったことないマップだったから塔も全く分かんなかったなー
Alright. Man, it was a map I'd never played, so I had no idea about the towers at all.

5684
04:43:55,619 --> 04:44:00,619
結構システム、え、ASAでしたっけ？それも含めて変わってましたからね
The systems, like ASA, right? Including that, so much had changed.

5685
04:44:00,619 --> 04:44:02,119
うん、ねー
Yeah, totally.

5686
04:44:02,119 --> 04:44:08,619
恐竜とかもね、その使い方がとか新しい恐竜とかを調べたりしてね
With the dinos too, looking up how to use them, or researching new dinos.

5687
04:44:08,619 --> 04:44:10,119
ねー
Yeah.

5688
04:44:10,619 --> 04:44:13,619
あっちだ、雪山を越えなきゃいけない。雪山やば
Over there, have to cross the snowy mountain. The snow mountain is brutal.

5689
04:44:13,619 --> 04:44:15,919
「ここに行け」行きます
"Go here", on my way!

5690
04:44:15,919 --> 04:44:19,619
「ここに行け」... ここに行け？
"Go here"... Go here?

5691
04:44:20,119 --> 04:44:23,119
始まる？始まるらしいぞ
Starting? Sounds like it's starting.

5692
04:44:23,119 --> 04:44:27,119
始まるか。小猿がめっちょ膨れると嬉しい
Starting, huh. I'd love it if the little monkey puffed up huge.

5693
04:44:27,119 --> 04:44:29,619
オッケーです。ちょっと待機を
All good. Please wait a bit.

5694
04:44:30,119 --> 04:44:33,619
やばい人いっぱいあ、絶対。人いっぱいすぎてやばいかも
Oh no, there are so many people. Too many people, this might lag bad.

5695
04:44:34,119 --> 04:44:37,619
ちょいちょい重くて
It's lagging quite a bit.

5696
04:44:38,619 --> 04:44:40,119
ふぅー
Whew~

5697
04:44:41,119 --> 04:44:42,619
よーし
Alright.

5698
04:44:42,619 --> 04:44:45,119
これどうですか？見えてます？
How's this? Can you see it?

5699
04:44:45,119 --> 04:44:46,619
お、わー
Oh, wow.

5700
04:44:46,619 --> 04:44:50,119
いーと。ありがたーい
Nice. So grateful~

5701
04:44:50,619 --> 04:44:53,119
なんかあっという間だったな、マジで
It went by in a flash, seriously.

5702
04:44:53,119 --> 04:44:57,119
あっという間だけどさ、なんでこんなに濃いんだろうね
It was in a flash, but why was it so packed and intense?

5703
04:44:57,119 --> 04:44:59,119
あ、すごい！
Ah, awesome!

5704
04:45:00,119 --> 04:45:02,119
2日間だったって
It was only two days!

5705
04:45:02,119 --> 04:45:04,919
眩し！Ouch
So bright! Ouch.

5706
04:45:05,140 --> 04:45:06,940
眩しっ！確かにこれ...
So blinding! For sure, this...

5707
04:45:06,940 --> 04:45:08,640
まつり先輩！
Matsuri-senpai!

5708
04:45:09,640 --> 04:45:11,140
ねー、眩しい
Yeah, it's so blinding.

5709
04:45:11,140 --> 04:45:13,640
えーっと...
Umm...

5710
04:45:14,640 --> 04:45:16,340
やばい
This is bad.

5711
04:45:16,340 --> 04:45:19,640
喉が渇いてる、お茶なんかなかったんだ
My throat is dry. I guess there wasn't any tea.

5712
04:45:19,940 --> 04:45:21,940
やばい、なんかめっちゃ...
Oh no, it's really...

5713
04:45:22,140 --> 04:45:25,640
水が無い、水が
There's no water! No water!

5714
04:45:26,640 --> 04:45:28,640
水が...
Water...

5715
04:45:31,640 --> 04:45:33,940
殴らないでよー！
Don't punch me!

5716
04:45:34,040 --> 04:45:35,640
No, don't hit her!

5717
04:45:35,940 --> 04:45:37,940
How does it feel?

5718
04:45:38,140 --> 04:45:40,940
傷口に...
Into the wound...

5719
04:45:41,140 --> 04:45:43,640
すごく殴り合ってる
They're really punching each other.

5720
04:45:43,940 --> 04:45:47,640
やべぇ...会場バリバリ音するわ
Oh man... The venue is making crunching sounds.

5721
04:45:47,940 --> 04:45:49,940
やばい、大丈夫か
Oh no, are you okay?

5722
04:45:50,140 --> 04:45:53,140
水が無い...
There's no water...

5723
04:45:53,340 --> 04:45:56,340
水筒一個だけあるけど
I only have one canteen, though.

5724
04:45:56,640 --> 04:45:58,440
ルイ先輩がしゃべってる
Lui-senpai is talking.

5725
04:45:58,640 --> 04:46:00,940
会場にいないけど会場の声は...
We're not in the venue, but the voice there...

5726
04:46:00,940 --> 04:46:03,940
これじゃ何も聞こえないから会話は大丈夫や
...means we can't hear anything, so talking is fine.

5727
04:46:04,940 --> 04:46:07,940
声は一旦しまって
Let's keep our voices down for now.

5728
04:46:07,940 --> 04:46:10,440
聞こえてる、ありがとう
I hear you, thank you.

5729
04:46:10,440 --> 04:46:14,340
恐竜しまいたいんだけどさ、エイムが全然合わなくて
I want to store my dino, but my aim won't lock on at all.

5730
04:46:14,640 --> 04:46:18,640
ボール入んないよね、分かる
It won't go in the ball, right? I feel you.

5731
04:46:19,140 --> 04:46:23,640
はい、集まり次第始めていきますので、ご静粛にお願いいたします
Yes, we will start as soon as everyone gathers, so please be quiet.

5732
04:46:23,940 --> 04:46:26,340
誰か入れてくれないかな
I wonder if someone can let me in.

5733
04:46:26,340 --> 04:46:28,640
水、水...よいしょ
Water, water... There.

5734
04:46:33,140 --> 04:46:36,640
当たり判定マジ厳しくない？
Isn't the hitbox seriously strict?

5735
04:46:37,940 --> 04:46:40,340
外に連れ出してから...
Take it outside first...

5736
04:46:40,340 --> 04:46:42,940
うん、それがいいかも。みんなボリボリ食ってる
Yeah, that might be better. Everyone's crunching and eating.

5737
04:46:43,140 --> 04:46:47,640
あーなんか設定...
Ah, something in the settings...

5738
04:46:47,940 --> 04:46:50,940
まだ集まれてないチームメンバーはいますか？
Are there any team members who haven't gathered yet?

5739
04:46:51,140 --> 04:46:53,940
コンパニオンモードな
Companion mode.

5740
04:46:53,940 --> 04:46:56,340
ぺこら先輩落ちたかも
Pekora-senpai might have crashed.

5741
04:46:56,340 --> 04:46:58,940
ぺこらちゃんね、今再起してる、あきちゃん
Pekora-chan is restarting right now, Aki-chan.

5742
04:46:58,940 --> 04:47:00,940
オッケー、ちょっと待ちましょう
Okay, let's wait a moment.

5743
04:47:03,140 --> 04:47:08,940
チームCフブキ先輩がVC聞こえなくなったみたいで画面共有で見てるんで一旦こっちは大丈夫です
In Team C, Fubuki-senpai can't hear voice chat and is watching via screen share, so we're okay for now.

5744
04:47:08,940 --> 04:47:10,940
了解しました
Understood.

5745
04:47:11,140 --> 04:47:13,640
お疲れ様、お疲れ様
Good work, everyone. Good job.

5746
04:47:13,640 --> 04:47:16,340
解除したよー。お疲れ様、お疲れ
I disabled it~ Good work, everyone.

5747
04:47:21,140 --> 04:47:24,640
でかいな
That's huge.

5748
04:47:27,140 --> 04:47:29,140
あ、戻った戻った
Ah, she's back, she's back.

5749
04:47:30,640 --> 04:47:32,940
ぺこら帰ってきた！ぺこらいける？
Pekora is back! Pekora, are you good?

5750
04:47:33,140 --> 04:47:35,140
結構大丈夫そうかね
Looks like everyone's mostly alright.

5751
04:47:35,140 --> 04:47:37,140
眩しいね
It's so bright.

5752
04:47:39,140 --> 04:47:41,640
ぺこら戻ってきた？
Did Pekora come back?

5753
04:47:41,640 --> 04:47:43,640
はい、オッケー！ありがとう
Yes, all set! Thank you.

5754
04:47:43,640 --> 04:47:46,340
猫は同伴オッケーですか？
Are cats allowed to join us?

5755
04:47:46,340 --> 04:47:48,640
猫もオッケーです！
Cats are fine too!

5756
04:47:48,640 --> 04:47:50,640
あ、猫やったー！
Ah, yay, cats!

5757
04:47:50,640 --> 04:47:53,640
いいな、猫燃えてる
Nice, that cat is on fire.

5758
04:47:53,640 --> 04:47:56,140
猫がオッケー
Cats are okay.

5759
04:47:56,140 --> 04:48:02,140
それでは、こちらの声が聞こえる範囲内にお集まりいただき、ご静粛にお願いいたします
Well then, please gather within range of my voice and remain quiet.

5760
04:48:02,140 --> 04:48:04,640
はーい！
Okay!

5761
04:48:07,640 --> 04:48:09,640
あれ？みこち...
Huh? Mikochi...

5762
04:48:09,640 --> 04:48:13,140
各チームメンバーでいない人はいないかね？大丈夫かね？
Are there any missing members from each team? Everyone good?

5763
04:48:14,640 --> 04:48:19,140
あれ？みこちがちょっとまだかも。確かにみこちいないかも
Huh? Mikochi might not be here yet. Yeah, Mikochi might be missing.

5764
04:48:20,640 --> 04:48:22,640
めっちゃ食べてる
Someone's eating a ton.

5765
04:48:22,640 --> 04:48:25,140
みこちとポルカかな？
Mikochi and Polka maybe?

5766
04:48:25,140 --> 04:48:27,640
そうだね、みこポルがいないね
Yeah, Miko and Polka aren't here.

5767
04:48:28,640 --> 04:48:30,640
おーい、始まるぞー！
Hey, it's starting!

5768
04:48:37,140 --> 04:48:39,140
水を飲むんだ
Drink some water.

5769
04:48:39,140 --> 04:48:41,640
はい、大丈夫でしょうかー？
Okay, is everyone ready?

5770
04:48:41,640 --> 04:48:43,140
はーい！
Yes!

5771
04:48:43,140 --> 04:48:47,640
それでは、皆様3日間のサバイバル生活お疲れ様でした！
Well then, good job everyone on your three days of survival life!

5772
04:48:47,640 --> 04:48:52,140
お疲れ様でしたー！
Good job, everyone!

5773
04:48:52,640 --> 04:48:54,140
イエイ！
Yay!

5774
04:48:54,140 --> 04:49:01,640
それでは、3日間の全てを各チームが背負っての閉会式及び授賞式を開会させていただきます
Now then, carrying everything from these three days for each team, we will begin the closing and awards ceremony!

5775
04:49:02,140 --> 04:49:04,640
はい！お願いします！
Yes! Let's do it!

5776
04:49:05,140 --> 04:49:07,140
それでは、まず...
Well then, first...

5777
04:49:07,140 --> 04:49:11,140
誰か死んだ音がしたが大丈夫か？
I heard someone die, is everyone okay?

5778
04:49:11,140 --> 04:49:15,140
ドゥーンって言った
It went 'doon'.

5779
04:49:15,140 --> 04:49:17,640
スバルちゃんが落ちたかも？
Subaru-chan might have died?

5780
04:49:18,140 --> 04:49:20,140
誰か死んだ？
Did someone die?

5781
04:49:20,140 --> 04:49:22,640
マジで？空腹すぎ？ご飯？
Seriously? Starving? Food?

5782
04:49:23,140 --> 04:49:25,640
ご飯か水？
Food or water?

5783
04:49:25,640 --> 04:49:29,140
みんな食い始めた
Everyone started eating!

5784
04:49:30,140 --> 04:49:33,140
こんな風にならないようにしなきゃっていう
Like, 'we've gotta make sure we don't end up like that.'

5785
04:49:33,140 --> 04:49:35,140
そう、自分たちも怖くて
Yeah, we got scared too.

5786
04:49:35,640 --> 04:49:39,640
おそらくすぐ戻ってくると思うので少し待ちましょう
She'll probably be right back, so let's wait a moment.

5787
04:49:39,640 --> 04:49:41,640
はーい！
Okay!

5788
04:49:41,640 --> 04:49:44,140
過労死だ、過労死
Death from overwork, definitely.

5789
04:49:46,640 --> 04:49:49,640
頑張ってたから
She worked so hard, after all.

5790
04:49:50,140 --> 04:49:52,140
やばい
Oh no.

5791
04:49:58,640 --> 04:50:01,640
かっこいいな、無言で
That looks so cool, standing there in silence.

5792
04:50:02,140 --> 04:50:05,140
どうしても人が集まるとね、落ちやすいのでお気を...
When everyone gathers like this, crashes happen easily, so please be caref...

5793
04:50:05,761 --> 04:50:07,261
あー、なるほど。
Ah, I see.

5794
04:50:10,261 --> 04:50:15,061
はい、設定でね、落とせる設定は低めにしておくと、安心かもしれない。
Yeah, if you keep any settings you can lower set to low, it might be safer.

5795
04:50:15,161 --> 04:50:17,761
あ、戻ったっぽい。/ はい。
Ah, seems like they're back. / Yes.

5796
04:50:18,761 --> 04:50:20,961
頑張っす、キャプ。
Good luck, Cap!

5797
04:50:23,161 --> 04:50:26,161
あれ？ あれ？
Huh? Huh?

5798
04:50:25,161 --> 04:50:27,661
OKって？ 聞こえる？
Is it OK? Can you hear?

5799
04:50:30,361 --> 04:50:32,661
あ、OKってきてる。
Ah, they're saying OK.

5800
04:50:34,161 --> 04:50:37,661
OK、OK。復帰しましたかね？
OK, OK. Are they back?

5801
04:50:37,661 --> 04:50:39,161
はい、はい。
Yes, yes.

5802
04:50:39,161 --> 04:50:45,661
じゃ、もし見れてない、音声聞こえてないようでしたら、えーと、画面共有などでお願いいたしますー。
Alright, if you can't see or hear the audio, please let us know via screen share or similar.

5803
04:50:45,761 --> 04:50:48,761
はーい。
Okay!

5804
04:50:49,361 --> 04:50:53,961
はい、それでは少しずつ発表させていただきまーす。
Alright, then we will start announcing the results one by one!

5805
04:50:54,161 --> 04:50:59,161
えー、まずマル秘ミッションがどういった内容だったかを発表していきます。
First, I will announce what the secret missions actually were.

5806
04:50:59,261 --> 04:51:02,161
おー！
Ooh!

5807
04:51:02,161 --> 04:51:05,161
これで違ってたら悲しい...
It would be so sad if we got it wrong...

5808
04:51:05,661 --> 04:51:11,161
えー、まずミッション1は、ラヴァエレメンタルの討伐でした！
First, Mission 1 was to defeat the Lava Elemental!

5809
04:51:11,161 --> 04:51:15,161
おおー！ 合ってた！
Ooh! We got it right!

5810
04:51:15,161 --> 04:51:19,861
達成できたチームは、「おかたづけできるもん」
The teams that achieved this are "Okataduke Dekirumon,"

5811
04:51:19,961 --> 04:51:23,161
「一連託生ディノパーティー」
"Ichirentakushou Dino Party,"

5812
04:51:23,161 --> 04:51:26,661
そして、「エリートファミリア」の3チームになります！
and "Elite Familia," for a total of three teams!

5813
04:51:26,661 --> 04:51:30,661
わー！ やったー！
Yay! Awesome!

5814
04:51:31,361 --> 04:51:36,161
続いてマル秘ミッション2の正解は、太鼓をクラフトする。
Next, the answer to Secret Mission 2 was: craft a war drum.

5815
04:51:36,361 --> 04:51:38,561
うんうん。ほうほう。
Mm-hmm. I see.

5816
04:51:38,661 --> 04:51:42,161
こちらは全チームクリアいたしました！
All teams cleared this one!

5817
04:51:42,161 --> 04:51:45,661
おおー！ やったー！
Ooh! Nice!

5818
04:51:45,961 --> 04:51:50,761
マル秘ミッション3、2枚以上の日誌を書く。
Secret Mission 3: write two or more diary pages.

5819
04:51:50,861 --> 04:51:52,561
うんうん。
Mm-hmm.

5820
04:51:52,661 --> 04:51:56,661
え、こちらは概ね、ほとんどのメンバーが達成いたしました！
For this one, almost all members achieved it!

5821
04:51:56,661 --> 04:52:01,661
おおー！ まあまあまあ。
Ooh! Nice, nice.

5822
04:52:01,661 --> 04:52:11,661
え、マル秘ミッション4、正解は開会式ステージでマンモスに2人で乗りながら太鼓を叩く。
Secret Mission 4: the answer was to play the drums while riding a mammoth together on the opening ceremony stage.

5823
04:52:12,161 --> 04:52:13,661
ほほー。
Oho.

5824
04:52:13,761 --> 04:52:16,661
こちらも全チームクリアとなります！
All teams cleared this one as well!

5825
04:52:16,661 --> 04:52:21,161
おおー！ きたー！
Ooh! Let's go!

5826
04:52:22,161 --> 04:52:34,161
え、続きましてですね、えー、今回発表していなかった、ムキロゼシークレット賞を発表しまーす！
Moving on... I will now announce the Mukiroze Secret Awards, which weren't revealed beforehand!

5827
04:52:34,161 --> 04:52:39,161
おおー！ 何それ何それ！
Ooh! What is that?!

5828
04:52:39,161 --> 04:52:47,161
はい、こちらはですね、公表しておらず、シークレットで用意、あらかじめ用意しといた賞になります。
Yes, these were not announced beforehand; they are awards prepared in secret.

5829
04:52:47,161 --> 04:52:50,961
シークレットあったんだ！ へえー！
There was a secret one?! Whoa!

5830
04:52:51,161 --> 04:52:59,161
それで、こちらのムキロゼシークレット賞は、賞品およびポイントの追加がございます。
And for this Mukiroze Secret Award, there are prizes and bonus points awarded.

5831
04:52:59,161 --> 04:53:02,661
ええー！ おおー！
No way! Ooh!

5832
04:53:02,961 --> 04:53:07,161
それではまず1つ目のシークレット賞から発表いたします！
Then let us start by announcing the first secret award!

5833
04:53:07,161 --> 04:53:10,661
1つ目？ 複数あるの？
The first one? There's more than one?

5834
04:53:10,661 --> 04:53:14,661
最も死んだ回数が多いプレイヤー！
The player with the highest death count!

5835
04:53:14,661 --> 04:53:22,161
ええー！？ 誰だそれ！？ ポイントになるんだ！
What?! Who is it?! That gives points?!

5836
04:53:22,161 --> 04:53:27,161
エリートファミリアワンチャンあるんじゃないか！？ ワンチャンある！
Does Elite Familia have a chance at this?! Definitely a chance!

5837
04:53:27,361 --> 04:53:33,161
「ベッドを一番愛したで賞」ということで、ノエルさんが受賞です！
For the "Loved the Bed the Most Award"... Noel-san wins the prize!

5838
04:53:33,161 --> 04:53:39,661
キャー！ 28！？ 28！？
Aaaah! 28 deaths?! 28?!

5839
04:53:39,961 --> 04:53:45,961
それでは、えー、グラビアを行いたいと思いますので、こちら、前までお願いいたしますー！
We'd like to take a photo, so please come to the front!

5840
04:53:46,161 --> 04:53:51,161
おめでとう！ かわいい！
Congratulations! So cute!

5841
04:53:51,661 --> 04:54:01,661
はい、ということで、最も死んだ回数が多いプレイヤーということで、「ベッドを1番愛したで賞」を受賞されたお気持ち一言お願いいたします！
Alright, having won the "Loved the Bed the Most Award" for the most deaths, could you say a few words?

5842
04:54:01,961 --> 04:54:09,361
はい！ えーっと団長はARKは結構経験者で、しかも予習もしたんですけど、こういう結果になって複雑ですが...
Yes! I actually have quite a bit of ARK experience and even studied up, so I have mixed feelings about this result, but...

5843
04:54:09,461 --> 04:54:13,661
でもあれですよね、チームに貢献できたんですよね？ ポイントが入って。なら嬉しいです！
But hey, I contributed to the team with these points, right? Then I'm happy!

5844
04:54:13,661 --> 04:54:19,161
貢献した！ やったー！ おめでとー！
You contributed! Yay! Congrats!

5845
04:54:19,361 --> 04:54:26,961
え、受賞されたノエルさんにはですね、リアルの景品をムキロゼのポケットマネーから贈呈！
And for winning, Noel-san will receive a real-life prize paid out of Mukiroze's own pocket!

5846
04:54:26,961 --> 04:54:33,661
うわー！ リアル！？ 嬉しい！ やったぜ！
Whoa! A real prize?! That's awesome! Let's go!

5847
04:54:33,761 --> 04:54:40,161
さらにですね、エリートファミリアのチームにプラス10ポイント進呈いたします！
Furthermore, 10 bonus points will be awarded to team Elite Familia!

5848
04:54:40,161 --> 04:54:44,661
うわー！ でっか！ 10ポイント！？
Whoa! That's huge! 10 points?!

5849
04:54:44,661 --> 04:54:46,161
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

5850
04:54:46,161 --> 04:54:51,161
はい、それでは続いての賞を発表してまいります。ノエルさんありがとうございましたー！
Alright, moving on to the next award. Thank you very much, Noel-san!

5851
04:54:51,161 --> 04:54:52,661
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

5852
04:54:52,961 --> 04:54:59,161
え、続きましての賞は、最もプレイヤーにキルされた回数が多い...
Moving on, the next award goes to the player killed the most times by other players...

5853
04:54:59,161 --> 04:55:05,161
うわー！ プレイヤー！？ そんなことある？
Whoa! By players?! Is that even a thing?

5854
04:55:05,782 --> 04:55:09,382
こちら、みんなに愛されすぎたで賞ということで...
Here, for the "Most Loved by Everyone Award"...

5855
04:55:10,982 --> 04:55:12,582
3名いらっしゃいます。
we have three winners.

5856
04:55:12,582 --> 04:55:14,682
おー！
Ooh!

5857
04:55:17,982 --> 04:55:23,682
べーちゃん、そして水海ミア、そしてスバル。
Bae-chan, Mizumi Mia, and Subaru.

5858
04:55:37,182 --> 04:55:42,882
では代表、そうですね、3名一言ずついただきたいので一応前に出てきていただいてよろしいでしょうか？
So, since we'd like a few words from all three of you, could you please come forward?

5859
04:55:49,182 --> 04:55:51,682
ナイス！
Nice!

5860
04:55:59,182 --> 04:56:03,382
それでは1人ずつ、水海ミアから順にお願いいたします。
Then one by one, let's start with Mizumi Mia, please go ahead.

5861
04:56:03,682 --> 04:56:08,382
はい！なんか不憫でポイントもらえた！やったー！嬉しいです！
Yes! I got points for being pitiful! Yay! I'm so happy!

5862
04:56:12,382 --> 04:56:14,982
それでは続いて、じゃあスバルお願いいたします。
Moving on, Subaru, please go ahead.

5863
04:56:15,182 --> 04:56:19,382
なんか分からんけど死んでたらしい！殺してくれたみんなありがとう！
I don't know what happened, but apparently I kept dying! Thanks to everyone who killed me!

5864
04:56:22,182 --> 04:56:24,382
べーちゃん、お願いいたします。
Bae-chan, please go ahead.

5865
04:56:24,682 --> 04:56:29,182
いやー、同じくよく分からんが、愛されてよかったな！
Well, same here, I don't really get it, but I'm glad I was loved!

5866
04:56:35,982 --> 04:56:41,682
こちらはですね、ムキロゼからは高級和美菓子をリアルでお渡し...
For this, Mukiroze will present premium Japanese sweets in real life...

5867
04:56:41,682 --> 04:56:44,682
おーー！
Ooh!

5868
04:56:45,182 --> 04:56:47,682
キルしてくれたみんなありがとう！
Thanks to everyone who killed me!

5869
04:56:50,682 --> 04:56:57,182
続きましてですね、所属しているチーム「ぽんこつザウルス」一条莉々華、恐竜PARTY...
Next up, from their teams, Ponkotsu Saurus's Ichijou Ririka, Dino Party's...

5870
04:56:57,682 --> 04:57:05,782
こちら恐竜PARTYからは2名なんですが各チーム上限1回とさせていただきまして、それぞれ10ポイント進呈！
There were two from Dino Party, but with a 1-per-team limit, each team is awarded 10 points!

5871
04:57:05,782 --> 04:57:09,182
イェーーイ！
Yay!

5872
04:57:20,682 --> 04:57:31,682
最も恐竜をテイムした数が多いチーム、「テイムマスター賞」を受賞したチームは...
The team that tamed the most dinosaurs, winning the "Tame Master Award", is...

5873
04:57:32,682 --> 04:57:35,982
お片付けできるもん！
Okataduke Dekirumon!

5874
04:57:35,982 --> 04:57:39,682
イェーーイ！
Yay!

5875
04:57:40,682 --> 04:57:45,182
では代表してリーダーの風真いろはちゃん、こちら前で一言お願いいたします。
Representing them, leader Kazama Iroha-chan, please step forward and say a few words.

5876
04:57:45,382 --> 04:57:48,982
あ、猫持ってる。確かに猫いっぱいいたね。
Ah, she's holding a cat. There really were a lot of cats.

5877
04:57:49,682 --> 04:57:52,182
声入ってるかな？入ってますか、これ？
Is my mic working? Can you hear me?

5878
04:57:52,682 --> 04:58:00,982
イエーイ！みんなが手分けしてミッションクリアしようとしてダブったテイムとかもあったんですけど、結果的にいっぱいになったんで良かったです！ありがとうございます！
Yay! We split up to clear missions so we had duplicate tames, but in the end we got plenty, so I'm glad! Thank you!

5879
04:58:01,182 --> 04:58:04,182
イエーイ！
Yay!

5880
04:58:06,182 --> 04:58:13,682
はい、こちらですね、リアルのプレゼントとしましてチーム1人1人にプレゼントがあります。
Yes, for this, as a real-life present, each team member will receive a gift.

5881
04:58:15,682 --> 04:58:20,182
小さめなペットロボットをプレゼントいたします！
We will be giving you a mini pet robot!

5882
04:58:20,182 --> 04:58:23,182
え！？ペットロボット！？
Eh?! A pet robot?!

5883
04:58:23,382 --> 04:58:26,182
いやー、頑張ってよかったー！
Ah, I'm so glad we worked hard!

5884
04:58:26,382 --> 04:58:29,982
はい、ポケットマネーから出させていただきますので...
Yes, I'll be paying for it out of pocket...

5885
04:58:30,182 --> 04:58:33,182
Did the capybara at the start count?

5886
04:58:35,182 --> 04:58:38,682
さらにチームにはプラス10ポイントが進呈されます。
Furthermore, 10 bonus points are awarded to the team.

5887
04:58:38,682 --> 04:58:42,182
イェーーイ！
Yay!

5888
04:58:43,182 --> 04:58:53,182
さあ続きまして、最もテイムした恐竜の種類が多いチーム、「恐竜図鑑賞」を受賞されたのは...
Moving on, the team that tamed the most types of dinosaurs, winning the "Dino Encyclopedia Award", is...

5889
04:58:54,182 --> 04:58:57,682
お片付けできるもん、エリートファミリア！
Okataduke Dekirumon and Elite Familia!

5890
04:58:57,682 --> 04:59:02,182
イェーーイ！やったー！
Yay! We did it!

5891
04:59:02,182 --> 04:59:10,682
はい、こちらも同率となっておりまして、それぞれ20種類。どっちも20種類をテイムされておりました！
Yes, this was a tie as well, with 20 species each. Both teams tamed 20 types!

5892
04:59:11,182 --> 04:59:14,682
イェーーイ！
Yay!

5893
04:59:15,682 --> 04:59:19,182
それでは代表の方、前にお願いいたします。
Now, representatives, please step forward.

5894
04:59:20,182 --> 04:59:25,682
みこちゃん？みこちゃん行ってきなー。
Miko-chan? Miko-chan, go on ahead.

5895
04:59:25,982 --> 04:59:29,182
いやいやいや、いいよいいよ...
No no no, it's fine, it's fine...

5896
04:59:32,182 --> 04:59:35,182
うちの家族がすごいです。はい。
Our family is amazing. Yes.

5897
04:59:36,182 --> 04:59:41,682
はい、じゃあ先ほども受賞されましたお片付けできるもんのチームリーダーから一言お願いいたします。
Alright, then a few words from the leader of Okataduke Dekirumon, who also won earlier.

5898
04:59:42,182 --> 04:59:46,182
これは、本当にイナ先輩がめちゃ頑張ってくれました！
This was really thanks to Ina-senpai working super hard!

5899
04:59:46,182 --> 04:59:49,982
イエーイ！イナ先輩！
Yay! Ina-senpai!

5900
04:59:50,182 --> 04:59:53,982
えー！うそ！嬉しい！
Eh?! Really?! I'm so happy!

5901
04:59:54,182 --> 04:59:58,182
続いてエリートファミリアのリーダーみこち、お願いいたします。
Next, from Elite Familia, leader Mikochi, please.

5902
04:59:58,382 --> 05:00:03,382
はい！うちの家族のみんなが一生懸命テイムしてくれました！みんなありがとおおお！
Yes! Everyone in our family worked super hard taming! Thank you so muuuuch, everyone!

5903
05:00:03,382 --> 05:00:05,182
イエーイ！
Yay!

5904
05:00:08,403 --> 05:00:09,403
ありがとう
Thank you!

5905
05:00:09,403 --> 05:00:11,803
はい、こちらリアルの経費のプレゼントは
Okay, the real-life sponsored prize here...

5906
05:00:11,803 --> 05:00:14,703
恐竜フィギュアをそれぞれ1つずつプレゼントいたします！
...will be one dinosaur figure for each member!

5907
05:00:14,703 --> 05:00:16,703
おおー！
Whoa!

5908
05:00:16,703 --> 05:00:19,703
すごい！嬉しい！
That's awesome! I'm so happy!

5909
05:00:19,703 --> 05:00:22,603
さらに所属するチームそれぞれに
Furthermore, to each of their respective teams...

5910
05:00:22,603 --> 05:00:25,203
プラス10ポイント進呈いたします！
...an additional 10 points will be awarded!

5911
05:00:25,203 --> 05:00:28,203
イエーイ！
Yay!

5912
05:00:28,203 --> 05:00:30,203
10ポイントでかい！
10 points is huge!

5913
05:00:30,203 --> 05:00:35,003
えー、そして最後のムキロゼシークレット賞を...
And now, presenting the final Mukirose Secret Award...

5914
05:00:35,003 --> 05:00:39,203
お、なんだなんだ？
Oh, what is it? What could it be?

5915
05:00:39,703 --> 05:00:42,703
アイスワームクイーンのトロフィー納品を
For delivering the Iceworm Queen trophy...

5916
05:00:42,703 --> 05:00:45,003
最初に達成したチーム
...the first team to accomplish it...

5917
05:00:45,003 --> 05:00:49,703
「道を切り開いたで賞」を受賞されたのは...
...and win the "Trailblazer Award" is...

5918
05:00:49,703 --> 05:00:52,503
一蓮托生DINO PARTYです！
Ichiren Takusho DINO PARTY!

5919
05:00:52,503 --> 05:00:55,703
おおー！
Whoa!

5920
05:00:55,703 --> 05:00:58,703
ディノパやばいって！
DinoPa is insane!

5921
05:00:59,203 --> 05:01:03,703
代表者の方、ぜひ前に...
Would a team representative please come forward?

5922
05:01:03,703 --> 05:01:05,203
はーい
Okay!

5923
05:01:05,203 --> 05:01:09,203
はい、それでは受賞した、えーっと、一言お願いいたします。
All right, please give us a few words on winning this award.

5924
05:01:09,403 --> 05:01:14,003
パーティー仲間のおかげで結構ぺこら自由に動かされたので
Thanks to my party members, Pekora was able to act pretty freely,

5925
05:01:14,003 --> 05:01:18,003
本当にパーティーのみんなには感謝してます。ありがとうございました！
so I'm truly grateful to everyone in the party. Thank you so much!

5926
05:01:18,003 --> 05:01:22,703
おおー！
Whoa!

5927
05:01:22,703 --> 05:01:29,003
はい。こちらですね、なんと9月5日の23時07分に達成したのが最速となっておりました。
Yes. In fact, their completion time of 23:07 on September 5th was the fastest.

5928
05:01:29,003 --> 05:01:32,203
早っ！
So fast!

5929
05:01:32,203 --> 05:01:35,703
こちらの報酬として10ポイント進呈いたします。
As a reward, 10 points will be awarded!

5930
05:01:35,703 --> 05:01:39,703
うおおー！でかい！
Whoa! That's huge!

5931
05:01:39,703 --> 05:01:45,703
そして景品はですね、インスタントヌードルセットをムキロゼから進呈いたします。
And for the physical prize, an instant noodle set will be presented by Mukirose!

5932
05:01:45,703 --> 05:01:49,203
早いってことか！
Because it's fast noodles?!

5933
05:01:49,203 --> 05:01:53,703
おめでとうございます！
Congratulations!

5934
05:01:53,703 --> 05:01:56,203
カップ麺だといいな
Hope it's cup ramen!

5935
05:01:56,203 --> 05:02:00,703
そうしまして、すべての賞が終了いたしました。
And with that, all of the special awards have concluded.

5936
05:02:00,703 --> 05:02:04,003
それでは最終結果の発表をいたします。
We will now announce the final results.

5937
05:02:04,003 --> 05:02:06,703
はい！おお！
Yes! Whoa!

5938
05:02:06,703 --> 05:02:13,703
えー、どの順位から発表するか非常に迷うところではありますが...
Um, deciding which rank to announce first is quite a dilemma, but...

5939
05:02:13,703 --> 05:02:17,203
えー、3位から発表させていただきます。
...we will start with 3rd place!

5940
05:02:17,203 --> 05:02:21,703
3位...怖い
3rd place... I'm nervous!

5941
05:02:21,703 --> 05:02:25,703
それでは、3位のチームは...
And so, the 3rd place team is...

5942
05:02:25,703 --> 05:02:30,403
合計得点、193ポイント！
...with a total of 193 points...

5943
05:02:30,403 --> 05:02:35,703
おおー！高い！すごい！
Whoa! That's so high! Amazing!

5944
05:02:35,703 --> 05:02:39,003
チーム名は「お片付けできまもん」！
...Team "Okatadzuke Dekimamon"!

5945
05:02:39,003 --> 05:02:43,703
ああー！おめでとう！
Ahhh! Congratulations!

5946
05:02:43,703 --> 05:02:46,003
すごいすごい！
Amazing, amazing!

5947
05:02:46,003 --> 05:02:51,203
続きまして、2位と行きたいところなんですが...
Moving on, I'd like to announce 2nd place, but...

5948
05:02:51,203 --> 05:02:57,203
なんと、同率で2位のチームとなりました！
...surprisingly, we have a tie for 2nd place!

5949
05:02:57,203 --> 05:03:01,203
うわー！同率？！
Whoa! A tie?!

5950
05:03:01,203 --> 05:03:05,703
得点ポイントがそれぞれ200ポイントとなりました！
Both teams scored exactly 200 points!

5951
05:03:05,703 --> 05:03:09,703
ええー？！ぴったり！
What?! Exactly 200?!

5952
05:03:09,703 --> 05:03:16,203
そちらのチームが2チーム。「一蓮托生DINO PARTY」、そして「エリートファミリア」！
Those two teams are: "Ichiren Takusho DINO PARTY" and "Elite Familia"!

5953
05:03:16,203 --> 05:03:20,703
うわあああ！ええー？！
Whoaaa! What?!

5954
05:03:20,703 --> 05:03:27,203
なんとー！
Unbelievable!

5955
05:03:33,703 --> 05:03:37,203
おめでとうございます！
Congratulations!

5956
05:03:37,203 --> 05:03:39,203
Only seven points difference...
Only a seven-point difference...

5957
05:03:39,203 --> 05:03:47,703
そうしまして、結果4位となりましたポンコツサウルスの獲得ポイントは171ポイントとなっております。
And with that, coming in 4th place, Ponkotsusaurus earned a total of 171 points.

5958
05:03:47,703 --> 05:03:52,703
ああー！頑張った！
Ahhh! Good job!

5959
05:03:52,703 --> 05:03:55,703
はい、おめでとうございます。
Yes, congratulations!

5960
05:03:55,703 --> 05:03:58,003
They were so close!

5961
05:03:58,003 --> 05:04:05,003
総合順位に対しましてもムキロゼからの賞品がございます！
There are also prizes from Mukirose for the overall rankings!

5962
05:04:05,003 --> 05:04:08,703
おおー！まだあるんですか？
Whoa! There are more?!

5963
05:04:08,703 --> 05:04:12,203
ええ、奮発させていただきました。
Yes, I really splurged on them.

5964
05:04:12,203 --> 05:04:15,703
ええー！何々？
Whoa! What could it be?

5965
05:04:15,703 --> 05:04:20,203
ちょっと待ってくださいね。報酬一覧がですね、ちょっとお待ちくださいね。
Just a moment, please. The prize list is... please wait a second.

5966
05:04:20,203 --> 05:04:23,203
めっちゃすごいんじゃないか、これ！
Isn't this gonna be super amazing?!

5967
05:04:26,203 --> 05:04:30,703
何だこれ？なんかすげえの飛んでる！
What is that? Something huge is flying!

5968
05:04:30,703 --> 05:04:33,703
え、何これ？！何これ？！
Wait, what is this?! What is this?!

5969
05:04:33,703 --> 05:04:37,203
エンタープライズ来た！俺たちのエンタープライズが！
The Enterprise is here! Our Enterprise!

5970
05:04:40,203 --> 05:04:42,203
Live long and prosper.

5971
05:04:42,203 --> 05:04:45,203
うわ、すげえ！
Whoa, incredible!

5972
05:04:45,703 --> 05:04:47,703
少々お待ちくださいね。
Please wait just a moment.

5973
05:04:49,203 --> 05:04:53,003
大変お待たせいたしましたー！
Thank you so much for waiting!

5974
05:04:53,203 --> 05:04:55,703
Beam me up, Fuboking.

5975
05:04:55,703 --> 05:04:58,203
それではですね、えーっと...
Now then...

5976
05:04:58,203 --> 05:05:05,203
まず最下位になりましたポンコツサウルスには「もっと強くなれ」という意味で...
First, for Ponkotsusaurus in last place, with the meaning of "grow even stronger"...

5977
05:05:06,424 --> 05:05:08,324
1人1つ プロテインを！
One protein supplement per person!

5978
05:05:08,424 --> 05:05:11,424
プロテイン？！
Protein?!

5979
05:05:12,724 --> 05:05:14,724
プロテイン！
Protein!

5980
05:05:18,424 --> 05:05:23,924
そして同率1位となりました皆様にはそれぞれに
And to all of you who tied for 1st place, each of you gets...

5981
05:05:25,524 --> 05:05:27,224
高級肉ギフトを！
a luxury meat gift set!

5982
05:05:27,224 --> 05:05:31,724
おおー！お肉ー！
Whoa! Meat!

5983
05:05:31,724 --> 05:05:35,024
いい肉ー！
Good meat!

5984
05:05:35,224 --> 05:05:38,224
楽しんでください！
Please enjoy it!

5985
05:05:38,224 --> 05:05:41,224
はい、肉パーティ楽しんでください！
Yes, please enjoy your meat party!

5986
05:05:41,224 --> 05:05:42,924
肉ー！
Meat!

5987
05:05:43,024 --> 05:05:48,924
ということで 改めまして3日間 ロゼキャンARK ありがとうございましたー！
And with that, once again, thank you so much for these 3 days of Rose-Camp ARK!

5988
05:05:49,024 --> 05:05:53,724
ありがとうございましたー！お疲れ様でしたー！
Thank you very much! Great work everyone!

5989
05:05:54,424 --> 05:05:59,224
それでは最後に記念撮影をぜひ撮らせていただきたいと思いますので
And so, finally, we'd love to take a commemorative group photo,

5990
05:05:59,224 --> 05:06:03,724
こちらのステージに ちょっと良い感じに並んでいただけますでしょうか？
so could everyone please line up nicely on this stage?

5991
05:06:04,024 --> 05:06:06,524
死にそうなので水一瞬飲んできます！
I'm about to die, so I'm gonna go drink water real quick!

5992
05:06:06,524 --> 05:06:08,224
行ってらっしゃい！
Go right ahead!

5993
05:06:10,724 --> 05:06:13,724
うわーー！
Whoa--!

5994
05:06:16,224 --> 05:06:18,724
うぇーー！
Whoa!

5995
05:06:18,724 --> 05:06:21,024
きれーい！
Beautiful!

5996
05:06:21,024 --> 05:06:23,724
たーまやー！
Tamaya--!

5997
05:06:23,724 --> 05:06:27,024
すげー！たーまやー！
Amazing! Tamaya--!

5998
05:06:27,224 --> 05:06:29,724
めっちゃ綺麗！
It's so pretty!

5999
05:06:29,724 --> 05:06:32,024
フィナーレって感じするじゃん！
Really feels like the grand finale!

6000
05:06:32,024 --> 05:06:34,224
花火初めて見たわ
It's my first time seeing fireworks [in ARK].

6001
05:06:34,224 --> 05:06:37,224
夏終わったなー 夏の終わりを感じる
Summer is over... Really feels like the end of summer.

6002
05:06:41,224 --> 05:06:43,224
綺麗！
So pretty!

6003
05:06:43,724 --> 05:06:46,424
ツェッペリン...
Zeppelin...

6004
05:06:46,724 --> 05:06:50,724
上がっていただいて、ここのあたり、もう一度上がれますか？
Come on up around here, can everyone get up here once more?

6005
05:06:51,724 --> 05:06:55,224
ゆっくり...
Slowly...

6006
05:06:59,224 --> 05:07:03,224
ぎゅうぎゅうだ
We're so packed together.

6007
05:07:05,224 --> 05:07:08,224
顔見えないか？
Can our faces be seen?

6008
05:07:08,224 --> 05:07:10,724
アゴスチームの真ん中行きなよ、アゴス！
Go to the middle of the Agos team, Agos!

6009
05:07:10,724 --> 05:07:13,724
リーダー！リーダー真ん中行って！
Leader! Leader, go to the middle!

6010
05:07:20,224 --> 05:07:23,724
写真撮るよー
Taking a picture~

6011
05:07:25,224 --> 05:07:28,224
いろはどこや？いろはどこにも...
Where's Iroha? Iroha isn't anywhere...

6012
05:07:28,424 --> 05:07:31,724
いない人はいませんか？大丈夫ですか？
Is there anyone missing? Is everyone here?

6013
05:07:32,724 --> 05:07:35,724
まだいるね、大丈夫ですね？
Still around, right? Are we good?

6014
05:07:41,024 --> 05:07:44,024
チームメンバーで揃ってない人はいませんか？
Anyone whose team members haven't gathered yet?

6015
05:07:44,224 --> 05:07:47,724
全員大丈夫です！
Everyone's good!

6016
05:07:48,024 --> 05:07:49,424
クボちゃん！
Kubo-chan!

6017
05:07:49,724 --> 05:07:52,724
俺はツェッペリンにいる！
I'm on the Zeppelin!

6018
05:07:56,724 --> 05:08:01,724
はい、こちらで運営さんがね、今写真を撮影してくれてますので
All right, the management staff is taking photos for us right now,

6019
05:08:01,724 --> 05:08:06,024
各々のエモートなども楽しんでいただきつつ、もう撮られていると思いますので、お願いします！
so please enjoy doing your emotes—I think they're already snapping away!

6020
05:08:06,424 --> 05:08:08,724
エモート？
Emotes?

6021
05:08:09,024 --> 05:08:12,724
リング長押しして、左10時ぐらいのところに...
Long press the wheel menu, around 10 o'clock on the left...

6022
05:08:13,024 --> 05:08:15,224
ほほほ...
Ohoho...

6023
05:08:15,724 --> 05:08:18,724
おーー
Ohh--

6024
05:08:20,724 --> 05:08:25,224
エンタープライズが！エンタープライズが！
The Enterprise! The Enterprise is...!

6025
05:08:26,724 --> 05:08:29,224
みんな揃ってる？
Is everyone ready?

6026
05:08:29,224 --> 05:08:33,224
それでは一応掛け声もさせていただきますので、よろしいでしょうかー？
All right, I'll give the cue, so are you all ready?

6027
05:08:33,224 --> 05:08:36,024
はーい！
Yes!

6028
05:08:36,224 --> 05:08:40,424
ロゼキャンARK 3日間お疲れ様でした！はい、チーズ！
Great job everyone during the 3 days of Rose-Camp ARK! Say cheese!

6029
05:08:40,724 --> 05:08:44,224
イエーーーイ！
Yaaay!

6030
05:08:44,224 --> 05:08:49,224
イエーーーイ！
Yaaay!

6031
05:08:49,724 --> 05:08:53,224
イエーイ！
Yay!

6032
05:08:53,224 --> 05:08:56,224
Ah, I forgot to turn off my snack.

6033
05:08:56,224 --> 05:09:00,724
イエーイ！お疲れ様でしたー！
Yay! Great work everyone!

6034
05:09:02,224 --> 05:09:05,724
うぇーーい！ありがとうございました！
Whoo! Thank you so much!

6035
05:09:06,224 --> 05:09:11,224
もしですね、よろしければ感想とかがありましたらね、余裕があれば日誌の方に入れていただきましたら
And if you'd like, if you have any thoughts and have time, please write them in your diary,

6036
05:09:11,224 --> 05:09:16,024
後日の振り返りなどでも読ませていただきますので、たくさん書いていただけると嬉しいです！
and I'll read them during the recap stream later on, so please feel free to write a lot!

6037
05:09:16,224 --> 05:09:18,724
はーい！
Okay!

6038
05:09:19,024 --> 05:09:23,224
お疲れ様でしたー！
Great work everyone!

6039
05:09:23,724 --> 05:09:28,224
プロテインの前でちょっと写真撮りたいよね
I kinda want to take a photo in front of the protein!

6040
05:09:34,724 --> 05:09:38,724
お疲れ様でしたー！
Good work everyone!

6041
05:09:42,224 --> 05:09:46,724
ツェッペリン乗って... ツェッペリン乗ろうぜ！
Hop on the Zeppelin... Let's ride the Zeppelin!

6042
05:09:46,724 --> 05:09:49,224
ツェッペリン！
Zeppelin!

6043
05:09:51,724 --> 05:09:56,724
ツェッペリン乗って記念撮影だー！
Riding the Zeppelin for a commemorative photo!

6044
05:09:57,224 --> 05:10:00,224
ツェッペリン直してくれて...
Thanks for repairing the Zeppelin...

6045
05:10:00,724 --> 05:10:04,224
ツェッペリンだいぶ助かったけどな、今日
The Zeppelin was a huge help today though.

6046
05:10:04,224 --> 05:10:05,642
ですよね！
Definitely!

6047
05:10:05,245 --> 05:15:05,266
Error processing subtitles for this segment.

6048
05:15:05,266 --> 05:20:05,287
Error processing subtitles for this segment.

6049
05:20:05,287 --> 05:20:07,387
...everyone for watching.

6050
05:20:07,787 --> 05:20:09,787
I hope you guys enjoyed

6051
05:20:10,387 --> 05:20:11,787
this journey

6052
05:20:12,187 --> 05:20:14,787
in ARK, the ARK arc.

6053
05:20:17,487 --> 05:20:19,587
Oh, I'm going to take a break

6054
05:20:19,587 --> 05:20:23,287
'cause I've been running on so little sleep that I feel like I'm going crazy.

6055
05:20:24,087 --> 05:20:25,987
So, um, yeah.

6056
05:20:26,287 --> 05:20:28,187
Anniversary coming up.

6057
05:20:28,487 --> 05:20:31,087
Real fun stuff, let's go.

6058
05:20:32,187 --> 05:20:35,087
Some big things on the way.

6059
05:20:35,587 --> 05:20:36,987
Anyways, thank you guys.

6060
05:20:37,037 --> 05:20:39,887
Hope you guys have a wonderful rest of the morning, afternoon, evening.

6061
05:20:40,087 --> 05:20:41,287
Until next time,

6062
05:20:41,487 --> 05:20:42,587
take care.

6063
05:20:42,887 --> 05:20:44,387
Bye-bye!

6064
05:20:44,587 --> 05:20:46,087
Bye-bye!

6065
05:20:46,287 --> 05:20:47,787
Bye-bye!

